�脢id�b5fedf9b7150�body���卤素自上而下（氟、氯、溴、碘）原子半径增大、得电子能力减弱，氧化性依次减弱。因此氟能置换氯、溴、碘的化合物，而碘几乎不能置换其他卤素。氧化性强的卤素单质常用作氧化剂。�]From top to bottom among halogens (fluorine, chlorine, bromine, iodine), the atomic radius grows and the ability to gain electrons weakens, so oxidizing power decreases. Fluorine can displace the compounds of chlorine, bromine and iodine, while iodine can hardly displace any other halogen. The stronger oxidizers are often used as oxidizing agents.�ans��src��ZHousecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》（第5版，Pearson）p区元素（卤素）章节�ZHousecroft, C. E.; Sharpe, A. G. Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson (p-block; halogens)��id�b74e05e07d87�body���小苏打是弱碱性，能破坏肉类肌肉蛋白的某些结构，使肌纤维吸水膨胀、口感变嫩。它还能提高肉的保水性，让炒出的肉更滑嫩。但用量过多会有碱味，且会损失部分B族维生素。�:Baking soda is mildly alkaline and disrupts some of the muscle-protein structure in meat, causing the fibers to swell as they take up water, which makes the texture tender. It also improves water retention so the cooked meat stays juicy. Too much, however, leaves an alkaline taste and can destroy some B vitamins.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b8f1044e9512�body���牛奶中的酪蛋白在酸性环境或高温下会失去稳定性而凝固沉淀，形成豆花状的块。煮糊时局部高温使蛋白质变性聚集，酸则降低pH让酪蛋白析出。这跟做奶酪、酸奶的原理相似。�Casein, the main milk protein, becomes unstable in acid or at high temperature and precipitates into curds. Local overheating denatures and aggregates the proteins, while acid lowers the pH and makes casein fall out. This is the same principle behind cheese and yogurt making.�ans��src��OH.-D. Belitz, W. Grosch, P. Schieberle, Food Chemistry, 4th ed., Springer, 2009�OH.-D. Belitz, W. Grosch, P. Schieberle, Food Chemistry, 4th ed., Springer, 2009��id�b97943955cbc�body�ٜ番茄酱是剪切变稀的非牛顿流体：静止时黏稠难流，受到拍打震动后黏度下降，才容易倒出，与玉米淀粉糊正好相反。�yKetchup is shear-thinning: at rest it's viscous, but shaking/shearing lowers viscosity so it flows—opposite of oobleck.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�ba7b35056ae2�body���柠檬酸是有机酸，能像醋酸一样与碳酸钙等水垢反应生成可溶盐，但酸性更强、用量更少、无味。它常做成除垢剂用于咖啡机、电水壶。除垢后同样要冲洗干净。�Citric acid is an organic acid that, like acetic acid, reacts with scale such as calcium carbonate into soluble salts, but it is stronger, needs less, and is odorless. It is often sold as descaler for coffee makers and kettles. Rinse well afterward, just the same.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�ba80f669684e�body��H碳原子能相互连成长短不一的链和环，且可四价成键。�SCarbon atoms link into chains and rings and form four bonds, enabling huge variety.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�bb3539b60790�body��{磷脂双分子层自组装成空心囊泡，把难溶或易降解的药包在里面，延长循环并帮助靶向递送。ٙPhospholipid bilayers self-assemble into hollow vesicles that encapsulate hard-to-dissolve or fragile drugs, prolonging circulation and aiding targeting.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�bc9cb4c86864�body�ِ超级电容靠电极表面静电吸存电荷，充放极快、寿命长，但单位质量储能比电池少，适合补功率而非长续航。ٞA supercapacitor stores charge electrostatically on surfaces—ultra-fast and long-lived, but lower energy density than batteries; it boosts power, not range.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�bd54e285f2b8�body��A土壤重金属（如镉、铅、砷）主要来自采矿冶炼、工业废水废渣、含重金属农药与大气沉降。它们大多不降解、易在表层累积并通过食物链放大，且常以多种化学形态存在，迁移转化复杂。因此修复常需钝化、植物提取或淋洗等长期工程手段。��Soil heavy metals such as cadmium, lead, and arsenic mainly come from mining and smelting, industrial wastewater and slag, metal-containing pesticides, and atmospheric deposition. They do not degrade, accumulate in surface layers, and biomagnify through food chains, often existing in multiple chemical forms with complex mobility. Remediation therefore needs long-term measures like immobilization, phytoextraction, or leaching.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�bebdf107cfb9�body���普通燃烧先把化学能变成热能，再经热机转成机械功，受卡诺效率限制，大量热量被排掉；燃料电池则让燃料在电极上直接发生氧化还原反应，电子经外电路流动产生电能，化学能一步变成电能，不受卡诺循环限制。因此氢气燃料电池的理论效率可达80%以上，远高于内燃机的30%左右。它本质上是一个不断进食燃料的原电池，只要持续供气就能一直发电。�ZOrdinary combustion first turns chemical energy into heat, then a heat engine converts that heat into work, and Carnot efficiency caps how much survives. A fuel cell instead runs the fuel's redox reaction directly at the electrodes, so electrons stream through an external circuit and chemical energy becomes electricity in one step, outside the Carnot limit. That is why a hydrogen fuel cell can exceed 80% theoretical efficiency versus about 30% for an internal combustion engine. A fuel cell is essentially a galvanic cell that keeps being fed fuel and generates power as long as gases are supplied.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�c0340b3ba683�body��g标准电极电势越正，说明该电对的氧化态越容易被还原（相应的还原态越难被氧化）；越负则相反，还原态越易失电子。把两个半反应组成电池时，电势较高的电对作正极发生还原、较低者作负极发生氧化，电池电动势 E° = E°(正) − E°(负) 为正即该方向反应可自发进行。��A more positive standard electrode potential means the oxidized form is more readily reduced. In a cell, the half-reaction with the higher potential is reduced and the lower one is oxidized; a positive cell EMF E° indicates a spontaneous reaction.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�c100310997d1�body���选择性指催化剂促使反应朝向某一特定产物而非多种副产物的能力。优良催化剂不只加快反应，更要抑制副反应、提高目标产物比例。炼油与合成氨等工业高度依赖选择性催化。�*Selectivity is a catalyst's ability to steer a reaction toward a specific product rather than various byproducts. A good catalyst does more than speed things up; it suppresses side reactions and raises the target product fraction. Refining and ammonia synthesis rely heavily on selective catalysis.�ans��src��`Atkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）催化选择性章节�hAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (catalyst selectivity)��id�c1f69fa4234d�body��␀虽然稀有气体极不活泼，但较重的氪、氙、氡能与强电负性的氟、氧形成化合物，如六氟化氙（XeF6）。最轻的氦和氖至今几乎未形成稳定化合物。稀有气体化合物的合成打破了惰性的传统观念。�8Although noble gases are very unreactive, the heavier krypton, xenon and radon can form compounds with highly electronegative fluorine or oxygen, such as xenon hexafluoride (XeF6). The lightest, helium and neon, have almost no stable compounds known. Their synthesis overturned the traditional idea of inertness.�ans��src��YHousecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》（第5版，Pearson）稀有气体化合物章节�\Housecroft, C. E.; Sharpe, A. G. Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson (noble-gas compounds)��id�c36e5fd25627�body���化学平衡常数K是平衡时生成物浓度幂之积与反应物浓度幂之积的比值，各物质浓度以其化学计量数为指数。K只与温度有关，不随浓度或压力改变。K越大表示反应进行得越完全。�The equilibrium constant K is the ratio of the product of product concentrations (each raised to its stoichiometric coefficient) to that of reactants at equilibrium. K depends only on temperature, not on concentration or pressure. A larger K means the reaction proceeds more completely.�ans��src��cAtkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）化学平衡常数章节�hAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (equilibrium constant)��id�c3836ecb0d7a�body�ٍ生铁含磷、硅、硫等杂质。石灰与它们反应生成炉渣浮在钢水表面被除去，从而把生铁炼成性能合格的钢。نHot metal contains P, Si, S impurities. Lime reacts with them to form slag that floats off, turning pig iron into specification steel.�ans��src���Gupta, Sarkar, Roy,《A Strategy for Partial Replacement of Lime by Limestone and Its Impact on Basic Oxygen Furnace Steelmaking》,steel research international,2025 (DOI: 10.1002/srin.202400030)��Gupta, Sarkar, Roy, 'A Strategy for Partial Replacement of Lime by Limestone and Its Impact on Basic Oxygen Furnace Steelmaking', steel research international, 2025, DOI: 10.1002/srin.202400030��id�c4455c5b3c39�body���简单化学方法通常只能检测到毫克/升量级的成分，而痕量污染物浓度低至微克甚至纳克/升，远超常规方法的灵敏度极限，颜色反应根本看不到信号。仪器分析如色谱-质谱联用能先把目标物分离，再以极高灵敏度逐一计数分子，把信号从噪声中提取出来。而且这类污染物成分复杂，需要同时确认是什么和有多少，只有联用技术才能给出定性与定量结果。�4Simple chemical tests typically reach only milligram-per-litre concentrations, while trace pollutants sit at microgram or even nanogram per litre - far beyond the sensitivity limit of routine methods, so colour reactions show no signal at all. Instrumental analysis such as chromatography-mass spectrometry first separates the target compound, then counts its molecules with extreme sensitivity, pulling the signal out of the noise. And because such mixtures are complex, labs need to know both what is present and how much, which only combined techniques deliver.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�c48b8317bd72�body���气体在液体里的溶解度随压强增大而升高（亨利定律）。灌装时用高压把大量二氧化碳压进水里，开盖后瓶内压强骤降到大气压，溶解的二氧化碳变成过饱和状态，于是不断析出气泡。温度升高也会降低气体溶解度，所以热汽水跑气更快。这既是溶解平衡，也是气体分子从液体逸出的过程。��Gas solubility in a liquid rises with pressure (Henry's law). Filling machines use high pressure to force lots of carbon dioxide into the water; once the cap opens, the pressure inside drops to atmospheric, the dissolved gas becomes supersaturated, and bubbles stream out. Heat lowers gas solubility too, which is why warm soda goes flat faster. This is a dissolution equilibrium combined with gas molecules escaping the liquid.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�c6dc70619fa2�body�ف内焰燃烧较充分温度高，火焰本身偏蓝；外焰混有未燃尽的碳粒，受热发光显黄，温度反而较低。ٙThe inner flame burns more completely and is hotter (bluish); the outer flame contains glowing unburned carbon particles (yellow) and is actually cooler.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c6fd02d7b17b�body��z高温破坏酶(蛋白质)的折叠结构，活性中心变形就再也“抓不住”底物，催化能力随之丧失。�wHeat disrupts the folded protein structure; the misshapen active site can no longer bind substrate, so catalysis fails.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c7725a98c856�body���红外光谱中 4000–1300 cm⁻¹ 为特征频率区（官能团区），主要出现 O-H、N-H、C≡C、C=O 等基团的特征伸缩振动，可据此判断分子含有哪些官能团。1300–400 cm⁻¹ 为指纹区，主要来自单键伸缩和骨架弯曲振动，谱形与整个分子骨架密切相关，如同分子「指纹」，常用于区分同分异构体和比对标准谱图。��In infrared spectroscopy the 4000-1300 cm-1 range is the group-frequency (functional-group) region, dominated by characteristic stretching vibrations of O-H, N-H, C(triple)C and C=O, which reveal which functional groups are present. The 1300-400 cm-1 fingerprint region arises mainly from single-bond stretching and skeletal bending, so its pattern reflects the whole molecular framework and, like a fingerprint, is used to distinguish isomers and to match reference spectra.�ans��src��4《仪器分析》(武汉大学) 第五版 第 4 章�tN. B. Colthup, L. H. Daly & S. E. Wiberley, Introduction to Infrared and Raman Spectroscopy, 3rd ed., Academic Press��id�c7728a846af5�body��w白磷燃点约30°C，极易氧化放热而自燃，必须泡在水中保存；红磷结构稳定得多，燃点高。�White phosphorus ignites around 30 C by spontaneous oxidation and must be stored underwater; red phosphorus is far more stable.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c7fcf30703c7�body��T鲜味是甜、酸、苦、咸之外的第五种基本味觉，主要由谷氨酸等 L-型氨基酸的钠盐激活舌上的鲜味受体（如 mGluR4 与 T1R1/T1R3）产生。MSG 溶于水解离出谷氨酸根，与受体结合并协同呈味核苷酸（如肌苷酸）显著增强鲜味。它广泛存在于天然高汤与发酵食品中。��Umami is a fifth basic taste alongside sweet, sour, bitter, and salty, produced mainly when L-amino acids such as glutamate activate umami receptors on the tongue (e.g., mGluR4 and T1R1/T1R3). MSG dissociates in water to glutamate, which binds these receptors and, with synergistic nucleotides like inosinate, strongly enhances savoriness. It occurs naturally in stocks and fermented foods.�ans��src��F《食品化学》(王璋) 呈味物质章；Nature 味觉受体研究�NNature, umami receptor studies; ACS Journal of Agricultural and Food Chemistry��id�c8813b3120dc�body��i对位芳纶分子链刚性强、氢键片层规整取向，使强度与重量比极高，用于防弹。هPara-aramid chains are rigid with ordered hydrogen-bonded sheets, giving an extremely high strength-to-weight ratio used in body armor.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c90dfcb4b4b8�body��sV2O5在约400°C就能高效催化SO2氧化为SO3，且比铂便宜、不易中毒，是经济又耐用的选择。وV2O5 efficiently catalyzes SO2 → SO3 near 400 °C; it is cheaper than platinum and resists poisoning, making it economical and robust.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�ca819f748301�body���冰糖受热先熔化，然后发生焦糖化反应，糖分脱水并生成棕红色的物质和焦香风味。这些糖色既能给肉上色，又带来微苦回甘的复杂味道。火候过大会发苦，所以需小火慢炒。�Heated rock sugar first melts, then undergoes caramelization in which the sugar dehydrates and forms brown-red pigments and a toasty flavor. The caramel both colors the meat and adds a complex bittersweet note. Too high a heat turns it bitter, so it is done over low flame.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�cb94d2d01ade�body�٨纳豆由纳豆菌（枯草芽孢杆菌）发酵大豆，产生γ-多聚谷氨酸等多糖而拉丝，并分解蛋白产生特殊风味，是东亚传统发酵食品。٭Natto is fermented by Bacillus subtilis, producing γ-polyglutamate (stringy polysaccharide) and broken-down proteins (distinctive smell)—a traditional East Asian ferment.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�cc7a580f532e�body��u把p型和n型硅接在一起形成内建电场，光生电子-空穴对被分开，形成可对外供电的电流。قJoining p- and n-type silicon creates a built-in field that separates light-generated electron–hole pairs into a usable current.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�cc9823c6b53e�body���构效关系研究化合物结构与生物活性之间的定量或定性联系。通过系统改变取代基、骨架和立体构型，药物化学家可预测并优化先导化合物的活性、选择性与安全性。�,Structure-activity relationship studies the qualitative or quantitative link between a compound's structure and its biological activity. By systematically varying substituents, scaffolds, and stereochemistry, medicinal chemists predict and optimize a lead compound's potency, selectivity, and safety.�ans��src��1《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 1 章�KC. G. Wermuth, The Practice of Medicinal Chemistry, 4th ed., Academic Press��id�cdb3fedd8247�body��w两者都有核自旋可共振且天然丰度合适；¹H 灵敏度高，¹³C（约 1.1%）需累加但谱图清晰。مBoth have nuclear spin and suitable natural abundance; ¹H is sensitive, while ¹³C (~1.1%) needs averaging but gives clear spectra.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�ce8639d7ae4d�body��P共振结构是用多个经典路易斯结构共同描述一个无法用单一结构准确表达的分子，例如碳酸根与苯。真实分子是这些极限式的共振杂化体，电子在多个原子间离域，使体系能量低于任一单一结构。共振不是结构间的快速互变，而是一种离域的稳定化效应。��Resonance structures are several classical Lewis forms used together to describe a molecule that cannot be captured by a single structure, such as the carbonate ion or benzene. The real molecule is a resonance hybrid of these contributors, with electrons delocalized over several atoms, lowering the energy below any single form. Resonance is not rapid interconversion but a stabilization from delocalization.�ans��src��v《有机化学》(邢其毅, 第四版) 芳香族化合物章；IUPAC《化学术语总表》(Gold Book, 2014 修订)�}IUPAC Gold Book (Compendium of Chemical Terminology, 2014); Clayden, Greeves & Warren, Organic Chemistry, aromaticity chapter��id�chem_19_002�body���锐钛矿 TiO2 的带隙约 3.2 eV,只能吸收波长小于 387 nm 的紫外光,而这部分只占太阳光谱的很小份额。掺氮、沉积贵金属或与窄带隙半导体异质结后,可以在带隙中引入杂质能级或构建 Z 型/II 型电荷转移通道,把响应边推到可见区。代价往往是引入的缺陷成为复合中心,所以活性和稳定性的平衡需要精细调控。��Anatase TiO2 has a band gap near 3.2 eV, absorbing only UV light below about 387 nm — a small slice of the solar spectrum. Nitrogen doping, noble-metal deposition, or heterojunctions with narrow-gap semiconductors introduce impurity levels or Z-scheme/Type-II charge-transfer pathways that push absorption into the visible range. The trade-off is that such defects can act as recombination centers, so activity and stability must be balanced carefully.�ans��src��[Fujishima 与 Honda 1972 年 Nature 论文及 Asahi 等 2001 年 Science 掺氮 TiO2 工作هA. Fujishima & K. Honda, Nature, 1972; R. Asahi et al., "Visible-light photocatalysis in nitrogen-doped titanium oxides", Science, 2001��id�chem_19_005�body���宇宙射线在中层大气产生 C-14,经氧化成为 CO2 进入碳循环,生物体存活期间体内 C-14/C-12 比值与环境一致;死亡后不再交换,C-14 按 5730 年半衰期指数衰减。测定残留放射性或用加速器质谱计数原子即可反推年代。经过约十个半衰期后剩余信号只剩初始值的千分之一左右,本底与污染误差已超过可分辨范围,故上限约为五万年。��Cosmic rays produce C-14 in the mid-atmosphere; oxidized to CO2 it mixes through the carbon cycle, so living organisms track the ambient C-14/C-12 ratio. After death, exchange stops and C-14 decays exponentially with a 5730-year half-life; residual beta activity or accelerator mass spectrometry atom counting then dates the sample. After roughly ten half-lives only ~0.1% of the original signal remains, at which point background and contamination dominate — hence the ~50,000-year ceiling.�ans��src��QW. F. Libby 1949 年 Science 论文《Age determination by radiocarbon content》�vW. F. Libby et al., "Age determination by radiocarbon content: world-wide assay of natural radiocarbon", Science, 1949��id�chem_19_008�body���SMILES 由 Daylight 提出,目标是用紧凑直观的字符串表达连接关系,同一分子允许多种合法写法,便于人读和人写,规范化和同构判定需要额外算法支持。InChI 由 IUPAC 主导,目标是生成唯一的标准化标识符:按固定规则规范化电荷、互变异构和立体信息,使得结构相同的分子必然得到相同字符串,适合数据库索引与去重。简言之 SMILES 偏向表达自由,InChI 偏向身份唯一。�SMILES, introduced by Daylight, aims at compact human-readable strings encoding connectivity; one molecule may have many valid writings, and canonicalization requires extra algorithms. InChI, led by IUPAC, targets a unique standardized identifier: fixed normalization rules for charges, tautomers, and stereochemistry guarantee that identical structures always produce identical strings, suiting database indexing and deduplication. In short, SMILES favors expressive freedom while InChI favors identity uniqueness.�ans��src�ٚHeller, McNaught, Pletnev, Stein,《InChI, the IUPAC International Chemical Identifier》,Journal of Cheminformatics,2015 (DOI: 10.1186/s13321-015-0068-4)٘Heller, McNaught, Pletnev, Stein, 'InChI, the IUPAC International Chemical Identifier', Journal of Cheminformatics, 2015, DOI: 10.1186/s13321-015-0068-4��id�chem_19_012�body��O前进角大于后退角,两者之差称为接触角滞后,来源于表面化学组成的不均一与微纳粗糙结构对三相接触线的钉扎。在Cassie-Baxter复合润湿态下,截留的空气进一步放大这种前后不对称。滞后足够小时液滴便能轻易滚离并携带尘粒,这就是自清洁的界面学基础。��The advancing angle exceeds the receding angle, and their gap is the contact angle hysteresis, rooted in chemical heterogeneity plus pinning of the three-phase contact line by micro/nano roughness. In the Cassie-Baxter composite state the trapped air amplifies this fore-aft asymmetry further. Once hysteresis is small enough, drops roll off readily and carry dust away — the interfacial basis of self-cleaning.�ans��src��ZP.-G. de Gennes《Wetting: statics and dynamics》,Reviews of Modern Physics 57 (1985) 827�WP.-G. de Gennes, Wetting: statics and dynamics, Reviews of Modern Physics 57 (1985) 827��id�chem_19_015�body���(-)-薄荷醇是皮肤冷觉通道TRPM8的激动剂,该离子通道平时靠低温开启,被分子结合后同样向神经系统发出“变冷”指令。羟基与受体极性残基成氢键、环己基嵌入疏水口袋,这一构效关系决定了凉感的强弱与时长。与之互补的是辣椒素激活TRPV1带来的灼热感,两者共同说明温度感知可以被特定小分子劫持。�(-)-Menthol is an agonist of the skin's cold channel TRPM8, an ion pore normally gated by low temperature; once bound, it instructs the nervous system that cooling is under way. A hydroxyl group hydrogen-bonds to polar receptor residues while the cyclohexyl ring sits in a hydrophobic pocket — a structure-activity relationship that sets both strength and duration of the chill. Capsaicin activating TRPV1 supplies the complementary burn, showing together that temperature perception can be hijacked by specific small molecules.�ans��src�هD. D. McKemy 等《Identification of a cold receptor reveals a general role for TRP channels in thermosensation》,Nature 416 (2002) 52هD. D. McKemy et al., Identification of a cold receptor reveals a general role for TRP channels in thermosensation, Nature 416 (2002) 52��id�chem_19_018�body���光生载流子在皮秒到纳秒量级就完成体内复合,把能量以热或辐射形式白白耗散,而它们迁移到表面参与反应需要的时间窗口要长得多。只有少数空穴成功氧化水和氢氧根生成羟基自由基等活性氧物种,才真正启动矿化。沉积Pt捕集电子、掺杂引入缺陷能级、构筑异质结形成内建电场,都是延长载流子寿命的经典手段。��Photogenerated carriers recombine in the bulk within picoseconds to nanoseconds, dissipating their energy as heat or emission, while reaching the surface to react demands a far longer window. Only the minority of holes that oxidize water and hydroxide into hydroxyl radicals and related reactive oxygen species actually start mineralization. Depositing Pt to trap electrons, doping to introduce defect levels, and building heterojunctions with internal fields are the classic ways to stretch carrier lifetimes.�ans��src�٘Hoffmann、Martin、Choi 与 Bahnemann,《Environmental Applications of Semiconductor Photocatalysis》,Chemical Reviews,1995 (DOI: 10.1021/cr00033a004)ْHoffmann, Martin, Choi & Bahnemann, 'Environmental Applications of Semiconductor Photocatalysis', Chemical Reviews, 1995, DOI: 10.1021/cr00033a004��id�chem_19_020�body���两亲分子优先占据气液界面:硫酸根基团留在水中,十二条碳的长尾探向空气,替换掉一部分表面能很高的裸露水面,Gibbs吸附等温式定量描述了这一界面富集过程。当浓度抵达临界胶束浓度(约8 mmol/L),界面已经饱和,新增分子只能转入体相聚集成胶束,表面张力随之走平。胶束同时充当油污的容器,这正是洗涤剂增溶作用的出发点。�␀Amphiphiles crowd preferentially onto the air-water interface: sulfate heads stay submerged while twelve-carbon tails reach for air, displacing bare high-energy water surface, a process Gibbs adsorption isotherms quantify. Once concentration reaches the critical micelle concentration near 8 millimolar the interface saturates, newcomers can only aggregate into bulk micelles, and surface tension flattens out. Those micelles double as containers for oily soil — the starting point of detergent solubilization.�ans��src��[M. J. Rosen 与 J. T. Kunjappu《Surfactants and Interfacial Phenomena》第4版,Wiley,2012�[M. J. Rosen and J. T. Kunjappu, Surfactants and Interfacial Phenomena, 4th ed., Wiley, 2012��id�chem_20_005�body���血红素基团中的Fe^2+/Fe^3+铁离子在过氧化氢存在下催化鲁米诺氧化,产生激发态3-氨基邻苯二甲酸二价阴离子,退激时发射蓝紫色光。该方法灵敏度极高但并非血迹特异,漂白剂中的次氯酸盐以及铜、铁等某些金属离子也能触发类似发光。因此现场阳性结果只能作为筛查线索,仍需后续免疫层析或DNA确证。��The iron center of the heme group cycles between Fe2+ and Fe3+ and catalyzes oxidation of luminol by hydrogen peroxide, generating excited-state 3-aminophthalate dianion that emits blue-violet light on relaxation. Although extremely sensitive, the test is not specific for blood: hypochlorite from household bleach and certain metal ions such as copper can trigger similar glow. A positive scene test is therefore only presumptive and must be confirmed by immunoassay or DNA analysis.�ans��src�ٓCreamer等2003年发表于Luminescence的对鲁米诺血迹检测工业、生活与环境常见干扰物的系统实验研究(DOI: 10.1002/bio.723)��J. I. Creamer et al., A comprehensive experimental study of industrial, domestic and environmental interferences with the forensic luminol test for blood, Luminescence, 2003, 18 (DOI: 10.1002/bio.723)��id�chem_20_008�body���双乙酰由酵母缬氨酸合成支路中间体α-乙酰乳酸在发酵液中外溢并自发氧化脱羧生成,赋予啤酒馊饭样甜味,阈值仅约0.1 mg/L。控制手段包括提高发酵后期温度进行双乙酰还原、添加足量酵母利用α-乙酰乳酸脱羧酶加速转化,以及保证麦汁中足量可同化氮减少α-乙酰乳酸积累。成品检测双乙酰含量达标后方可过滤包装。�5Diacetyl arises when α-acetolactate, an intermediate of yeast valine biosynthesis, leaks into wort and spontaneously oxidatively decarboxylates; it gives a buttery, spoiled-milk note with a threshold near 0.1 mg/L. Brewers control it with a warm diacetyl rest late in fermentation, sufficient pitching yeast (sometimes engineered or supplemented with α-acetolactate decarboxylase) to convert the precursor quickly, and adequate assimilable nitrogen in wort to limit precursor buildup. Packaging proceeds only after diacetyl analysis confirms the batch meets spec.�ans��src�كKobayashi等2005年发表于J. Biosci. Bioeng.的α-乙酰乳酸分解动力学与双乙酰测定方法研究99卷第5期502-507页ٞK. Kobayashi et al., Method for the simultaneous assay of diacetyl and acetoin in the presence of alpha-acetolactate, J. Biosci. Bioeng., 2005, 99(5), 502-507��id�chem_20_012�body���牛奶中的脂肪球被天然乳化剂——磷脂和蛋白质膜包裹,形成带电荷的水化层,通过静电排斥和空间位阻抑制聚结,体系长期稳定。豆浆的蛋白质颗粒主要靠双电层静电排斥维持分散,pH 接近等电点或加热使蛋白变性聚集时,排斥势垒降低,颗粒迅速絮凝沉降。因此两者的差异本质在于界面保护层的组成与稳定性不同。�
Fat globules in milk are coated by natural emulsifiers — phospholipids and protein membranes — that form hydrated charged layers; electrostatic repulsion plus steric hindrance suppresses coalescence, keeping the emulsion stable. Soy milk particles rely mainly on double-layer electrostatic repulsion, so near the isoelectric point or after heat denaturation the repulsive barrier drops and the particles flocculate and settle. The difference lies in the composition and robustness of each interfacial protective layer.�ans��src��jP. C. Hiemenz & R. Rajagopalan,《Principles of Colloid and Surface Chemistry》第2版,Marcel Dekker,1997�`Hiemenz & Rajagopalan, Principles of Colloid and Surface Chemistry, 2nd ed., Marcel Dekker, 1997��id�chem_20_015�body���糖酵解用过量乙二醇在催化剂作用下把 PET 解聚为对苯二甲酸双羟乙酯(BHET),可重新缩聚成原生级树脂,因此能处理含染料或多次回收降级的瓶片,实现闭环循环。机械回收仅熔融再加工,分子量下降且杂质累积限制使用次数。代价是能耗高、需要催化剂分离与纯化步骤,BHET 结晶纯化成本使整体经济性仍逊于成熟的大规模机械回收。�/Glycolysis uses excess ethylene glycol with a catalyst to depolymerize PET into bis(2-hydroxyethyl) terephthalate (BHET), which can be re-polymerized into virgin-grade resin; this handles dyed or multi-cycle degraded flakes and closes the loop. Mechanical recycling merely remelts the polymer, where falling molecular weight and contaminant buildup limit reuse cycles. The trade-offs are higher energy demand plus catalyst separation and purification steps, and BHET crystallization costs keep overall economics behind mature large-scale mechanical recycling.�ans��src��GBarnard et al., Green Chemistry, 2021, 23, 3765 (PET glycolysis review)�}E. Barnard, J. J. Rubio Arias & W. Thielemans, Chemolytic depolymerisation of PET: a review, Green Chem., 2021, 23, 3765-3789��id�chem_20_018�body���18-冠-6的六个醚氧原子朝向内侧空穴,空穴直径约2.6至3.2埃,与K+约2.8埃的直径最为匹配,六个给电子原子几乎同时包裹阳离子,焓与熵均得到补偿。Na+偏小使氧原子偏离最佳配位距离,Cs+过大只能位于环口之上,结合常数因此显著下降。相对于开链类似物,预组织的大环骨架还避免了结合时的构象熵损失,这一大环效应是冠醚化学获得1987年诺贝尔化学奖的核心概念之一。��The six ether oxygens of 18-crown-6 point into an internal cavity roughly 2.6-3.2 angstroms across, which best matches the approximately 2.8 angstrom diameter of K+, so six donor atoms wrap the cation simultaneously with favorable enthalpy and entropy. Smaller Na+ pushes the oxygens away from ideal coordination distances, while larger Cs+ can only sit atop the ring mouth, markedly lowering the binding constant. Compared with open-chain analogues, the preorganized macrocycle also avoids a conformational entropy penalty upon binding - the macrocyclic effect - one of the key concepts behind the 1987 Nobel Prize in Chemistry awarded for crown ether chemistry.�ans��src�ٕPedersen, C. J.,《Cyclic polyethers and their complexes with metal salts》,Journal of the American Chemical Society,1967 (DOI: 10.1021/ja01002a035)ْC. J. Pedersen, 'Cyclic polyethers and their complexes with metal salts', Journal of the American Chemical Society, 1967, DOI: 10.1021/ja01002a035��id�chem_20_020�body��iDLVO理论将范德华吸引势能与双电层重叠导致的静电排斥势能叠加,得到粒子间总相互作用能曲线;当排斥能垒远高于热运动动能时,布朗运动带来的碰撞无法逾越能垒,溶胶处于动力学稳定状态。升高电解质浓度会压缩扩散双电层、使zeta电位绝对值减小,能垒随之降低直至消失,粒子坠入初级极小并发生不可逆聚沉,恰好消除能垒所对应的浓度即临界聚沉浓度(CCC)。Schulze-Hardy经验规律指出,起决定作用的是与胶粒电性相反的反离子,且CCC大致随反离子价态的六次方急剧下降。�6DLVO theory sums van der Waals attraction with the electrostatic repulsion produced by overlapping double layers into a total interaction energy curve; while the repulsive barrier greatly exceeds thermal kinetic energy, collisions driven by Brownian motion cannot cross it and the sol stays kinetically stable. Increasing the electrolyte concentration compresses the diffuse double layer and shrinks the magnitude of the zeta potential, lowering the barrier until it disappears; particles then fall into the primary minimum and coagulate irreversibly, and the concentration at which the barrier vanishes is the critical coagulation concentration (CCC). The empirical Schulze-Hardy rule adds that counterions opposite in charge dominate the effect, and CCC drops steeply, roughly with the sixth power of counterion valence.�ans��src�ِDerjaguin & Landau, Acta Physicochimica URSS 1941, 14: 633-662; Verwey & Overbeek, Theory of the Stability of Lyophobic Colloids, Elsevier, 1948َDerjaguin & Landau, Acta Physicochim. URSS 1941, 14, 633-662; Verwey & Overbeek, Theory of the Stability of Lyophobic Colloids, Elsevier, 1948��id�chem_21_002�body���偶联循环中氧化加成后生成的有机钯物种需要与亲核试剂转金属化,而转金属化通常要求亲核试剂以负离子或中性的富电子形式存在。碱的作用是中和氧化加成产生的卤化氢,并把硼酸及其酯转化为更易转移的四配位硼酸根等活性物种;Negishi 反应中的有机锌试剂本身即为活性亲核体,通常无需外加碱。没有碱,转金属化速率极慢,催化剂停留在Pd(II)中间体而失活,偶联产率大幅下降。�\After oxidative addition, the organopalladium species must undergo transmetalation with the nucleophilic partner, which generally requires the nucleophile in an anionic or electron-rich neutral form. The base neutralizes the HX generated in oxidative addition and converts boronic acids and esters into readily transmetalating tetrahedral boronate species; organozinc reagents in Negishi couplings are themselves active nucleophiles and usually need no added base. Without base, transmetalation is extremely slow, the catalyst stalls at a Pd(II) intermediate and decomposes, and coupling yields collapse.�ans��src�٭Suzuki,《Synthetic studies via the cross-coupling reaction of organoboron derivatives with organic halides》,Pure and Applied Chemistry,1991 (DOI: 10.1351/pac199163030419)٫Suzuki, 'Synthetic studies via the cross-coupling reaction of organoboron derivatives with organic halides', Pure and Applied Chemistry, 1991, DOI: 10.1351/pac199163030419��id�chem_21_005�body���FCC采用Y型分子筛等固体酸催化剂,其骨架铝产生的Bronssted酸位在约500摄氏度下将重质油中的大分子烷烃和芳烃侧链质子化,经碳正离子机理发生β-断裂,C-C键逐级切断生成C3-C12的较小烃类。分子筛的规整孔道还起到择形作用,限制过度缩合的焦炭前体扩散。裂化吸热由再生器中焦炭燃烧放热补偿,两器循环维持热量平衡,最终得到高辛烷值汽油、液化气和柴油。�sFCC uses solid acid catalysts such as Y zeolites whose framework aluminum generates Bronsted acid sites; at roughly 500 degrees C these sites protonate large paraffins and aromatic side chains in the feed, and beta-scission along the carbenium-ion pathway cleaves C-C bonds stepwise into C3-C12 hydrocarbons. The ordered zeolite pores also exert shape selectivity that limits diffusion of over-condensed coke precursors. The endothermic cracking heat is balanced by coke combustion in the regenerator, the two-vessel circulation maintains thermal balance, and the process yields high-octane gasoline, LPG, and diesel fractions.�ans��src��YSadeghbeigi R. Fluid Catalytic Cracking Handbook. 3rd ed. Waltham: Elsevier, 2012: 45-78.�SSadeghbeigi, Fluid Catalytic Cracking Handbook, 3rd ed., Elsevier, 2012, pp. 45-78.��id�chem_21_008�body���纯 SiO2 熔点约 1700 °C 且熔体极黏,难以成形;Na2O 打断部分 Si-O-Si 桥键生成非桥氧,显著降低熔化温度和黏度。但单纯的钠硅酸盐玻璃网络疏松,Na+ 易被水溶出,化学稳定性差。再引入 CaO 后,Ca2+ 占据网络空隙并交联非桥氧,使结构重新致密,耐水性大幅恢复,同时保留低温易熔的优点——这正是苏打石灰玻璃配方的基本原理。�+Pure SiO2 melts near 1700 degrees C with extremely high viscosity, which makes forming impractical; Na2O breaks some Si-O-Si bridges into non-bridging oxygens, sharply lowering melting temperature and viscosity. A sodium silicate network alone is open, however, so Na+ leaches out in water and chemical durability suffers. Adding CaO supplies Ca2+ ions that occupy interstices and cross-link non-bridging oxygens, densifying the network and restoring water resistance while keeping easy low-temperature melting - the basic recipe logic of soda-lime glass.�ans��src��rKingery W. D., Bowen H. K., Uhlmann D. R., Introduction to Ceramics, 2nd ed., Wiley, 1976, 第 3 章(玻璃结构)�wKingery W. D., Bowen H. K., Uhlmann D. R., Introduction to Ceramics, 2nd ed., Wiley, 1976, Ch. 3 (structure of glasses)��id�chem_21_015�body��b偶氮基把两个芳环连成大的共轭体系,其前线轨道能级差落入可见光区,电子跃迁吸收特定波长后呈现互补色;给电子基团与吸电子基团的推拉效应还会进一步加深色光。日光照射下偶氮键发生顺反异构化并被氧化断裂,共轭通道被切断,吸收峰移出可见区,宏观上就是褪色。��An azo bridge fuses two aromatic rings into one extended conjugated system whose frontier-orbital gap lies in the visible range; after absorbing particular wavelengths the dye shows the complementary color, and donor-acceptor push-pull substitution deepens the shade further. Sunlight drives trans-cis isomerization and eventual oxidative scission of the nitrogen-nitrogen bond, cutting the conjugation so absorption moves out of the visible spectrum—the dye visibly fades.�ans��src��xBandara H M D, Burdette S C. Photoisomerization in different classes of azobenzene. Chem. Soc. Rev., 2012, 41: 1809-1825فBandara H M D, Burdette S C. Photoisomerization in different classes of azobenzene. Chemical Society Reviews, 2012, 41: 1809-1825��id�chem_21_018�body���循环由氧化加成、碱辅助的硼酸转金属化和还原消除三步构成，后者生成联芳基 C-C 键并再生 Pd(0)。C-I 与 C-Br 键远比 C-Cl 容易氧化加成，故碘代、溴代芳烃在温和条件下即可偶联，而氯代物需要 SPhos 等富电子大位阻配体活化。碱一方面把硼酸转成四配位硼酸根以促进转金属，另一方面清除卤化氢，因此 K2CO3 与 K3PO4 的选择会明显影响收率与副产物。�UThe cycle runs through oxidative addition of the aryl halide to Pd(0), base-assisted transmetalation from the arylboronic acid, and reductive elimination that forms the biaryl C-C bond and regenerates Pd(0). Aryl iodides and bromides add oxidatively far more readily than aryl chlorides, so they couple under mild conditions whereas chlorides require electron-rich bulky ligands such as SPhos. The base both converts boronic acids into tetrahedral boronate species primed for transmetalation and scavenges HX, which is why choosing K2CO3 over K3PO4 measurably shifts yield and byproduct formation.�ans��src��zMiyaura N, Suzuki A，有机硼化合物的钯催化交叉偶联反应（综述），Chemical Reviews，1995 年第 95 卷هN. Miyaura, A. Suzuki, Palladium-Catalyzed Cross-Coupling Reactions of Organoboron Compounds, Chemical Reviews, vol. 95, p. 2457 (1995)��id�chem_21_020�body���H = A + B/u + Cu：A 由填料粒径分布与流道不均匀性决定，与流速无关；B/u 在低流速下占优，溶质沿柱轴的纵向扩散把谱带拉宽；Cu 在高流速下占优，固定相内外传质跟不上流动相导致峰展宽。三项叠加使 H-u 曲线呈开口向上的双曲形，最低点对应最佳线速度，而实际方法常选稍快流速换取更短的分析时间。亚 2 微米填料同时缩小 A 与 C 项，这正是 UHPLC 能在高线速下保持柱效的原因。��H = A + B/u + Cu sums three band-broadening channels: A reflects eddy diffusion set by particle-size spread and bed irregularity and ignores flow rate; B/u dominates at low velocity where solutes diffuse longitudinally along the column; Cu dominates at high velocity because equilibration between mobile and stationary phases cannot keep pace. Their superposition bends the H-u plot into an upward-open hyperbola whose minimum marks the optimum linear velocity, although practical methods often run slightly faster to trade a little efficiency for shorter runs. Sub-2-micron packings shrink both the A and C terms, which is precisely why UHPLC holds its efficiency at high linear velocities.�ans��src�مvan Deemter J J 等，纵向扩散与传质阻力作为色谱非理想性的成因，Chemical Engineering Science，1956 年第 1 卷��J. J. van Deemter, F. J. Zuiderweg, A. Klinkenberg, Longitudinal Diffusion and Resistance to Mass Transfer as Causes of Nonideality in Chromatography, Chemical Engineering Science, vol. 1, p. 271 (1956)��id�chem_22_005�body���锌的标准电极电位比铁更负。当两者在海水中接触时便构成原电池：锌作为阳极优先氧化溶解，向钢板持续输出电子，把铁的电位负移到免蚀区，使铁只发生阴极的吸氧反应而不再失去电子溶解。腐蚀集中在锌上，锌块逐渐消耗，需要定期更换，因此称为牺牲阳极的阴极保护，广泛用于船体、码头钢桩和储罐底部。�WZinc has a more negative standard electrode potential than iron. When the two metals touch in conductive seawater they form a galvanic cell: zinc dissolves preferentially as the anode, delivering a continuous stream of electrons to the hull and polarizing the iron below its corrosion potential, so iron only sustains cathodic oxygen reduction instead of losing electrons and dissolving. Since the corrosion concentrates in the zinc, the anodes are consumed and periodically replaced; this is called sacrificial-anode cathodic protection and is widely applied to hulls, steel piles and tank bottoms.�ans��src��H《腐蚀工程》，M. G. Fontana 著，第3版，McGraw-Hill，1986年�@Corrosion Engineering, M. G. Fontana, 3rd ed., McGraw-Hill, 1986��id�chem_22_020�body���Pt–Pd–Rh颗粒负载在涂层的陶瓷蜂窝载体上分工协作：铂钯把CO与未燃烃氧化成CO₂和H₂O；铑对NO吸附更强，可将N—O键解离，相邻表面氮原子再复合成N₂脱附，抑制N₂O与NH₃副产。上游氧传感器闭环控制把空燃比锁定在化学计量比附近的窄窗（λ≈1）内，三类污染物转化率才能同时超过90%。早年汽油含铅会毒化表面，这正是推广无铅汽油的原因。�NPt–Pd–Rh particles dispersed on a washcoated ceramic honeycomb work in series. Platinum and palladium oxidise CO and unburnt hydrocarbons to CO₂ and H₂O. Rhodium adsorbs NO strongly enough to cleave the N–O bond; adjacent surface nitrogen atoms then recombine and desorb as N₂, suppressing N₂O and NH₃ by-products. A closed-loop oxygen sensor holds the air–fuel ratio inside the narrow window around stoichiometry (λ ≈ 1), where all three conversions exceed 90% simultaneously. Lead additives once poisoned the active surface, which is why unleaded petrol was mandated.�ans��src��qKašpar J., Fornasiero P., Hickey N., Catalysis Today, 2003, 77:419–449（DOI: 10.1016/S0920-5861(02)00384-X）�oJ. Kašpar, P. Fornasiero & N. Hickey, Catalysis Today, 2003, 77:419–449 (DOI: 10.1016/S0920-5861(02)00384-X)��id�chem_23_002�body���燃烧是让煤在过量空气中完全氧化，只输出热量；气化则是高温下用不足量的氧和水蒸气使煤部分氧化，主产物为由CO和H₂组成的合成气，核心步骤是放热的碳氧反应与吸热的蒸汽碳反应（C+H₂O→CO+H₂）。合成气经水煤气变换调整氢碳比后，可用于费托合成油品、生产甲醇或合成氨，把煤从燃料升级为化工原料。��Combustion fully oxidizes coal in excess air and releases heat only; gasification partially oxidizes coal at high temperature with limited oxygen plus steam, yielding syngas of CO and H₂ through the exothermic carbon–oxygen step and the endothermic steam–carbon reaction (C + H₂O → CO + H₂). Once the water–gas shift sets the H₂/CO ratio, syngas can feed Fischer–Tropsch fuels, methanol plants, or ammonia synthesis, upgrading coal from a mere fuel into chemical feedstock.�ans��src��^C. Higman、M. van der Burgt《Gasification》第2版，Gulf Professional Publishing，2008年�YC. Higman & M. van der Burgt, "Gasification", 2nd ed., Gulf Professional Publishing, 2008��id�chem_23_005�body���两种处理都会在晶格中留下氯离子空位：辐照直接制造空位并把电子留在其中，钠蒸气则带入过量金属，电离出的电子占据氯空位。被阴离子空位俘获的电子称为F心（色心），在可见光区有特征吸收带，NaCl的F带位于约465 nm处，吸收蓝紫色光后晶体即呈黄褐色；色心越密颜色越深，这类光谱也是研究点缺陷的经典手段。��Both treatments leave chloride vacancies in the lattice: irradiation creates them and traps electrons inside, while sodium vapor introduces excess metal whose ionized electrons fill chlorine vacancies. An electron captured by an anion vacancy is called an F-center (color center) and absorbs light in a characteristic visible band; the NaCl F-band sits near 465 nm, so the crystal takes on a yellow-brown hue. Denser color centers mean deeper color, and such spectra remain a classic probe of point defects.�ans��src��VJ. H. Schulman、W. D. Compton《Color Centers in Solids》，Pergamon Press，1962年�OJ. H. Schulman & W. D. Compton, "Color Centers in Solids", Pergamon Press, 1962��id�chem_23_008�body���试纸反应区固定着葡萄糖氧化酶：血样中的葡萄糖被催化氧化为葡萄糖酸内酯，酶辅基FAD随之被还原，随后由预置的媒介体铁氰化钾将其重新氧化，自身转变为亚铁氰根。电极间施加恒定电位，亚铁氰根在工作电极上放电产生电流，其大小与葡萄糖浓度成正比。毛细作用吸血，数秒即可完成测定。�The reaction zone of the strip carries immobilized glucose oxidase: glucose in the blood sample is oxidized to gluconolactone, reducing the enzyme's FAD cofactor, which a preloaded mediator, potassium ferricyanide, then reoxidizes while itself becoming ferrocyanide. With a fixed potential applied across the electrodes, ferrocyanide discharges at the working electrode and the resulting current is proportional to the glucose concentration. Capillary action draws in the blood, and the reading is ready within seconds.�ans��src��VJ. Wang, Electrochemical Glucose Biosensors, Chemical Reviews, 2008, 108, 814–825。�fJ. Wang, Electrochemical Glucose Biosensors, Chem. Rev., 2008, 108, 814–825, DOI: 10.1021/cr068123a.��id�chem_23_012�body��-从发生器淋洗出的高锝酸钠中锝为+7价，对配体几乎呈惰性。亚锡离子把Tc(VII)还原到+4/+5等较低氧化态，形成能被DTPA、MDP或HMPAO等螯合剂迅速捕获的活性物种；过量锡还可清除溶解氧并维持合适pH，从而保障标记率和制剂稳定性。�sPertechnetate eluted from the generator carries Tc(VII), which is almost inert toward ligands. Stannous ion reduces Tc(VII) to lower oxidation states such as +4/+5, forming reactive species promptly captured by chelators like DTPA, MDP or HMPAO; surplus tin also scavenges dissolved oxygen and keeps the pH suitable, safeguarding labeling yield and formulation stability.�ans��src��AS.S. Jurisson & J.D. Lydon, Chemical Reviews, 1999, 99, 2205-2218�US.S. Jurisson and J.D. Lydon, Chem. Rev., 1999, 99, 2205-2218, DOI: 10.1021/cr980435t��id�chem_23_015�body���关键在于自由基增殖与销毁之间的竞争。H• + O2 -> OH• + O•这类支化步骤一次性翻倍活性粒子；低压时自由基易扩散到器壁复合，高压时三体碰撞（H + O2 + M）又将它们消灭，只有在中间的压力窗口内支化胜出，自由基雪崩式增长引发爆炸。温度与压力会移动这一平衡，于是出现下限与上限。��The decisive factor is the race between radical multiplication and radical removal. Branching steps such as H• + O2 -> OH• + O• double the active population at a stroke; at low pressure radicals diffuse to the walls and recombine, while at high pressure three-body collisions (H + O2 + M) destroy them. Only in an intermediate pressure window does branching win, producing an explosive radical avalanche; shifts of this balance with temperature and pressure define the lower and upper limits.�ans��src��VC.K. Westbrook & F.L. Dryer, Progress in Energy and Combustion Science, 1984, 10, 1-57�lC.K. Westbrook and F.L. Dryer, Prog. Energy Combust. Sci., 1984, 10, 1-57, DOI: 10.1016/0360-1285(84)90118-7��id�chem_23_018�body���先将煤与氧气、水蒸气气化为一氧化碳和氢气的混合气，调好氢碳比；合成气流经约200-350摄氏度的铁或钴催化剂时，一氧化碳在表面解离出碳原子，逐级加氢成CH2单元，再经类似聚合的链增长连成从甲烷到重蜡的烃类。蜡馏分加氢裂化后即得柴油和石脑油，南非Sasol公司据此实现大规模煤制油。�%Coal is first gasified with oxygen and steam into synthesis gas, a mixture of carbon monoxide and hydrogen whose ratio is adjusted to suit the catalyst. At roughly 200-350 degrees C the syngas flows over iron or cobalt catalysts: CO dissociates on the surface and its carbon is hydrogenated stepwise into CH2 units, which couple through polymer-like chain growth into hydrocarbons ranging from methane to heavy wax. Hydrocracking the wax fraction yields diesel and naphtha; Sasol industrialised this route for large-scale coal-to-liquids production.�ans��src�٬A. P. Steynberg 与 M. E. Dry 主编,《Fischer-Tropsch Technology》,Studies in Surface Science and Catalysis 第152卷, Elsevier,2004 (DOI: 10.1016/s0167-2991(04)x8456-1)٧A. P. Steynberg & M. E. Dry (eds.), 'Fischer-Tropsch Technology', Studies in Surface Science and Catalysis Vol. 152, Elsevier, 2004, DOI: 10.1016/s0167-2991(04)x8456-1��id�chem_24_001�body��q臭氧销毁需要阳光,而活性氯在极夜期间就已积累。极夜低温使极涡内形成极地平流层云,云粒表面把氯储库物种(HCl、ClONO2)转化为Cl2等活性氯;早春太阳回归后光解释放氯原子,经ClO二聚体催化循环,每个氯原子可销毁数万个臭氧分子,故空洞此时最深,并随气温回升、云层消散而减弱。�Ozone destruction needs sunlight, but the active chlorine is stockpiled during the polar night. Intense cold lets polar stratospheric clouds form inside the winter vortex, and on their surfaces reservoir species such as HCl and ClONO2 are converted into photolabile chlorine. When the sun returns in early spring, chlorine atoms are released at once and, through the ClO dimer catalytic cycle, each atom can destroy tens of thousands of ozone molecules, so the hole peaks then and fades as temperatures rise and the clouds vanish.�ans��src��\S. Solomon 等,《On the depletion of Antarctic ozone》,Nature,1986 (DOI: 10.1038/321755a0)�]S. Solomon et al., 'On the depletion of Antarctic ozone', Nature, 1986, DOI: 10.1038/321755a0��id�chem_26_001�body���常规DFT缺少真正的长程色散吸引，须叠加DFT-D类校正。机理：色散源自电子瞬时涨落偶极间的远程相关，而LDA、GGA等半局域泛函的交换相关能只依赖局部密度及梯度，在分子间远距离处指数衰减为零，故弱复合物和分子晶体的结合被系统性低估。主流做法是Grimme的DFT-D方案，在总能量上叠加按元素参数化的原子对C6/R6项；或用vdW-DF、VV10非局域相关泛函直接由密度积分求出色散能。��Plain DFT lacks genuine long-range dispersion attraction, so extra corrections are layered on top. Dispersion is the long-range correlation between fluctuating instantaneous dipoles, whereas the exchange-correlation energy of semilocal functionals such as LDA and GGA depends only on the local density and its gradient and decays exponentially to zero between molecules, leaving weak complexes and molecular crystals systematically underbound. Mainstream fixes add element-parameterized pairwise C6/R6 terms to the DFT energy (the Grimme DFT-D family), or use nonlocal correlation functionals like vdW-DF and VV10 that integrate the dispersion energy directly from the density.�ans��src���S. Grimme、J. Antony、S. Ehrlich、H. Krieg《A consistent and accurate ab initio parametrization of density functional dispersion correction (DFT-D) for the 94 elements H-Pu》，J. Comput. Chem.，2010年，第31卷，1459页�gS. Grimme, J. Antony, S. Ehrlich & H. Krieg, J. Chem. Phys., 2010, 132, 154104 (DOI: 10.1063/1.3382344)��id�d0faaef09f58�body�ِ米曲霉等分泌蛋白酶把大豆蛋白分解成氨基酸（谷氨酸带来鲜味），加盐既调味又抑制杂菌，长期晒酿而成。ٚAspergillus oryzae releases proteases that break soy protein into amino acids (glutamate = umami); salt seasons and prevents spoilage during long brewing.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�d208cfcc5388�body�ل都是依数性：盐降低水的凝固点（化雪）同时升高沸点（汤更难开），同一原理的两面，并不矛盾。ٚBoth are colligative properties: salt lowers the freezing point (melts snow) and raises the boiling point (harder to boil soup)—two sides of one effect.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�d25e0d716975�body�ٙ冰糖是蔗糖溶液缓慢重结晶得到的纯净大晶体，故透明；红糖保留了糖蜜，含色素和矿物质，未充分精制，故色深。ًRock sugar is pure sucrose grown as large slow crystals, hence clear; brown sugar keeps molasses with pigments and minerals, so it is dark.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�d4fa76298778�body��l羊毛纤维表面有鳞片，热水加揉搓让鳞片互相勾住、纠结成毡，这种毡化不可逆。�fWool fibers have scales; hot water and agitation make the scales hook together into irreversible felt.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�d6e1161bec42�body��臭氧分子（O3）能吸收波长200至320纳米的紫外辐射，吸收能量后分解为氧气和氧原子，随后又重新结合为臭氧。这一循环持续消耗有害的UV-B和UV-C，保护地表生物免受伤害。氟氯烃等物质会破坏这一平衡。�Ozone molecules (O3) absorb ultraviolet radiation at 200 to 320 nm; after absorbing energy they split into oxygen and an oxygen atom, then recombine into ozone. This cycle continuously removes harmful UV-B and UV-C, protecting surface life. Substances like CFCs disrupt this balance.�ans��src��nChapman, S. 《高层大气臭氧理论》，《Quarterly Journal of the Royal Meteorological Society》, 1930�}Chapman, S. 'A Theory of Upper-Atmospheric Ozone,' Quarterly Journal of the Royal Meteorological Society, 1930, 56, 175–194��id�d736c88f8737�body�ل汞与银锡铜粉混合成可塑体填入牙洞，随后固化变硬、耐磨又便宜；但含汞，使用时需权衡安全性。ٝMercury mixed with silver–tin–copper powder forms a plastic mass that hardens in the cavity—durable and cheap, though mercury raises safety trade-offs.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�d7bc16d152a6�body���两种色素都围绕金属离子搭建出卟啉类的大环配合物：叶绿素是含镁的卟啉配合物，血红蛋白是含铁的卟啉配合物。镁离子使叶绿素能够吸收红光和蓝光进行光合作用，镁的缺失会导致叶片发黄；铁离子则能与氧可逆配位，负责运输氧气。金属离子的选择不是随意的，它由配体结构与功能需求共同决定，同样的大环配不同的金属，就有截然不同的生物功能。�$Both pigments are built as porphyrin-like macrocyclic complexes around a metal ion: chlorophyll is a magnesium porphyrin and hemoglobin an iron porphyrin. The Mg²⁺ lets chlorophyll absorb red and blue light for photosynthesis - when magnesium is missing, leaves turn yellow - while Fe²⁺ coordinates oxygen reversibly and carries it around the body. The choice of metal is not arbitrary; it was shaped together with the porphyrin scaffold and the biological job. The same macrocycle with different metals performs entirely different functions.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d998cec5d307�body�٢先用碱打开毛鳞片，小分子无色前体渗入皮质，再用氧化剂（过氧化氢）让它们在发丝内偶合成有色大分子，就被锁住了。ٛAlkali opens the cuticle; tiny colorless precursors enter the cortex and an oxidant (hydrogen peroxide) couples them into colored molecules trapped inside.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�d9ca2c588ffe�body�٘把空气液化后再分馏，利用氮（-196°C）与氧（-183°C）沸点不同，把氧气和氮气分开，得到高纯氧气供医疗和工业。ٙLiquefied air is fractionally distilled; N2 (-196 C) and O2 (-183 C) boil off at different temperatures, yielding pure oxygen for medical/industrial use.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�da5b1e0e010e�body��3有效数字是测量结果中能真实反映精度的数字位数，例如刻度到0.1毫升的量筒读出15.6毫升，就是三位有效数字。乘除法结果与参与运算中有效数字最少者相同，加减法则按小数点后位数最少者确定。多写出的位数并不代表真实精度。��Significant figures are the digits in a measurement that genuinely reflect its precision; for example, a reading of 15.6 mL on a 0.1-mL-graduated cylinder has three significant figures. In multiplication and division the result keeps as many significant figures as the least precise factor, while in addition and subtraction it follows the operand with the fewest decimal places. Extra digits do not represent real precision.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�daafe926559e�body���同位素是质子数相同、中子数不同的同一元素原子，化学性质相近。稳定同位素不发生自发衰变，放射性同位素则通过 α、β 或 γ 衰变变为其他核素，并可用于定年与示踪。�Isotopes are atoms of the same element with the same proton number but different neutron numbers, so their chemistry is similar. Stable isotopes do not decay spontaneously, whereas radioactive isotopes transform via α, β, or γ decay and are useful for dating and tracing.�ans��src��?陈骏、王鹤年《地球化学》(科学出版社) 第 2 章�;K. K. Turekian, Treatise on Geochemistry, 2nd ed., Elsevier��id�db0c8f3d6996�body�ه它是聚醋酸乙烯乳液，水分蒸发后聚合物成膜并渗入木纤维孔隙，靠机械咬合加分子间力把木头粘牢。٤It’s a polyvinyl acetate emulsion; as water evaporates the polymer films and penetrates wood pores, bonding by mechanical interlocking plus intermolecular forces.�ans��src��潘祖仁《高分子化学》�Polymer Chemistry (Pan Zuren)��id�dc69060e3c53�body�ٔ水离解成H+和OH-，阴极还原出氢气、阳极氧化出氧气。按反应计量，每生成1份氧气对应2份氢气，故体积比约2:1。َWater yields H+ and OH-; the cathode reduces H2, the anode oxidizes O2. Stoichiometry gives 2 volumes of H2 per 1 of O2, so the ratio is ~2:1.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�dec087a47dbe�body��N酸雨里的硫酸、硝酸与石灰石和金属反应，慢慢侵蚀表面。�WAcid rain's sulfuric/nitric acids react with limestone and metals, slowly eroding them.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�ded22b10562d�body�ل小苏打是碳酸氢钠，遇酸才产气；泡打粉本身已含酸和碱，遇水加热就双重产气，更方便控制蓬松。ٞBaking soda is sodium bicarbonate that needs acid to release gas; baking powder already contains acid plus base, so it leavens on its own with water and heat.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�df0581303d4d�body��|让 CO₂ 与含钙、镁的硅酸盐或工业废渣反应生成稳定的碳酸盐，永久固定；速率慢但最耐久。�CO₂ reacts with Ca/Mg silicates or industrial wastes to form stable carbonates, fixing it permanently; slow but most durable.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�df5718a9656d�body��o在多步合成中，某些活泼官能团会干扰后续反应，需要暂时遮蔽后再释放。例如把醇羟基转化为硅醚（TMS 或 TBS 保护），待目标反应完成后，再用氟离子试剂（如 TBAF、HF·吡啶）或稀酸/含水乙酸等条件选择性脱除。这样既保证了中间步骤的化学选择性，又不破坏其他敏感基团。��In multistep synthesis, reactive functional groups can interfere with later steps and must be temporarily masked and released later. For example, an alcohol is converted to a silyl ether (TMS or TBS protection) and then removed selectively with a fluoride source such as TBAF or HF-pyridine, or under dilute aqueous acid. This preserves chemoselectivity in the intervening steps without damaging other sensitive groups.�ans��src��9《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 19 章�?Greene's Protective Groups in Organic Synthesis, 4th ed., Wiley��id�df5b0b4b842c�body��+ATP 水解为 ADP 与磷酸时释放约 -30.5 kJ/mol 的标准自由能，主要来自产物中磷酸根基团更好的共振稳定与溶剂化，以及反应中静电排斥的减小。细胞把这一放能过程与吸能过程（如物质合成、主动运输）偶联，从而驱动生命活动。�?ATP hydrolysis to ADP and phosphate releases about -30.5 kJ/mol of standard free energy, mainly because the products are better stabilized by resonance and solvation and carry less electrostatic repulsion. Cells couple this exergonic step to endergonic processes such as biosynthesis and active transport to power life.�ans��src��c《生物化学》(Lehninger, 第七版) 生物能量学章；Nature Reviews Molecular Cell Biology�kLehninger Principles of Biochemistry, 7th ed., bioenergetics chapter; Nature Reviews Molecular Cell Biology��id�dffe8e781ff2�body���配位键是由一个原子提供孤对电子、另一个原子提供空轨道形成的共价键。配合物通常由中心金属离子（或原子）和围绕它的配体组成，配体通过孤对电子与中心金属配位。��A coordinate bond is a covalent bond in which one atom supplies a lone pair and the other supplies an empty orbital. A coordination compound typically consists of a central metal ion (or atom) surrounded by ligands that donate lone pairs to the metal.�ans��src��4《无机化学》(武汉大学) 第三版 第 9 章�<IUPAC Gold Book, coordination entity (IUPAC Recommendations)��id�e38f15ea0503�body���蛋白质腐败时含硫氨基酸被细菌分解，释放出硫化氢等含硫气体，就是典型的臭鸡蛋味。同时还会产生氨、吲哚等刺鼻物。闻到这种气味说明已变质，不应食用。�As proteins spoil, sulfur-containing amino acids are broken down by bacteria, releasing gases like hydrogen sulfide—the classic rotten-egg smell. Ammonia and indoles also form pungent odors. Such a smell means the food has spoiled and should not be eaten.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e41ca92c6dbe�body���防水防晒霜常含油溶性成膜剂和二氧化钛等，靠普通洗面奶的表面活性难以完全乳化。卸妆油以油溶油，能先把防晒膜溶解再乳化冲走。不卸干净易堵塞毛孔、引发粉刺。�Waterproof sunscreen contains oil-soluble film formers and particles like titanium dioxide that ordinary face wash cannot fully emulsify. Cleansing oil dissolves the film by like-dissolves-like and then emulsifies it away. Incomplete removal can clog pores and cause breakouts.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e5d5f405d31a�body�� 稀有气体最外层电子已达稳定结构（氦为2电子，其余为8电子），极难得失电子，长期被认为是完全不反应的。直到1962年巴特利特合成出氙的化合物，人们才确认它们也能参与反应。因此它们更准确地被称为稀有气体。�_Noble gases have complete outer shells (helium with 2 electrons, the rest with 8), making them extremely reluctant to gain or lose electrons, so they were long thought to be completely unreactive. Only after Bartlett synthesized a xenon compound in 1962 was it confirmed they can participate in reactions. The more accurate name is noble (rare) gases.�ans��src�٘Housecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》（第5版，Pearson）稀有气体化合物章节；Bartlett, N. 《Proceedings of the Chemical Society》, 1962ٔHousecroft, C. E.; Sharpe, A. G. Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson (noble-gas compounds); Bartlett, N. Proceedings of the Chemical Society, 1962��id�e740019f17a8�body��酶是蛋白质或RNA构成的生物大分子，能高效、专一地催化体内生化反应，且反应条件温和（常温常压近中性）。它们通过降低活化能加速反应，但自身不被消耗。酶的专一性来自其活性中心与底物的精确匹配。�jEnzymes are biological macromolecules made of proteins or RNA that efficiently and specifically catalyze biochemical reactions under mild conditions (near room temperature, pressure and neutral pH). They speed reactions by lowering activation energy without being consumed. Their specificity comes from precise matching between the active site and the substrate.�ans��src��gBerg, J. M.; Tymoczko, J. L.; Stryer, L. 《生物化学》（第7版，W. H. Freeman）酶章节, 2012�]Berg, J. M.; Tymoczko, J. L.; Stryer, L. Biochemistry, 7th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2012 (enzymes)��id�e7812e66ec51�body�ِ它同时含铵根和硝酸根，是高效氮肥；但在强热或受冲击时分解产气极快，可能爆炸，因此储运需严格管理。١It carries both ammonium and nitrate, making a potent fertilizer; but under strong heat or shock it decomposes explosively fast, so storage is tightly regulated.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e7d3ba99b2ac�body���氨分子是极性分子，且氮上有孤对电子，能与水分子形成氢键。同时氨在水中部分反应生成铵离子和氢氧根，进一步促进溶解。因此氨气在水中溶解度很大，1体积水可溶解约700体积氨。�$Ammonia is a polar molecule and its nitrogen has a lone pair that can form hydrogen bonds with water. It also partly reacts in water to form ammonium and hydroxide ions, further aiding dissolution. As a result ammonia is very soluble: about 700 volumes of gas dissolve in one volume of water.�ans��src��iBrown、LeMay、Bursten 等《化学：中心科学》（第14版，Pearson）氨的性质与氢键章节َBrown, T. L.; LeMay, H. E.; Bursten, B. E.; et al. Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson (properties of ammonia; hydrogen bonding)��id�e7f07aff70fb�body��u蛋白酶、脂肪酶等能把血渍、油渍等大分子污物分解成小分子，低温下也能洗得更干净。�zProteases and lipases break big stains like blood and grease into small molecules, cleaning well even at low temperatures.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�e88c8c7c8e68�body��o它集成光吸收与催化电极，在光照下把水分解或还原 CO₂，直接得到 H₂ 或甲酸等。ٔIt integrates light absorption with catalytic electrodes that split water or reduce CO₂ under illumination, yielding H₂ or formic acid directly.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e91abb708aaf�body�ٮ水泥加水后，其中的硅酸盐和铝酸盐与水发生水化反应，生成坚硬的结晶物质把砂和石粘在一起。这个过程会放热并需要一定时间。��When water is added to cement, its silicates and aluminates react with water in hydration, forming hard crystalline substances that bind sand and gravel. The process releases heat and takes time.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e98d1b10cb3a�body�ك乙醛脱氢酶ALDH2基因缺陷在东亚常见，酒精代谢出的乙醛堆积，使血管扩张脸红，也提升致癌风险。نA common East Asian ALDH2 gene variant impairs acetaldehyde breakdown, causing acetaldehyde buildup, flushing, and higher cancer risk.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�eae45752e182�body�م活体不断与环境交换 ¹⁴C，死后停止；依其约 5730 年的半衰期测剩余量来推算年代，上限约数万年。ٵLiving things exchange ¹⁴C with the environment and stop at death; measuring the remaining ¹⁴C against its ~5730-year half-life dates samples up to tens of thousands of years.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�eb84312257e6�body�٥含硫化氢（H2S）及多种矿物质的温泉能促进血液循环、舒缓关节，但高浓度硫化氢有毒，不可吸入过多；中日温泉文化悠久。ٚSulfur (H2S) and mineral hot springs boost circulation and ease joints, but high H2S is toxic—don't over-inhale. Japan and China have long spa cultures.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�eba1dd3a0b51�body��碱金属（锂、钠、钾等）最外层只有一个电子，且原子半径大、电离能低，极易失去该电子。遇水时它们迅速将电子转移给水分子，生成氢气和强碱，并放出大量热。钾、铷、铯反应更为剧烈，甚至引发燃烧或爆炸。�~Alkali metals (lithium, sodium, potassium and so on) have a single outer electron with large atomic radius and low ionization energy, so they lose it very easily. In water they rapidly transfer electrons to water molecules, producing hydrogen gas and a strong base while releasing much heat. Potassium, rubidium and cesium react even more violently, sometimes igniting or exploding.�ans��src��]Housecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》（第5版，Pearson）s区元素（碱金属）章节�_Housecroft, C. E.; Sharpe, A. G. Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson (s-block; alkali metals)��id�ecaeb92dcd78�body���樟脑丸主要成分（樟脑或对二氯苯）会缓慢升华成气体，这种气味对衣蛾等害虫有驱避或毒杀作用。它直接作用在虫子的神经系统。注意要密封衣柜使用，且避免儿童和宠物接触。��The main components of mothballs (camphor or p-dichlorobenzene) slowly sublime into a gas whose odor repels or poisons pests like clothes moths. It acts on the insects' nervous system. Use them sealed in a closet and keep them away from children and pets.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�eebca2f3bcaf�body��l水果中的果胶是高分子，加糖和酸后在水分合适时相互网联，把液体锁成半固体。�|Pectin, a fruit polymer, forms a network with sugar and acid at the right water level, trapping liquid into a semisolid gel.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�ef67f971c039�body���CO2中碳为sp杂化，无孤对电子，两个双键对称分布，分子呈直线形。SO2中硫有一对孤对电子，sp2杂化下孤对电子压缩键角，使分子呈V形。孤对电子的存在是二者形状不同的关键。� In CO2, carbon is sp hybridized with no lone pairs, so the two double bonds are symmetric and the molecule is linear. In SO2, sulfur has one lone pair; under sp2 hybridization the lone pair compresses the bond angle, giving a bent shape. The presence of a lone pair is the key difference.�ans��src��~Brown、LeMay、Bursten 等《化学：中心科学》（第14版，Pearson）价层电子对互斥理论与分子形状章节كBrown, T. L.; LeMay, H. E.; Bursten, B. E.; et al. Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson (VSEPR; shapes of CO2 and SO2)��id�ef7f7d83c2e4�body�ٍ蓄光材料（如掺铜的硫化锌）吸收光后电子缓慢回迁释放能量，发出余辉（磷光）；而普通荧光关灯即灭。َGlow materials (e.g. copper-doped ZnS) absorb light and slowly release it as afterglow (phosphorescence); ordinary fluorescence stops at once.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f17d5d9659dc�body���活化能是反应物分子转变为产物所需跨越的最低能量壁垒。只有能量达到或超过活化能的分子（活化分子）才能发生反应。催化剂通过提供新路径降低活化能，从而加快反应。�Activation energy is the minimum energy barrier that reactant molecules must cross to become products. Only molecules with energy at or above this level (activated molecules) can react. A catalyst lowers the activation energy by offering a new pathway, thus speeding the reaction.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f1aac098cfd2�body�ل用硫酸处理不溶的磷酸钙矿石，生成可溶于水的磷酸一钙，植物能直接吸收，于是成了常用的磷肥。ًTreating insoluble calcium phosphate rock with sulfuric acid yields water-soluble monocalcium phosphate, which plants can take up directly.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f22e797d8c80�body�ٷ它们是碳的同素异形体：金刚石中碳原子四面体强键（硬、绝缘），石墨中分层（软、导电），还有富勒烯、石墨烯，仅是原子排列不同。ٶThey are carbon allotropes: diamond's 3D strong bonds (hard, insulating) vs graphite's layers (soft, conductive), plus fullerenes and graphene—same element, different arrangements.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�f22fb55026ee�body�٤辣来自辣椒素激活痛觉受体（TRPV1），不是酸甜苦咸鲜那种味觉；辣椒素不溶于水，所以喝水没用，喝牛奶（脂肪）更有效。�uCapsaicin activates pain receptors (TRPV1), not the tastes; it is oil-soluble, so water doesn't help—milk fat does.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�f2d22300bbb4�body��:对乙酰氨基酚含苯环、酰胺基和酚羟基，是酰胺类解热镇痛药。它通过抑制中枢神经系统的环加氧酶，减少前列腺素合成；前列腺素会升高体温设定点，所以药物能退热。常规剂量安全，过量则因代谢物N-乙酰对苯醌亚胺积聚而损伤肝脏。��Paracetamol contains a benzene ring, an amide group and a phenolic hydroxyl, making it an amide-type antipyretic analgesic. It inhibits cyclooxygenase in the central nervous system, cutting prostaglandin synthesis; because prostaglandins raise the body's temperature set point, fever falls. Normal doses are safe, but overdose damages the liver through accumulation of the metabolite NAPQI.�ans��src��9ACS Journal of Chemical Education（药物化学专题）�?ACS Journal of Chemical Education (medicinal chemistry feature)��id�f3f25c191672�body���微波让食物内部水分子快速振动生热，蒸汽在封闭空间（如鸡蛋、葡萄、密封盒）里急剧积聚压力。当压力超过外壳或包装承受力就会爆开。加热前应戳孔或留缝隙、避免密封。�$Microwaves make water molecules inside the food vibrate and heat rapidly, so steam builds up pressure in a closed space such as an egg, a grape, or a sealed container. When pressure exceeds what the skin or package can hold, it bursts. Pierce skins or leave vents and never heat fully sealed.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f49ea8e003c6�body�� 色谱利用混合物中各组分在固定相与流动相之间分配（吸附、溶解或亲和作用）的差异实现分离。分配系数大的组分在固定相停留更久、迁移更慢，因而在不同时间流出。常见形式包括气相色谱、液相色谱和薄层色谱。�ZChromatography separates mixtures based on differences in how components partition between a stationary phase and a mobile phase (by adsorption, solubility, or affinity). Components with larger partition coefficients spend more time in the stationary phase and migrate slower, eluting at different times. Common formats include GC, HPLC, and TLC.�ans��src��X《分析化学》(武汉大学, 第五版) 色谱章；美国化学会(ACS)分析化学�ZHarris, Quantitative Chemical Analysis, chromatography chapter; Analytical Chemistry (ACS)��id�f5209b8187f1�body��rζ 电位是滑移面处的电势，绝对值越大颗粒间互斥越强、越稳定；接近零时容易絮凝。ْZeta potential is the potential at the shear plane; larger magnitude means stronger repulsion and stability, while near zero invites flocculation.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f5bc7c992150�body�ٜ酶的活性中心形状刚好匹配特定底物，只催化一种或一类反应，这就是酶的专一性；后来发现还会“诱导契合”微调。يAn enzyme’s active site fits one specific substrate, catalyzing just one reaction type—its specificity (later refined as induced fit).�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f75b5580ab03�body�ه试纸上葡萄糖氧化酶把血糖氧化，产生的电子经电极变成电流，电流大小对应血糖浓度，几秒出结果。٠Glucose oxidase on the strip oxidizes blood sugar; the resulting electrons become an electric current whose size maps to glucose concentration, read in seconds.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�f7889bb136a2�body�ّ氟单质极活泼，但其聚合物聚四氟乙烯（特氟龙）中碳-氟键极牢固，表面能极低，不粘且耐高温，反而最惰。ٕFluorine is fiercely reactive, but its polymer PTFE (Teflon) has very strong C-F bonds and low surface energy—non-stick, heat-resistant, and inert.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f80b33d3ff70�body��催化剂同等降低正、逆反应的活化能，从而同等加快两个方向的速率。它能使体系更快达到平衡，但不会改变平衡的位置和各物质的平衡浓度。也就是说，催化剂只改变到达平衡的速度，不改变平衡常数。�[A catalyst lowers the activation energy of both forward and reverse reactions equally, speeding up both rates by the same factor. It lets the system reach equilibrium faster but does not change the equilibrium position or the equilibrium concentrations. In short, a catalyst changes the speed of reaching equilibrium, not the equilibrium constant.�ans��src��iAtkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）催化对平衡的影响章节�uAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (effect of catalyst on equilibrium)��id�f8a3bc9ba506�body���三相点是液态水、冰和水蒸气三相共存的唯一温度和压强点，即0.01摄氏度和611.7帕，此时三相相互平衡。它与常说的大气压下冰点（0摄氏度）不同：冰点随压强改变，而三相点是热力学上固定的参考点。历史上开尔文温标曾以水的三相点（273.16 K）为基准定义，2019年国际单位制改版后改用玻尔兹曼常数定义，但三相点仍是重要的温度固定点。�5The triple point is the unique temperature and pressure at which liquid water, ice and water vapor coexist in equilibrium - 0.01 degrees Celsius and 611.7 pascals. It differs from the familiar freezing point at 1 atmosphere (0 degrees Celsius), which shifts with pressure, while the triple point is a fixed thermodynamic reference. Historically the kelvin scale was defined via the water triple point (273.16 K); since the 2019 SI redefinition the kelvin is fixed through the Boltzmann constant, though the triple point remains an important temperature fixed point.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f8a8f47f7709�body���低温让酵母活动变慢，延长发酵时间，使风味物质（有机酸、酯类）更充分生成，面香更浓。同时面筋松弛、延展性更好，成品组织细腻。这就是冷藏发酵（cold retard）受面包师欢迎的原因。�Low temperature slows the yeast, lengthening fermentation so flavor compounds like organic acids and esters develop more fully and the crumb smells richer. The gluten also relaxes and extends better for a finer texture. That is why bakers love cold retardation.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f9bffac667a1�body��n薄荷醇能激活皮肤里的冷觉受体（TRPM8），大脑误以为温度下降，于是产生清凉感。�xMenthol activates cold receptors (TRPM8) in the skin, so the brain perceives a cooling sensation without actual cooling.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�fb69544fc9ca�body��h根据比尔-朗伯定律A等于吸光系数乘光程乘浓度，同一物质在固定波长下吸光度与浓度成正比。先配制一系列已知浓度的标准溶液，在最大吸收波长处测吸光度，绘制吸光度-浓度标准曲线；再测未知样品吸光度，从曲线上读出浓度，前提是样品浓度落在曲线的线性范围内。��By the Beer-Lambert law, A equals molar absorptivity times path length times concentration, so at a fixed wavelength absorbance is proportional to concentration for a given substance. Prepare a series of standard solutions of known concentration, measure their absorbance at the absorption maximum, plot the standard curve, then read the unknown concentration from its absorbance - provided it falls within the linear range of the curve.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�fd14e9ae0041�body��r量子限域使带隙随粒径减小而增大，越小发光越偏蓝；广泛用于 QLED 显示与生物标记。�}Quantum confinement widens the band gap as particles shrink, shifting emission bluer; used in QLED displays and bio-labeling.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�fd59feb4fdf9�body�ِ卤化银（如溴化银）见光分解出银核，显影液把曝光处放大成黑色银粒，定影液溶去未曝光部分，完成影像。٠Silver halides (e.g. AgBr) split into silver nuclei on exposure; developer amplifies exposed grains to black silver, fixer removes the rest—forming the image.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�fd758df8725d�body�ف加入氧化硼降低了热膨胀系数，温度变化时内部应力小，不容易炸裂，所以可作烧杯和烤箱器皿。١Boron oxide lowers the thermal expansion coefficient, so temperature changes cause little internal stress and it resists cracking—used in labware and ovenware.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�06118b30f8dc�body��在碱性条件下，酯水解生成的羧酸立即被碱中和成羧酸盐，使逆反应（酯化）无法进行，因此皂化反应进行到底、不可逆。酸性水解是可逆平衡反应，需除去水或使用过量试剂推动平衡，产物为游离羧酸和醇。��Under basic conditions the carboxylic acid produced by ester hydrolysis is immediately neutralized to a carboxylate salt, preventing the reverse esterification, so saponification goes to completion and is irreversible. Acid-catalyzed hydrolysis is an equilibrium process that requires removing water or using excess reagent to drive it toward products, yielding free carboxylic acid and alcohol.�ans��src��Q邢其毅、裴坚《基础有机化学》（第四版），北京大学出版社�\Xing Qiyi & Pei Jian, 'Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry' (4th ed.), Peking University Press��id�1253d1f5731a�body��>氧化加成使催化剂（如 Pd(0)）插入底物卤键，生成高价金属中间体；迁移插入将配位基团转移到金属上的另一个配体，延长碳链或成环；还原消除则把金属上两个配体接合为产物并再生低价催化剂。这一循环决定了反应的选择性与催化周转。��Oxidative addition inserts the catalyst (e.g., Pd(0)) into a substrate's halide bond to give a higher-valent metal complex; migratory insertion transfers a coordinated group onto another ligand, extending a chain or closing a ring; reductive elimination joins two ligands into the product and regenerates the low-valent catalyst. This cycle governs selectivity and catalytic turnover.�ans��src��9《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 22 章�RJ. F. Hartwig, Organotransition Metal Chemistry, 2nd ed., University Science Books��id�15d2172d6fcd�body��&硫化是在天然橡胶（聚异戊二烯）中加入硫并加热，使硫原子在聚合物链之间形成交联桥。这些交联限制了分子链的相对滑移，从而大幅提高橡胶的弹性、强度、耐热性和抗变形能力，避免未硫化橡胶发黏、易流淌的缺点。�TVulcanization adds sulfur to natural rubber (polyisoprene) and heats it, forming sulfur cross-links between polymer chains. These cross-links restrict the relative slippage of molecular chains, greatly improving elasticity, strength, heat resistance, and resistance to deformation, overcoming the stickiness and flow of unvulcanized rubber.�ans��src��c美国化学会（ACS）化学史（查尔斯·固特异，1839）；潘祖仁《高分子化学》�`American Chemical Society (ACS) history (Charles Goodyear, 1839); Pan Zuren, 'Polymer Chemistry'��id�19a61cbafa35�body��过渡金属有未充满的 d 轨道，电子可在不同 d 能级间跃迁（d–d 跃迁）吸收可见光，使化合物显色。多种氧化态则源于 (n-1)d 与 ns 电子能量接近，可不同程度失去。这带来丰富的催化与配位化学。�OTransition metals have partially filled d orbitals; electrons can jump between d levels (d–d transitions) absorbing visible light, coloring their compounds. Multiple oxidation states arise because (n-1)d and ns electrons have similar energies and can be lost to varying degrees. This yields rich catalysis and coordination chemistry.�ans��src��*《无机化学》（武汉大学等编）�!Inorganic Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�1b80019ebb27�body���凯夫拉是芳香族聚酰胺，分子链含刚性苯环并可形成大量链间氢键，沿链方向极其坚固，因此用于防弹与缆绳。Kwolek 在 1965 年于杜邦发明了这种芳纶纤维。��Kevlar is an aramid: rigid benzene rings line the backbone and many interchain hydrogen bonds make it enormously strong along the chain, suiting body armor and ropes. Kwolek invented the aramid fiber at DuPont in 1965.�ans��src��/Kwolek 1965 年专利；Odian《聚合原理》�9Kwolek (1965 patent); Odian, Principles of Polymerization��id�24dc168ea0ef�body��E18 电子规则认为，过渡金属配合物若价层电子数达到 18（达到稀有气体构型）则较稳定，常用于预测有机金属物种的合理性。但它主要适用于低氧化态、强场配体的配合物，对高氧化态、早期过渡金属及具有金属-金属键或自由基的体系常常失效。�tThe 18-electron rule holds that a transition-metal complex is stable when its valence shell reaches 18 electrons (a noble-gas configuration) and is widely used to assess organometallic plausibility. It mainly applies to low-oxidation-state, strong-field complexes and often fails for high-oxidation-state, early-transition-metal, or metal-metal-bonded and radical species.�ans��src��5《无机化学》(武汉大学) 第三版 第 14 章�5C. Elschenbroich, Organometallics, 3rd ed., Wiley-VCH��id�31803a42d64a�body��朗伯-比尔定律指出，溶液对单色光的吸光度 A 与吸光物质浓度 c 和光程 l 成正比：A = εcl，其中 ε 为摩尔吸光系数。它使分光光度法能通过测吸光度来定量未知浓度。该定律只在稀溶液和特定条件下严格成立。�MThe Beer–Lambert law states that a solution's absorbance A of monochromatic light is proportional to the concentration c and path length l: A = εcl, with ε the molar absorptivity. It lets spectrophotometry quantify unknown concentrations from absorbance. The law holds strictly only for dilute solutions under defined conditions.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�320de6bbbae7�body��接触角是液滴在固体表面气-液-固三相交界处与固体的夹角，杨氏方程 cos θ = (γsv − γsl)/γlv 把接触角与三个界面张力联系起来，反映润湿性。超疏水表面的接触角通常大于 150°，水滴近乎球状滚落。�EThe contact angle is the angle a liquid drop makes with a solid at the three-phase line, and Young's equation cos θ = (γsv − γsl)/γlv links it to the three interfacial tensions, reflecting wettability. A superhydrophobic surface shows a contact angle usually above 150°, with droplets nearly spherical and rolling off.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�34443221015f�body���同一周期从左到右，有效核电荷增大，原子半径逐渐减小；同一族从上到下，电子层数增加，半径增大。过渡金属区变化较缓。原子半径直接影响键长、硬度和反应活性。��Across a period left to right, rising effective nuclear charge shrinks atomic radius; down a group, added electron shells enlarge it. The transition block changes more slowly. Atomic radius directly affects bond length, hardness, and reactivity.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�3537d9adbf33�body��苯酚解离出质子后形成的苯氧负离子，其负电荷可通过共振离域到苯环上，从而得到显著稳定。普通醇的烷氧负离子负电荷局限在氧原子上，稳定性差，因此苯酚的pKa约10，远强于乙醇（pKa约16）。�+Upon losing a proton, the phenoxide ion stabilizes its negative charge by resonance delocalization onto the benzene ring. In ordinary alcohols the alkoxide charge is localized on the oxygen, making it much less stable; consequently phenol has a pKa around 10, far more acidic than ethanol (pKa ~16).�ans��src��Q邢其毅、裴坚《基础有机化学》（第四版），北京大学出版社�\Xing Qiyi & Pei Jian, 'Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry' (4th ed.), Peking University Press��id�35b12ad0f5b7�body��'鲍林电负性是基于键能经验数据定义的相对标度，数值越大表示原子在共价键中吸引共用电子对的能力越强。氟的电负性最高（约3.98），是周期表中吸引电子能力最强的元素，因而几乎总是共价化合物中带部分负电的一方。��The Pauling electronegativity scale is a relative scale derived from empirical bond-energy data; the larger the value, the stronger an atom's ability to attract shared electron pairs in a covalent bond. Fluorine has the highest electronegativity (about 3.98) and is the strongest electron-attracting element in the periodic table, so it is almost always the partially negative end of covalent compounds.�ans��src��NL. 鲍林《化学键的本质》（The Nature of the Chemical Bond）；IUPAC�4L. Pauling, 'The Nature of the Chemical Bond'; IUPAC��id�3eab9ff69221�body��活体生物不断与环境交换碳，体内碳-14 与稳定碳比例恒定；死亡后交换停止，碳-14 按已知半衰期衰变减少。测出现存碳-14 比例即可反推死亡至今的时间，有效范围约数万年。该方法由利比创立并获诺贝尔化学奖。�LLiving organisms constantly exchange carbon, keeping a constant C-14 to stable-carbon ratio; after death exchange stops and C-14 decays at its known half-life. Measuring the remaining C-14 fraction back-calculates the time since death, valid up to tens of thousands of years. Libby developed it and won the Nobel Prize in Chemistry.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�470b388ccf9d�body��紫外可见光谱记录分子在 200–800 nm 范围内对光的吸收，源于价电子从基态到激发态的跃迁。含共轭双键或发色团的分子在该区有强吸收，吸收强度遵守朗伯-比尔定律 A = εcl。它广泛用于定量测定溶液浓度。�?UV-Vis spectroscopy records a molecule's light absorption from 200–800 nm, arising from electronic transitions to excited states. Molecules with conjugated double bonds or chromophores absorb strongly there, and intensity follows the Beer–Lambert law A = εcl. It is widely used to quantify solution concentrations.�ans��src��武汉大学《分析化学》�"Analytical Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�4f3c44d2ffd5�body��;由于电极电势的绝对值无法测定，电化学上约定将标准氢电极（2H⁺ + 2e⁻ ⇌ H2，标准状态）的电极电势定义并规定为0伏，作为比较基准。所有其他物质的标准电极电势都是相对于SHE测得的相对值，据此可判断氧化还原反应的方向与强弱。�\Because absolute electrode potentials cannot be measured, electrochemistry defines the standard hydrogen electrode (2H⁺ + 2e⁻ ⇌ H2 under standard conditions) to have exactly 0 V as a reference. All other standard electrode potentials are measured relative to the SHE, allowing prediction of the direction and driving force of redox reactions.�ans��src��\国际纯粹与应用化学联合会（IUPAC）电化学术语；傅献彩《物理化学》�xInternational Union of Pure and Applied Chemistry (IUPAC) electrochemistry terminology; Fu Xiancai, 'Physical Chemistry'��id�5574aee32222�body��M锂离子电池充放电时，Li⁺在正负极的层状/框架材料之间来回嵌入与脱出（脱嵌），电子则经外电路做功，这一过程称为“摇椅式”机制。由于锂是密度最小、电极电势最低的金属，单位质量储能高且无需笨重的金属负极，因此电池轻巧、能量密度大。��During charge and discharge, Li⁺ ions shuttle back and forth by inserting into and extracting from layered/framework electrode materials (intercalation), while electrons do work through the external circuit—a 'rocking-chair' mechanism. Because lithium is the lightest metal with the lowest electrode potential, it stores much energy per unit mass and needs no heavy metal negative electrode, making the battery light and energy-dense.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�5646bdee3f06�body��配位化合物由中心金属离子（或原子）与围绕它的若干配体通过配位键结合而成。配体是提供孤对电子的分子或离子（如 NH₃、Cl⁻、H₂O），中心离子接受电子对。经典例子是六氨合钴(III)离子 [Co(NH₃)₆]³⁺。�.A coordination compound consists of a central metal ion (or atom) bonded to surrounding ligands via coordinate bonds. Ligands are molecules or ions donating lone pairs (e.g., NH₃, Cl⁻, H₂O), and the central ion accepts them. A classic example is the hexaamminecobalt(III) ion [Co(NH₃)₆]³⁺.�ans��src��*《无机化学》（武汉大学等编）�!Inorganic Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�57fe755b0405�body��E尼龙是缩聚产物，由二元胺与二元酸（或氨基酸自身）缩合形成含酰胺键（—CO—NH—）的长链聚酰胺。其分子链间可形成氢键，赋予纤维高强度与光泽，外观和手感类似丝绸，因此被称为合成丝；尼龙由华莱士·卡罗瑟斯于1935年在杜邦公司发明。�cNylon is made by condensation polymerization of a diamine and a diacid (or self-condensation of an amino acid) into long polyamide chains containing amide bonds (—CO—NH—). Interchain hydrogen bonds give the fibers high strength and luster resembling silk, earning it the name 'synthetic silk'; it was invented by Wallace Carothers at DuPont in 1935.�ans��src��N美国化学会（ACS）与杜邦公司史料；潘祖仁《高分子化学》�]American Chemical Society (ACS) and DuPont historical records; Pan Zuren, 'Polymer Chemistry'��id�6302c006c4a6�body��顺铂的化学名为顺式二氯二氨合铂(II)，进入细胞后氯离子被水分子取代，活化的铂配合物与DNA两条链上的相邻鸟嘌呤形成链内交联。这种DNA损伤阻断了复制与转录，从而抑制癌细胞增殖，是经典的金属类化疗药物。�PCisplatin (cis-diamminedichloroplatinum(II)) enters cells where chloride is replaced by water, and the activated platinum complex forms intrastrand cross-links between adjacent guanines on DNA. This DNA damage blocks replication and transcription, inhibiting cancer-cell proliferation, making it a classic metal-based chemotherapy drug.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�69cecddfc56a�body��9硅酸盐的基本结构单元是硅氧四面体（SiO4），其中硅位于四面体中心、氧位于顶点。这些四面体可通过共用氧原子连接成孤立岛状、链状、片状或三维网络结构，云母为层状、石棉为链状、石英为三维骨架，差异源于四面体的聚合方式。�nThe fundamental building block of silicates is the silicon-oxygen tetrahedron (SiO4), with silicon at the center and oxygen at the corners. These tetrahedra share oxygen atoms to form isolated, chain, sheet, or three-dimensional framework structures; mica is sheet-like, asbestos is chain-like, and quartz is a 3D network, differing in how the tetrahedra polymerize.�ans��src��N北京师范大学等《无机化学》（第四版），高等教育出版社�YBeijing Normal University et al., 'Inorganic Chemistry' (4th ed.), Higher Education Press��id�6c13201ccd43�body���洪特规则说，在能量相同的简并轨道上，电子会先以相同自旋分别占据不同轨道，再配对。这样排布使总自旋最大、电子间排斥最小，体系能量最低。例如碳的 2p 轨道先各占一个电子。�Hund's rule says that electrons first occupy degenerate orbitals singly with parallel spins before pairing. This maximizes total spin and minimizes electron repulsion, giving the lowest energy. For example, carbon's 2p electrons first occupy separate p orbitals.�ans��src��!周公度《结构化学基础》�"Structural Chemistry (Zhou Gongdu)��id�707eb2b82689�body���生物电子等排体替换是用体积、电荷分布或电子效应相近的基团互换，以保持或改善活性。经典例子是把酯换成酰胺以抵抗酯酶水解，或用氟原子替换氢以调节代谢稳定性和脂溶性。�!Bioisosteric replacement swaps groups with similar size, charge distribution, or electronic effects to maintain or improve activity. Classic cases replace an ester with an amide to resist esterase hydrolysis, or replace hydrogen with fluorine to tune metabolic stability and lipophilicity.�ans��src��x《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 3 章 ; 另见: G. A. Patani & E. J. LaVoie, Chem. Rev. 1996, 96, 3147 (ACS)�zG. A. Patani & E. J. LaVoie, Chem. Rev. 1996, 96, 3147 (ACS) ; see also: 《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 3 章��id�7135087ed768�body��&比尔—朗伯定律指出，溶液对单色光的吸光度A与吸光物质的浓度c和光程长度l成正比，即 A = ε·c·l（ε为摩尔吸光系数）。利用该关系可通过测量吸光度来定量测定溶液中物质的浓度，是紫外—可见分光光度法的理论基础。�bThe Beer-Lambert law states that the absorbance A of a solution at a given wavelength is directly proportional to the concentration c of the absorbing species and the path length l: A = ε·c·l, where ε is the molar absorptivity. It allows quantitative determination of concentration from measured absorbance and underlies UV-visible spectrophotometry.�ans��src��u华中师范大学、东北师范大学、陕西师范大学《分析化学》（第四版），高等教育出版社�`Central China Normal University et al., 'Analytical Chemistry' (4th ed.), Higher Education Press��id�75025c225c4e�body���沸石是具有均匀孔道和强酸位的微孔铝硅酸盐，能按分子大小筛分反应物并稳定碳正离子中间体，广泛用于石油裂化与异构化。Corma 等的综述总结了其在炼油中的核心地位。�Zeolites are microporous aluminosilicates with uniform pores and strong acid sites; they size-select reactants and stabilize carbocation intermediates, widely used in petroleum cracking and isomerization. Corma's reviews summarize their central role in refining.�ans��src��DCorma 沸石催化综述；Thomas 与 Thomas《多相催化原理》�XCorma, zeolite catalysis reviews; Thomas & Thomas, Principles of Heterogeneous Catalysis��id�76b88d527980�body��a石墨烯是单层碳原子以sp²杂化形成的二维蜂窝状六角晶格，每个碳原子贡献一个离域π电子。这些自由离域的电子可在平面内无阻碍高速移动，加上极强的C-C键和高效的声子传输，使其兼具超高导电性与导热性，2004年由盖姆和诺沃肖洛夫首次分离并获2010年诺贝尔奖。��Graphene is a single layer of carbon atoms in a two-dimensional honeycomb lattice with sp² hybridization, each atom contributing one delocalized π electron. These delocalized electrons move freely and rapidly in the plane, and the strong C-C bonds enable efficient phonon transport, giving both extraordinary electrical and thermal conductivity; it was first isolated by Geim and Novoselov in 2004, earning the 2010 Nobel Prize.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�770623818f41�body���基准物质是纯度高、组成确定、稳定且摩尔质量较大的物质，可直接配制标准溶液。例如邻苯二甲酸氢钾、碳酸钠常用于标定酸或碱的浓度。它保证了滴定等定量分析的准确起点。�&A primary standard is a highly pure, well-defined, stable substance with a large molar mass that can directly make a standard solution. Potassium hydrogen phthalate and sodium carbonate, for example, standardize acid or base concentrations. It ensures an accurate starting point for titrations.�ans��src��武汉大学《分析化学》�"Analytical Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�7c7e8d125949�body��h最常见的那几类塑料（聚乙烯、聚丙烯、聚苯乙烯）主链是碳-碳单键，没有可以被水解攻击的极性键，也没有微生物熟悉的可代谢「接口」；再加上分子量大、不亲水、常温下玻璃化或结晶，酶根本靠近不了。自然界降解木质素和纤维素的真菌是花了几亿年演化出配套酶的，而塑料量产不过七十年，微生物的适应才刚开始——确实已经有一些细菌和真菌能啃聚氨酯或聚乙烯，但速率以年计。所以「难降解」是化学结构与演化时间双重造成的，不是「塑料有毒」。��The most common plastics - polyethylene, polypropylene, polystyrene - have carbon-carbon single-bond backbones: no polar bond for hydrolysis to attack, and no metabolic 'handle' that microbes recognise. On top of that the molecules are huge, hydrophobic and glassy or crystalline at room temperature, so enzymes can barely reach them. Fungi that break down lignin and cellulose spent hundreds of millions of years evolving the enzymes for it, whereas plastics have been mass-produced for only about seventy years, so microbial adaptation has just begun - some bacteria and fungi do nibble polyurethane or polyethylene, but at rates measured in years. 'Hard to degrade' therefore comes from chemical structure plus evolutionary time, not from plastic being toxic.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�8196c9015fe7�body��盖斯定律指出，化学反应的热效应只与始态和终态有关，与反应途径无关。因此可以把多个已知反应热的方程式相加，间接求得难以直接测量的反应焓变。它在热化学计算和工业过程设计中非常实用。�(Hess's law states that the heat of a reaction depends only on initial and final states, not the pathway. Thus one can add equations with known reaction heats to find an enthalpy change that is hard to measure directly. It is practical in thermochemical calculations and industrial process design.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�8b1db7c6b027�body��细胞呼吸主要包括糖酵解、三羧酸循环（TCA）和氧化磷酸化三个阶段。糖酵解在细胞质把葡萄糖分解为丙酮酸，TCA 在线粒体基质彻底氧化，电子传递链通过氧化磷酸化产生大量 ATP。整个过程消耗 O₂ 并放出 CO₂。�gCellular respiration has three main stages: glycolysis, the tricarboxylic acid (TCA) cycle, and oxidative phosphorylation. Glycolysis in the cytosol splits glucose to pyruvate; the TCA cycle in the mitochondrial matrix fully oxidizes it; the electron transport chain makes large ATP via oxidative phosphorylation. The process consumes O₂ and releases CO₂.�ans��src��王镜岩《生物化学》�Biochemistry (Wang Jingyan)��id�9556d3bbb9c1�body��杂化是原子在成键时把能量相近的原子轨道混合，重新组合成数目相等、方向更合理的新轨道。甲烷中碳的一个 2s 与三个 2p 轨道杂化为四个等价的 sp³ 轨道，指向正四面体四个顶点，键角约109.5°。�Hybridization mixes atomic orbitals of similar energy to form new equivalent orbitals oriented for bonding. In methane, carbon's one 2s and three 2p orbitals hybridize into four equivalent sp³ orbitals pointing to a tetrahedron's corners, with bond angles near 109.5°.�ans��src��!周公度《结构化学基础》�"Structural Chemistry (Zhou Gongdu)��id�b31458503d05�body��均相催化剂与反应物同相（如溶液中的金属配合物），活性位点均一、选择性高但难回收；多相催化剂为另一相（如固体表面），易分离却可能传质受限。二者机理分别由有机金属与表面科学阐述。�HA homogeneous catalyst shares a phase with reactants (e.g., a metal complex in solution), giving uniform sites and high selectivity but hard recovery; a heterogeneous one is a separate phase (solid surface), easy to separate yet mass-transport limited. Their mechanisms belong to organometallic and surface science respectively.�ans��src��DAtkins《物理化学》；Thomas 与 Thomas《多相催化原理》�RAtkins, Physical Chemistry; Thomas & Thomas, Principles of Heterogeneous Catalysis��id�bd226bb4dd1c�body��,手性分子与其镜像不能重合，就像左手和右手的关系，通常源于连有四个不同基团的碳原子（手性中心）。许多药物的手性对映体生理活性差异巨大，例如一种沙利度胺对映体镇静、另一种致畸。因此药物研发必须区分对映体。�eA chiral molecule is not superimposable on its mirror image, like left and right hands, often due to a carbon attached to four different groups (a stereocenter). Many drug enantiomers differ greatly in biological activity—one thalidomide enantiomer sedated, the other caused birth defects. Distinguishing enantiomers is thus essential in drug development.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�becfe80b3c9d�body��阿伦尼乌斯方程 k = A·e^(−Ea/RT) 描述了反应速率常数k随温度T指数上升的关系，其中A为指前因子、R为气体常数。活化能Ea是反应物分子跨越能垒、转变为产物所需的最低能量，Ea越大反应对温度越敏感、速率越慢。�\The Arrhenius equation, k = A·e^(−Ea/RT), describes how the rate constant k rises exponentially with temperature T, where A is the pre-exponential factor and R the gas constant. The activation energy Ea is the minimum energy reactant molecules must overcome to form products; a larger Ea makes the reaction more temperature-sensitive and slower.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�c018dfff7a4a�body��系统误差由固定原因（仪器未校准、方法缺陷）引起，方向恒定、可修正，决定结果的准确度。随机误差来自不可控波动，大小方向随机，决定精密度，可通过多次测量取平均减小。两者共同影响分析质量。�?Systematic error arises from fixed causes (uncalibrated instrument, flawed method), is constant in direction, and is correctable—it sets accuracy. Random error comes from uncontrollable fluctuations, varies unpredictably, and sets precision; averaging replicate measurements reduces it. Both shape analytical quality.�ans��src��武汉大学《分析化学》�"Analytical Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�c16231f33daa�body�� 诱导契合学说认为，底物靠近酶时并非被动嵌入现成口袋，而是诱导酶活性中心的构象发生适应性变化，使催化基团精确就位。相比把酶看作刚性模板的锁钥模型，它更好地解释了酶对底物的广谱适应性与催化高效性。�fThe induced-fit model holds that as a substrate approaches, it induces a conformational change in the enzyme's active site so catalytic groups are positioned precisely—rather than the substrate simply dropping into a preformed pocket. Compared with the rigid lock-and-key model, it better explains enzymes' broad adaptability and high catalytic efficiency.�ans��src��[王镜岩等《生物化学》（第三版），高等教育出版社；D. E. Koshland,1958�[Wang Jingyan et al., 'Biochemistry' (3rd ed.), Higher Education Press; D. E. Koshland, 1958��id�c4e4fa42ab78�body��@指示剂本身是弱酸或弱碱，其酸式与碱式具有不同颜色，颜色随溶液pH在某一范围内（变色范围）突变。选择指示剂时应使其变色范围落在滴定突跃区间内，例如强酸强碱滴定可用酚酞或甲基橙，而弱酸滴定宜选用酚酞等变色在碱区的指示剂。��An indicator is itself a weak acid or base whose acid and base forms have different colors, and the color switches over a certain pH interval (its transition range). The indicator should be chosen so its transition range falls within the titration's sharp pH jump—e.g., phenolphthalein or methyl orange for strong acid-strong base titrations, and phenolphthalein for titrating weak acids.�ans��src��u华中师范大学、东北师范大学、陕西师范大学《分析化学》（第四版），高等教育出版社�`Central China Normal University et al., 'Analytical Chemistry' (4th ed.), Higher Education Press��id�c87c6f492da5�body��(格氏试剂（RMgX）是强亲核试剂，可与醛、酮、酯等羰基化合物加成，是构建碳—碳键、合成醇类的重要工具。它极易与水反应生成烷烃（RMgX + H2O → RH + MgXOH），也易被氧气氧化，因此必须在严格无水无氧环境下制备和使用。��Grignard reagents (RMgX) are strong nucleophiles that add to carbonyl compounds such as aldehydes, ketones, and esters, making them essential for forming carbon-carbon bonds and synthesizing alcohols. They react violently with water to give alkanes (RMgX + H2O → RH + MgXOH) and are readily oxidized by air, so they must be prepared and used under strictly anhydrous, oxygen-free conditions.�ans��src��c诺贝尔奖官方网站（NobelPrize.org，1912年化学奖）；邢其毅《基础有机化学》�ONobelPrize.org (Chemistry 1912); Xing Qiyi, 'Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry'��id�cc74a1090968�body���速率方程是把反应速率与反应物浓度联系的经验式，如 v = k[A]^m[B]^n。各浓度指数之和 m+n 为总反应级数，k 为速率常数。级数由实验测定，不一定等于化学计量数。�A rate law is an empirical relation linking reaction rate to reactant concentrations, e.g., v = k[A]^m[B]^n. The sum m+n is the overall reaction order, and k is the rate constant. Order is found experimentally and need not match stoichiometric coefficients.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�cdfc7118584c�body��熵是体系混乱度（微观状态数）的度量，单位为 J·K⁻¹·mol⁻¹。热力学第二定律指出孤立体系的熵永不减少，等温等压下可用吉布斯自由能 ΔG = ΔH – TΔS 判断：ΔG<0 时过程自发。熵增常伴随扩散、混合和气体生成。�WEntropy measures a system's disorder (number of microstates), with units J·K⁻¹·mol⁻¹. The second law states the entropy of an isolated system never decreases; at constant T and p, Gibbs free energy ΔG = ΔH – TΔS decides spontaneity: if ΔG<0 the process is spontaneous. Entropy increases with spreading, mixing, and gas formation.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�cf87f46c02ae�body���焓（H）是体系的内能加压强体积项（H = U + pV），在等压条件下的变化 ΔH 约等于吸收或放出的热量。ΔH<0 为放热反应，ΔH>0 为吸热反应。燃烧、中和多为放热，而分解、汽化多为吸热。�FEnthalpy (H) is a system's internal energy plus a pressure–volume term (H = U + pV); at constant pressure its change ΔH roughly equals heat absorbed or released. ΔH<0 means an exothermic reaction, ΔH>0 an endothermic one. Combustion and neutralization are typically exothermic, decomposition and vaporization endothermic.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�chem_26_020�body��模型把水溶性高分子主链、经间隔臂悬挂的药物与靶向基团三个模块连于一体，是聚合物前药设计的通用蓝图。主链提供水溶性并延长体内循环；药物通过可水解或可酶切的间隔臂偶联，被转运至病灶处切下后才恢复活性，避免偶联态失效；靶向基团如半乳糖、叶酸或抗体识别病变细胞特异受体，实现主动富集。它首次将增溶、控制释放与靶向整合进同一个分子架构，成为后续高分子载药体系的共同起点。��The model fastens three modules onto one scaffold - a water-soluble polymer backbone, drugs hung on spacer arms, and targeting groups - and stands as the general blueprint for polymer prodrugs. The backbone supplies water solubility and prolongs circulation; each drug rides a hydrolyzable or enzymatically cleavable spacer, recovering activity only after being clipped off at the lesion, since the tethered form is inactive; targeting ligands such as galactose, folate, or antibodies dock receptors unique to diseased cells for active accumulation. It first unified solubilization, controlled release, and targeting within a single molecular design, the shared starting point of later polymer carriers.�ans��src�ٞRingsdorf,《Structure and properties of pharmacologically active polymers》,Journal of Polymer Science: Polymer Symposia,1975 (DOI: 10.1002/polc.5070510111)ٜRingsdorf, 'Structure and properties of pharmacologically active polymers', Journal of Polymer Science: Polymer Symposia, 1975, DOI: 10.1002/polc.5070510111��id�d7a3b735768a�body��?ATP（三磷酸腺苷）水解为ADP和磷酸时释放大量自由能，主要原因是产物中磷酸基团间的静电斥力被解除、且产物比反应物更稳定（共振与溶剂化更好）。在标准生化条件下其ΔG°′约为−30.5 kJ/mol，细胞借此驱动合成、运输、运动等耗能过程。�~ATP (adenosine triphosphate) releases substantial free energy when hydrolyzed to ADP and phosphate, mainly because electrostatic repulsion among its phosphate groups is relieved and the products are more stable (better resonance and solvation). Under standard biochemical conditions ΔG°′ is about −30.5 kJ/mol, energy the cell uses to drive synthesis, transport, and movement.�ans��src��E王镜岩等《生物化学》（第三版），高等教育出版社�EWang Jingyan et al., 'Biochemistry' (3rd ed.), Higher Education Press��id�dfb2a72b7d42�body��#质谱先将样品分子电离成带电离子，再在电场和磁场中按质荷比（m/z，质量与电荷数之比）分离并检测。分子离子峰的m/z对应分子的相对分子质量，而碎片离子峰则提供分子结构信息，是现代有机物结构鉴定的核心手段。�Mass spectrometry first ionizes sample molecules into charged ions, then separates and detects them according to their mass-to-charge ratio m/z (mass divided by charge number) in electric and magnetic fields. The molecular ion peak's m/z gives the relative molecular mass, while fragment ion peaks reveal structural information, making MS central to organic structure identification.�ans��src��u华中师范大学、东北师范大学、陕西师范大学《分析化学》（第四版），高等教育出版社�`Central China Normal University et al., 'Analytical Chemistry' (4th ed.), Higher Education Press��id�e1838a58abe1�body��FITC 等染料可被特定波长激发并发射波长更长的荧光，实现对生物分子的特异性可视化。斯托克斯位移（发射波长长于激发波长）使发射光与激发光在光谱上分离，便于滤光片滤除背景激发光，提高信噪比。�9Dyes like FITC are excited at a specific wavelength and emit longer-wavelength fluorescence, enabling specific visualization of biomolecules. The Stokes shift (emission at longer wavelength than excitation) spectrally separates emission from excitation so filters can remove background, improving signal-to-noise.�ans��src��5《仪器分析》(武汉大学) 第五版 第 11 章�VR. P. Haugland, Handbook of Fluorescent Probes and Research Products, Molecular Probes��id�e9e9efd6531f�body��标准电极电势（E°）衡量半反应在标准状态下得电子的趋势，数值越正越容易被还原。通过比较两电对的 E°，可判断氧化还原反应自发方向及电池电压。例如 E°(F₂/F⁻) 很高，说明氟是最强氧化剂之一。�HStandard electrode potential (E°) measures a half-reaction's tendency to gain electrons under standard conditions; the more positive, the easier reduction. Comparing two E° values predicts a redox reaction's spontaneity and cell voltage. For example, E°(F₂/F⁻) is very high, marking fluorine among the strongest oxidants.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�ece4a8c264d5�body���半衰期是反应物浓度降到初始值一半所需的时间。一级反应的半衰期 t½ = ln2 / k，只与速率常数 k 有关，与初始浓度无关。放射性衰变和许多药物代谢都遵循一级动力学。�Half-life is the time for a reactant's concentration to fall to half its initial value. For a first-order reaction t½ = ln2 / k, depending only on the rate constant k, not the starting concentration. Radioactive decay and many drug metabolisms follow first-order kinetics.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�f25ac422199c�body��,沸石是微孔铝硅酸盐骨架，内部具有均匀、规则的纳米级孔道和空腔。这些孔道能选择性吸附特定大小的分子（分子筛效应）并提供限域反应空间，骨架上的负电荷可由可交换的阳离子平衡，从而兼具择形催化与离子交换能力。�uZeolites are microporous aluminosilicate frameworks with uniform, regular nano-sized channels and cavities. These pores selectively adsorb molecules of certain sizes (molecular-sieving) and provide confined reaction space, while negative charges on the framework are balanced by exchangeable cations, giving zeolites both shape-selective catalysis and ion-exchange ability.�ans��src��K国际沸石协会（IZA）结构数据库；潘履让《固体催化剂》�ZInternational Zeolite Association (IZA) Structure Database; Pan Lürang, 'Solid Catalysts'��id�f43c7d84887e�body��&分子中电子、振动、转动能级都是量子化的，只有当入射光子的能量恰好等于两个能级差时才会被吸收。不同分子能级结构不同，吸收的频率（波长）就不同，形成特征指纹。这正是红外、紫外可见等光谱定性分析的基础。�eElectronic, vibrational, and rotational levels in molecules are quantized, so a photon is absorbed only when its energy exactly matches a level difference. Different molecules have different level structures and thus absorb different frequencies, forming characteristic fingerprints. This is the basis of IR, UV-Vis, and other qualitative spectral analyses.�ans��src��武汉大学《分析化学》�"Analytical Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�f5bb1698821a�body��$以镍钛诺（NiTi）为代表的形状记忆合金在低温下可发生可逆的马氏体相变，此时易被扭曲成新形状。加热回到较高温度的奥氏体相时，材料会自动恢复之前在高温下定型的“记忆”形状，这种效应源于晶体相变的可逆性。�Shape-memory alloys like Nitinol (NiTi) undergo a reversible martensitic phase transformation at low temperature, when they can be easily deformed into a new shape. Upon heating back to the higher-temperature austenite phase, the material spontaneously recovers the 'remembered' shape set at high temperature; the effect arises from the reversibility of the crystal-phase transition.�ans��src�ٛ材料研究学会（MRS）形状记忆合金综述；大冢和韦曼《形状记忆材料》（Shape Memory Materials, Cambridge University Press, 1998）ٖMaterials Research Society (MRS) reviews on shape-memory alloys; K. Otsuka & C. M. Wayman, 'Shape Memory Materials' (Cambridge University Press, 1998)��id�f6e11f955cf4�body��␀过渡态理论用活化络合物（位于势能面鞍点、与反应物近似平衡）的浓度及其越过势垒的频率 ν 来表达速率。活化络合物是反应物在转化为产物途中、键部分断裂又部分形成的瞬时高能量构型。�oTransition-state theory expresses the rate via the concentration of the activated complex (at the saddle point of the potential energy surface, in quasi-equilibrium with reactants) and its frequency ν of crossing the barrier. The activated complex is the transient, high-energy configuration midway between reactants and products with bonds partly broken and formed.�ans��src��p《物理化学》(傅献彩) 第五版 上册 第 10 章 ; 另见: H. Eyring, J. Chem. Phys. 1935, 3, 107 (AIP)�rH. Eyring, J. Chem. Phys. 1935, 3, 107 (AIP) ; see also: 《物理化学》(傅献彩) 第五版 上册 第 10 章��id�f7190d44642d�body��放电时 Li 从负极（通常为石墨）脱出，经电解液和隔膜嵌入正极（如 LiCoO2 或磷酸铁锂），电子则经外电路做功。负极提供可逆的锂宿主，正极提供高电势的锂嵌入框架，两者电位差决定电池电压。�}On discharge, Li deintercalates from the negative electrode (usually graphite), migrates through the electrolyte and separator, and inserts into the positive electrode (e.g., LiCoO2 or LiFePO4), while electrons do work in the external circuit. The anode is a reversible Li host and the cathode a high-potential insertion framework; their potential difference sets the cell voltage.�ans��src��~《物理化学》(傅献彩) 第五版 下册 第 10 章 ; 另见: J.-M. Tarascon & M. Armand, Nature 2001, 414, 359 (Nature)ـJ.-M. Tarascon & M. Armand, Nature 2001, 414, 359 (Nature) ; see also: 《物理化学》(傅献彩) 第五版 下册 第 10 章��id�fc927a1b0960�body���红外光谱测量分子对红外光的吸收，对应化学键的振动和转动能级跃迁。不同官能团在特定波数出现特征吸收峰，例如羰基约 1700 cm⁻¹、O–H 约 3300 cm⁻¹。它常用于鉴定有机物中的官能团。�NInfrared spectroscopy measures a molecule's absorption of infrared light, corresponding to vibrational and rotational transitions. Different functional groups show characteristic peaks at specific wavenumbers, e.g., carbonyl near 1700 cm⁻¹ and O–H near 3300 cm⁻¹. It is commonly used to identify functional groups in organics.�ans��src��武汉大学《分析化学》�"Analytical Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�fca1f943dc94�body��QCFC在平流层被紫外线光解释放出活泼的氯原子，氯原子催化地使臭氧（O3）分解为氧气（O2），且自身不被消耗、可反复破坏大量臭氧分子。1974年马里奥·莫利纳和舍伍德·罗兰提出这一机理，推动了《蒙特利尔议定书》禁限CFC，二人获1995年诺贝尔化学奖。�|In the stratosphere, UV light photolyzes CFCs to release reactive chlorine atoms, which catalytically convert ozone (O3) into oxygen (O2) without being consumed, so one chlorine atom destroys many ozone molecules. Mario Molina and Sherwood Rowland proposed this mechanism in 1974, leading to the Montreal Protocol phasing out CFCs; they received the 1995 Nobel Prize in Chemistry.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�fcedcf05473e�body��'测一个工作电极的电位必须有一个已知且稳定的基准与之配对，参比电极就提供这个恒定不变的电位。例如饱和甘汞电极（SCE，约 +0.241 V vs 标准氢电极）不受待测溶液组成影响，使测得的电池电动势只反映工作电极的变化。�,Measuring one electrode's potential requires a stable, known benchmark paired with it, which the reference electrode supplies. The saturated calomel electrode (SCE, about +0.241 V vs SHE), for instance, is unaffected by the test solution, so the measured cell emf reflects only the working electrode.�ans��src��MBard & Faulkner《电化学方法：基础与应用》（第2版），第2章�YBard & Faulkner, "Electrochemical Methods: Fundamentals and Applications" (2nd ed.), Ch.2��id�fd2208652457�body��9法拉第第一定律：电解时在电极上析出物质的质量与通过的电量成正比；第二定律：相同电量下析出不同物质的量与它们的化学当量（摩尔质量/电子数）成正比。据此可由电量精确计算产物量，是电解、电镀等工业定量控制的理论基础。��Faraday's first law states that the mass of substance deposited at an electrode is proportional to the charge passed; the second law states that for the same charge, the amount of different substances deposited is proportional to their chemical equivalent (molar mass divided by electrons transferred). This lets industry calculate product amounts precisely from charge, underpinning electrolysis and electroplating.�ans��src��LM. 法拉第《电的化学分解》（1834）；傅献彩《物理化学》�]M. Faraday, 'Experimental Researches in Electricity' (1834); Fu Xiancai, 'Physical Chemistry'��id�fd70f8f032c5�body��&原子轨道是描述原子中电子概率分布的空间区域，由主量子数 n、角量子数 l、磁量子数 m 和自旋量子数 ms 共同确定。n 决定能级与大小，l 决定形状（s 球形、p 哑铃形等），m 决定空间取向。它们限定了电子可能的量子态。�HAn atomic orbital is the spatial region describing an electron's probability distribution in an atom, specified by the principal n, azimuthal l, magnetic m, and spin ms quantum numbers. n sets energy and size, l sets shape (s spherical, p dumbbell, etc.), and m sets orientation. Together they define the allowed quantum states.�ans��src��!周公度《结构化学基础》�"Structural Chemistry (Zhou Gongdu)��id�fe7346019334�body���重量分析是通过化学反应把待测组分转化为组成确定的沉淀，经过滤、洗涤、干燥或灼烧后称量其质量来定量。例如用 BaCl₂ 把硫酸根沉淀为 BaSO₄ 再称重。它以准确著称，但操作较繁琐。�Gravimetric analysis converts the analyte into a well-defined precipitate by a chemical reaction, then filters, washes, dries or ignites, and weighs it to quantify. For example, sulfate is precipitated as BaSO₄ with BaCl₂ and weighed. It is highly accurate but laborious.�ans��src��武汉大学《分析化学》�"Analytical Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�00a5792e5f4b�body�� 复合材料由两种或以上性能不同的材料组合，取长补短，获得单一材料没有的综合性能。例如玻璃纤维增强塑料（玻璃钢）以树脂为基体、玻璃纤维为增强相，质轻而强度高。碳纤维复合材料广泛用于航空与运动器材。�*A composite combines two or more materials with different properties to gain synergies no single material has. Glass-fiber-reinforced plastic (fiberglass) uses resin as matrix and glass fibers as reinforcement—light yet strong. Carbon-fiber composites are widely used in aviation and sports gear.�ans��src��'《材料科学基础》（胡赓祥）�0Fundamentals of Materials Science (Hu Gengxiang)��id�033c8cc7ee75�body��␀加聚是含不饱和键的单体直接相连、无小分子副产物（如聚乙烯）；缩聚是带两个或以上官能团的单体反应并脱去小分子（如水、醇），如尼龙-66 由二胺与二酸缩合。缩聚物常含酯、酰胺等键。�KAddition polymerization links unsaturated monomers directly with no small byproducts (e.g., polyethylene); condensation polymerization reacts monomers with two or more functional groups and eliminates small molecules like water or alcohol, as in nylon-66 from a diamine and a diacid. Condensates often contain ester or amide bonds.�ans��src��潘祖仁《高分子化学》�Polymer Chemistry (Pan Zuren)��id�048dfee225e6�body��u它的温室效应约为 CO₂ 的 300 倍，还会破坏臭氧，主要来自化肥与燃烧，且大气寿命长。لIts warming power is about 300× CO₂ and it also harms ozone; sources are fertilizers and combustion, and it persists long in air.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�050bec7cd0b4�body���绿色化学十二原则由Anastas和Warner于1998年提出并系统阐述，美国化学会绿色化学研究所（GCI）长期推广这一框架。核心思想是从源头设计无毒、高效、原子经济的化学过程，而不是等废物产生后再处理。重点包括防止废物优于治理废物、设计更安全的化学品、使用可再生原料、提高原子经济性和催化效率。��The twelve principles of green chemistry were formulated by Paul Anastas and John Warner in 1998, and the ACS Green Chemistry Institute has long promoted the framework. Their core idea is to design non-toxic, efficient, atom-economical chemical processes at the source rather than treating waste after it forms. Highlights include preventing waste rather than cleaning it up, designing safer chemicals, using renewable feedstocks, and maximizing atom economy and catalysis.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�08cd853d4169�body��荧光物质吸收紫外或短波长可见光后，电子跃迁到激发态，很快（约纳秒级）以辐射形式放出波长更长的光回到基态。荧光笔墨水中的荧光染料吸收紫外光，放出蓝紫色可见光，因此字迹在紫外灯下显得格外明亮。�SA fluorescent substance absorbs UV or short-wavelength light, exciting electrons to a higher state, then quickly (within nanoseconds) returns to the ground state by emitting light of longer wavelength. The fluorescent dyes in highlighter ink absorb UV and re-emit blue-violet light, so the writing appears unusually bright under a UV lamp.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�0a1b8c13c217�body���自发氧化还原反应被分隔在两电极：阳极发生氧化释放电子，经外电路流向阴极发生还原。电子流动形成电流，离子通过盐桥迁移维持电荷平衡，电池电势来自两半反应电势差。�DA spontaneous redox reaction is split across two electrodes: oxidation at the anode releases electrons that flow through an external circuit to the cathode where reduction occurs. Electron flow is current, and a salt bridge moves ions to maintain charge balance; cell potential comes from the half-cell potential difference.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�0b527fb6dbf7�body���ATP 末端磷酸酐键水解自由能很高，可在酶催化下把磷酸基转移给受体，直接驱动合成、运输与运动等过程，并能被细胞快速再生。Berg 的《生物化学》将其列为能量偶联的核心分子。�ATP's terminal phosphoanhydride bond releases large free energy on hydrolysis and, enzymatically, transfers its phosphate to drive synthesis, transport and motion, while being rapidly regenerated. Berg's 'Biochemistry' treats it as the central energy-coupling molecule.�ans��src��:Lehninger《生物化学原理》；Berg《生物化学》�9Lehninger, Principles of Biochemistry; Berg, Biochemistry��id�0b6eb265d40b�body���这类反应是可逆的，正反应和逆反应同时在发生，当两者速率相等时就达到了化学平衡，反应物和产物的量都不再变化。平衡点由平衡常数K决定，K等于产物浓度幂的乘积与反应物浓度幂的乘积之比；K越大，反应进行得越完全。改变温度等条件能移动平衡，但不能删掉逆反应，所以产物中总会残留一些反应物。�Such reactions are reversible: the forward and reverse reactions proceed simultaneously, and equilibrium is reached when their rates are equal, so reactant and product amounts stop changing. The equilibrium position is set by the equilibrium constant K, the ratio of product concentrations raised to their coefficients over the same for reactants; the larger K, the more complete the reaction. Changing conditions like temperature can shift the equilibrium, but it cannot delete the reverse reaction, so some reactant always remains.�ans��src��$《普通化学》（化学平衡）�(General Chemistry (chemical equilibrium)��id�0c071d2a5009�body���手性药物含有手性中心，存在互为镜像的对映体。生物体内的受体和酶本身是手性的，只与特定立体构型匹配，因此一个对映体可能高效，另一个无效甚至有毒（如沙利度胺事件）。�A chiral drug contains a stereocenter and exists as mirror-image enantiomers. Biological receptors and enzymes are themselves chiral and recognize only a specific configuration, so one enantiomer may be potent while the other is inactive or toxic (as in the thalidomide case).�ans��src��q《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 1 章 ; 另见: E. J. Ariëns, Eur. J. Clin. Pharmacol. 1984, 26, 663�sE. J. Ariëns, Eur. J. Clin. Pharmacol. 1984, 26, 663 ; see also: 《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 1 章��id�0ed025f356ee�body��'天然橡胶是线性的聚异戊二烯，室温下发黏、易冷流且强度低。硫化用硫在分子链间形成共价交联（二硫/多硫桥），限制链滑移，使橡胶获得弹性、强度、耐热与耐溶剂性。适度交联是橡胶从黏流态变为可用弹性体的关键。�pNatural rubber is linear polyisoprene that is sticky, cold-flowing, and weak at room temperature. Vulcanization uses sulfur to form covalent cross-links (disulfide/polysulfide bridges) between chains, restricting chain slippage and giving rubber elasticity, strength, heat, and solvent resistance. Proper cross-linking is what turns sticky gum into a useful elastomer.�ans��src��U《高分子化学》(潘祖仁, 第五版) 橡胶章；美国化学会(ACS)高分子�:Mark, Physical Properties of Polymers; ACS Rubber Division��id�0f82fcd14b14�body�ٮ催化剂只改变反应途径而不被消耗，它在反应中被暂时结合，又在产物生成后释放出来。因此反应结束时的催化剂与开始时一样多。��A catalyst only changes the reaction pathway and is not consumed; it is temporarily bound during the reaction and released when products form. So the amount of catalyst at the end equals that at the start.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�0fbdb3dbb006�body�ٮΔG = ΔH − TΔS；当 ΔG < 0 时反应在恒温恒压下自发。它把焓变与熵变统一：放热且增熵最有利，吸热但强增熵在较高温度也可自发。��ΔG = ΔH − TΔS; a reaction is spontaneous at constant T and P when ΔG < 0. It unifies enthalpy and entropy: exothermic plus entropy-increasing is favorable, while an endothermic reaction can still be spontaneous if entropy gain is large at high T.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�10fcdeb2e5d4�body���过渡金属离子未充满的 d 轨道在配体场中分裂，电子吸收可见光在不同 d 能级间跃迁，于是透射或反射出特定颜色。Cotton 与 Wilkinson 在《高等无机化学》中系统论述了这一 d-d 跃迁。�In transition-metal ions the partially filled d orbitals split in a ligand field, and electrons absorb visible light jumping between these d levels, giving the compound its color. Cotton and Wilkinson treat this d-d transition in 'Advanced Inorganic Chemistry'.�ans��src��VHousecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》；Cotton 与 Wilkinson《高等无机化学》�ZHousecroft & Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry; Cotton & Wilkinson, Advanced Inorganic Chemistry��id�11229cf63d1b�body��1869年门捷列夫把已知元素按原子量排列，发现化学性质呈周期性重复，于是制成周期表。他大胆地在表中留下空位，并根据上下左右相邻元素的规律推算出这些未知元素的原子量和性质，预言了类铝、类硼、类硅等元素。十几年后镓、钪、锗被相继发现，性质与他预言的惊人吻合，周期表因此被公认为化学的基本定律。他还纠正了铍、铟等元素的原子量，因为只有依据性质的周期规律才能得到正确的排序。��In 1869 Mendeleev arranged the known elements by atomic weight and saw that chemical properties repeat periodically, so he built the periodic table. Boldly, he left gaps and used the trends along rows and columns to predict the atomic weights and properties of the missing elements - eka-aluminium, eka-boron, eka-silicon and so on. When gallium, scandium and germanium were found over the following years with properties matching his predictions almost exactly, the table was accepted as a fundamental law of chemistry. He also corrected the atomic weights of elements like beryllium and indium, because only the periodic pattern of properties gives the true ordering.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�12ddc4db3324�body��E用电解把一层不活泼金属镀在表面，隔绝空气和水。�FElectrolysis coats a surface with inert metal, blocking air and water.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�12e62ecb2d79�body��化石燃料燃烧排放的二氧化硫（SO₂）与氮氧化物（NOₓ）在大气中氧化为硫酸与硝酸，随降水落到地面形成酸雨（pH 常低于 5.6）。它酸化湖泊土壤、释放铝等有毒金属、腐蚀建筑石材，并损害森林与水生生物。�MSulfur dioxide (SO₂) and nitrogen oxides (NOₓ) from fossil-fuel combustion are oxidized in the atmosphere to sulfuric and nitric acids, which fall with precipitation as acid rain (often pH below 5.6). It acidifies lakes and soils, mobilizes toxic metals like aluminum, corrodes building stone, and harms forests and aquatic life.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�13fcf0adf34a�body�ٴ自发性由 ΔG = ΔH − TΔS 决定。若熵增足够大（ΔS > 0），在较高温度下 TΔS 项可超过正的 ΔH，使 ΔG < 0，例如硝酸铵溶于水吸热却自发。��Spontaneity follows ΔG = ΔH − TΔS. If entropy increases enough (ΔS > 0), at high T the TΔS term can outweigh positive ΔH, making ΔG < 0—as when NH₄NO₃ dissolves endothermically yet spontaneously.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�152b740496c0�body��0硅胶多孔，表面能吸附大量水分子。�ESilica gel is porous and adsorbs many water molecules on its surface.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�1557dd3e8942�body��在强日照下，汽车尾气中的氮氧化物和挥发性有机物（VOCs）发生一系列光化学反应，生成臭氧、过氧乙酰硝酸酯（PAN）等二次污染物。它常见于夏季拥挤城市，刺激眼睛和呼吸道。治理依赖减少 NOₓ 与 VOC 排放。�>Under strong sunlight, nitrogen oxides and volatile organic compounds (VOCs) from vehicle exhaust undergo photochemical reactions that form secondary pollutants like ozone and peroxyacetyl nitrate (PAN). Common in crowded summer cities, it irritates eyes and airways. Control relies on cutting NOₓ and VOC emissions.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�1624e9b7d5ce�body��E溶质打乱水的结晶，使冰点下降，这正是防冻原理。�TSolute disrupts crystallization, lowering the freezing point—how antifreeze works.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�17bbb13ec9a2�body���焦糖化是纯糖类在 160°C 以上无水加热时的热分解与聚合，产生焦糖色与苦甜风味，不涉及氨基酸。美拉德则需要糖与氨基化合物共同作用，两者都属非酶促褐变但机理不同。�Caramelization is the anhydrous thermal decomposition and polymerization of sugars above ~160°C, yielding caramel color and bittersweet flavor without amino compounds. The Maillard reaction needs sugars plus amines; both are non-enzymatic browning but mechanistically distinct.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�18370b1149c1�body�ٮ稀有气体位于周期表最右侧，包括氦、氖、氩等，它们最外层电子已满，化学性质极其稳定、很难参与反应。因此常被用作保护气。��Noble gases sit at the far right of the periodic table, including helium, neon, and argon. Their outermost electron shells are full, making them extremely stable and unreactive, so they are often used as protective gases.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�190e1859aa3d�body�٥陶瓷是无机非金属材料，通常由粘土高温烧制而成，耐高温、硬度高但较脆。现代陶瓷还用于牙齿、发动机部件和电子产品。��Ceramics are inorganic nonmetallic materials, usually made by firing clay at high temperature; they resist heat and are hard but brittle. Modern ceramics are also used in teeth, engine parts, and electronics.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�1b551172c7b2�body��,在给定温度和压强下，当溶质溶解的速率与从溶液中结晶析出的速率相等时，溶液达到饱和，此时的浓度就是该条件下的溶解度。判断办法：再投入一些溶质不再溶解，或者晃动时已有晶体始终不消失，通常就说明溶液已饱和。�eAt a given temperature and pressure, a solution is saturated when solute dissolves at the same rate as it crystallizes back out; that concentration is the solubility under those conditions. To test it, add a little more solute and see whether it refuses to dissolve, or check whether existing crystals never disappear when shaken - both indicate saturation.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�1c791d5c94e8�body��紫外光子的能量大于 TiO₂ 的带隙（约 3.2 eV），把电子从价带激发到导带，留下带正电的空穴。电子把氧分子还原成超氧自由基，空穴把水氧化成羟基自由基，这些高活性物种再去氧化分解有机物污染物。�UV photons exceed TiO₂'s band gap (~3.2 eV), exciting electrons from the valence band to the conduction band and leaving holes behind. Electrons reduce O₂ to superoxide radicals and holes oxidize water to hydroxyl radicals, and these reactive species decompose organic pollutants.�ans��src��NFujishima & Honda, "Nature" 1972, 238, 37（TiO₂ 光解水开创性论文）�kFujishima & Honda, "Electrochemical Photolysis of Water at a Semiconductor Electrode," Nature 1972, 238, 37��id�1e0b9010aeff�body�ٜ酶是蛋白质类生物催化剂，能大大加快体内化学反应而不被消耗。例如消化酶帮助我们把食物分解成可吸收的小分子。��Enzymes are protein catalysts that greatly speed up chemical reactions in the body without being consumed. For example, digestive enzymes help break food into small molecules that can be absorbed.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�1ed15b5808c7�body��D维生素B12（钴胺素）分子中心是钴离子，它被一个类似卟啉的咕啉大环配合物包住。人体造血和维持神经系统都依赖维生素B12，缺乏时会出现巨幼细胞性贫血和神经损伤。人体不能自行合成维生素B12，只能主要从肉类、蛋奶等动物性食物中获取。�iVitamin B12 (cobalamin) has a cobalt ion at its center, enclosed by a corrin macrocycle similar to porphyrin. The body depends on vitamin B12 for blood formation and a healthy nervous system; deficiency leads to megaloblastic anemia and nerve damage. Humans cannot synthesize vitamin B12 and must obtain it mainly from animal foods such as meat, eggs and dairy.�ans��src��*《无机化学》生物无机化学章节�4Inorganic Chemistry (bioinorganic chemistry); Nature��id�2005744d556e�body���碱金属是周期表第一族（除氢外）的元素，如锂、钠、钾，它们最外层只有一个电子，极易失去而表现强活泼性。它们遇水会剧烈反应放出氢气。��The alkali metals are the elements of group 1 (except hydrogen), such as lithium, sodium, and potassium. They have only one outer electron and readily lose it, making them highly reactive. They react violently with water to release hydrogen.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�21ee96d13803�body���同位素示踪用可探测的同位素标记原子，跟踪物质在体系中的去向与转化路径。例如用 15N 标记肥料追踪氮在土壤-植物-水体中的迁移，或用 2H（氘）标记代谢物研究生物合成途径。�Isotope tracing uses detectable isotope-labeled atoms to follow the fate and transformation paths of substances in a system. For example, 15N-labeled fertilizer tracks nitrogen movement through soil-plant-water, and deuterated (2H) metabolites reveal biosynthetic pathways.�ans��src��x陈骏、王鹤年《地球化学》(科学出版社) 第 10 章 ; 另见: B. Fry, Stable Isotope Ecology, Springer 2006�zB. Fry, Stable Isotope Ecology, Springer 2006 ; see also: 陈骏、王鹤年《地球化学》(科学出版社) 第 10 章��id�2254d3a578d0�body���主要是碳酸/碳酸氢盐系统（H₂CO₃/HCO₃⁻），由肺调节 CO₂、肾调节 HCO₃⁻ 共同维持 pH≈7.4。血红蛋白也缓冲运输中产生的 H⁺，三者协同保证生理 pH 稳定。��The main system is the carbonic acid/bicarbonate pair (H₂CO₃/HCO₃⁻), with the lungs regulating CO₂ and kidneys regulating HCO₃⁻ to keep pH≈7.4. Hemoglobin also buffers H⁺ from CO₂ transport, together stabilizing physiological pH.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�23aa69c62986�body���实验室先把尿样经固相萃取等前处理富集，再送入气相色谱-质谱联用仪（GC-MS）。气相色谱先把混合物按极性、沸点等差异在毛细管柱中分离成单一组分，随后质谱把每个组分离子化、给出特征质谱图，像指纹一样与标准品比对。色谱负责分离定量，质谱负责定性确认，两者串联既灵敏又能排除假阳性，所以成为兴奋剂检测的国际标准配置。�yLabs first concentrate the urine with cleanup steps such as solid-phase extraction, then run it through gas chromatography-mass spectrometry (GC-MS). The GC column separates the mixture into individual components by differences in polarity and boiling point; the mass spectrometer then ionizes each one and records a characteristic spectrum that acts like a fingerprint to match against reference standards. Chromatography provides separation and quantification while mass spectrometry confirms identity, so combining them gives both sensitivity and freedom from false positives - the international standard setup for doping control.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�23fb6a15d3ae�body�ٰ二者由 ΔG° = −RT ln K 联系：ΔG° 越负，平衡常数越大，反应在标准态下越偏向产物。该式把热力学判据与平衡位置定量地统一起来。��They are linked by ΔG° = −RT ln K: the more negative ΔG°, the larger K, and the more the reaction favors products under standard conditions. This equation quantitatively unifies the thermodynamic criterion with equilibrium position.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�2423ac469508�body��#加成聚合是小分子单体通过不饱和键（如 C=C）打开并相互连接成大分子，过程中没有小分子副产物。乙烯（CH₂=CH₂）在催化剂和压力下打开双键，连成 –(CH₂–CH₂)–n 长链，即聚乙烯。它是全球产量最大的塑料之一。�<Addition polymerization links monomers via their unsaturated bonds (e.g., C=C) into a large molecule without releasing small byproducts. Ethylene (CH₂=CH₂) opens its double bond under catalyst and pressure to form the –(CH₂–CH₂)–n chain of polyethylene. It is one of the world's most produced plastics.�ans��src��潘祖仁《高分子化学》�Polymer Chemistry (Pan Zuren)��id�25027dce19ce�body���将待测组分通过沉淀、挥发或电解转化为已知组成的纯物质，精确称量其质量，再按化学计量换算为原组分含量。关键是沉淀要完全、纯净且易过滤，常用于高准确度测定。�Convert the analyte into a pure substance of known composition by precipitation, volatilization, or electrolysis, weigh it precisely, then use stoichiometry to back-calculate the original amount. Complete, pure, filterable precipitates are essential, giving highly accurate results.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�27b246b708df�body�ل若保护层有裂缝或氯离子渗入，钢筋发生电化学腐蚀，铁锈体积比铁大几倍，膨胀就把混凝土胀裂。ّThrough cracks or chloride ingress, rebar corrodes electrochemically; rust has several times iron's volume and the expansion cracks the concrete.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�27f55667792e�body��水的硬度主要来自钙、镁离子，由岩石风化或溶入地下水造成。暂时硬度由碳酸氢钙/镁引起，煮沸可沉淀除去；永久硬度由硫酸盐、氯化物等引起，煮沸不去除，需用离子交换或软化法。硬水易在锅炉和管道结垢。�'Hardness mainly comes from calcium and magnesium ions leached from rocks into groundwater. Temporary hardness from calcium/magnesium bicarbonates is removed by boiling; permanent hardness from sulfates or chlorides is not and needs ion exchange or softening. Hard water scales boilers and pipes.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�280512db9c56�body���d 轨道在配体场中分裂，电子吸收可见光中特定能量发生 d-d 跃迁（能量 ≈ 分裂能 Δ），未被吸收的补色被反射/透射而显色。跃迁被禁阻时颜色较浅，电荷转移跃迁则可产生深色。�)Ligand-field splitting of d orbitals lets electrons absorb visible light of a specific energy for d-d transitions (energy ≈ Δ); the unabsorbed complementary color is reflected/transmitted, giving the hue. Largely forbidden transitions are pale, while charge-transfer transitions can be intense.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�29beb7173d1f�body�٨明矾（硫酸铝钾）与小苏打受热放出二氧化碳，被面筋网络兜住，油炸时气体膨胀撑出孔洞；因铝残留，现多改用无铝膨松剂。ٮAlum (potassium aluminum sulfate) with baking soda releases CO2 trapped by gluten; frying expands the gas into holes. Al-residue concerns have driven aluminum-free leavening.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�2ba5898249ab�body�ٹ同分异构体是具有相同分子式但原子连接方式或空间排列不同的化合物。例如正丁烷和异丁烷分子式都是C4H10，但结构不同，性质也有差别。��Isomers are compounds with the same molecular formula but different arrangements of atoms or spatial layouts. For example, n-butane and isobutane both have the formula C4H10 but differ in structure and some properties.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�2c7db8788a2f�body���锁钥模型认为酶与底物形状预先完全契合；Koshland 1958 年提出诱导契合，强调结合时酶构象主动调整以更好地包裹底物。后者更好解释了催化中的构象变化与专一性。�␀The lock-and-key model holds enzyme and substrate pre-fit like a key in a lock; Koshland's 1958 induced-fit says the enzyme actively reshapes on binding to cradle the substrate. The latter better explains conformational change and specificity in catalysis.�ans��src��9Fischer 1894 年锁钥说；Koshland 1958 年诱导契合�:Fischer (lock-and-key, 1894); Koshland (induced fit, 1958)��id�2d553b5c23f3�body�ٽ质量守恒定律指出，在化学反应中参加反应的各物质总质量等于反应后生成物的总质量。这是因为反应只是原子重新组合，原子本身不增不减。��The law of conservation of mass states that in a chemical reaction the total mass of reactants equals the total mass of products. This is because the reaction only rearranges atoms without creating or destroying them.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�310917ee0706�body�ٴ酶是高效、专一的生物催化剂，通常只在温和的温度和酸碱条件下工作。它们能加速特定反应数百万倍，但高温或强酸强碱会使酶失活。��Enzymes are efficient, specific biological catalysts that usually work only under mild temperatures and pH. They can speed a specific reaction millions of times, but high heat or strong acid or base deactivates them.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3287360d915e�body��U同位素示踪利用同一元素不同核素（如 ²H、¹³C、¹⁵N、¹⁸O）化学行为相同但可被检测的特性，追踪原子在反应或代谢中的去向。典型应用包括用 ¹³C 标记底物研究代谢通路、用 ¹⁵N 追踪肥料在土壤-植物中的迁移、以及用 ¹⁸F 标记示踪剂进行 PET 成像。�Isotope tracing exploits that different nuclides of an element (e.g., ²H, ¹³C, ¹⁵N, ¹⁸O) behave chemically identically yet are detectable, letting researchers follow atoms through reactions or metabolism. Typical uses include ¹³C-labeled substrates to map metabolic pathways, ¹⁵N to track fertilizer movement in soil–plant systems, and ¹⁸F tracers for PET imaging.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�333800d40e7e�body���形状记忆合金（最常见的是镍钛合金）存在两种晶体结构：低温的马氏体和高温的奥氏体。常温下弯折只改变马氏体晶体的孪晶排列方式，原子没有真正滑移，变形是可逆的；加热到相变温度以上，合金转变回奥氏体，晶体恢复原本排列，宏观形状也跟着复原。这一记住高温相形状的本领来自可逆的固相相变，而不是普通金属的弹性，因此被用于牙箍、血管支架和航天机构中。��Shape-memory alloys, most commonly nitinol (nickel-titanium), have two crystal structures: martensite at low temperature and austenite at high temperature. Bending at room temperature only rearranges the twin domains of the martensite without real atomic slip, so the deformation is reversible; heating above the transformation temperature converts the alloy back to austenite, whose original atomic arrangement restores, and the frame recovers its shape. This memory of the high-temperature phase comes from a reversible solid-state phase change, not ordinary elasticity - which is why it is used in braces, vascular stents and space mechanisms.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�34874671fa01�body��E它减少食物与空气、水分的接触，延缓氧化和变干。�FIt limits contact with air and moisture, slowing oxidation and drying.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�352db720c654�body�ف铜先氧化成红棕色的氧化亚铜，再与空气中的水和二氧化碳反应生成绿色的碱式碳酸铜（铜绿）。�wCopper first forms reddish cuprous oxide, then reacts with water and CO2 to form green basic copper carbonate (patina).�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3578caa8db18�body��X经典不粘涂层是聚四氟乙烯（PTFE，商品名特氟龙）。它的主链由极强的碳-氟键构成，氟原子把碳链包裹得严严实实，使涂层表面能极低、摩擦系数很小，食物与涂层之间难以形成牢固相互作用，因此不易粘锅。高温干烧会使涂层分解，所以不粘锅不建议空烧。��The classic non-stick coating is polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE, brand name Teflon). Its backbone is made of very strong C-F bonds, and the fluorine atoms wrap the carbon chain so tightly that the coating has extremely low surface energy and low friction, so food cannot form strong interactions with it and does not stick. Dry heating decomposes the coating, which is why empty pans should be avoided.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�359c48b19c45�body���发酵是无氧条件下微生物或酶把糖转化为乙醇、乳酸等并释放少量能量的代谢过程。如酵母将葡萄糖经糖酵解生成乙醇与 CO₂（酿酒、发面），乳酸菌生成乳酸（酸奶、泡菜）。�Fermentation is an anaerobic metabolic process where microbes or enzymes convert sugars into ethanol, lactate, etc., releasing little energy. Yeast turns glucose via glycolysis into ethanol and CO₂ (brewing, bread), while lactic-acid bacteria make lactate (yogurt, kimchi).�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�36e512d94ca1�body�ٜ嗅觉通路直接连到处理情绪和记忆的脑区（杏仁核、海马），绕过了其他感觉的中转，所以气味和记忆绑定得特别紧。ًThe olfactory pathway links directly to the amygdala and hippocampus, bypassing other relays, so smells bind tightly to emotion and memory.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3771a0d1be70�body�ـ乙醇沸点约78℃比水100℃低，加热到两者之间时乙醇先变成蒸气被收集，再冷凝就得到更浓的酒。كEthanol boils at ~78°C, lower than water's 100°C; heating between them vaporizes ethanol first, which is collected and condensed.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�391a0487f85b�body���反应级数不能从化学方程式猜测，必须由实验测定：保持其他反应物浓度不变，改变某一反应物浓度，观察速率变化倍数，从而得出该物质的级数；总级数为各级数之和。��Reaction order cannot be guessed from the balanced equation; it is found experimentally by varying one reactant's concentration while holding others constant and observing the rate change, giving that species' order; the overall order is their sum.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�39a08ea5137b�body��c等价轨道在半满前，电子先分占且自旋平行，使交换能最低、总能量最小。�}Before pairing, electrons occupy equivalent orbitals singly with parallel spins, minimizing exchange energy and total energy.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�39f71d6c5216�body��M这属于依数性中的沸点升高。加入不挥发的溶质后，溶液的蒸气压比纯水低，必须加热到更高温度才能让蒸气压等于外界大气压而沸腾。沸点升高量只取决于溶质的质量摩尔浓度，与溶质种类无关。日常烹饪加盐量少，升高幅度很小，主要作用是调味。�|This is boiling-point elevation, a colligative property. A nonvolatile solute lowers the vapor pressure, so the solution must be heated to a higher temperature before its vapor pressure matches the external pressure. The elevation depends only on the molality, not on what the solute is. In everyday cooking the salt amount is small, so the effect is slight and mostly for flavor.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3a1bd8930d80�body���光敏化指由敏化剂先吸收光进入激发态，再把能量或电子转移给自身几乎不吸光的反应物，从而引发其光化学反应，敏化剂在净反应中不被消耗。在光催化中，敏化剂（如钌联吡啶配合物、有机染料）把体系的可利用光谱拓宽到可见光区，并将激发态能量或电子高效注入底物或半导体导带，从而提高太阳光利用率。�JPhotosensitization is when a substance that does not itself react absorbs light and transfers energy or electrons to the reacting species to trigger photochemistry. A sensitizer (e.g., a ruthenium complex or organic dye) broadens the absorbed spectrum and efficiently delivers excited-state energy to a substrate or semiconductor.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�3a86473e6eac�body���两性氧化物既能与酸反应又能与碱反应生成盐和水，典型例子是氧化铝（Al₂O₃）。它与盐酸生成氯化铝，与氢氧化钠生成偏铝酸钠。这类性质在工业提纯金属和陶瓷中很有用。��An amphoteric oxide reacts with both acids and bases to form salts and water; a classic example is aluminum oxide (Al₂O₃). It forms aluminum chloride with HCl and sodium aluminate with NaOH. Such behavior is useful in metal refining and ceramics.�ans��src��*《无机化学》（武汉大学等编）�!Inorganic Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�3a8a4bc8d70d�body��.SN2 是一步协同过程，亲核试剂从背面进攻，速率与底物和亲核试剂均有关，易发生构型翻转，利于位阻小的伯卤代烃。SN1 先离解成碳正离子再被进攻，速率只与底物有关，常伴重排与外消旋化，利于能稳定碳正离子的叔卤代烃。�RSN2 is a one-step concerted backside attack whose rate depends on both substrate and nucleophile, giving inversion and favoring unhindered primary halides. SN1 first ionizes to a carbocation then is attacked, rate depends only on substrate, often with rearrangement and racemization, favoring tertiary halides that stabilize carbocations.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�3c157c88d8da�body���硬水中富含钙、镁离子，它们会与肥皂的脂肪酸钠反应生成不溶于水的钙/镁皂（皂垢），既消耗了肥皂又浮在表面。这些沉淀物无法起泡，还会附着在衣物和器皿上形成灰白色的垢渍。�Hard water is rich in calcium and magnesium ions, which react with soap's sodium fatty acids to form insoluble calcium/magnesium soaps (scum), wasting the soap and floating on the surface. These precipitates can't lather and coat fabrics and dishes with a grayish film.�ans��src��KRosen & Kunjappu《表面活性剂与界面现象》（第4版），第1章�IRosen & Kunjappu, "Surfactants and Interfacial Phenomena" (4th ed.), Ch.1��id�3ce1e6151557�body���血红蛋白分子中心的血红素是一个卟啉环配合物，铁离子位于环中央，通过配位键与四个氮原子结合，还保留着一个空位。肺部氧分压高时，氧分子以配位键挂到铁离子上，形成氧合血红蛋白；到组织处氧分压降低，配位键变弱，氧就被释放。这本质上是金属配合物的可逆配位平衡：氧充足时结合，氧浓度下降时解离，铁离子就是氧的装卸站。�1In the center of hemoglobin sits heme, a porphyrin-ring complex with an iron ion held at the middle by coordinate bonds to four nitrogen atoms, leaving one site free. In the lungs, where oxygen partial pressure is high, an O2 molecule coordinates to the iron, forming oxyhemoglobin; in the tissues the pressure is low, the coordinate bond weakens, and oxygen is released. This is essentially a reversible coordination equilibrium of a metal complex: binding when oxygen is plentiful, dissociation when it is scarce - the iron ion is the loading dock for oxygen.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3f30f91698bc�body���溶质粒子降低了溶剂的蒸气压，使固液平衡温度下移，这就是依数性中的凝固点降低；降低幅度正比于溶质粒子浓度（Raoult 定律）。道路除冰撒盐正是利用这一原理。�Solute particles lower the solvent's vapor pressure, shifting the solid-liquid balance to a lower temperature—freezing-point depression, a colligative property proportional to solute particle concentration (Raoult's law). Spreading salt on roads exploits exactly this.�ans��src��3拉乌尔 1882 年论文；Atkins《物理化学》�)Raoult (1882); Atkins, Physical Chemistry��id�420ff84c49f3�body���锌和铜的活泼性不同，在稀硫酸中就构成了原电池：锌比铜活泼，锌失电子被氧化（Zn-2e- 生成 Zn2+）成为负极，电子沿导线流到铜电极；氢离子在铜表面获得电子被还原成氢气，铜是正极并冒出气泡。电子在导线中的定向移动形成电流，化学能转化为电能。若两极直接接触短路，电子就直接传给氢离子，外电路就没有电流。�^Because the two metals differ in activity, they form a galvanic (voltaic) cell in dilute sulfuric acid. Zinc is the more active metal, so it loses electrons and is oxidized (Zn - 2e⁻ → Zn²⁺) as the anode; electrons travel through the wire to the copper electrode, where H⁺ gains electrons and is reduced to hydrogen gas, so copper is the cathode and bubbles gas. The directed flow of electrons in the wire is the electric current, and chemical energy becomes electrical energy. If the two metals touch directly, electrons pass straight to the ions and no current flows through an external circuit.�ans��src��!《普通化学》（电化学）�$General Chemistry (electrochemistry)��id�430b63cdb6e7�body��~表面活性剂超过 CMC 后自组装成疏水核、亲水壳的胶束，可增溶油污；CMC 是开始成胶束的阈值。٨Above the CMC, surfactants self-assemble into micelles with hydrophobic cores and hydrophilic shells that solubilize grease; CMC is the threshold for micelle formation.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�434ac87b084d�body��多晶型指同一化学组成因分子排列或构象不同而形成多种晶型，各晶型的稳定性、熔点和溶解度都不同。药物的不同晶型溶出速率可能差很多，直接影响药效与安全性，因此药典对关键药物的晶型有严格规定。�]Polymorphism is when one composition adopts several crystal forms differing in molecular packing or conformation, each with distinct stability, melting point, and solubility. Different polymorphs of a drug can dissolve at very different rates, directly affecting efficacy and safety, so pharmacopeias strictly control crystal forms of key medicines.�ans��src��^Bernstein《多晶型：分子晶体的稳定形式》（Polymorphism in Molecular Crystals）�GBernstein, "Polymorphism in Molecular Crystals" (Cambridge Univ. Press)��id�451dcbb4b3e6�body�ٱ加入含相同离子的物质会使平衡向左移动：在弱酸中抑制解离（pH 升高），在难溶盐中降低溶解度。这是缓冲与沉淀分离的理论基础。��Adding a species with a common ion shifts equilibrium leftward: in a weak acid it suppresses dissociation (raising pH), and in a sparingly soluble salt it lowers solubility. This underlies buffers and precipitation separations.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�4548788c588b�body�ِ烃是只由碳和氢两种元素组成的有机化合物，是石油和天然气的主要成分。甲烷、汽油中的辛烷都属于烃类。ٴHydrocarbons are organic compounds made only of carbon and hydrogen, and they are the main components of petroleum and natural gas. Methane and octane in gasoline are hydrocarbons.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�45bdaec650b4�body��1α 粒子是氦核（⁴₂He），带正电、质量大，电离强但一张纸即可阻挡；β 粒子是高速电子，穿透力中等，需几毫米铝板屏蔽；γ 是高频电磁波（光子），电离弱但穿透极强，需厚铅或混凝土防护。三者电离与穿透能力呈反向关系。��Alpha particles are helium nuclei (⁴₂He), positively charged and massive, with strong ionization but stopped by paper; beta particles are fast electrons of moderate penetration needing a few millimeters of aluminum; gamma rays are high-frequency photons, weakly ionizing but highly penetrating, requiring thick lead or concrete. Their ionizing and penetrating powers are inversely related.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�4688fd86636e�body�ٙ酯是酸和醇反应生成的一类有机物，许多酯带有水果般的香气。香蕉、苹果和菠萝的香味就来自不同的酯类化合物。ٰEsters are organic compounds formed from acids and alcohols, and many esters have fruity scents. The smells of banana, apple, and pineapple come from different ester compounds.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�46ef3be0e35b�body���乳化是把一种不互溶液体分散成微小液滴混入另一种液体形成乳状液的过程。乳化剂（表面活性剂）吸附在液-液界面，降低界面张力并形成机械或电荷屏障，阻止液滴聚并。�Emulsification disperses one immiscible liquid as fine droplets into another to form an emulsion. An emulsifier (surfactant) adsorbs at the liquid-liquid interface, lowers interfacial tension, and forms a mechanical or charge barrier that prevents droplet coalescence.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�4755ac4f3717�body���Ksp 是难溶盐饱和溶液中离子浓度幂的乘积常数。对 AB 型盐，溶解度 s 满足 Ksp = s²；对 A₂B 型则 Ksp = 4s³。但同离子效应或配位会显著改变实际溶解度。��Ksp is the ion-concentration product constant for a saturated sparingly soluble salt. For an AB salt, s satisfies Ksp = s²; for A₂B, Ksp = 4s³. Common-ion effects or complexation can markedly change actual solubility.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�4788fed2ac83�body���陶瓷多由金属与非金属元素的离子/共价化合物（如氧化铝、硅酸盐）构成，硬度高、耐高温、耐腐蚀且绝缘。缺点是脆性大、抗冲击差。它们广泛用于刀具、耐火材料和电子基板。�3Ceramics are mostly ionic/covalent compounds of metals and nonmetals (e.g., alumina, silicates); they are hard, heat-resistant, corrosion-resistant, and insulating. Their drawback is high brittleness and poor impact resistance. They are widely used in cutting tools, refractories, and electronic substrates.�ans��src��'《材料科学基础》（胡赓祥）�0Fundamentals of Materials Science (Hu Gengxiang)��id�48779f79f658�body��B两者都是极性分子且能形成氢键，所以完全混溶。�?Both are polar and form hydrogen bonds, so they mix completely.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�4b8a123b25b5�body��k用 V₂O₅ 催化 SO₂ 氧化成 SO₃，再吸收成硫酸；是最大宗的工业催化过程之一。�V₂O₅ catalyzes SO₂ to SO₃, which is then absorbed into sulfuric acid; among the largest industrial catalytic processes.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�4c5e0122be49�body���先导化合物是具有一定药理活性但尚需优化的分子骨架，是药物研发的起点。它可来自天然产物、随机筛选、已知药物的结构改造或计算机辅助设计。�A lead compound is a molecular scaffold with some pharmacological activity that still needs optimization and serves as the starting point of drug development. It may come from natural products, random screening, structural modification of known drugs, or computer-aided design.�ans��src��1《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 1 章�KC. G. Wermuth, The Practice of Medicinal Chemistry, 4th ed., Academic Press��id�4da50c35f9d7�body�ٙ聚合物是由许多重复单元连接成的巨大分子，如塑料、橡胶和纤维。它们的性能取决于链的长短、排列和交联方式。٨Polymers are huge molecules made of many repeating units, such as plastics, rubber, and fibers. Their properties depend on chain length, arrangement, and cross-linking.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�510bd40fbe9f�body��	σ 键由原子轨道沿键轴"头碰头"重叠形成，电子云绕轴呈圆柱形对称，可绕轴自由旋转、键较强。π 键由 p 轨道"肩并肩"侧向重叠形成，电子云分布在键轴上下，不能绕轴自由旋转、键较弱且较易断裂。�1A sigma bond forms by head-on overlap of orbitals along the bond axis, giving cylindrically symmetric electron density that allows free rotation and is relatively strong. A pi bond forms by side-on overlap of p orbitals above and below the axis, blocks free rotation, and is weaker and more easily broken.�ans��src��9McMurry《有机化学》（第9版），第1章共价键�,McMurry, "Organic Chemistry" (9th ed.), Ch.1��id�5134780db4c6�body��@过电位是电极实际电位偏离其平衡（可逆）电位的额外电压损失，主要来自电极反应缓慢的动力学（活化极化）以及气泡在电极上脱离困难等。水的理论分解电压约 1.23 V，但由于析氧反应动力学极慢，实际常需 1.8–2.0 V 以上才开始明显产气。��Overpotential is the extra voltage loss when an electrode operates away from its equilibrium potential, driven mainly by sluggish reaction kinetics (activation polarization) and difficulty of bubble detachment. Water's theoretical decomposition voltage is about 1.23 V, but the slow oxygen-evolution reaction typically forces the real cell to 1.8–2.0 V or more before gas evolves appreciably.�ans��src��MBard & Faulkner《电化学方法：基础与应用》（第2版），第3章�YBard & Faulkner, "Electrochemical Methods: Fundamentals and Applications" (2nd ed.), Ch.3��id�51bbb073ec12�body���先选 pKa 最接近目标 pH 的弱酸/碱对，由亨德森方程算出 [A⁻]/[HA] 比，再用相近浓度的酸与共轭碱（或其盐）按计量混合，最后用 pH 计校准。常用方法包括半中和法与混盐法。�(Pick a weak acid/base pair whose pKa is closest to the target pH, use Henderson-Hasselbalch to get the [A⁻]/[HA] ratio, mix the acid and its conjugate base (or salt) at matching concentration accordingly, then calibrate with a pH meter. Common routes are partial neutralization and salt-mixing.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�51d6f5a1e3e2�body�ٰKp = Kc(RT)^(Δn)，其中 Δn 是气体生成物与反应物化学计量数之差。仅当 Δn = 0（气体摩尔数不变）时 Kp = Kc；否则两者数值随温度变化。ٻKp = Kc(RT)^(Δn), where Δn is the change in moles of gas (products minus reactants). Kp equals Kc only when Δn = 0 (no net change in gas moles); otherwise they differ with temperature.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�555c8f2c9d7b�body��`火药中的硝石供氧、硫磺和木炭剧烈燃烧，瞬间产生大量高温气体膨胀。�VNitre supplies oxygen; sulfur and charcoal burn violently, making hot gas expand fast.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�55c26e356d6a�body��燃烧是放热的，但反应必须先跨过"活化能"这道门槛——常温下反应物分子的能量不足以启动链式氧化。火苗或火花提供初始能量把少数分子激发到能反应的状态，反应放出的热再维持连锁反应，于是继续烧下去。�2Combustion is exothermic, but the reaction must first clear an "activation energy" barrier—at room temperature reactant molecules lack the energy to start the oxidation chain. A flame or spark supplies that initial energy to excite a few molecules; the heat they release then sustains the chain reaction.�ans��src��<Atkins & de Paula《物理化学》（第10版），第22章�9Atkins & de Paula, "Physical Chemistry" (10th ed.), Ch.22��id�55fd36f1c05d�body�ٚ柠檬含有柠檬酸等有机酸，这些酸在水中释放出氢离子，刺激舌头产生酸味。柠檬汁的pH大约只有2到3，属于强酸性。��Lemons contain organic acids such as citric acid, which release hydrogen ions in water and stimulate the tongue to produce a sour taste. Lemon juice has a pH of about 2 to 3, making it strongly acidic.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�5614a3b51199�body��螯合效应指多齿配体通过两个或多个配位原子与同一金属结合形成环状结构，使配合物比单齿配体类似物更稳定。从熵角度看，一个多齿配体取代多个单齿配体时体系粒子数增加，熵增有利于螯合物形成。�0The chelate effect refers to the extra stability when a polydentate ligand binds a metal through two or more donor atoms to form a ring. Entropically, replacing several monodentate ligands by one multidentate ligand increases the number of free particles, and the entropy gain favors the chelate complex.�ans��src��4《无机化学》(武汉大学) 第三版 第 9 章�0IUPAC Gold Book, chelate (IUPAC Recommendations)��id�57bb01a12423�body��YCFC 在对流层稳定，上升至平流层后在紫外照射下释放氯原子。单个氯原子通过催化循环（Cl + O₃ → ClO + O₂，ClO + O → Cl + O₂）反复破坏臭氧分子，自身不被消耗，因而效率极高。一个氯原子可破坏数以万计的臭氧分子，这就是蒙特利尔议定书管控 CFC 的原因。��CFCs are stable in the troposphere but release chlorine atoms in the stratosphere under UV light. A single chlorine atom catalytically destroys ozone through the cycle Cl + O₃ → ClO + O₂ and ClO + O → Cl + O₂, regenerating itself and thus acting with very high efficiency. One chlorine atom can destroy tens of thousands of ozone molecules, which is why the Montreal Protocol controls CFCs.�ans��src��d《环境化学》(戴树桂, 第二版) 大气环境章；世界气象组织(WMO)臭氧评估报告�?WMO Ozone Assessment reports; Nature, ozone depletion mechanism��id�58b3766d6638�body��|超级电容器通过电极/电解液界面的双电层静电吸附（或快速可逆的赝电容 redox）储能，充放电快、循环寿命长但能量密度低。锂离子电池依靠锂离子在正负极间的嵌入/脱嵌发生氧化还原反应储能，能量密度高但功率密度与倍率性能较低。二者常互补用于需要高功率与高能量的不同场景。��Supercapacitors store energy by electrostatic double-layer adsorption at the electrode–electrolyte interface (or fast pseudocapacitive redox), giving fast charge–discharge and long life but low energy density. Lithium-ion batteries store energy via redox-coupled intercalation of Li⁺, offering high energy density but lower power and rate capability. The two are complementary for high-power versus high-energy needs.�ans��src��X《Nature Reviews Materials》电化学储能综述；美国化学会(ACS)能源 LETTERS�MNature Reviews Materials, electrochemical storage reviews; ACS Energy Letters��id�59cebe4a01e8�body��64 个三联体密码子对应 20 种氨基酸，多数氨基酸由 2–6 个同义密码子编码，这种冗余叫做简并。它使许多突变成为"同义突变"——碱基变了但氨基酸不变，从而缓冲了突变对蛋白质的有害影响，提高容错性。�/With 64 triplet codons but only 20 amino acids, most amino acids are encoded by two to six synonymous codons—a redundancy called degeneracy. It turns many mutations into "silent" ones that change the base but not the amino acid, buffering the harmful effects of mutation and improving fault tolerance.�ans��src��ELehninger《生物化学原理》（第7版），第27章遗传密码�8Lehninger, "Principles of Biochemistry" (7th ed.), Ch.27��id�5a279d2d3b80�body�� 玉米淀粉颗粒在冷水中只是悬浮；加热到约 60–70°C 时颗粒吸水膨胀、破裂，内部的直链和支链淀粉大量溶出，形成黏稠的网状凝胶，使汤汁变稠、产生光泽。继续过度加热或处于酸性环境会破坏这种凝胶，反而变稀。�Starch granules merely suspend in cold water; heating to about 60–70°C makes them swell and burst, releasing amylose and amylopectin that form a viscous network gel, thickening and glossing the sauce. Prolonged heating or acidic conditions can break that gel down.�ans��src��LMcGee《食物与烹饪》（On Food and Cooking 修订版），淀粉章节�6H. McGee, "On Food and Cooking" (rev. ed.), Ch. Starch��id�5a3043389c98�body���单齿配体只通过一个配位原子成键，如 H₂O、NH₃、Cl⁻；多齿配体（螯合剂）通过两个及以上原子成键，如乙二胺（双齿）、EDTA（六齿），能形成更稳定的螯合环。��Monodentate ligands bind through one donor atom, e.g., H₂O, NH₃, Cl⁻; polydentate (chelating) ligands bind through two or more atoms, e.g., ethylenediamine (bidentate) and EDTA (hexadentate), forming more stable chelate rings.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�5afe4d568694�body��r它在皮肤中转成维 A 酸，调控基因促进胶原并加速更新，但易光解刺激，宜夜间使用。ٗIt converts to retinoic acid in skin, regulating genes to boost collagen and turnover; but it is light-sensitive and irritating, so best used at night.�ans��src��8Royal Society of Chemistry（护肤与化妆品化学）�<Royal Society of Chemistry (skincare and cosmetic chemistry)��id�5b4038b7d98e�body��:可生物降解高分子能在微生物或水解作用下断裂成小分子，最终进入自然循环，典型如聚乳酸（PLA）、聚己二酸/对苯二甲酸丁二酯（PBAT）。它们用于包装、医用缝合线，可缓解白色污染。但降解仍需合适条件，并非任何环境都快速分解。�-Biodegradable polymers break into small molecules under microbes or hydrolysis and rejoin natural cycles; typical examples are polylactic acid (PLA) and PBAT. They serve in packaging and surgical sutures, easing plastic pollution. Yet degradation needs suitable conditions and is not rapid everywhere.�ans��src��潘祖仁《高分子化学》�Polymer Chemistry (Pan Zuren)��id�5ca0744c4971�body���氨基酸的羧基与另一氨基酸的氨基脱水缩合形成酰胺键（—CO—NH—）。由于共振，C—N 具部分双键特征，使肽单元呈刚性平面、不能自由旋转，这是蛋白质二级结构的基础。�Amino acid carboxyl and amino groups condense with loss of water to form an amide linkage (—CO—NH—). Resonance gives the C—N bond partial double-bond character, making the peptide unit a rigid planar group that cannot rotate freely—the basis of protein secondary structure.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5cb10f6956d4�body��醛的羰基（C=O）碳至少连有一个氢原子，官能团写在碳链末端（–CHO）；酮的羰基碳两侧都连着碳，位于链中。这一位置差异使醛更易被氧化，能与斐林试剂、托伦试剂反应，酮一般不能。两者都可由醇的氧化得到。�\An aldehyde's carbonyl carbon is bonded to at least one hydrogen, placing the group at a chain end (–CHO); a ketone's carbonyl carbon is flanked by carbons in the middle. This positional difference makes aldehydes easier to oxidize—they react with Fehling's and Tollens' reagents, unlike most ketones. Both can be obtained by alcohol oxidation.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�5e236bdd9573�body��活化能是反应物翻越能垒到达过渡态所需的最低额外能量；阿伦尼乌斯方程 k=Ae^(−Ea/RT) 表明速率常数随温度升高或 Ea 降低而指数增长。阿伦尼乌斯 1889 年提出该式并解释了温度对反应速率的影响。�Activation energy is the extra energy reactants need to reach the transition state; the Arrhenius equation k=Ae^(−Ea/RT) shows the rate constant rises exponentially with temperature or lower Ea. Arrhenius proposed it in 1889 to explain temperature effects.�ans��src��9阿伦尼乌斯 1889 年论文；Atkins《物理化学》�,Arrhenius (1889); Atkins, Physical Chemistry��id�5e35d97f5eae�body��~他称量金属煅烧后增重、且空气体积减少，证明燃烧是物质与氧结合，而不是放出虚构的燃素。ُHe showed metals gain mass and air volume drops on burning, proving combustion is combination with oxygen, not release of imaginary phlogiston.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5e6e2f6da63f�body���平流层的臭氧在 200–320 nm 波段强烈吸收紫外线，把高能光子转化为热，保护了地表生命。查普曼 1930 年提出臭氧生成与破坏的循环（Chapman cycle），NASA 持续监测其变化。��Stratospheric ozone strongly absorbs ultraviolet light in the 200-320 nm band, converting energetic photons into heat and shielding life below. Chapman proposed the formation-destruction cycle in 1930, and NASA keeps monitoring it.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5fc8258a240a�body���酶是高度专一的生物大分子，在温和条件下通过降低活化能极大加速反应，并受底物结构、pH、温度与抑制剂调控；无机催化剂通常作用较广、条件更剧烈且易失活性较低。�$Enzymes are highly specific biomacromolecules that, under mild conditions, greatly accelerate reactions by lowering activation energy and are regulated by substrate structure, pH, temperature, and inhibitors; inorganic catalysts are generally broader, harsher, and less prone to denaturation.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�609a24bd4de3�body��液晶是介于各向同性液体与晶体之间的中间态，分子可流动（像液体）却又保持一定的取向有序（像晶体）。其分子取向可被电场改变，从而旋转入射偏振光的偏振方向，这一性质正是液晶显示器（LCD）的工作原理。�EA liquid crystal is an intermediate state between an isotropic liquid and a crystal: its molecules can flow like a liquid yet retain some orientational order like a crystal. An applied electric field can reorient the molecules, rotating the polarization of passing light—the principle behind liquid-crystal displays (LCDs).�ans��src��W英国皇家化学会（RSC）材料化学综述；P. G. de Gennes《液晶物理学》�eRoyal Society of Chemistry (RSC) materials reviews; P. G. de Gennes, 'The Physics of Liquid Crystals'��id�61362f11e5b5�body��7牛奶是胶体，属于水包油型乳浊液：酪蛋白等包裹着微小的脂肪球分散在水中，粒子直径约0.1到10微米，与可见光波长相当，对光产生强烈散射，所以整体呈白色。若均质化不充分，脂肪球会上浮分层，这就是放置后出现奶油层的原因。�[Milk is a colloid, specifically an oil-in-water emulsion: casein coats tiny fat globules dispersed in water, forming particles about 0.1 to 10 micrometers across. Being comparable to visible wavelengths, these particles scatter light strongly, so the milk looks white. If homogenization is incomplete, the globules rise and cream separates on top.�ans��src��'《普通化学》(Atkins) 胶体章节�@General Chemistry (Atkins), colloids; Royal Society of Chemistry��id�61a8ebab121c�body���HF 的 H-F 键极短极强，在水中难以解离，且解离出的 F⁻ 与未解离 HF 形成强氢键二聚体 HF₂⁻，抑制进一步电离。因此它是弱酸，而 HCl、HBr 等反而强得多。��The H-F bond is very short and strong, so HF barely dissociates in water, and the F⁻ formed hydrogen-bonds with undissociated HF into HF₂⁻, suppressing further ionization. Thus HF is a weak acid while HCl and HBr are far stronger.�ans��src��BAtkins《物理化学》；Housecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》�DAtkins, Physical Chemistry; Housecroft & Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry��id�62a4ea18a412�body���过氧化氢分解 2H2O2 生成 2H2O+O2 的活化能较高，室温下能越过能量障碍的分子很少。二氧化锰作为催化剂吸附并分解过氧化氢分子，提供一条活化能低得多的路径，反应速率骤增，放出的氧气就成了大量气泡。反应结束后二氧化锰仍保持原状，可反复使用，这正是催化剂参加反应又回归原貌的典型例子。��The decomposition 2H2O2 → 2H2O + O2 has a fairly high activation energy, so at room temperature few molecules can clear the barrier. Manganese dioxide acts as a catalyst, adsorbing and breaking down H2O2 molecules along a much lower-energy path, so the rate jumps and the oxygen released forms a burst of bubbles. The manganese dioxide is left unchanged and reusable - a classic example of a catalyst taking part and then regenerating.�ans��src��中国科学院�"ACS, Journal of Chemical Education��id�63237945924b�body���脂类氧化会产生自由基链式反应使食品酸败。抗氧化剂（如维生素 C、E、酚类）作为氢供体中断自由基链，自身较稳定，从而延缓氧化、保持色泽风味并延长保质期。�Lipid oxidation proceeds by a radical chain reaction causing rancidity. Antioxidants (e.g., vitamins C and E, phenolics) donate hydrogen to break the chain and are relatively stable themselves, thus delaying oxidation, preserving color/flavor, and extending shelf life.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�63924b7c1d48�body�ق卷曲的石墨烯sp²碳网络赋予极高强度与导电性，中空结构又极轻；单壁管可呈金属性或半导体性。٠The rolled graphene sp² network gives strength and conductivity, while the hollow structure is very light; single-wall tubes can be metallic or semiconducting.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�63b3e30cdde5�body�ً轻、重同位素因质量差在物理化学过程中比例出现微小改变；可用于气候记录（¹⁸O/¹⁶O）与代谢示踪。١Light and heavy isotopes shift in ratio during physico-chemical processes due to mass differences; used in climate records (¹⁸O/¹⁶O) and metabolic tracing.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�65f725423850�body��N酵母分解糖产生二氧化碳，气体被困在面筋里使面团鼓起。�AYeast breaks sugar into CO2 trapped by gluten, puffing the dough.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�66475e7c0303�body���相对原子质量是某元素原子的平均质量与碳-12原子质量的十二分之一的比值，是一个没有单位的数。由于存在同位素，多数元素的相对原子质量不是整数。��Relative atomic mass is the ratio of the average mass of an element's atoms to one-twelfth of the mass of a carbon-12 atom, and it has no unit. Because of isotopes, most elements have non-integer relative atomic masses.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�6736183eb1b2�body��␀酶是蛋白质（或 RNA）催化剂，能大幅降低反应的活化能，常在常温常压下达到极高速率。活性中心通过精确的空间与化学作用稳定过渡态，并具有底物专一性。多数酶受温度、pH 和抑制剂调控。�=Enzymes are protein (or RNA) catalysts that greatly lower activation energy, achieving very high rates at mild conditions. Their active sites stabilize the transition state through precise spatial and chemical interactions and show substrate specificity. Most enzymes are regulated by temperature, pH, and inhibitors.�ans��src��王镜岩《生物化学》�Biochemistry (Wang Jingyan)��id�6933ffefc3f6�body���DNA 由两条反向平行的脱氧核苷酸链组成，通过碱基对之间的氢键配对（A–T、G–C）相互结合。糖-磷酸骨架在外侧，碱基堆叠在内侧，形成右手双螺旋。氢键与碱基堆积力共同维持其稳定。�DNA consists of two antiparallel deoxyribonucleotide strands held together by hydrogen-bonded base pairs (A–T, G–C). The sugar-phosphate backbones lie outside, with bases stacked inside, forming a right-handed double helix. Hydrogen bonds and base stacking together stabilize it.�ans��src��王镜岩《生物化学》�Biochemistry (Wang Jingyan)��id�6a5692edaa15�body��5质谱仪先将样品分子电离成带电离子，再在电磁场中按质荷比（m/z）分离并检测。它可提供分子的相对分子质量、元素组成（由精确质量与同位素峰）以及结构碎片信息。现代串联质谱还能进行复杂混合物中痕量化合物的定性与定量。��A mass spectrometer first ionizes sample molecules into charged ions, then separates them by mass-to-charge ratio (m/z) in electric or magnetic fields and detects them. It provides relative molecular mass, elemental composition (from exact mass and isotope patterns), and structural fragments. Modern tandem MS also enables qualitative and quantitative analysis of trace compounds in complex mixtures.�ans��src��X《分析化学》(武汉大学, 第五版) 质谱章；美国化学会(ACS)分析化学�]Harris, Quantitative Chemical Analysis, mass spectrometry chapter; Analytical Chemistry (ACS)��id�6a57af36e9e4�body���pKa 是酸解离一半时的 pH，也是该共轭对缓冲能力最强的点。缓冲只在 pH 接近 pKa 时有效，偏离越远，溶液对加酸或加碱越敏感。因此 pKa 是选择缓冲剂的判据。��pKa is the pH where the acid is half dissociated and where its conjugate pair buffers best. Buffering is effective only near pKa; the farther away, the more sensitive the solution is to added acid or base. Hence pKa guides buffer choice.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�6ab082d3724a�body���氧原子有两对孤对电子，按价层电子对互斥理论（VSEPR），孤对-成键对之间的排斥大于成键对之间，把两个 O-H 键压成约 104.5° 的夹角。Gillespie 与 Nyholm 在 1957 年系统提出 VSEPR 模型。��Oxygen carries two lone pairs; by VSEPR theory lone-pair/bond-pair repulsion exceeds bond-pair/bond-pair repulsion, pushing the two O-H bonds to about 104.5°. Gillespie and Nyholm set out the VSEPR model in 1957.�ans��src��MGillespie 与 Nyholm 1957 年论文；Housecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》�CGillespie & Nyholm (1957); Housecroft & Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry��id�6b8254eb6a4e�body���含不饱和双键的油脂在光照、氧气或水解作用下发生氧化或断裂，产生短链脂肪酸与醛酮等刺激性气味物质。Coultate 在《食物成分化学》中详述了脂类氧化与水解两条酸败路径。��Fats with unsaturated double bonds oxidize or hydrolyze under light, oxygen or moisture, breaking into short-chain fatty acids and aldehydes that smell rancid. Coultate's 'Food: The Chemistry of its Components' details the oxidative and hydrolytic routes.�ans��src��ACoultate《食物：成分的化学》；Belitz《食品化学》�GCoultate, Food: The Chemistry of its Components; Belitz, Food Chemistry��id�6cd0cd644169�body�ً天然群青取自青金石，矿少难提炼，合成群青（1828）出现前极昂贵；现在用高岭土、硫和纯碱即可合成。ِNatural ultramarine came from rare lapis lazuli and was precious before synthetic ultramarine (1828); now made from kaolin, sulfur and soda ash.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�6cf1a819975d�body�ٽ配位数 6 的配合物最常见为八面体构型，六个配体占据正八面体的顶点。典型例子是六水合钴(II)离子 [Co(H2O)6]2+ 或六氨合钴(III)离子 [Co(NH3)6]3+。��Coordination number 6 most commonly gives an octahedral geometry, with six ligands at the vertices of a regular octahedron. Typical examples are the hexaaquacobalt(II) ion [Co(H2O)6]2+ and the hexaamminecobalt(III) ion [Co(NH3)6]3+.�ans��src��4《无机化学》(武汉大学) 第三版 第 9 章�<IUPAC Gold Book, coordination number (IUPAC Recommendations)��id�6d2a7e5ea4d2�body���布朗运动是悬浮微粒受周围分子不平衡碰撞而产生的无规运动。它能使胶体颗粒不断随机位移，部分抵消重力沉降，但胶体长期稳定主要靠双电层排斥和溶剂化层，而非布朗运动本身。�NBrownian motion is the random movement of suspended particles from unbalanced molecular collisions. It gives colloidal particles continuous random displacement that partly counters gravitational settling, but long-term colloidal stability mainly relies on double-layer repulsion and solvation shells rather than Brownian motion alone.�ans��src��bA. Einstein,《由分子运动论所要求的悬浮微粒的布朗运动》,Ann. Phys. 1905,17,549�%A. Einstein, Ann. Phys. 1905, 17, 549��id�6d7a668ad19b�body��H固体直接变气体要克服粒子间作用力，因而吸收能量。�SGoing straight from solid to gas overcomes intermolecular forces, absorbing energy.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�6de9faa21a1d�body���缓冲容量是使 pH 改变一个单位所需加入的强酸/强碱量。它随总浓度增大而增大，并在 [A⁻] ≈ [HA]（pH ≈ pKa）时最大，偏离此比例或浓度过低时缓冲能力急剧下降。��Buffer capacity is the amount of strong acid/base needed to change pH by one unit. It grows with total concentration and is maximal when [A⁻] ≈ [HA] (pH ≈ pKa);deviating from that ratio or low concentration sharply weakens buffering.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�6e4cda823828�body�ٖ他们利用镭化合物与钡化合物性质相近难分离的特点，反复结晶富集，最终从沥青铀矿残渣中得到极少量氯化镭。ٖBecause radium resembles barium, they repeatedly crystallized to enrich it, finally isolating a tiny amount of radium chloride from uranium-ore waste.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�6ef02ec54abe�body���菠萝含菠萝蛋白酶、猕猴桃含猕猴桃蛋白酶，这些酶能切断肌肉蛋白里的肽键，破坏致密的蛋白质网络，使肉质变软。但腌制过久会过度水解蛋白质，反而让肉变得松散、口感发柴。��Pineapple contains bromelain and kiwi contains actinidin—proteases that cleave peptide bonds in muscle proteins, breaking the dense protein network and softening the meat. Over-marinating hydrolyzes too much, however, leaving the texture mushy.�ans��src��LMcGee《食物与烹饪》（On Food and Cooking 修订版），肉类章节�4H. McGee, "On Food and Cooking" (rev. ed.), Ch. Meat��id�70fad6565780�body��N水泥矿物与水发生水化反应，生成交织的晶体把沙石胶结。�PCement minerals hydrate, forming interlocking crystals that bind sand and stone.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�718f971df5e2�body��;白烟是可燃气体(蜡蒸气)，遇火会重新燃烧。�CThe white smoke is flammable wax vapor that reignites with a flame.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�72a39851fdd7�body��;分液漏斗用于分离两种互不相溶、密度不同的液体，比如水和油的混合物。把液体倒入漏斗静置分层后，打开下方活塞先放出下层液体，再把上层液体从漏斗口倒出。萃取实验常与分液漏斗配合：将水相和有机相振荡混合、静置后再分液。�aA separating funnel separates two immiscible liquids of different densities, such as water and oil. After the mixture settles into layers, the lower layer is drained through the stopcock and the upper layer is poured out of the top. It is usually paired with extraction: aqueous and organic phases are shaken together, allowed to settle, then separated.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�72fe210c948b�body�٩维生素是维持健康所需的微量有机化合物，如维生素C。矿物质是无机元素如钙、铁、锌，它们参与骨骼、酶和血液等多种功能。��Vitamins are tiny amounts of organic compounds needed for health, such as vitamin C. Minerals are inorganic elements like calcium, iron, and zinc, which take part in bones, enzymes, and blood functions.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7426a8e25402�body��x二价铁(Fe2+)偏绿、三价铁(Fe3+)偏黄；回收玻璃常含铁，于是带绿调，控制价态就能调颜色。�yFe2+ tends green, Fe3+ yellow; recycled glass often contains iron and looks greenish—controlling valence tunes the hue.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�742827b5c415�body�ٖ加热能提供越过活化能所需要的能量，让反应物分子达到可反应的状态。加催化剂或提高温度都能加快这类反应。ٵHeating supplies the energy needed to overcome activation energy, bringing reactant molecules to a reactive state. Adding a catalyst or raising temperature speeds up such reactions.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�752c10c19c18�body���煤和石油燃烧排放的二氧化硫和氮氧化物在大气中氧化并溶于水滴，生成硫酸和硝酸，使雨水 pH 降到5.6以下形成酸雨。大理石的主要成分是碳酸钙（CaCO3），它是弱酸盐，遇到酸会发生反应：CaCO3+2H+ 生成 Ca2+、H2O 和 CO2，变成可溶的钙盐被雨水冲走。日积月累，雕像的线条、铭文和细节被溶解，建筑结构受损，所以酸雨被称为建筑的无形杀手。�$Sulfur dioxide and nitrogen oxides from burning coal and oil are oxidized in the atmosphere and dissolve in raindrops to form sulfuric and nitric acid, pushing rain pH below 5.6. Marble is mostly calcium carbonate (CaCO3), a salt of a weak acid, so it reacts with the acid: CaCO3 + 2H⁺ → Ca²⁺ + H2O + CO2, dissolving into soluble calcium salts that rain washes away. Over time the fine lines, inscriptions and details of statues are melted off and structures weaken - which is why acid rain is called the invisible destroyer of architecture.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7558caf82a82�body��u容量瓶在指定温度下只有一个精确刻度，定容后体积很准；烧杯只有粗略刻度，误差大。�tA volumetric flask has one calibrated mark at a set temperature for precise volume; a beaker's marks are only rough.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�76d0a3faa380�body��9陶瓷由强离子键和共价键构成，熔点很高。�JCeramics use strong ionic/covalent bonds, giving very high melting points.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�776608dc614b�body���沿周期增加核电荷而新增电子进入同层，有效核电荷增大，把电子云拉得更紧，故半径递减。这一趋势在 Atkins 与 Housecroft 的教材中由屏蔽与有效核电荷解释。��Across a period the nuclear charge rises while added electrons enter the same shell, so the effective nuclear charge grows and pulls the cloud tighter, shrinking the radius. Atkins and Housecroft explain it via shielding and effective nuclear charge.�ans��src��BAtkins《物理化学》；Housecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》�DAtkins, Physical Chemistry; Housecroft & Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry��id�77c3c39caea5�body��放射性是某些原子核自发放出 α、β 或 γ 射线并转变为其他核素的现象。中子数与质子数比例失衡（过多或过少）或质量数过大的核往往不稳定，如铀-238、碳-14。衰变使核趋向更稳定的中子/质子比。�#Radioactivity is the spontaneous emission of α, β, or γ radiation as a nucleus changes into another nuclide. Nuclei with imbalanced neutron-to-proton ratios or very large mass numbers are often unstable, like uranium-238 and carbon-14. Decay drives the nucleus toward a more stable ratio.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�7bcba6e0b91d�body�٭酸雨是pH低于约5.6的降水，主要由二氧化硫和氮氧化物在大气中转化为硫酸和硝酸造成。它会酸化土壤和湖泊，损害森林和建筑物。��Acid rain is precipitation with a pH below about 5.6, mainly caused by sulfur dioxide and nitrogen oxides turning into sulfuric and nitric acids in the atmosphere. It acidifies soil and lakes and damages forests and buildings.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�7d60e84abfed�body���有机金属试剂（如格氏试剂、有机锂）和低价过渡金属催化剂易被水和氧破坏，导致失活或副反应。常用手段包括 Schlenk 技术、惰性气体保护、分子筛除水和使用高纯溶剂。�4Organometallic reagents (e.g., Grignard and organolithium reagents) and low-valent transition-metal catalysts are readily destroyed by water and oxygen, causing deactivation or side reactions. Common practices include Schlenk techniques, inert-gas blanketing, molecular sieves, and rigorously dried solvents.�ans��src��9《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 11 章�[D. F. Shriver & M. A. Drezdzon, The Manipulation of Air-Sensitive Compounds, 2nd ed., Wiley��id�7f4eab6aacf3�body��纳米颗粒的尺寸已经小到可以和可见光波长相比，光不再被金属表面直接反射，而是激发颗粒中的自由电子集体振荡，形成局域表面等离激元共振，强烈吸收特定波长的光。金的等离激元共振落在绿光附近，吸收掉绿光后透过的光呈红色；颗粒大小、形状改变时共振波长移动，颜色也随之从红到紫、蓝变化。纳米材料比表面积巨大、表面原子占比高，所以催化活性、熔点等性质也和大块材料明显不同。��When particles shrink to sizes comparable to visible wavelengths, light no longer reflects off a flat metal surface; instead it excites collective oscillation of the free electrons inside each particle - localized surface plasmon resonance - which strongly absorbs light of a specific wavelength. Gold's resonance sits near the green, so green light is absorbed and the transmitted light looks red; changing particle size or shape shifts the resonance, marching the colour from red through purple to blue. Nanomaterials also have enormous surface area and a high fraction of surface atoms, so catalytic activity, melting point and other properties differ markedly from bulk material.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7f50c76d395a�body��^乙烯在催化剂（如 Ziegler–Natta 或茂金属）作用下发生加聚，打开双键连接成—CH₂—CH₂—长链。低密度聚乙烯（LDPE）由高压自由基聚合得到支化结构、较软透明；高密度聚乙烯（HDPE）在低压配位催化下链规整、支化少、强度高。二者密度与结晶度差异决定用途。��Ethylene undergoes addition polymerization under catalysts such as Ziegler–Natta or metallocene, opening its double bond to link into long —CH₂—CH₂— chains. Low-density polyethylene (LDPE) comes from high-pressure radical polymerization, giving branched, softer, transparent material; high-density polyethylene (HDPE) uses low-pressure coordination catalysis for more linear, less branched, stronger chains. Their density and crystallinity differences dictate applications.�ans��src��g《高分子化学》(潘祖仁, 第五版) 自由基与配位聚合章；美国化学会(ACS)高分子�LOdian, Principles of Polymerization; ACS Macro Letters, polyolefin catalysis��id�7f9d82693338�body��'硼砂是四硼酸钠的十水合物（Na₂B₄O₇·10H₂O），是一种天然硼酸盐矿物。它熔点低、能助熔，传统上用于陶瓷釉料、玻璃和清洁剂，并在分析化学中作为基准物质配制缓冲溶液。过量摄入对人体有害，因此食品用途受限。�:Borax is the decahydrate of sodium tetraborate (Na₂B₄O₇·10H₂O), a natural borate mineral. With a low melting point and fluxing ability, it is used in ceramics glazes, glass, and detergents, and as a primary standard in analytical chemistry. Excessive ingestion is harmful, so its food uses are restricted.�ans��src��0《无机化学》（北京师范大学等编）�*Inorganic Chemistry (Beijing Normal Univ.)��id�80911dcd4a36�body���平均键焓是某类化学键在不同分子中键能的平均值，与分子环境无关；标准生成焓是针对特定化合物由其元素生成的精确值。用键焓估算 ΔH 仅是近似，因实际键能随结构变化。� Average bond enthalpy is a mean bond energy for a bond type across molecules, independent of context; standard enthalpy of formation is an exact value for a specific compound from its elements. Bond-enthalpy estimates of ΔH are approximate because real bond energies vary with structure.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�8203eab2adb8�body��原电池利用自发氧化还原反应，把氧化半反应和还原半反应分置两电极，电子经外电路从负极流向正极形成电流。例如丹尼尔电池中锌被氧化、铜离子被还原，盐桥维持电荷平衡。总反应的自由能下降转化为电功。�VA galvanic cell uses a spontaneous redox reaction, placing oxidation and reduction at separate electrodes so electrons flow through an external circuit from anode to cathode as current. In the Daniell cell, zinc is oxidized and copper ions reduced, with a salt bridge balancing charge. The reaction's free-energy drop becomes electrical work.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�837ff46eaeba�body��5酶固定化是将游离酶通过吸附、包埋、共价交联或载体结合等方式固定于不溶性支持物上的技术。固定化酶稳定性更高、可重复使用、易于与产物分离，并能装填于连续反应柱中实现工业化催化。它在食品、医药和传感领域应用广泛。�lEnzyme immobilization attaches free enzymes to insoluble supports by adsorption, entrapment, covalent cross-linking, or carrier binding. Immobilized enzymes are more stable, reusable, and easy to separate from products, and can be packed into continuous-flow reactors for industrial catalysis. They are widely used in food, pharmaceutical, and sensor applications.�ans��src��gBuchholz, Kasche & Bornscheuer《生物催化剂与酶技术》（Biocatalysts and Enzyme Technology）�DBuchholz, Kasche & Bornscheuer, "Biocatalysts and Enzyme Technology"��id�86b26984c6f4�body���用生物质、CO₂、植物油脂等可再生资源替代石油等枯竭性原料，可降低碳足迹并减少对不可再生资源的依赖。例如生物基乙醇、聚乳酸（PLA）源自玉米淀粉而非化石燃料。��Using biomass, CO₂, or plant oils instead of depleting petrochemical feedstocks lowers the carbon footprint and reduces reliance on finite resources—e.g., bio-ethanol and polylactic acid (PLA) from corn starch rather than fossil fuels.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�86cee5a5fb14�body��)核心包括：预防废弃物优于末端治理、原子经济性最大化、使用低毒合成方法、设计可降解产品、使用可再生原料、避免不必要的保护与衍生、催化优于化学计量试剂、设计节能过程等。它们指导从源头减少环境与健康危害。�ACore ideas: prevent waste rather than treat it, maximize atom economy, use low-toxicity methods, design degradable products, use renewable feedstocks, avoid unnecessary protection/derivatization, favor catalysis over stoichiometric reagents, and design energy-efficient processes. They aim to reduce hazard at the source.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�874ca03e33d4�body�ٺ金属元素通常能导电导热、有金属光泽且易失去电子，多位于周期表左侧。非金属元素多在右侧，常得到或共用电子，许多在常温下是气体。�Metal elements usually conduct electricity and heat, have a metallic luster, and tend to lose electrons, and they sit mostly on the left of the periodic table. Nonmetals are mostly on the right, tend to gain or share electrons, and many are gases at room temperature.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�88a20af81755�body���毒性不只取决于官能团，还取决于分子被代谢后的产物。乙醇在体内主要被氧化成乙醛和乙酸，能继续分解为二氧化碳和水；而甲醇被醇脱氢酶氧化成甲醛和甲酸，甲酸会在体内积累，损伤视神经和肾脏，少量即可致盲甚至致命。所以误喝工业酒精（含甲醇）极其危险，医用酒精用的是乙醇。��Toxicity depends not just on the functional group but on what the body turns the molecule into. Ethanol is oxidized mainly to acetaldehyde then acetic acid, which breaks down to carbon dioxide and water; methanol, however, is oxidized by alcohol dehydrogenase to formaldehyde and formic acid. Formic acid accumulates and damages the optic nerve and kidneys - small amounts can blind or kill. That is why industrial alcohol containing methanol is extremely dangerous, while medical alcohol is ethanol.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�88d56b9109fd�body��L我们缺少分解 β-糖苷键的酶，所以纤维素只当膳食纤维。�KWe lack enzymes for the beta-glycosidic bond, so cellulose passes as fiber.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�8ab827a1fcc5�body�ٙ他把易炸的硝化甘油吸附进硅藻土做成稳定的炸药用于工程；晚年立遗嘱把财富设奖，奖励对人类有贡献的科学家。ٕHe stabilized volatile nitroglycerin in diatomite for safe engineering use; in his will he left his fortune to prize scientists who benefit humanity.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8bb7855ae399�body���理想气体假设分子无体积且无力作用；真实分子有有限体积并产生范德华吸引，高压低温下尤为明显。范德华 1873 年用 (P+a/V²)(V−b)=RT 修正，因此获 1910 年诺奖。�The ideal gas assumes point particles with no forces; real molecules have finite volume and attract one another, deviations that grow at high pressure and low temperature. van der Waals corrected this in 1873 with (P+a/V²)(V−b)=RT, earning the 1910 Nobel Prize.�ans��src��3范德华 1873 年论文；Atkins《物理化学》�0van der Waals (1873); Atkins, Physical Chemistry��id�8cbffe0953be�body��按元素基态最后填入的电子亚层划分：s 区（ns¹⁻²，碱金属与碱土）、p 区（np¹⁻⁶，主族其余）、d 区（(n−1)d¹⁻¹⁰，过渡金属）、f 区（(n−2)f，镧系锕系）。这反映价电子构型与化学性质。�8Blocks are defined by the subshell receiving the last electron in the ground state: s-block (ns¹⁻², alkali/alkaline earth), p-block (np¹⁻⁶, rest of main groups), d-block ((n−1)d¹⁻¹⁰, transition metals), f-block ((n−2)f, lanthanides/actinides). This mirrors valence configuration and chemistry.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�8cc415af022d�body��普通电池把反应物储存在内部，电量耗尽需充电或更换；燃料电池则持续从外部供给燃料（如氢气）和氧化剂（如氧气），不断发电，只排放水。它能量转化效率高、无燃烧，是清洁电源方向之一。�4Ordinary batteries store reactants internally and need recharging or replacement when depleted; a fuel cell continuously receives fuel (e.g., hydrogen) and oxidant (e.g., oxygen) from outside, generating electricity and emitting only water. With high efficiency and no combustion, it is a clean power option.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�8d141625a98e�body�ِ趁石灰乳（氢氧化钙）未干时作画，石灰吸收空气中的CO2硬化成碳酸钙，颜料被嵌进这层石质中，稳定持久。�{Fresco is painted on wet lime (Ca(OH)2) that absorbs CO2 and hardens to CaCO3, locking pigments into a durable stone layer.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�8d5bb464f312�body��N电解质在两极间传导离子，让电子只能走外电路形成电流。�^The electrolyte carries ions between electrodes so electrons flow through the wire as current.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8e0ecb35e29e�body��水的三相点是纯水固、液、气三相平衡共存的唯一状态，温度为0.01℃（273.16 K）、压力为611.657帕。它被选定为热力学温标（开尔文）的定义固定点，即规定该点温度精确为273.16 K，是温度计量的基准。�KThe triple point of water is the unique state where pure water's solid, liquid, and vapor phases coexist in equilibrium, at 0.01 ℃ (273.16 K) and 611.657 Pa. It is designated as the defining fixed point of the thermodynamic temperature scale (kelvin), fixed exactly at 273.16 K, and serves as a primary reference for thermometry.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8ffce3422471�body��1是的，钢铁腐蚀是典型的电化学过程：在潮湿表面形成微电池，铁作阳极失去电子被氧化成 Fe²⁺，氧在阴极被还原，产物进一步生成铁锈（水合氧化铁）。盐水和酸性环境会加速这一过程。涂漆、镀锌则是阻断电解质接触来防锈。�JYes—steel corrosion is a classic electrochemical process: moisture forms microcells where iron acts as anode, losing electrons to Fe²⁺, while oxygen is reduced at the cathode, eventually forming hydrated iron oxide (rust). Saltwater and acidity accelerate it. Painting or galvanizing blocks electrolyte contact to prevent it.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�900911602501�body��0金属内部自由电子能快速传递能量。�.Free electrons in metals carry energy quickly.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�90d7123835c4�body��W辅酶是与酶蛋白松散结合、反应中可解离扩散的小分子有机辅助因子（如 NAD⁺、CoA）；辅基则通过共价或强非共价作用牢固结合在酶上（如血红素、FAD）。二者常作为电子、基团或原子的载体，扩展酶的活性中心化学能力。缺少它们，许多酶将失去催化活性。�LA coenzyme binds loosely to the enzyme and can dissociate during the reaction (e.g., NAD⁺, CoA), whereas a prosthetic group is tightly and often covalently attached (e.g., heme, FAD). Both act as carriers of electrons, groups, or atoms, extending the chemical repertoire of the active site. Without them many enzymes are inactive.�ans��src��O《生物化学》(Lehninger, 第七版) 酶章；IUPAC（生物化学术语）�]Lehninger Principles of Biochemistry, 7th ed., enzyme chapter; IUPAC Biochemical Nomenclature��id�91229062620a�body��H表面分子受内部分子吸引更强，使表面像一层弹性膜。�NSurface molecules are pulled inward more strongly, making a skin-like surface.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�91309fc70926�body���反应级数是速率方程中各物质浓度幂次的总和，由实验测定。分子数是基元反应中同时碰撞的反应物粒子数，仅对基元反应有意义。对复杂反应，反应级数可以是分数或零，与分子数并不一致。�<Reaction order is the sum of concentration exponents in the rate law, determined experimentally. Molecularity is the number of particles colliding simultaneously in an elementary step and applies only to elementary reactions. For complex reactions the order can be fractional or zero and need not equal molecularity.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�93a2f803f039�body���稀土包括镧系15种元素以及钪、钇，它们的用量通常很少，但添加后能显著改善材料性能：钕可用于制造超强的钕铁硼永磁体，镧用于光学玻璃和催化裂化催化剂，铈用在抛光粉和储氢合金中。像味精做菜一样少加一点、效果明显，所以被称为工业味精。全球稀土的开采与冶炼很大一部分集中在中国，在高新技术产业中地位重要。�*The rare earths are the 15 lanthanides plus scandium and yttrium. They are usually added in tiny amounts yet dramatically improve material performance: neodymium makes super-strong NdFeB permanent magnets, lanthanum goes into optical glass and cracking catalysts, and cerium is used in polishing powder and hydrogen-storage alloys. Like seasoning, where a little goes a long way, they are nicknamed the vitamins of industry. Much of the world's rare-earth mining and refining takes place in China, giving them strategic weight in high-tech manufacturing.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�9494ed8dc254�body��合金是在金属中加入其他元素形成的混合物，异种原子破坏了纯金属规则的层状排列，使位错滑移受阻。原子尺寸差异和固溶强化提高了硬度和强度，例如钢比纯铁坚硬得多。这解释了为何工程少用纯金属。�*Alloys mix a metal with other elements; foreign atoms disrupt the regular layered arrangement of pure metal, hindering dislocation slip. Size mismatch and solid-solution strengthening raise hardness and strength—steel is far harder than pure iron. This is why engineering rarely uses pure metals.�ans��src��'《材料科学基础》（胡赓祥）�0Fundamentals of Materials Science (Hu Gengxiang)��id�94d99737dc3d�body�٨碳纤维是由碳原子构成的高温处理细丝，又轻又硬、强度高，常用于飞机、赛车和运动器材。它常与树脂结合成复合材料使用。��Carbon fiber is a fine filament of carbon atoms treated at high temperature; it is light, stiff, and strong, used in aircraft, race cars, and sports gear. It is often combined with resin as a composite.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�97a46cdfed2b�body�ـ荧光团（如 FITC、GFP）吸收特定波长的光、发出另一波长，可偶联抗体或标签来定位蛋白与结构。ِFluorophores like FITC or GFP absorb one wavelength and emit another, and can be linked to antibodies or tags to locate proteins and structures.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�98228ee9a021�body���某些羰基化合物中，质子在氧与α-碳之间转移，使酮式与烯醇式达成快速平衡，二者互为构造异构体。烯醇式因共轭或分子内氢键而稳定，Clayden 把它列为有机机理的核心概念。�In some carbonyl compounds a proton shuttles between oxygen and the alpha carbon, equilibrating a keto form with an enol form that are constitutional isomers. The enol is stabilized by conjugation or intramolecular hydrogen bonding; Clayden treats this as a core mechanism.�ans��src��Clayden《有机化学》�Clayden, Organic Chemistry��id�99280b278a15�body��8胃酸(盐酸)帮助分解食物并杀灭部分细菌。�=Stomach acid (HCl) helps digest food and kills some bacteria.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9c1797df1172�body��碳原子把2s轨道和三个2p轨道杂化成四个能量相同的sp3杂化轨道，每个轨道与一个氢的1s轨道沿轴向重叠成键。四个sp3杂化轨道指向正四面体的四个顶点，夹角约109.5°，所以甲烷是正四面体形，四个C-H键完全等价。�?Carbon hybridizes its 2s and three 2p orbitals into four equivalent sp3 hybrid orbitals, each overlapping a hydrogen 1s orbital along its axis to form a bond. The four sp3 hybrids point to the corners of a regular tetrahedron with angles of about 109.5°, so methane is tetrahedral with four fully equivalent C-H bonds.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�9d2566efd51a�body���三磷酸腺苷（ATP）是细胞内的能量货币，其末端的磷酸酐键水解时释放能量驱动各种生命活动。ATP 与 ADP 之间的循环实现了能量的捕获、储存与释放。呼吸作用和光合作用都为其合成提供能量。�Adenosine triphosphate (ATP) is the cell's energy currency; hydrolysis of its terminal phosphoanhydride bond releases energy to power life processes. The ATP/ADP cycle captures, stores, and releases energy. Respiration and photosynthesis supply the energy for its synthesis.�ans��src��王镜岩《生物化学》�Biochemistry (Wang Jingyan)��id�9e166689db1b�body��一步燃烧放出的热能又猛又烫，细胞无法储存，还会损坏蛋白质。细胞把葡萄糖经糖酵解、三羧酸循环和氧化磷酸化分解成几十个小步骤，每一步只释放少量能量，并用它合成高能分子 ATP（1分子葡萄糖约可产生30到32个 ATP）或还原型辅酶。这样能量以 ATP 形式被打包储存，按需支取，效率远高于一步燃烧。分步还能让细胞对能量需求精细调控，比如缺氧时切换到产能较少的糖酵解应急。�UOne-step burning dumps energy as heat - too fast and too hot to store, and destructive to proteins. Instead the cell chops glucose through glycolysis, the citric-acid cycle and oxidative phosphorylation into dozens of small steps, each releasing a little energy that is captured to make the high-energy molecule ATP (about 30-32 ATP per glucose) or reduced coenzymes. Energy is packaged into ATP and spent on demand, far more efficiently than a single burst of burning. The stepwise design also allows fine control - in low oxygen the cell shifts to the less productive glycolysis to keep running.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9e43ebd1ecd1�body�٨铁在潮湿空气中与氧气发生电化学腐蚀，生成红棕色的氧化铁（铁锈）。水和盐分都会加速这个过程，所以海边的铁更易生锈。ٳIron undergoes electrochemical corrosion with oxygen in moist air, forming reddish-brown iron oxide (rust). Water and salt speed up the process, so iron near the sea rusts faster.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�9f70f5c26065�body��>焦糖化是糖类在约 160 ℃ 以上自身受热脱水、裂解与聚合的非酶褐变，不需氨基酸参与，产生焦糖色素与苦味、坚果香。美拉德反应则需要还原糖与氨基化合物共同作用。两者都生成棕色物质，但原料与机理不同，常在高温烹饪中同时发生。��Caramelization is the non-enzymatic browning of sugars alone when heated above about 160 ℃, involving dehydration, fragmentation, and polymerization without amino compounds, yielding caramel color and bitter, nutty notes. The Maillard reaction requires both reducing sugars and amino compounds. Both give brown products but differ in reactants and mechanism and often co-occur in high-heat cooking.�ans��src��M《食品化学》(王璋) 褐变章；美国化学会(ACS)农业食品化学�RACS Journal of Agricultural and Food Chemistry, browning reactions; Food Chemistry��id�a0643b1616bf�body��酯由羧酸与醇在酶或酸催化下发生酯化反应生成，具有花果般挥发性香气。在水果成熟和葡萄酒发酵中，酵母与酯合成酶将脂肪酸与醇组装成乙酸乙酯、异戊酸乙酯等，构成特征香气。酯的水解则会减弱或改变风味。��Esters form by esterification of carboxylic acids with alcohols under enzyme or acid catalysis and carry fruity, floral volatile aromas. During fruit ripening and wine fermentation, yeasts and ester synthases assemble fatty acids with alcohols into compounds like ethyl acetate and ethyl isovalerate that define characteristic scents. Hydrolysis of esters weakens or alters the flavor.�ans��src��S《食品化学》(王璋) 香气成分章；美国化学会(ACS)农业食品化学�OACS Journal of Agricultural and Food Chemistry, volatile esters; Food Chemistry��id�a091a0355813�body��4稀有气体原子的最外层具有稳定的八电子构型，电离能极高，传统上被认为化学惰性、难以成键。1962年，尼尔·巴特利特（Neil Bartlett）用强氧化剂六氟化铂（PtF6）与氙反应，首次制得了六氟合铂酸氙（XePtF6），开创了稀有气体化学。�YNoble-gas atoms have a stable octet in their outer shell and extremely high ionization energies, so they were long considered chemically inert and unable to bond. In 1962 Neil Bartlett reacted xenon with the powerful oxidizer platinum hexafluoride (PtF6) and produced xenon hexafluoroplatinate (XePtF6), the first synthesized noble-gas compound.�ans��src�ل国际纯粹与应用化学联合会（IUPAC）无机化学命名指南；N. Bartlett,《Proceedings of the Chemical Society》,1962�International Union of Pure and Applied Chemistry (IUPAC); N. Bartlett, 'Xenon hexafluoroplatinate(VI),' Proc. Chem. Soc., 1962��id�a0f1f870dd36�body��米曲霉等霉菌分泌蛋白酶，把大豆蛋白逐步水解成肽和游离氨基酸，其中谷氨酸是鲜味的主要来源。同时淀粉酶把淀粉变成糖，微生物代谢产生醇、酸、酯，共同形成酱油"鲜中带香"的复杂风味。�FMolds such as Aspergillus oryzae secrete proteases that stepwise hydrolyze soy protein into peptides and free amino acids, among which glutamate is the main source of umami. Amylases convert starch to sugars, and microbial metabolism yields alcohols, acids, and esters that together build soy sauce's savory, aromatic profile.�ans��src��wGB/T 18186《酿造酱油》国家标准；McGee《食物与烹饪》（On Food and Cooking 修订版），发酵章节�yGB/T 18186 (Chinese national standard for brewed soy sauce); H. McGee, "On Food and Cooking" (rev. ed.), Ch. Fermentation��id�a20d41162078�body��\物理吸附由范德华力引起，可逆、无电子转移、活化能低；化学吸附涉及表面与吸附质间形成化学键，有电子共享或转移，具选择性且较稳定。催化反应通常依赖适中的化学吸附——过强会使表面中毒，过弱则无法活化反应物。因此吸附强度是催化剂设计的关键。��Physisorption arises from van der Waals forces and is reversible, non-specific, and low in activation energy; chemisorption involves bond formation with electron sharing or transfer and is selective and more stable. Catalysis generally relies on moderate chemisorption—too strong poisons the surface, too weak fails to activate reactants. Adsorption strength is therefore central to catalyst design.�ans��src��X《物理化学》(傅献彩, 第五版) 表面现象章；IUPAC（催化术语）, 2011�iIUPAC (Manual on Catalyst Characterization, 2011); Atkins & de Paula, Physical Chemistry, surface chapter��id�a20e8c13ade1�body��陶瓷多为离子或共价网络，键强且方向性强，故硬度高、熔点高；但位错难以滑移、裂纹一旦萌生便迅速扩展，所以缺乏塑性而易脆断。Callister 的《材料科学与工程》用键合与缺陷解释了这一点。�
Ceramics are ionic or covalent networks with strong, directional bonds, giving high hardness and melting point; but dislocations cannot easily slip and cracks propagate fast, so they lack ductility and fail brittlely. Callister explains this via bonding and defects.�ans��src��*Callister《材料科学与工程基础》�=Callister, Materials Science and Engineering: An Introduction��id�a2b27c9eedc4�body��`根据VSEPR（价层电子对互斥）理论，氧原子有6个价电子，与两个氢成键后还剩两对孤对电子。四对电子对按四面体方向互相排斥，两对孤对电子排斥力更强，把O-H键压缩到约104.5°，所以水分子呈弯曲状而不是直线形。孤对电子不参与成键，却决定了分子的整体形状。��By VSEPR (valence-shell electron-pair repulsion) theory, oxygen has six valence electrons and, after bonding to two hydrogens, keeps two lone pairs. The four electron pairs repel toward tetrahedral directions, and the two lone pairs repel more strongly, squeezing the O-H bonds to about 104.5°, so the molecule is bent rather than linear. Lone pairs do not bond but still fix the overall shape.�ans��src��-《普通化学》(Atkins) 分子结构章节�/General Chemistry (Atkins), molecular structure��id�a3f6a065d160�body��
氧原子在 H₂O 中有两对成键电子和两对孤对电子，根据价层电子对互斥理论（VSEPR），电子对彼此排斥使空间排布趋向四面体。孤对电子占据更多空间，把两个 O–H 键压向约104.5°，因此分子呈弯曲形。��In H₂O the oxygen has two bonding pairs and two lone pairs; VSEPR theory predicts electron pairs repel to a roughly tetrahedral arrangement. Lone pairs occupy more space and push the O–H bonds to about 104.5°, giving a bent shape.�ans��src��0《无机化学》（北京师范大学等编）�*Inorganic Chemistry (Beijing Normal Univ.)��id�a6355e724109�body��-SN1 先离解生成碳正离子，而更稳定的碳正离子（如从二级变三级）能量更低。当相邻碳上有氢或烷基可迁移时，它会"搬家"到缺电子的碳上，使中间体更稳定，于是产物骨架可能改变。这正是 SN1 与 SN2 产物有时不同的原因之一。�BSN1 first generates a carbocation, and a more stable one (e.g., secondary to tertiary) is lower in energy. When an adjacent hydrogen or alkyl group can migrate, it shifts to the electron-deficient carbon, stabilizing the intermediate and possibly changing the carbon skeleton—one reason SN1 products can differ from SN2.�ans��src��CClayden, Greeves & Warren《有机化学》（第2版），第39章�?Clayden, Greeves & Warren, "Organic Chemistry" (2nd ed.), Ch.39��id�a864519396e8�body��#哈伯—博施法在高温高压（约400–500℃、150–300 atm）及铁基催化剂下，使氮气与氢气直接化合生成氨（N2 + 3H2 ⇌ 2NH3）。该方法使大规模合成氮肥成为可能，极大提高了粮食产量，弗里茨·哈伯因此获1918年诺贝尔化学奖。�^The Haber-Bosch process combines nitrogen and hydrogen directly into ammonia (N2 + 3H2 ⇌ 2NH3) at high temperature and pressure (about 400–500 ℃, 150–300 atm) over an iron-based catalyst. It enabled the mass production of nitrogen fertilizers and dramatically raised food output; Fritz Haber received the 1918 Nobel Prize in Chemistry for it.�ans��src���K. Honkala、A. Hellman、I. N. Remediakis、J. K. Nørskov等《Ammonia synthesis from first-principles calculations》，Science，2005年，第307卷，555页；G. Ertl因表面催化研究获2007年诺贝尔化学奖�SK. Honkala et al., Science, 2005, 307, 555 ; G. Ertl, Nobel Prize in Chemistry 2007��id�aabeabc406b1�body���极性分子中电荷分布不均匀，一端偏正一端偏负，如水。非极性分子电荷分布均匀，如氧气和二氧化碳。分子的极性取决于键的极性和分子形状。��In a polar molecule, charge is unevenly distributed with a positive and a negative end, as in water. A nonpolar molecule has even charge distribution, like oxygen or carbon dioxide. Polarity depends on both bond polarity and molecular shape.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�ab1c180a80c0�body���用已知浓度的氢氧化钠标准溶液滴定一定量食醋，发生中和反应：CH3COOH+NaOH 生成 CH3COONa+H2O。当加入的氢氧化钠恰好与醋酸完全中和时到达化学计量点，用酚酞指示剂判断，终点时溶液由无色变浅红。根据 C酸乘V酸等于C碱乘V碱，就能算出醋酸的物质的量和浓度。食醋颜色深会干扰观察，通常先稀释再滴定。��A standard sodium hydroxide solution of known concentration is titrated into a measured portion of vinegar, neutralizing it: CH3COOH + NaOH → CH3COONa + H2O. When the added NaOH exactly consumes the acetic acid, the equivalence point is reached, detected with phenolphthalein as the solution turns from colourless to pale pink. The relation Cacid × Vacid = Cbase × Vbase then gives the amount and concentration of acetic acid. Dark vinegar is usually diluted first so the colour change is easy to see.�ans��src��$《普通化学》（酸碱滴定）�'General Chemistry (acid-base titration)��id�ab9d6255488f�body���在多步反应中，最慢的一步决定整个反应的速率，称为决速步（速率控制步）。它类似于瓶颈，总反应速率不超过该步速率。分析反应机理时常通过决速步推导实验速率方程。��In a multi-step reaction, the slowest step determines the overall rate and is called the rate-determining step. Like a bottleneck, the total rate cannot exceed that step's rate. Analyzing mechanisms often derives the experimental rate law from this step.�ans��src��iAtkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）反应机理与决速步章节�~Atkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (reaction mechanisms; rate-determining step)��id�ac64b03a76c1�body�٠pH = pKa + log([A⁻]/[HA]) 由弱酸及其共轭碱的浓度比直接估算缓冲溶液 pH。当 [A⁻] = [HA] 时 pH = pKa，是缓冲设计的核心关系。ٝpH = pKa + log([A⁻]/[HA]) estimates buffer pH from the conjugate base-to-acid ratio. When [A⁻] = [HA], pH = pKa—the central relation for buffer design.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�ae22201dc384�body��过渡金属拥有未充满的 d 轨道，能与反应物形成强弱适中的化学吸附键：足够强以活化分子，又不会强到让产物无法脱附而"中毒"。这种可调节的吸附强度使它们在加氢、氧化等反应中成为高效的活性中心。�DTransition metals possess partially filled d orbitals that form chemisorption bonds of intermediate strength with reactants—strong enough to activate molecules, weak enough to release products without poisoning. This tunable adsorption makes them efficient active sites for hydrogenation, oxidation, and related reactions.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�aed6ee06789d�body��
一个分子常有多个官能团，但某一步只想改造其中一个，保护基就临时"盖住"不想反应的基团，反应完再脱除。例如把醇变成硅醚保护，等别处反应结束后再水解脱保护，从而避免副反应、提高选择性。�XA molecule often has several functional groups, but a given step may need to modify just one; a protecting group temporarily "covers" the unreactive site and is removed afterward. For example, an alcohol is converted to a silyl ether for protection, then deprotected by hydrolysis once the other transformation is done, avoiding side reactions.�ans��src��dGreene & Wuts《有机合成中的保护基》（Protective Groups in Organic Synthesis，第4版）�AGreene & Wuts, "Protective Groups in Organic Synthesis" (4th ed.)��id�aef5354eaa01�body��H油脂被空气氧化或水解，产生刺鼻的醛、酮等小分子。�AFats oxidize or hydrolyze, forming pungent aldehydes and ketones.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�af0ad02bec16�body���电解质导电依靠溶液中自由移动的离子，而金属导电依靠电子，二者载流子不同。非电解质溶于水不离解成离子，因此不导电。区分二者可通过测定溶液是否能在电场下载流来判断。�.Electrolytes conduct via freely moving ions in solution, whereas metals conduct via electrons; the charge carriers differ. A non-electrolyte does not dissociate into ions in water and therefore does not conduct. The distinction is made by whether the solution can carry current under an electric field.�ans��src��~Atkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）电化学（电解质与非电解质导电）章节قAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (conduction by electrolytes vs non-electrolytes)��id�af34e67377ce�body���磷脂分子有一端亲水的头部和两条疏水的尾部，属于两亲分子。在水中它们自发排列成双层，亲水头朝外接触水、疏水尾朝内避水，构成细胞膜的基本骨架。这种自组装是生物膜形成的基础。� Phospholipids have a hydrophilic head and two hydrophobic tails, making them amphiphilic. In water they spontaneously arrange into a bilayer with heads outward toward water and tails inward, forming the basic framework of cell membranes. This self-assembly underlies biological membranes.�ans��src��王镜岩《生物化学》�Biochemistry (Wang Jingyan)��id�af55e0214a52�body���它用铂、钯、铑等贵金属涂层把尾气中的 CO 与未燃烃氧化为 CO₂ 和水，同时把氮氧化物还原为氮气，三类污染物同步转化。Twigg 的《催化剂手册》详述了其操作条件。��Its platinum, palladium and rhodium coating oxidizes CO and unburned hydrocarbons to CO₂ and water while reducing nitrogen oxides to N₂, treating all three pollutants at once. Twigg's 'Catalyst Handbook' details its operating conditions.�ans��src��JTwigg《催化剂手册》；美国环保署（EPA）机动车排放标准�;Twigg, Catalyst Handbook; US EPA vehicle emission standards��id�b0513544c959�body���标准还原电势 E° 以标准氢电极（0 V）为基准，越正表示该物质越易被还原（强氧化剂），越负表示其还原态越易被氧化（强还原剂）。两半反应的 E° 差决定电池能否自发。�/Standard reduction potentials E° use the standard hydrogen electrode (0 V) as reference; more positive means the species is more easily reduced (strong oxidant), more negative means its reduced form is easily oxidized (strong reductant). The E° difference of two half-reactions determines spontaneity.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�b072a5849271�body���竞争性抑制剂与底物结构相似，争夺同一活性位点，因而提高表观 Km 而 Vmax 不变。随着底物浓度增大，底物可在竞争中胜出，抑制作用被解除。典型的例子是丙二酸对琥珀酸脱氢酶的抑制。�2A competitive inhibitor resembles the substrate and competes for the same active site, raising the apparent Km while leaving Vmax unchanged. At high substrate concentration the substrate outcompetes the inhibitor, so inhibition is overcome. A classic example is malonate inhibiting succinate dehydrogenase.�ans��src��U《生物化学》(Lehninger, 第七版) 酶调节章；IUPAC（生物化学术语）�hLehninger Principles of Biochemistry, 7th ed., enzyme regulation chapter; IUPAC Biochemical Nomenclature��id�b27bddf02610�body���把配体按已知电荷（如 Cl⁻ = −1、CN⁻ = −1、中性 H₂O/NH₃ = 0）列出，根据配合物总电荷反推金属电荷。例如 [Fe(CN)₆]⁴⁻ 中 6×(−1)+x = −4，得 Fe 为 +2。��Assign known ligand charges (Cl⁻ = −1, CN⁻ = −1, neutral H₂O/NH₃ = 0) and solve for the metal from the complex's total charge. In [Fe(CN)₆]⁴⁻, 6×(−1)+x = −4 gives Fe as +2.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�b295be497da5�body�٣钙是骨骼和牙齿的主要成分，也参与神经和肌肉信号。饮食中奶类、豆制品不足或维生素D缺乏都会影响钙吸收，导致缺钙。��Calcium is the main component of bones and teeth and also takes part in nerve and muscle signals. Too little dairy or soy in the diet, or a lack of vitamin D, can impair calcium absorption and cause deficiency.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b30459940da9�body���标准状态指物质在 1 bar 压力下的最稳定形态（溶液为 1 mol/L 的理想状态），温度可另指定（常取 298.15 K）。标准焓、熵、自由能都相对于此参照态定义。��The standard state is a substance's most stable form at 1 bar pressure (1 mol/L ideal solution for solutes), with temperature specified separately (often 298.15 K). Standard enthalpy, entropy, and free energy are all defined relative to this reference.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�b3410527062e�body���含不饱和键的单体（如乙烯）在引发剂下打开双键，链式增长把成千上万个单元头尾相连成高分子，无副产物生成。施陶丁格在 1920 年提出高分子概念并因此获 1953 年诺奖。��Monomers with unsaturation (e.g., ethylene) open their double bonds under an initiator and chain-grow, linking thousands of units head-to-tail into a polymer with no byproduct. Staudinger proposed macromolecules in 1920 and won the 1953 Nobel Prize.�ans��src��5施陶丁格 1920 年论文；Odian《聚合原理》�6Staudinger (1920); Odian, Principles of Polymerization��id�b4ce4cd05356�body��#肥皂是脂肪酸盐，分子一端亲水（羧酸根），另一端是长链疏水烃基。在水中，疏水端插入油滴、亲水端留在水里，形成胶束把油污包在内部，使油污被水冲走。胶束外壳亲水、内核疏水，油污因此能稳定地悬浮在水中。�]Soap is a fatty-acid salt with a hydrophilic carboxylate head and a long hydrophobic hydrocarbon tail. In water, the tails embed in grease while the heads stay in the water, building micelles that encapsulate the oil so it can be rinsed away. Because the micelle has a hydrophilic shell and hydrophobic interior, the grease stays suspended in water.�ans��src��0《普通化学》(Atkins) 表面活性剂章节�CGeneral Chemistry (Atkins), surfactants; Royal Society of Chemistry��id�b5083fddc398�body�ٮ金属键是金属原子释放出的自由电子与金属阳离子之间形成的相互作用。这些自由电子像海洋一样流动，使得金属能够导电和导热。��A metallic bond is the interaction between the free electrons released by metal atoms and the metal cations. These free electrons flow like a sea, allowing metals to conduct electricity and heat.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b663c07adefd�body��荧光棒内两种液体混合后，过氧化物氧化荧光染料（如荧光素），把产物激发到高能态；它回落到基态时以光的形式释放能量，这叫化学发光。能量主要变成光而非热，所以荧光棒发光时几乎不升温。�3Inside a glow stick, mixing the two liquids lets a peroxide oxidize a fluorescent dye (e.g., fluorescein), exciting the product to a high-energy state; as it relaxes to the ground state it releases energy as light—chemiluminescence. Because the energy becomes light rather than heat, the stick stays cool.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b76b253a473a�body��平流层中的臭氧层（距地面约20到30公里）能强烈吸收太阳紫外线中的 UV-B，把它转变成热能，挡住对 DNA 有杀伤力的高能辐射，是地球的防晒伞。一旦臭氧被氯氟烃等物质消耗变薄，到达地面的紫外线增多，皮肤癌和白内障风险就会上升。而地面附近的臭氧却是光化学烟雾的成分，是强氧化剂，会刺激眼睛和呼吸道、损伤植物。同一种分子，在高层是保护伞，在近地面是污染物，关键看它所处的高度。�?The ozone layer in the stratosphere, roughly 20-30 km up, absorbs most UV-B radiation from the sun, converting it to heat and blocking the high-energy rays that damage DNA - the planet's sunscreen. When ozone is depleted by chlorofluorocarbons, more ultraviolet reaches the ground and the risks of skin cancer and cataracts rise. Near the ground, however, ozone is a component of photochemical smog: a powerful oxidant that irritates the eyes and airways and damages plants. The same molecule is a shield high above and a pollutant at the surface - altitude decides its role.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b7c9e4708cdd�body���热力学第二定律指出，孤立系统的总熵（混乱度的度量）不会减少，自发过程趋向于使总熵增加。冰融化和气体扩散都使分子排列更加无序、系统熵增大，因此在常温常压下能够自发进行。�SThe second law of thermodynamics states that the total entropy (a measure of disorder) of an isolated system never decreases, and spontaneous processes tend to increase total entropy. Both ice melting and gas diffusion increase molecular disorder and thus system entropy, so they proceed spontaneously at ordinary temperature and pressure.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�b8e6d17ed38b�body��m它们携带的官能团不同：乙醇带羟基（-OH），乙醛带醛基（-CHO），乙酸带羧基（-COOH），乙酸乙酯带酯基（-COOR）。有机分子的化学性质几乎全部由官能团决定，碳骨架只提供基本框架。所以含羟基的乙醇易被氧化成乙醛，含羧基的乙酸显酸性，而酯基则带来水果香气的特征。��They carry different functional groups: ethanol has a hydroxyl group (-OH), acetaldehyde an aldehyde group (-CHO), acetic acid a carboxyl group (-COOH), and ethyl acetate an ester group (-COOR). In organic chemistry the functional group decides almost all chemical behaviour, while the carbon skeleton is just the framework. That is why ethanol is readily oxidized to acetaldehyde, the -COOH group makes acetic acid acidic, and ester groups produce fruity aromas.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�b9d12466635e�body���格氏试剂（RMgX）提供强亲核的碳负离子等价物，可与醛、酮、酯加成构建新的碳-碳键，是制备醇类的关键工具。Grignard 于 1900 年发现并在 1912 年获诺贝尔奖。��A Grignard reagent (RMgX) supplies a strongly nucleophilic carbon equivalent that adds to aldehydes, ketones and esters to build new carbon-carbon bonds, a key route to alcohols. Grignard discovered it in 1900 and won the 1912 Nobel Prize.�ans��src��3Grignard 1900 年论文；Clayden《有机化学》�+Grignard (1900); Clayden, Organic Chemistry��id�bd4595742cd1�body��0核裂变是重核（如铀-235）分裂成两个中等质量核并释放能量，是现有核电站的基础。核聚变是轻核（如氢的同位素）结合成较重核并释放更多能量，是太阳和氢弹的能量来源，目前受控聚变仍在攻关。两者都依质量亏损转化为能。�`Nuclear fission splits a heavy nucleus (e.g., uranium-235) into medium ones, releasing energy and underpinning today's reactors. Fusion joins light nuclei (e.g., hydrogen isotopes) into heavier ones, releasing even more energy—the source of the Sun and hydrogen bombs; controlled fusion is still being developed. Both convert mass defect into energy.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�bdc0d2c81232�body��E加压缩小分子间距，让分子间引力把它们拉成液体。�TPressure shrinks distances so intermolecular attraction pulls molecules into liquid.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�bdd6fcf3599d�body���电解精炼以粗铜为阳极、纯铜为阴极，在硫酸铜溶液中通电，阳极铜溶解、纯铜在阴极沉积，杂质落入阳极泥。加入硫酸可提高溶液电导并提供酸性环境，抑制铜离子的水解。�)In electrolytic refining, impure copper is the anode and pure copper the cathode in a copper-sulfate bath; copper dissolves at the anode and deposits pure at the cathode while impurities fall as anode slime. Sulfuric acid raises conductivity and keeps the medium acidic to prevent Cu2+ hydrolysis.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�be545c6c5c6f�body�٨官能团是决定有机物化学性质的原子或原子团，如羟基、羧基、氨基等。含有相同官能团的化合物往往表现出相似的化学性质。��A functional group is an atom or group of atoms that determines the chemical properties of an organic compound, such as hydroxyl, carboxyl, and amino groups. Compounds with the same functional group often show similar chemistry.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�be7cd9b9d142�body��q这些动物用血蓝蛋白结合并运输氧气，其核心是铜离子，含氧的血蓝蛋白呈蓝色，所以它们的血液偏蓝；而人类血红蛋白以铁离子为核心，含氧时呈鲜红色。氧分子都是以配位键结合到金属离子上，只是金属不同，颜色和输送方式就不同，这是金属配位化学在生物中的典型例子。��These animals use hemocyanin, which binds and transports oxygen around a copper ion; the oxygenated copper protein is blue, so their blood looks bluish. Human hemoglobin, by contrast, uses iron and turns bright red when oxygenated. In both cases oxygen coordinates to a metal ion - only the metal differs, and with it the color and transport strategy. It is a classic example of metal coordination chemistry in biology.�ans��src��*《无机化学》生物无机化学章节�4Inorganic Chemistry (bioinorganic chemistry); Nature��id�bf63812793e3�body��,过渡态是反应坐标上能量最高的、无法分离的一瞬间构型，对应活化络合物；中间体是位于两个能垒之间的、能量相对较低的、可短暂存在甚至被检测到的物种。每步基元反应只有一个过渡态，而复杂反应可以经过多个中间体。��A transition state is the highest-energy, non-isolable configuration at a saddle point on the reaction coordinate (the activated complex), whereas an intermediate is a relatively low-energy species residing between two barriers that can exist transiently and sometimes be detected. Each elementary step has one transition state, but a complex reaction can pass through many intermediates.�ans��src��KAtkins & de Paula《物理化学》（第10版），第22章反应动力学�9Atkins & de Paula, "Physical Chemistry" (10th ed.), Ch.22��id�bf80f6ab577b�body���原子经济性 =（目标产物摩尔质量 ÷ 所有反应物摩尔质量之和）×100%，越高表示进入产物的原子比例越大、副产物越少。它与产率不同：高收率但低原子经济性仍产生大量废物。��Atom economy = (molar mass of desired product ÷ sum of reactant molar masses) ×100%; higher means more atoms end up in the product and less waste. Unlike yield, a high-yield but low-atom-economy reaction still generates much waste.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�bf82560bc47f�body���潜热是在温度不变的情况下，物质发生相变（如熔化、汽化）时吸收或放出的热量。例如冰在 0℃ 熔化成水要吸收熔化热，但温度不升高。潜热用于克服分子间作用力而非提高分子动能。�,Latent heat is the heat absorbed or released during a phase change such as melting or vaporization at constant temperature. Ice at 0°C absorbs the heat of fusion to become water without its temperature rising. Latent heat overcomes intermolecular forces rather than raising molecular kinetic energy.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�c0f1b8fababb�body��V醋里的酸和小苏打(碳酸氢钠)反应生成二氧化碳气体，所以冒泡。�WAcid in vinegar reacts with bicarbonate to release carbon dioxide gas, causing bubbles.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c27da6024645�body��#依数性是指只取决于溶质粒子数目、而与溶质种类无关的性质，包括沸点升高、凝固点降低、渗透压和蒸气压下降。例如在冰雪上撒盐，盐粒降低了水的凝固点，使冰在 0℃ 以下融化。海水凝固点低于纯水也是同一原理。�KColligative properties depend only on the number of solute particles, not their identity; they include boiling-point elevation, freezing-point depression, osmotic pressure, and vapor-pressure lowering. Spreading salt on ice lowers water's freezing point so it melts below 0°C. Seawater also freezes below 0°C for the same reason.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�c3156bd7fe18�body�٪k = A·e^(−Ea/RT) 把速率常数 k 与温度 T 联系，Ea 为活化能，A 为指前因子。温度升高或 Ea 降低都会使 k 指数增大，从而加快反应。��k = A·e^(−Ea/RT) links the rate constant k to temperature T, with Ea the activation energy and A the pre-exponential factor. Higher T or lower Ea exponentially increases k, speeding the reaction.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�c3774af0d010�body��!配位数指一个离子（或原子）周围最近邻、等距的异号离子（或原子）的数目。NaCl 中每个 Na⁺ 被 6 个 Cl⁻ 包围（6:6），对应面心立方堆积；CsCl 的离子半径比更大，每个 Cs⁺ 可容纳 8 个 Cl⁻（8:8），呈简单立方结构。�&Coordination number is the count of nearest equidistant oppositely charged ions (or atoms) around a given ion. In NaCl each Na⁺ is surrounded by six Cl⁻ (6:6) in a face-centered cubic arrangement; CsCl's larger radius ratio lets each Cs⁺ fit eight Cl⁻ (8:8) in a simple cubic structure.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�c4eb35cf406e�body��~每次洗涤化纤衣物会脱落大量极细纤维，随污水排入河流海洋，被鱼虾吃下并在食物链里累积。نEach wash sheds tiny synthetic fibers from clothes into wastewater, reaching oceans where they enter and accumulate up the food chain.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c4eb5b38a86e�body��~他用密闭容器精确称量反应前后的总质量，发现没有物质凭空出现或消失，由此提出质量守恒。لUsing sealed vessels, he weighed reactants and products precisely and found total mass unchanged, establishing conservation of mass.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c5ec0d697263�body��<苹果细胞被切伤后，多酚氧化酶与细胞内的酚类物质接触，在氧气参与下把酚氧化成醌，醌再聚合成褐色色素，这就是酶促褐变。用含维生素C的柠檬汁涂抹或浸入淡盐水可以抑制反应，因为酸性环境和还原性物质能降低酶活性、阻止氧化。�cWhen apple cells are damaged, polyphenol oxidase meets phenolic compounds and, with oxygen, oxidizes them to quinones, which polymerize into brown pigments - enzymatic browning. Coating cut surfaces with lemon juice (rich in vitamin C) or dipping them in salt water slows it, because acidity and reducing agents suppress the enzyme or block the oxidation.�ans��src�٫Tilley 等,《Enzymatic browning: The role of substrates in polyphenol oxidase mediated browning》,Current Research in Food Science,2023 (DOI: 10.1016/j.crfs.2023.100623)٬Tilley et al., 'Enzymatic browning: The role of substrates in polyphenol oxidase mediated browning', Current Research in Food Science, 2023, DOI: 10.1016/j.crfs.2023.100623��id�c6583955ef21�body��+红外光被分子吸收后会激发特定化学键的振动（伸缩、弯曲），不同键的力常数与折合质量决定其特征吸收频率。含氧、氮、氢等官能团在 4000–400 cm⁻¹ 范围内有可指认的特征吸收带，因此红外光谱是官能团鉴定的快速手段。�:Infrared light excites specific bond vibrations (stretching, bending), and each bond's force constant and reduced mass set its characteristic absorption frequency. Functional groups containing O, N, or H show identifiable bands across 4000–400 cm⁻¹, making IR a rapid tool for functional-group identification.�ans��src��J《有机波谱学》(宁永成) 红外章；IUPAC（分子光谱术语）�qIUPAC (Nomenclature of IR and Raman spectroscopy); Silverstein, Spectrometric Identification of Organic Compounds��id�c7532b9823eb�body�ٙ原子里的电子只能待在固定能级，受热跃迁回低能级时放出特定波长的光，于是每种元素都有独特的“指纹”光谱。ٛElectrons occupy fixed energy levels; when they fall back they emit light of specific wavelengths, giving each element a unique spectral ‘fingerprint’.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c785baf8b2fb�body���指示剂的变色范围（约 pKa ±1）应落在滴定突跃区间内。强酸强碱滴定突跃宽，多数指示剂可用；弱酸弱碱滴定突跃窄，需选变色范围匹配且靠近等当点 pH 的指示剂。�␀An indicator's color-change range (about pKa ±1) should fall within the titration's steep jump. Strong acid-base titrations have a wide jump so most indicators work; weak acid/base titrations need a narrow-jump indicator matching the equivalence-point pH.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�c94c9ca0877e�body��v由 SO₂、NOₓ、VOCs 在大气中经气相与颗粒相反应生成硫酸盐、硝酸盐和二次有机气溶胶。مThey form from SO₂, NOₓ and VOCs through gas- and particle-phase reactions into sulfates, nitrates and secondary organic aerosol.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c99fcd1f183e�body��碰撞理论认为，反应发生的前提是分子相互碰撞，但只有能量足够高且取向合适的有效碰撞才能引发反应。升高温度增加了高能分子比例，因此加快反应。该理论说明了浓度、温度和催化剂的作用。�ECollision theory holds that reactions require molecules to collide, but only effective collisions with enough energy and proper orientation lead to reaction. Raising temperature increases the fraction of high-energy molecules, speeding the reaction. The theory explains the roles of concentration, temperature, and catalysts.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�ca3f3b541ab7�body���Z_eff = Z − S，即核电荷减去内层电子屏蔽。同周期 Z_eff 增大使原子半径缩小、电离能升高；同族虽 Z 增大但屏蔽也增，Z_eff 变化小，半径主要受电子层数控制。��Z_eff = Z − S, the nuclear charge minus shielding by inner electrons. Across a period Z_eff rises, shrinking radius and raising ionization energy; down a group Z grows but shielding grows too, so Z_eff changes little and shell count dominates radius.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�cb07322eddcc�body��_手性分子与其镜像不能重合，如同左手与右手，通常因含一个连有四个不同基团的碳原子（手性中心）而产生。一对对映异构体除使偏振光旋转方向相反（一个左旋、一个右旋）外，熔点、沸点等物理性质完全相同，仅在手性环境（如偏振光、手性酶）中表现不同。��A chiral molecule is non-superimposable on its mirror image, like left and right hands, usually arising from a carbon attached to four different groups (a stereocenter). A pair of enantiomers differ only in the direction they rotate plane-polarized light (one levorotatory, one dextrorotatory); their melting points, boiling points, and other physical properties are identical except in chiral environments such as polarized light or chiral enzymes.�ans��src��Q邢其毅、裴坚《基础有机化学》（第四版），北京大学出版社�\Xing Qiyi & Pei Jian, 'Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry' (4th ed.), Peking University Press��id�cba00712f161�body���碳原子基态有 2s²2p²，杂化后形成四个能量相近的 sp³ 轨道，每个容纳一个未成对电子，故可形成四个共价键以满足八隅体。Pauling 在 1939 年《化学键的本质》中系统解释了杂化与键的方向性。�%A carbon atom has 2s²2p² valence electrons; after hybridization it forms four similar sp³ orbitals, each holding one unpaired electron, so it makes four covalent bonds to complete an octet. Pauling explained hybridization and bond directionality in 'The Nature of the Chemical Bond' (1939).�ans��src��?Clayden《有机化学》；Pauling《化学键的本质》1939�KClayden, Organic Chemistry; Pauling, The Nature of the Chemical Bond (1939)��id�cbe883c64374�body��]催化剂降低反应所需的活化能，让更多分子能跨越能垒，但不被消耗。�TA catalyst lowers activation energy so more molecules react, without being consumed.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�cbfc6b0727b1�body���乳化剂是两性分子，亲水头伸入水相、亲油尾伸入油相，降低油水界面张力并在液滴表面形成膜，阻止其聚并，从而稳定乳液（如蛋黄中的卵磷脂稳定蛋黄酱）。��Emulsifiers are amphiphilic: hydrophilic heads face water and lipophilic tails face oil, lowering interfacial tension and forming a film around droplets that prevents coalescence, stabilizing emulsions (e.g., lecithin in egg yolk stabilizes mayonnaise).�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�cd78e2ea6e3a�body��X液态水中分子热运动较强，氢键不断断裂和重建，分子排列较紧密；结冰时每个水分子通过氢键与周围四个水分子结合，形成开放的四面体网络，使冰的密度（约0.92克/立方厘米）小于液态水。因此冰浮在水面，湖泊也从上往下结冰，水底的水生生物得以存活。�WIn liquid water, thermal motion keeps breaking and reforming hydrogen bonds, so molecules pack more closely. On freezing, each molecule hydrogen-bonds to four neighbors, building an open tetrahedral network that makes ice less dense (~0.92 g/cm3) than liquid water. Ice therefore floats, lakes freeze top-down, and aquatic life survives below.�ans��src��3《普通化学》(Atkins) 分子间作用力章节�1General Chemistry (Atkins), intermolecular forces��id�ce0ba146cb5d�body���总体向右增大，但 Be（2s² 全满）比 B（失去一个 2p 电子）更难电离，N（2p³ 半满）比 O（2p⁴ 有成对电子排斥）更难电离，导致局部下降。这些“反常”源于亚层稳定性与电子排斥。�It generally rises rightward, but Be (filled 2s²) is harder to ionize than B (loses a 2p electron), and N (half-filled 2p³) harder than O (2p⁴ with paired-electron repulsion), causing local dips. These 'anomalies' arise from subshell stability and electron repulsion.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�cf29d9e46036�body��>简单蒸馏是把液体加热气化再冷凝，适合分离沸点相差较大的液体或除去溶剂；分馏在蒸馏瓶上方加装分馏柱，蒸气与回流液在柱内反复冷凝和汽化，相当于连续多次蒸馏，能分离沸点接近的液体。石油加工、乙醇提纯使用的就是分馏技术。��Simple distillation vaporizes a liquid and condenses it again, suitable for separating liquids with very different boiling points or for removing a solvent. Fractional distillation adds a fractionating column where vapor and refluxing liquid repeatedly condense and re-vaporize, effectively many distillations in one, and can separate close-boiling liquids. Petroleum refining and ethanol purification use fractionation.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�cfd6a84ac494�body��先列配体（按字母序或先无机后有机、先阴离子后中性），用倍数词头（di-, tri-）标明个数，再写金属名并括号注明氧化态，如 [Co(NH₃)₆]Cl₃ 称三氯化六氨合钴(III)。内界与外界按离子化合物规则命名。�#List ligands alphabetically (or inorganic before organic, anionic before neutral) with prefixes (di-, tri-) for counts, then the metal name with oxidation state in parentheses—e.g., [Co(NH₃)₆]Cl₃ is hexaamminecobalt(III) chloride. Inner and outer spheres follow ionic-compound rules.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�cfdbd0d69e49�body��两者都发生在无氧条件下、以糖酵解产生的丙酮酸为底物。酒精发酵把丙酮酸脱羧成乙醛再还原为乙醇（并放出 CO₂）；乳酸发酵则直接把丙酮酸还原为乳酸，不产气。产物不同，决定了一种会冒泡、一种只变酸。�7Both occur anaerobically on pyruvate from glycolysis. Alcoholic fermentation decarboxylates pyruvate to acetaldehyde and reduces it to ethanol (releasing CO₂); lactic-acid fermentation reduces pyruvate straight to lactate with no gas. The different products explain why one bubbles and the other merely sours.�ans��src��KLehninger《生物化学原理》（第7版），第16章糖酵解与发酵�8Lehninger, "Principles of Biochemistry" (7th ed.), Ch.16��id�cfe875a0c1ac�body�ٜ电子分层排布在称为电子层的壳层中，离核越远能量越高。每层最多容纳的电子数遵循2n平方的规律，其中n是层序数。��Electrons are arranged in shells called energy levels, with higher levels farther from the nucleus having more energy. The maximum number of electrons in each shell follows the rule 2n^2, where n is the shell number.�ans��src��!玻尔模型与电子排布规则�+Bohr model and electron configuration rules��id�chem_19_001�body��\酸性液中质子充足,Volmer 步骤直接由 H+ 在活性位上的吸附放电主导;碱性液中水是唯一质子源,必须先断裂 O–H 键,水的解离往往成为额外的能垒。因此同一催化剂在两种介质中的 Tafel 斜率和火山图位置都会移动。这也是 NiMo 等合金在碱性中优于 Pt 的一个解释角度。��In acid, protons are abundant and the Volmer discharge of H+ onto active sites usually controls the rate. In alkali, water is the only proton source, so O–H bond cleavage adds a distinct kinetic barrier that often becomes rate-determining. Consequently the same catalyst shows different Tafel slopes and volcano positions in the two media, which partly explains why NiMo-type alloys can even outperform Pt in alkaline conditions.�ans��src�ٔNørskov 等 1998 年 J. Electrochem. Soc. 论文《Origin of the overpotential for hydrogen evolution on a transition metal surface》(145卷28页)��J. K. Nørskov, A. Rossmeisl, A. Logadottir, R. Sumida, T. F. Jaramik, "Origin of the overpotential for hydrogen evolution on a transition metal surface", Journal of The Electrochemical Society, 1998, 145, 28-34��id�chem_19_004�body���当液体在三相线上移动时,表面化学不均匀性和微米/纳米级粗糙度会钉扎三相线,使润湿存在多个亚稳态。缓慢加液测得的前进角对应能量势垒较高的一侧,缓慢抽液测得的后退角对应另一侧,两者之差即滞后。滞后越大说明表面越"脏"或粗糙度梯度越大,因此它常被用作表面均匀性与洁净度的敏感判据。��As the three-phase contact line moves, chemical heterogeneity and micro/nanoscale roughness pin it, creating many metastable wetting states. Slowly adding liquid yields the advancing angle on the high-barrier side; slowly withdrawing gives the receding angle on the opposite side, and their gap is the hysteresis. Larger hysteresis signals greater contamination or roughness gradients, so it serves as a sensitive probe of surface uniformity and cleanliness.�ans��src��`de Gennes《Capillarity and Wetting Phenomena》第四章滞后与接触角去钉扎讨论, 2004�lP.-G. de Gennes et al., Capillarity and Wetting Phenomena, Springer, 2004, Ch. 4 on hysteresis and depinning��id�chem_19_007�body���十二烷基硫酸钠的疏水尾短且直,临界胶束浓度高、脱脂力强,同时破坏皮脂膜并干扰蛋白结构引起刺激。改用月桂醇聚醚硫酸酯钠(AES)在尾链与硫酸基之间插入数个环氧乙烷单元,头基变大、CMC 降低,胶束更温和,对皮肤的蛋白变性作用减弱。进一步复配两性表活如椰油酰胺丙基甜菜碱可形成混合胶束,降低单一阴离子表活的有效电荷密度,从而兼顾泡沫、清洁与温和性。��Sodium lauryl sulfate has a short straight hydrophobic tail, high CMC, and strong degreasing power, but it strips sebum films and denatures skin proteins, causing irritation. Inserting several ethylene oxide units to give sodium laureth sulfate enlarges the headgroup, lowers the CMC, softens micelles, and reduces protein interaction. Blending amphoteric surfactants like cocamidopropyl betaine forms mixed micelles that dilute effective anionic charge density, balancing foam, cleansing, and mildness.�ans��src��dM. J. Rosen《Surfactants and Interfacial Phenomena》(Wiley)关于环氧乙烷化与温和性章节�iM. J. Rosen, Surfactants and Interfacial Phenomena, Wiley, 4th ed., sections on ethoxylation and mildness��id�chem_19_010�body��全分解水要求四个空穴氧化水放氧、两个电子还原质子放氢在同一颗粒上同步进行,否则积累的电荷会通过复合或副反应耗散。仅负载 Pt 只加速放氢,空穴端缺乏有效抽取位点,表面会积聚过氧化物并发生逆向反应,氧气难以释放且效率骤降。采用 RhCrOx、CoOx 等双组分或选择性分别担载两种助催化剂,可以抑制逆反应并打通两个半反应,这正是 Domen 组 SrTiO3:Al 体系实现接近 100% 表观量子效率的关键设计。�iOverall splitting demands four holes oxidize water to O2 while two electrons reduce protons to H2 concurrently on the same particle; otherwise accumulated charge dissipates via recombination or side reactions. Depositing Pt alone accelerates HER but leaves no extraction site for holes, peroxide species accumulate, back reactions consume the gases, and efficiency collapses. Dual components such as RhCrOx or CoOx, or site-selective loading of two cocatalysts, suppress reverse reactions and complete both half-reactions — the key design behind Domen's SrTiO3:Al system reaching nearly 100% apparent quantum yield.�ans��src��`Kudo 与 Miseki 2009 年 Chem. Soc. Rev. 综述及 Takata/Domen 团队 Nature 2020 SrTiO3 工作٤A. Kudo & Y. Miseki, Chem. Soc. Rev., 2009; T. Takata et al. (Domen group), "Photocatalytic water splitting with a quantum efficiency of almost unity", Nature, 2020��id�chem_19_011�body��7增塑剂分子插入高分子链之间,既扩大了体系的自由体积,又屏蔽了链段间的偶极-偶极吸引,使链段在更低的温度下就能开始协同运动。Tg的降幅可按增塑剂体积分数用Kelley-Bueche方程估算。用量过头则因相分离而迁移渗出,制品会重新发脆。��Plasticizer molecules slip between the chains, enlarging the free volume while screening dipole-dipole attraction between segments, so cooperative segmental motion begins at a much lower temperature. The drop in Tg can be estimated from the plasticizer volume fraction with the Kelley-Bueche equation. Beyond an optimum dose the additive phase-separates and migrates out, leaving the product brittle again.�ans��src��LJ. Brandrup 等《Polymer Handbook》第4版第VI章,Wiley-Interscience,1999�SJ. Brandrup et al., Polymer Handbook, 4th ed., Chapter VI, Wiley-Interscience, 1999��id�chem_19_014�body��m赖氨酸侧链末端的ε-氨基亲核性突出,率先进攻还原糖的羰基生成Schiff碱,再经Amadori重排进入后续阶段,该残基由此丧失营养价值。同一反应链还派生出吡嗪类香气成分与大分子类黑精色素。把水分活度控制在0.6至0.7、适度调低炉温,可在风味生成与必需氨基酸保全之间取得折衷。�The epsilon-amino group capping the lysine side chain is unusually nucleophilic: it attacks carbonyls of reducing sugars first, giving Schiff bases that undergo Amadori rearrangement into later stages, and that residue thereby loses nutritional value. Along the way the same cascade releases pyrazine aroma compounds and macromolecular melanoidin pigments. Holding water activity at 0.6 to 0.7 and trimming oven temperature buys a compromise between flavor generation and preservation of the essential amino acid.�ans��src��yJ. E. Hodge《Chemistry of browning reactions in model systems》,Journal of Agricultural and Food Chemistry 1 (1953) 928�vJ. E. Hodge, Chemistry of browning reactions in model systems, Journal of Agricultural and Food Chemistry 1 (1953) 928��id�chem_19_017�body��析氧要走完四电子路径,依次经过*OH、*O、*OOH等含氧中间体,它们的吸附能受标度关系捆绑,*OOH与*OH的自由能之差被经验地钉在约3.2 eV,而热力学理想值仅为2×1.23≈2.46 eV。这约0.74 eV的盈余平摊到两个耦合步骤,折合每电子约0.37 V的理论最小过电位。该内在损耗叠加溶液欧姆降与气泡遮蔽,共同推高了工作电位。改用双活性位点或借助晶格氧参与机制去解耦标度关系,是当前降低能耗的核心策略。�bFour electrons must pass through *OH, *O and *OOH intermediates whose binding energies are chained by scaling relations: the *OOH-to-*OH free-energy gap is empirically pinned near 3.2 eV against a thermodynamic ideal of 2 x 1.23 = 2.46 eV. That ~0.74 eV surplus, shared over the two coupled steps, amounts to a theoretical minimum overpotential of about 0.37 V per electron. This intrinsic tax, added to ohmic losses and bubble shadowing, pushes the operating potential upward. Decoupling the scaling through dual active sites or lattice-oxygen participation now defines the main route to cheaper electrolysis.�ans��src�َI. C. Man 等,《Universality in Oxygen Evolution Electrocatalysis on Oxide Surfaces》,ChemCatChem 3: 1159,2011 (DOI: 10.1002/cctc.201000397)ُI. C. Man et al., 'Universality in Oxygen Evolution Electrocatalysis on Oxide Surfaces', ChemCatChem 3: 1159, 2011, DOI: 10.1002/cctc.201000397��id�chem_20_001�body��因为DMF分子中的C–N部分双键具有部分双键性质,阻碍了两个甲基的快速旋转交换。旋转受阻使两个甲基处于不同电子环境,化学位移不同,故各给一个单峰。升温会加速旋转,两峰逐渐合并为一个信号。�\The C–N bond of DMF has partial double-bond character due to amide resonance, which restricts rotation about that bond. The two methyl groups therefore sit in different electronic environments and resonate at distinct chemical shifts, each giving its own singlet. Heating speeds up the restricted rotation until the two signals coalesce into one.�ans��src��RSilverstein《有机化合物波谱解析》第8版第4章核磁共振波谱部分�fSilverstein et al., Spectrometric Identification of Organic Compounds, 8th ed., Chapter 4 (Proton NMR)��id�chem_20_004�body��r溶胶聚沉主要取决于与胶粒电荷符号相反的电解质离子,其价数越高聚沉能力越强,即Schulze–Hardy规则。SO4^2−是二价反离子,对正电Fe(OH)3胶粒的聚沉值远低于一价的Cl−,通常低一到两个数量级。因此相同摩尔浓度下硫酸钠的聚沉效果显著强于氯化钠,体现了反离子价态的决定性影响。��Coagulation of a sol is governed mainly by counterions of opposite sign to the particle charge, and their effectiveness rises sharply with valence — the Schulze–Hardy rule. Sulfate is divalent, so for positively charged Fe(OH)3 particles its critical coagulation concentration is one to two orders of magnitude lower than that of monovalent chloride. Hence equimolar Na2SO4 coagulates the sol much more readily than NaCl, demonstrating the decisive role of counterion valence.�ans��src��]沈钟、赵振国《胶体与表面化学》第三版第四章溶胶的电学性质与聚沉�|Shen Zhong & Zhao Zhenguo, Colloid and Surface Chemistry, 3rd ed., Chapter 4 (electrical properties and coagulation of sols)��id�chem_20_007�body���甲醇醇解在高温高压与催化剂作用下将PET打断为对苯二甲酸二甲酯(DMT)和乙二醇,产物经重结晶纯化后可直接重新缩聚制食品级PET。糖酵解则用乙二醇把PET降解为主要含对苯二甲酸双羟乙酯(BHET)及低聚物的混合物,提纯后同样回到聚合环节。糖酵解条件较温和、投资较低,适合中小规模处理有色瓶料,醇解产物更易精制,适合生产高纯度单体。�<Methanolysis breaks PET into dimethyl terephthalate (DMT) and ethylene glycol at elevated temperature and pressure with a catalyst; after recrystallization the DMT can be repolymerized into food-grade PET. Glycolysis uses ethylene glycol to degrade PET mainly to bis(2-hydroxyethyl) terephthalate (BHET) plus oligomers, which are purified and fed back into polycondensation. Glycolysis runs under milder conditions with lower capital cost and suits colored bottle scrap at smaller scale, while methanolysis yields more easily refined monomers for high-purity applications.�ans��src��mBarnard 等,《Chemolytic depolymerisation of PET: a review》,Green Chemistry,2021 (DOI: 10.1039/d1gc00887k)�nBarnard et al., 'Chemolytic depolymerisation of PET: a review', Green Chemistry, 2021, DOI: 10.1039/d1gc00887k��id�chem_20_010�body���主要驱动力包括疏水效应——水分子从非极性内腔释放回本体水相引起的熵增益,以及客体与腔壁范德华接触、可能的氢键与去溶剂化焓贡献。天然β-环糊精水溶性有限且有一定肾毒性,经羟丙基或磺丁基醚随机取代后溶解度大幅提高、结晶性下降,增溶能力随平均取代度先升后趋于平台。过高取代度反而可能因空间位阻削弱包合常数,故药用级衍生物需优化取代度范围。�~Key driving forces include the hydrophobic effect — entropy gained when cavity-bound water returns to bulk solvent — plus van der Waals contact with the cavity wall and sometimes hydrogen bonding and desolvation enthalpy. Native β-cyclodextrin has limited water solubility and some nephrotoxicity; random hydroxypropyl or sulfobutyl ether substitution raises solubility markedly and disrupts crystallinity, and solubilizing power climbs with average substitution before plateauing. Excessive substitution can sterically weaken binding constants, so pharmaceutical derivatives optimize rather than maximize the degree of substitution.�ans��src�ٳLoftsson 与 Brewster,《Pharmaceutical Applications of Cyclodextrins. 1. Drug Solubilization and Stabilization》,Journal of Pharmaceutical Sciences,1996 (DOI: 10.1021/js950534b)ٯLoftsson & Brewster, 'Pharmaceutical Applications of Cyclodextrins. 1. Drug Solubilization and Stabilization', Journal of Pharmaceutical Sciences, 1996, DOI: 10.1021/js950534b��id�chem_20_011�body��0充电时外接电源迫使正极发生氧化,锂离子从磷酸铁锂晶格中脱出,经电解液和隔膜迁移到负极;同时电子经外电路到达负极以维持电中性。在石墨表面,锂离子与电子结合并嵌入石墨层间,形成LiC6等嵌入化合物,电能以化学能形式储存。��The applied voltage drives oxidation at the cathode, de-intercalating lithium ions from the LiFePO4 lattice; they migrate through the electrolyte and separator toward the anode while electrons travel via the external circuit to keep the cell neutral. At the graphite surface, ions combine with electrons and intercalate between graphene layers forming compounds such as LiC6, storing energy chemically.�ans��src�٪J. B. Goodenough 与 K.-S. Park,《The Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery: A Perspective》,Journal of the American Chemical Society 135, 1167-1176,2013 (DOI: 10.1021/ja3091438)٦J. B. Goodenough & K.-S. Park, 'The Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery: A Perspective', Journal of the American Chemical Society 135, 1167-1176, 2013, DOI: 10.1021/ja3091438��id�chem_20_014�body���水蒸气透过包衣微孔渗入核心溶解尿素,形成的内压使养分通过扩散或膜破裂逐步释放,因此释放速率主要由包衣厚度、孔隙率和聚合物的亲水/疏水比决定。土壤温度显著影响膜渗透系数与尿素溶解度,通常符合 Arrhenius 型温度依赖;土壤湿度和微生物降解也会改变包衣完整性。合理设计可使氮素释放曲线与作物需肥规律同步,减少淋失。�:Water vapor permeates micropores of the coating, dissolves the urea core, and the resulting internal pressure releases nutrients gradually by diffusion or film rupture; hence release rate is governed mainly by coating thickness, porosity, and the hydrophilic/hydrophobic balance of the polymer. Soil temperature strongly affects membrane permeability and urea solubility, often following Arrhenius-type dependence, while moisture and microbial degradation alter coating integrity. Proper design synchronizes nitrogen release with crop demand and reduces leaching losses.�ans��src��WTrenkel, Controlled-Release and Stabilized Fertilizers in Agriculture, IFA, Paris, 1997هM. E. Trenkel, Controlled-Release and Stabilized Fertilizers in Agriculture, International Fertilizer Industry Association, Paris, 1997��id�chem_20_017�body���对二甲苯具有高度对称性,四个芳氢全部磁等价,在δ约7.05处表现为4H单峰;邻二甲苯构成AA'BB'体系,芳氢呈两组积分各2H的精细多重峰;间二甲苯对称性最低,H2、H4/6与H5给出三组信号,积分比约为1:2:1并带有间位远程偶合的小裂分。数清芳区信号组数再结合积分比即可完成指认,这也是分子对称性决定磁等价氢数目的直接例证。�.Highly symmetric p-xylene makes all four aromatic protons magnetically equivalent, giving a 4H singlet near delta 7.05. o-Xylene forms an AA'BB' system whose aromatic protons appear as two fine multiplets integrating to 2H each, while m-xylene has the lowest symmetry: H2, H4/6 and H5 give three signals with roughly a 1:2:1 integral ratio plus small meta long-range couplings. Counting the aromatic signals together with their integrations assigns each isomer, a direct illustration of how molecular symmetry fixes the number of magnetic-equivalent protons.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�chem_21_001�body���纳米金颗粒尺寸远小于可见光波长时,入射光的电磁场驱动导带电子集体振荡,产生表面等离激元共振,在约520 nm处强烈吸收绿光。透射光因此缺失绿色成分而呈红色。相比之下,块体金的颜色来自5d带向6sp导带的带间跃迁,它选择性吸收蓝绿光使反射光偏金黄,并无尖锐的等离激元峰。颗粒尺寸、形貌和介质折射率都会改变共振峰位置,所以不同粒径的溶胶可从红变紫再到蓝。��When gold nanoparticles are much smaller than the wavelength of visible light, the incident electromagnetic field drives collective oscillation of conduction electrons, producing a localized surface plasmon resonance that strongly absorbs green light around 520 nm. The transmitted light is therefore depleted in green and appears ruby-red. By contrast, the color of bulk gold arises from interband 5d-to-6sp transitions that preferentially absorb blue-green light and tint the reflection golden-yellow, with no sharp plasmon peak. Because particle size, shape, and the refractive index of the medium all shift the resonance peak, sols of different diameters range from red through purple to blue.�ans��src�ٳLink 与 El-Sayed,《Size and Temperature Dependence of the Plasmon Absorption of Colloidal Gold Nanoparticles》,The Journal of Physical Chemistry B,1999 (DOI: 10.1021/jp984796o)ٯLink & El-Sayed, 'Size and Temperature Dependence of the Plasmon Absorption of Colloidal Gold Nanoparticles', The Journal of Physical Chemistry B, 1999, DOI: 10.1021/jp984796o��id�chem_21_004�body���反相色谱固定相为疏水烷基链,溶质的保留主要靠疏水分配,流动相有机相比例升高会增强溶质在流动相中的溶解度,洗脱强度增大,保留时间按指数规律缩短。甲醇比例变化对不同官能团溶质的保留影响幅度不一,因此相邻色谱峰的相对距离即选择性因子也会改变,有时甚至出现峰序翻转。实际分离常通过梯度洗脱或二元/三元溶剂体系同时优化保留与选择性。�;Reversed-phase stationary phases are hydrophobic alkyl chains and retention arises mainly from hydrophobic partitioning; raising the organic fraction increases solute solubility in the mobile phase, raises elution strength, and shortens retention times exponentially. The magnitude of this effect differs among functional groups, so the relative spacing of neighboring peaks - the selectivity factor - also changes, occasionally reversing elution order. Practical separations tune both retention and selectivity through gradient elution or binary/ternary solvent systems.�ans��src��{Snyder L R, Kirkland J J, Dolan J W. Introduction to Modern Liquid Chromatography. 3rd ed. Hoboken: Wiley, 2010: chapter 6.�dSnyder, Kirkland & Dolan, Introduction to Modern Liquid Chromatography, 3rd ed., Wiley, 2010, ch. 6.��id�chem_21_007�body���供电子或吸电子取代基改变共轭体系的电荷分布,从而移动 π→π* 跃迁和分子内电荷迁移跃迁的能量。吸电子基与供电子基协同构成推拉电子结构时,跃迁能隙缩小,最大吸收波长红移,颜色加深;相互作用较弱的取代基影响有限,通常只带来小幅谱带位移或色调微调。工业上正是按这一规律,以不同取代模式设计出黄、橙、红、蓝等系列偶氮染料。�Donating or withdrawing substituents redistribute charge across the conjugated framework, shifting the energies of pi-pi* and intramolecular charge-transfer transitions. When an acceptor and a donor act together as a push-pull system, the transition gap narrows, the absorption maximum red-shifts, and the shade deepens; weakly interacting groups exert only modest effects, giving small band shifts or subtle hue adjustments. Dyestuff chemists apply this rule systematically to design azo series spanning yellow, orange, red, and blue shades.�ans��src��bZollinger H., Color Chemistry, 3rd ed., Wiley-VCH, 2003, 第 2 章(染料结构与颜色的关系)�fZollinger H., Color Chemistry, 3rd ed., Wiley-VCH, 2003, Ch. 2 (structure-color relationships in dyes)��id�chem_21_010�body���循环从一个 PPh3 解离开始,生成 14 电子、配位不饱和的 RhCl(PPh3)2 活性物种,随后依次发生 H2 氧化加成、烯烃配位、迁移插入和还原消除。PPh3 过多时解离平衡左移,活性物种浓度低,加氢速率下降;PPh3 过少时低配位铑碎片倾向二聚甚至析出铑黑而失活。配体解离平衡因此同时决定催化活性与催化剂寿命。�-Each cycle starts with dissociation of one PPh3, generating a coordinatively unsaturated 14-electron species RhCl(PPh3)2 that proceeds through oxidative addition of H2, olefin coordination, migratory insertion, and reductive elimination. With excess phosphine the dissociation equilibrium shifts left, the active-species population drops, and hydrogenation slows. With too little phosphine, underligated rhodium fragments dimerize or precipitate as inactive rhodium black; this ligand dissociation balance governs both activity and lifetime of the catalyst.�ans��src��#Osborn、Jardine、Young 与 Wilkinson,《The preparation and properties of tris(triphenylphosphine)halogenorhodium(I) and some reactions thereof including catalytic homogeneous hydrogenation of olefins and acetylenes and their derivatives》,J. Chem. Soc. A,1966 (DOI: 10.1039/j19660001711)�Osborn, Jardine, Young & Wilkinson, 'The preparation and properties of tris(triphenylphosphine)halogenorhodium(I) and some reactions thereof including catalytic homogeneous hydrogenation of olefins and acetylenes and their derivatives', J. Chem. Soc. A, 1966, DOI: 10.1039/j19660001711��id�chem_21_011�body��v阴离子聚合的活性链端是碳负离子,在严格除水除氧的体系中既不双基终止也难发生链转移,所有链几乎同步引发、同步增长。分子量分布因此接近泊松分布,重均与数均之比可低至1.05左右。自由基聚合中引发剂缓慢分解、链转移和随机双基终止叠加在一起,分散度通常落在1.5到2.0以上。��In anionic polymerization the growing ends are carbanions that neither terminate bimolecularly nor readily transfer in rigorously dried, oxygen-free systems, so essentially every chain starts and grows in step. The distribution therefore approaches a Poisson limit, with weight-average over number-average ratios as low as about 1.05. Slow initiator decomposition, chain transfer, and random radical termination combine to keep radical dispersities above roughly 1.5 to 2.0.�ans��src��GSzwarc,《‘Living’ Polymers》,Nature,1956 (DOI: 10.1038/1781168a0)�ESzwarc, '‘Living’ Polymers', Nature, 1956, DOI: 10.1038/1781168a0��id�chem_21_014�body���碱度是水中接受质子的总容量,天然淡水以碳酸氢根为主,再计入碳酸根、氢氧根以及少量硼酸盐和有机酸盐。pH只给出当前的氢离子活度,碱度则代表缓冲储备,决定外来酸进入时pH下坠的幅度。灰岩流域湖水的碱度可达每升一百毫克碳酸钙当量,而花岗岩流域水体碱度趋近于零,对酸沉降敏感得多。�Alkalinity is the total proton-accepting capacity of a water; in natural freshwaters bicarbonate dominates, joined by carbonate, hydroxide, minor borate, and organic anions. pH reports only the instantaneous hydrogen-ion activity, whereas alkalinity measures the buffer reserve that sets how far pH will plunge when acid arrives. Lakes on limestone bedrock can carry alkalinities near one hundred milligrams per liter as calcium carbonate, while waters on granite approach zero alkalinity and prove far more sensitive to acid deposition.�ans��src�مKramer J, Tessier A. Acidification of aquatic systems: a critique of chemical approaches. Environ. Sci. Technol., 1982, 16: 606A-615AّKramer J, Tessier A. Acidification of aquatic systems: a critique of chemical approaches. Environmental Science & Technology, 1982, 16: 606A-615A��id�chem_21_017�body���注入瞬间单体过饱和度骤升，触发 LaMer 模型中的爆发式成核；随后降温使残余单体只能在已有核上缓慢外延生长，把成核与生长两个阶段分开。若持续高温会不断二次成核，粒径分布变宽，激子吸收与荧光峰随之展宽。快速淬冷配合油酸等配体还能钝化表面悬挂键，保住量子点尺寸依赖的可调发光。��Injection spikes monomer supersaturation and triggers the burst nucleation described by the LaMer model; cooling then lets residual monomers grow slowly onto existing nuclei only, separating nucleation from growth. Sustained heat would cause repeated secondary nucleation, broadening the size distribution and smearing the excitonic absorption and emission peaks. Rapid quenching plus passivating ligands such as oleic acid also caps surface dangling bonds, preserving the size-tunable photoluminescence.�ans��src���Murray, Norris, Bawendi,《Synthesis and characterization of nearly monodisperse CdE (E = sulfur, selenium, tellurium) semiconductor nanocrystallites》,Journal of the American Chemical Society,1993 (DOI: 10.1021/ja00072a025)��Murray, Norris, Bawendi, 'Synthesis and characterization of nearly monodisperse CdE (E = sulfur, selenium, tellurium) semiconductor nanocrystallites', Journal of the American Chemical Society, 1993, DOI: 10.1021/ja00072a025��id�chem_22_001�body���螯合效应指多齿配体形成的环状配合物比同类单齿配体配合物更稳定。EDTA以两个氮和四个氧共六个配位原子同时结合金属，一个分子可置换出六到八个配位水，使溶液中自由粒子数明显增加，熵增大成为稳定性的主要来源；五个五元螯环也降低了成环的能量代价。故Ca-EDTA的logK约达10.7，广泛用于水质软化和配位滴定。�gThe chelate effect is the observation that complexes formed by polydentate ligands are markedly more stable than analogous complexes of comparable monodentate ligands. EDTA binds metals through six donor atoms, two nitrogens and four carboxylate oxygens, so one molecule displaces six to eight coordinated water molecules; the number of freely moving particles rises sharply, making the large positive entropy the dominant source of stability, aided by five strain-free five-membered rings. Consequently the calcium-EDTA complex has logK near 10.7 and is widely used in water softening and complexometric titration.�ans��src��aShriver & Atkins《无机化学》，Weller 等编著，第6版，牛津大学出版社，2014年�_Shriver & Atkins' Inorganic Chemistry, M. Weller et al., 6th ed., Oxford University Press, 2014��id�chem_22_004�body���Al2O3是结构助剂，分散在铁微晶之间，阻止高温高压运行中铁粒子的烧结长大，从而维持催化剂的大比表面积和多孔结构。K2O是电子助剂，向邻近的铁部位供给电子，增强铁对吸附态氮分子的反馈电子能力，削弱N≡N三重键，降低速控步骤即氮的解离吸附的活化能。两类助剂协同作用，使合成氨在450℃左右具备工业可行的速率。�=Alumina serves as the structural promoter: dispersed among iron crystallites, it impedes sintering and grain growth during operation at high temperature and pressure, maintaining the catalyst's large specific surface area and porous texture. Potassium oxide is the electronic promoter, donating electron density to neighboring iron sites so that back-donation into adsorbed dinitrogen strengthens, the NN triple bond weakens, and the activation energy of the rate-limiting dissociative adsorption falls. Acting together, they make synthesis viable near 450 degrees Celsius.�ans��src��l《现代催化与动力学概念》，Chorkendorff 与 Niemantsverdriet 著，第2版，Wiley-VCH，2007年�mConcepts of Modern Catalysis and Kinetics, I. Chorkendorff & J. W. Niemantsverdriet, 2nd ed., Wiley-VCH, 2007��id�chem_22_007�body���原子经济性等于目标产物的摩尔质量除以全部反应物摩尔质量之和再乘100%，由Trost于1991年提出，衡量反应物原子最终进入目标产物的比例。产率只反映转化是否充分，不体现副产物造成的浪费；原子经济性则在分子设计阶段就评估原料利用效率。E因子统计每千克产品伴随产生的废弃物总量（含溶剂），反映工艺层面的实际排放，两者互补。�WAtom economy is the molar mass of the desired product divided by the sum of the molar masses of all reactants, expressed as a percentage; proposed by Trost in 1991, it measures what fraction of the reactant mass ends up in the target molecule. Yield only reflects how far conversion proceeds, ignoring waste locked up in by-products, whereas atom economy assesses raw-material efficiency already at the molecular-design stage. The E-factor instead tallies the mass of waste produced per unit mass of product, solvents included, capturing process-level emissions. The two views complement each other.�ans��src�هB. M. Trost，《原子经济性——寻求合成效率》，Science（《科学》）周刊，1991年，第254卷，1471–1473页。�lB. M. Trost, "The atom economy - a search for synthetic efficiency", Science, vol. 254, pp. 1471-1473, 1991.��id�chem_22_010�body���亲核试剂须沿C-X键轴从离去基团背面进攻，使其填满电子的轨道与σ*(C-X)反键轨道有效重叠，正面进攻既受排斥又无重叠。反应经五配位三角双锥过渡态：C-Nu部分成键、C-X部分断裂，中心碳上三个基团如雨伞翻折般摆动，产物因而构型翻转。背面路径对位阻敏感，叔碳被三个烷基包围，活化能过高，故叔卤代烃几乎不发生SN2。��The nucleophile must attack along the axis of the C-X bond from the face opposite the leaving group, so that its filled orbital overlaps the σ*(C-X) antibonding orbital effectively; front-side approach meets repulsion and yields no useful overlap. The reaction runs through a five-coordinate, trigonal-bipyramidal transition state in which the C-Nu bond is partly formed while C-X is breaking, and the three substituents swing over like an inverting umbrella, so the product emerges with inverted configuration. Because backside access is sterically sensitive, a tertiary center surrounded by three alkyl groups raises the barrier so high that SN2 essentially cannot occur.�ans��src��gE. V. Anslyn、D. A. Dougherty，《现代物理有机化学》，University Science Books，2006年。�uE. V. Anslyn and D. A. Dougherty, "Modern Physical Organic Chemistry", University Science Books, Sausalito, CA, 2006.��id�chem_22_014�body���衍射要求入射波长与散射体间距相当。晶体中原子间距约为0.1 nm，正落在X射线波长范围内，相邻晶面的散射波相干叠加，才能产生符合布拉格方程 nλ = 2d·sinθ 的衍射峰。可见光波长约500 nm，比原子间距大数千倍，遇晶体只发生反射与折射，无法感知内部周期排列，故测定晶体结构须用X射线或电子、中子束。�/Diffraction requires a wavelength comparable to the spacing between scatterers. Atoms in a crystal lie roughly 0.1 nm apart, exactly the X-ray range, so waves scattered from neighboring atoms or planes interfere coherently to give peaks obeying Bragg's law, nλ = 2d sinθ. Visible light, at about 500 nm, is thousands of times longer than the atomic spacing; it is merely reflected and refracted by a crystal and senses none of the internal periodicity. Structure determination therefore relies on X-rays, or on shorter-wavelength electron and neutron beams.�ans��src��fC. Giacovazzo 主编《Fundamentals of Crystallography》第3版, Oxford University Press (IUCr), 2011�|C. Giacovazzo (ed.), Fundamentals of Crystallography, 3rd ed., Oxford University Press (IUCr Texts on Crystallography), 2011��id�chem_23_001�body���碳氟键是有机分子中最强的单键之一（CH₃–F约480 kJ/mol），氟原子半径小、极化率低，使细胞色素P450难以在该位置发生氧化攻击。在容易被羟基化的位点引入氟可封堵这条代谢途径，减慢药物失活、延长半衰期并减少给药次数；氟的强吸电子性还能微调相邻基团的酸碱性，因而定点氟化已成为先导物优化的常规手段。�+The C–F bond is one of the strongest single bonds in organic molecules (about 480 kJ/mol in CH₃–F), and fluorine's small radius and low polarizability make it hard for cytochrome P450 enzymes to attack oxidatively. Fluorine placed at a site prone to hydroxylation blocks that degradation route, slowing loss of activity, extending half-life, and cutting dosing frequency. Since fluorine is also strongly electron-withdrawing, it fine-tunes the acidity and basicity of neighboring groups, so targeted fluorination is now routine in lead optimization.�ans��src�٤S. Purser、P. R. Moore、S. Swallow、V. Gouverneur《Fluorine in Medicinal Chemistry》，Chem. Soc. Rev.，2008年，第37卷，320页（DOI: 10.1039/b610213c）ٍS. Purser, P. R. Moore, S. Swallow & V. Gouverneur, "Fluorine in Medicinal Chemistry", Chem. Soc. Rev., 2008, 37, 320 (DOI: 10.1039/b610213c)��id�chem_23_007�body���蓝光来自化学发光：预混火焰反应区内，激发态自由基CH*、C₂*跃回基态时发出位于蓝绿区的特征谱带。黄光来自炽热烟黑：富燃料缺氧区中，烃经乙炔与多环芳烃途径聚成纳米级烟黑颗粒，被加热到约2000 K后发射近似黑体的连续谱。前者是分子尺度的电子跃迁，后者是凝相颗粒的热辐射，故黄色火焰通常意味着不完全燃烧并伴随烟黑生成。�rBlue light is chemiluminescence: in the reaction zone of a premixed flame, electronically excited radicals such as CH* and C2* emit characteristic band radiation in the blue-green region as they fall back to the ground state. Yellow light comes from glowing soot: in oxygen-starved, fuel-rich pockets, hydrocarbons grow through acetylene and polycyclic-aromatic pathways into nanometre soot particles that radiate a near-blackbody continuum at about 2000 K. Molecular-scale electronic transitions versus thermal radiation from condensed particles is why a yellow flame usually signals soot formation and incomplete combustion.�ans��src�٨J. Warnatz, U. Maas, R. W. Dibble, Combustion: Physical and Chemical Fundamentals, Modeling and Simulation, Experiments, Pollutant Formation, 第4版, Springer, 2006。٦J. Warnatz, U. Maas, R. W. Dibble, Combustion: Physical and Chemical Fundamentals, Modeling and Simulation, Experiments, Pollutant Formation, 4th ed., Springer, 2006.��id�chem_23_010�body���气化炉中焦炭经历三个关键反应：部分氧化C + ½O₂ → CO强放热；水煤气反应C + H₂O ⇌ CO + H₂吸热约131 kJ/mol；Boudouard反应C + CO₂ ⇌ 2CO同样吸热。只通蒸汽则炉温持续下降，工业上因此交替吹入空气（或氧气）与蒸汽，以氧化热平衡气化的吸热负荷。所得CO与H₂即合成气，可供费托合成、制甲醇及合成氨使用。�Three key reactions consume the char: partial oxidation C + ½O2 → CO is strongly exothermic, the water-gas reaction C + H2O ⇌ CO + H2 absorbs about 131 kJ/mol, and the Boudouard reaction C + CO2 ⇌ 2CO is also endothermic. Steam alone would let the furnace cool steadily, so industrial units blow air or oxygen alternately with steam, balancing the endothermic gasification load against oxidation heat. The resulting CO and H2 constitute synthesis gas for Fischer-Tropsch liquids, methanol and ammonia synthesis.�ans��src��cD. W. van Krevelen, Coal: Typology—Chemistry—Physics—Constitution, 第3版, Elsevier, 1993。�gD. W. van Krevelen, Coal: Typology — Chemistry — Physics — Constitution, 3rd ed., Elsevier, 1993.��id�chem_23_011�body��4Zn²⁺被三个组氨酸和一个水分子配位，把配位水的pKa从约15降到接近7，因此生理pH下就能生成亲核性的锌-羟基去进攻CO2并释放HCO3-；随后水分子回填空位完成循环。锌的路易斯酸性与His64质子梭协同，使转换频率高达每秒约一百万次。�lZn2+, held by three histidines and one water molecule, lowers the pKa of bound water from about 15 to nearly 7, so at physiological pH a nucleophilic zinc-bound hydroxide attacks CO2 and releases bicarbonate; water then rebinds to close the cycle. Zinc's Lewis acidity acts together with the His64 proton shuttle to push turnover to roughly one million per second.�ans��src��QD.W. Christianson & C.A. Fierke, Accounts of Chemical Research, 1996, 29, 331-339�]D.W. Christianson and C.A. Fierke, Acc. Chem. Res., 1996, 29, 331-339, DOI: 10.1021/ar9501232��id�chem_23_014�body���微波能经偶极极化与离子传导在介电损耗高的物料内部直接耗散，加热自本体而非器壁开始，温度梯度方向与常规相反，多数报道的加速皆源于此。要检验非热效应，必须使对照与样品温度曲线一致、用光纤探头实测内部温度，并用吸波而不含极性溶剂的碳化硅反应瓶做对照；迄今所有严格对照实验中，独立于温度的非热效应仍缺乏可靠证据。�LMicrowave energy dissipates directly inside lossy materials through dipolar polarization and ionic conduction, so heating starts in the bulk rather than at the vessel wall and the temperature gradient runs opposite to convention; most reported accelerations follow from this fast bulk heating. Testing non-thermal claims demands matched temperature profiles, internal readings by fiber-optic probes, and control runs in silicon-carbide vials that absorb microwaves yet hold no polar solvent - and in every rigorous comparison to date, genuinely non-thermal effects lack reliable evidence.�ans��src��HC.O. Kappe, Angewandte Chemie International Edition, 2004, 43, 6250-6284�SC.O. Kappe, Angew. Chem. Int. Ed., 2004, 43, 6250-6284, DOI: 10.1002/anie.200400655��id�chem_23_017�body���SF6是正八面体构型，六个强S-F键把中心硫原子完全包裹，水解等常见反应难以触及硫核，动力学惰性极强，因此能在带电设备中长期稳定使用。它又善于捕获电子，放电时迅速吸收自由电子、阻断电离连锁发展，从而快速灭弧并耐受远高于空气的电压。正是这份惰性让它在大气中几乎不降解，红外吸收又极强，单分子温室效应超过二氧化碳两万倍。�oSF6 adopts an octahedral shape whose six strong S-F bonds completely shield the central sulfur atom, so hydrolysis and ordinary reactions barely reach it; this kinetic inertness lets it sit safely inside live equipment for decades. It is also strongly electron-capturing: during a discharge it mops up free electrons and suppresses ionization avalanches, extinguishing arcs quickly while withstanding voltages far above air's limit. Precisely because it is so inert it hardly degrades in the atmosphere yet absorbs infrared radiation intensely, giving one molecule more than twenty thousand times the warming effect of CO2.�ans��src��dN. N. Greenwood 与 A. Earnshaw《Chemistry of the Elements》第2版，Butterworth-Heinemann，1997�^N. N. Greenwood & A. Earnshaw, Chemistry of the Elements, 2nd ed., Butterworth-Heinemann, 1997��id�chem_24_004�body��+切开后细胞破损,多酚氧化酶以氧气为电子受体把酚类底物氧化成醌,醌再聚合成褐色黑色素,这就是酶促褐变。柠檬汁里的抗坏血酸把醌还原回酚类,柠檬酸降低pH抑制酶活性,两者共同延缓变色;加热钝化酶或隔绝氧气也同样有效。��Cutting the fruit breaks cells open, and polyphenol oxidase then uses oxygen to oxidize phenolic substrates into quinones, which polymerize into the brown melanin pigments; this is enzymatic browning. Lemon juice helps twice over, because its ascorbic acid reduces the quinones back to phenols while citric acid lowers the pH and suppresses the enzyme. Blanching to denature the enzyme or keeping oxygen away works just as well.�ans��src��JH.-D. Belitz、W. Grosch、P. Schieberle《Food Chemistry》,Springer,2009�GH.-D. Belitz, W. Grosch & P. Schieberle, Food Chemistry, Springer, 2009��id�chem_24_005�body��]油与水互不相溶,纯水又无法降低油污与织物之间的界面张力,所以洗不掉。肥皂分子一端亲水、一端亲油,会吸附在油水界面并把亲油尾插入油滴,使油滴容易被机械作用从表面卷离;浓度超过临界胶束浓度后,分子聚成胶束把油包裹成稳定乳液随水冲走,油污便被清除。��Oil and water do not mix, and pure water cannot lower the interfacial tension that holds grease onto fabric, so rinsing alone fails. A soap molecule has a water-loving head and an oil-loving tail; it adsorbs at the oil-water interface with its tail buried in the droplet, letting agitation roll the grease off the surface. Once the concentration passes the critical micelle concentration, the molecules cluster into micelles that swallow the oil into a stable emulsion carried away by the rinse water.�ans��src��bP. C. Hiemenz、R. Rajagopalan《Principles of Colloid and Surface Chemistry》,Marcel Dekker,1997�`P. C. Hiemenz & R. Rajagopalan, Principles of Colloid and Surface Chemistry, Marcel Dekker, 1997��id�chem_24_009�body���编号是美国塑料工业协会1988年定的树脂识别码:1号PET饮料瓶、2号HDPE洗涤剂瓶、3号PVC、4号LDPE薄膜、5号PP餐盒、6号PS泡沫、7号其他。分开回收是因为聚合物间相容性差,熔融共混时剧烈相分离;少量PVC混入PET回收流受热会分解出盐酸,腐蚀设备并黄化整批料,故回收厂以红外光谱按号分选后再清洗造粒。工程上也可有意借增容剂做PC/ABS等合金,但那是精密配方,不是垃圾场里的偶遇。�FThe codes are a 1988 resin identification system: 1 PET bottles, 2 HDPE jugs, 3 PVC, 4 LDPE film, 5 PP tubs, 6 PS foam, 7 others. Separation matters because unlike polymers mix like oil and water — molten blends phase-separate badly, and even trace PVC in a PET stream releases hydrochloric acid that corrodes equipment and yellows the batch. Facilities therefore sort by infrared spectroscopy before washing, shredding and pelletizing each stream. Intentional blending exists — compatibilized engineering alloys like PC/ABS — but those are precise recipes, not landfill luck.�ans��src��;Andrady 主编,《Plastics and the Environment»,Wiley,2003�<A. L. Andrady ed., Plastics and the Environment, Wiley, 2003��id�chem_24_012�body���因为铝有很强的钝化本领。新暴露的铝一接触空气便立即与氧化合，生成仅几纳米厚的致密氧化铝膜，它结合牢固、无缝隙地盖住表面，切断氧气和水汽进入内部的通道，使腐蚀停留在表层；即使被划伤，膜也会在空气中迅速重建。不锈钢抗锈同理，靠铬形成富铬钝化膜。而铁的锈层疏松多孔，无法隔离内部，腐蚀才不断向深处推进。��Aluminum protects itself with a passive film. The moment freshly exposed metal meets air it oxidizes into an alumina layer only a few nanometers thick, which clings tightly and covers the surface completely, denying oxygen and moisture any path to the metal underneath; scratched spots repair themselves almost at once. Stainless steel works the same way through a chromium-rich passive film. Ordinary iron, by contrast, grows loose porous rust that shields nothing, so the attack digs ever deeper.�ans��src��YM. G. Fontana，《腐蚀工程（Corrosion Engineering）》第3版，McGraw-Hill，1986�DM. G. Fontana, Corrosion Engineering, 3rd edition, McGraw-Hill, 1986��id�chem_24_015�body���关键一步是被氧化为三氧化硫或硫酸盐。燃煤排放的二氧化硫升入大气后，在晴天主要被羟基自由基逐步氧化；溶入云雾滴后，则在痕量铁、锰离子催化下被溶解氧更高效地氧化成硫酸盐，过氧化氢等也参与氧化。产物与水结合即得硫酸，使雨水酸度跌破约5.6的正常下限，形成酸雨。氮氧化物走类似路径生成硝酸，同样助长雨水变酸。�(The decisive change is oxidation of sulfur dioxide to sulfate. In dry air, SO2 is converted mainly through attack by hydroxyl radicals, but once it dissolves into cloud or fog droplets it is oxidized far more efficiently by dissolved oxygen, with traces of iron and manganese acting as catalysts and hydrogen peroxide lending extra oxidizing power. The sulfate then combines with water to yield sulfuric acid, pushing rainfall below the natural acidity limit near pH 5.6. Nitrogen oxides follow an analogous route to nitric acid and deepen the problem.�ans��src��~Likens 与 Bormann,《Acid Rain: A Serious Regional Environmental Problem》,Science,1974 (DOI: 10.1126/science.184.4142.1176)�zLikens & Bormann, 'Acid Rain: A Serious Regional Environmental Problem', Science, 1974, DOI: 10.1126/science.184.4142.1176��id�chem_24_018�body���顺铂先经水解活化，再交联DNA。细胞外氯离子浓度高，顺铂的两个氯配体安稳不动；进入细胞后氯离子浓度骤降，水分子取而代之，生成亲电的活性物种。铂继而与DNA上鸟嘌呤的N7位配位，主要在同一条链相邻两个鸟嘌呤间架起1,2-链内交联，双螺旋局部弯折，复制与转录受阻，损伤累积最终触发细胞凋亡。只有顺式构型能完成这类邻位交联，故反式异构体几乎无效。�lCisplatin first activates itself by aquation, then crosslinks DNA. Outside the cell, plentiful chloride holds the two chloride ligands in place; once inside, chloride levels plunge and water molecules take over, yielding electrophilic aqua species. Platinum then coordinates the N7 site of guanines, most often bridging two neighboring guanines on the same strand into a 1,2-intrastrand crosslink. The helix kinks locally, replication and transcription stall, and accumulating damage finally triggers apoptosis. Only the cis geometry can manage these adjacent bindings, so the trans isomer is nearly worthless as a drug.�ans��src��PB. Rosenberg 等，《自然（Nature）》，1965年，第205卷，698至699页ٯB. Rosenberg, L. VanCamp and T. Krigas, Inhibition of cell division in Escherichia coli by electrolysis products from a platinum electrode, Nature, 1965, vol. 205, pp. 698-699��id�chem_24_020�body��%这是靠阴极还原沉积实现的。直流电源把零件变成阴极，槽液里的金属离子游向零件表面夺取电子，还原成中性原子并嵌入晶格逐层析出，镀层随之增厚：每个镍离子得到两个电子变成金属镍，铬酐镀液中的六价铬则经多步还原落到表面。阳极因镀种而异：镀镍用可溶性镍板补离子，镀铬则用铅基不溶性阳极并补加铬酐。电流密度、温度与添加剂调控成核和长大的速度，从而决定镀层的致密程度、光泽与结合力。��The trick is cathodic reduction and deposition. The DC supply turns the workpiece into the cathode; metal ions in the bath migrate to its surface, capture electrons, and are reduced to neutral atoms that settle into the crystal lattice layer by layer, thickening the coating. Each nickel ion takes up two electrons to become metal, while hexavalent chromium from chromic-acid baths reaches the surface through several reduction steps. Anode practice differs by bath: nickel plating dissolves soluble nickel slabs to replenish ions, while chromium plating runs insoluble lead-based anodes topped up with chromic acid. Current density, temperature and additives control how fast nuclei form and grow, setting the coating density, brightness and adhesion.�ans��src��kM. Schlesinger 与 M. Paunovic 主编，《现代电镀（Modern Electroplating）》第5版，Wiley，2010�UM. Schlesinger and M. Paunovic, eds., Modern Electroplating, 5th edition, Wiley, 2010��id�chem_26_005�body���Al₂O₃是结构助剂，K₂O是电子助剂，分别负责保住活性表面与降低速控步骤能垒。机理：合成氨的速控步骤是N₂在铁表面的解离吸附，优先发生在Fe(111)等开放台阶位。Al₂O₃分散隔开铁微晶、抑制烧结，维持大比表面积和活性形貌；K₂O向相邻铁原子给电子，提高表面电子密度，削弱N≡N三键并稳定N₂*与N*吸附中间体，降低解离活化能。二者协同才能在400-500°C、10-30 MPa下高效运行。�xAlumina is the structural promoter and potash the electronic one: the former preserves the active surface, the latter lowers the barrier of the rate-determining step. That step is dissociative adsorption of N2 on iron, favored at open sites such as Fe(111). Al2O3 separates the iron crystallites and suppresses sintering at operating temperatures, holding a large area and the reactive morphology; K2O donates electron density to neighboring iron atoms, weakening the N≡N triple bond and stabilizing adsorbed N2 and N species, which eases dissociation. Only together do they sustain efficient service at 400-500 °C and 10-30 MPa.�ans��src���K. Honkala、A. Hellman、I. N. Remediakis、J. K. Nørskov等《Ammonia synthesis from first-principles calculations》，Science，2005年，第307卷，555页；G. Ertl因表面催化研究获2007年诺贝尔化学奖�SK. Honkala et al., Science, 2005, 307, 555 ; G. Ertl, Nobel Prize in Chemistry 2007��id�chem_26_006�body���关键看速率定律中两个分压各自的幂次。LH机理要求两种分子都先吸附、再在表面上相互反应，低覆盖度下速率正比于两分压之积，某一反应物饱和后对其降为零级甚至出现负级数；ER机理只有一种分子吸附，另一分子从气相直接撞上吸附态物种成键，故饱和区对吸附组分呈零级、对气相组分始终保持一级。再用程序升温脱附或同位素标记验证共吸附是否必要，即可可靠判别。��Read off the order with respect to each partial pressure in the rate law. A Langmuir-Hinshelwood route needs both molecules adsorbed before they react on the surface: at low coverage the rate follows the product of the two pressures, and once either reagent saturates the surface its order falls to zero or turns negative. An Eley-Rideal route keeps only one species adsorbed, struck directly by the partner arriving from the gas phase, so in the saturation regime the rate is zero-order in the adsorbate yet strictly first-order in the gas-phase molecule. Temperature-programmed desorption or isotopic labeling that tests whether coadsorption is truly required clinches the assignment.�ans��src�ًI. Chorkendorff、J. W. Niemantsverdriet《Concepts of Modern Catalysis and Kinetics》，Wiley-VCH，2003年，表面反应动力学章节َI. Chorkendorff & J. W. Niemantsverdriet, Concepts of Modern Catalysis and Kinetics, Wiley-VCH, 2003, chapter on kinetics of surface reactions��id�chem_26_008�body���CO在铂上的吸附能远高于氢，燃料中百万分之一量级的CO便会抢占氢解离吸附所需的Pt位点并阻断其氧化再生通道，阳极电压随之迅速恶化。PtRu的缓解来自双功能协同加电子调制：Ru在更低电位即可生成Ru-OH含氧物种，相邻Pt上的Pt-CO与其表面反应放出CO2，实现低温氧化再生；同时Ru使Pt的d带中心下移、CO吸附键减弱，双重效应显著拓宽了耐CO的电位窗口。�=Carbon monoxide adsorbs on platinum far more strongly than hydrogen, so parts-per-million levels of CO occupy the sites needed for H2 dissociation and block their oxidative regeneration, collapsing anode performance. PtRu relieves this through bifunctional cooperation plus electronic modulation: ruthenium supplies oxygenated Ru-OH species at lower potentials that oxidize neighboring Pt-CO to CO2 and free the sites, while the Ru-induced downshift of the platinum d-band center weakens the Pt-CO bond itself, together widening the potential window the anode can tolerate.�ans��src�٩M. Watanabe、S. Motoo《Electrosynthesis on adatoms: CO oxidation on platinum electrodes with ruthenium adatoms》，J. Electroanal. Chem.，1975年，第60卷，267页�nM. Watanabe & S. Motoo, J. Electroanal. Chem., 1975, 60, 267 (bifunctional mechanism of CO oxidation on Pt-Ru)��id�chem_26_011�body��,因为两单体在复合物中互借对方的基函数，变分能量被人为压低，相互作用能随之偏大。机理：有限基组下分子轨道只能在自身的原子函数上展开，形成复合物后各自多出邻居提供的变分自由度，由此带来的额外稳定化并非真实的电子相关，而是基组不完备的假象。Boys-Bernardi校正把单体能量放到完整的超分子基组中重算，即将另一单体的全部基函数作为不含电子的幽灵原子并入，两份同基组能量之差便扣除这项虚增。��Because each monomer borrows the other's basis functions inside the complex, variational energies sink artificially and the computed binding comes out too strong. With a finite basis, orbitals expand only on a molecule's own functions until the complex forms, whereupon each monomer gains extra variational freedom donated by its neighbor; the resulting stabilization is an artifact of basis-set incompleteness rather than genuine electron correlation. The Boys-Bernardi counterpoise recipe recomputes every monomer energy in the complete supramolecular basis, the partner riding along as ghost atoms that carry no electrons, and the difference of two energies evaluated in one identical basis cancels the artificial gain.�ans��src���S. F. Boys & F. Bernardi《The calculation of small molecular interactions by the differences of separate total energies. Some procedures with reduced errors》，Molecular Physics，1970年，第19卷，553页�[S. F. Boys & F. Bernardi, Molecular Physics, 1970, 19, 553 (DOI: 10.1080/00268977000101561)��id�chem_26_016�body��直接蒸发得到的是易溶于水的盐饼，一旦接触水体核素便迅速浸出，加上罐体腐蚀与衰变热累积，长期裸存风险极高。硼硅玻璃以SiO₄四面体共价网络为骨架，Na₂O降低熔点便于连续浇注，B₂O₃提升热稳定性并抑制失透；Cs⁺、Sr²⁺作为网格改体离子嵌入网络空隙，锕系与氧配位并入骨架，核素靠化学键合而非简单包裹被固定，浸出率比煅烧盐低几个数量级，产物致密体积小，可直接转入地质处置。��Straight evaporation leaves water-soluble salts that release radionuclides the moment groundwater arrives, while canister corrosion and decay heat compound the hazard year after year. Borosilicate glass builds on a covalent network of SiO4 tetrahedra: Na2O lowers the melting point for continuous casting and B2O3 improves thermal stability while suppressing devitrification. Cs+ and Sr2+ sit as network-modifying cations in the interstices and actinides coordinate into the framework, so nuclides are locked by chemical bonding instead of mere encapsulation; leach rates fall orders of magnitude below calcined salts, and the dense compact product passes straight to geological disposal.�ans��src��|I. W. Donald,《Waste Immobilization in Glass and Ceramic Based Hosts》,John Wiley & Sons,2010 (DOI: 10.1002/9781444319354)�zI. W. Donald, 'Waste Immobilization in Glass and Ceramic Based Hosts', John Wiley & Sons, 2010, DOI: 10.1002/9781444319354��id�chem_26_018�body���主要因为PEG增大了药物的流体力学半径，并屏蔽了降解与识别位点。机理：肾小球按分子尺寸滤过，PEG高度水化后的表观体积远超其实际分子量对应值，原本数分钟即被肾脏排出的小型蛋白因此滞留循环；柔性的水化PEG链又如分子刷般阻挡蛋白酶接近肽键、遮蔽抗原表位，并减少肝脏与网状内皮系统的摄取。清除率整体下降，血药浓度波动收窄，给药间隔随之延长。�\PEG works chiefly by inflating the drug's hydrodynamic radius and masking the sites proteases and antibodies recognize. Kidney glomeruli sieve by size, and because PEG drags along a large shell of bound water its apparent volume dwarfs what its nominal molecular weight implies, so proteins that would vanish within minutes linger in circulation. The flexible hydrated chain also behaves like a molecular brush, denying proteases access to peptide bonds, hiding epitopes, and curbing uptake by liver and reticuloendothelial tissue. Clearance falls, plasma levels smooth out, and dosing intervals stretch.�ans��src�وVeronese 与 Pasut,《PEGylation, successful approach to drug delivery》,Drug Discovery Today,2005 (DOI: 10.1016/s1359-6446(05)03575-0)لVeronese & Pasut, 'PEGylation, successful approach to drug delivery', Drug Discovery Today, 2005, DOI: 10.1016/s1359-6446(05)03575-0��id�d0cfa182331e�body��B范德华力是分子间弱相互作用的总称，包括取向力、诱导力和色散力，强度通常为每摩尔几到几十千焦，比共价键弱得多。氢键是一种特殊的、方向性强的偶极-偶极作用，强度在范德华力和共价键之间，传统上把它单独列为一类分子间作用力。�{Van der Waals forces are the weak interactions between molecules, including orientation, induction and London dispersion forces, typically a few to tens of kilojoules per mole, far weaker than covalent bonds. A hydrogen bond is a directional dipole-dipole interaction intermediate in strength between van der Waals forces and covalent bonds, and is usually classified on its own.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d32d3916c339�body��催化剂提供一条新的反应路径，通过暂时与反应物成键形成中间体，使决速步的能垒低于无催化途径，但本身在反应前后不被消耗。Atkins 与 Thomas 均在教材中强调它只改变速率、不改变平衡位置。�A catalyst offers an alternative pathway: by temporarily bonding with reactants to form intermediates it lowers the barrier of the rate-determining step, yet is not consumed. Atkins and Thomas stress it changes only the rate, never the equilibrium position.�ans��src��DAtkins《物理化学》；Thomas 与 Thomas《多相催化原理》�RAtkins, Physical Chemistry; Thomas & Thomas, Principles of Heterogeneous Catalysis��id�d3ce0d89ec33�body���酯化是羧酸与醇在酸催化下脱水生成酯和水的反应，例如乙酸与乙醇生成乙酸乙酯。许多酯类具有挥发性并带有水果或花香气味，被用于香料工业。反应是可逆的，通常需除去水来提高产率。�5Esterification is the acid-catalyzed condensation of a carboxylic acid with an alcohol to form an ester and water, e.g., acetic acid with ethanol giving ethyl acetate. Many esters are volatile with fruity or floral odors and are used in perfumery. The reaction is reversible, so removing water improves yield.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�d450b388ed91�body��胶体是分散相粒子直径约 1–100 nm 的分散体系，介于溶液与悬浊液之间，如牛奶、雾、豆浆。当一束光穿过胶体，粒子散射光形成可见光路，称为丁达尔效应，可用来区分胶体与真溶液。胶体因高比表面而性质活跃。�bA colloid is a dispersion with particles about 1–100 nm in size, between true solutions and suspensions—milk, fog, and soy milk are examples. A light beam passing through scatters off particles, showing a visible path called the Tyndall effect, which distinguishes colloids from true solutions. Colloids are active because of their high surface area.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�d46b5ff1e732�body��?大气气溶胶是悬浮于空气中的固体或液体微粒（如硫酸盐、黑碳、矿物尘），粒径多在 0.01–10 μm。它们通过散射和吸收太阳辐射产生冷却或加热的辐射强迫，并作为云凝结核改变云特性；细颗粒物（PM2.5）可深入肺部引发呼吸与心血管疾病。�iAtmospheric aerosols are solid or liquid particles suspended in air—such as sulfates, black carbon, and mineral dust—mostly 0.01–10 μm in size. They exert radiative forcing by scattering and absorbing sunlight and act as cloud condensation nuclei that alter clouds; fine PM2.5 penetrates deep into lungs and drives respiratory and cardiovascular disease.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d5e165699176�body��;这源于水的表面张力。表面层的水分子受到下方水分子的净吸引，使液面趋向收缩，形成类似弹性薄膜的界面。水的氢键网络使它的表面张力在常见液体中很高，足以托住水黾这类轻小昆虫；露珠在荷叶上滚成球形，也是表面张力的表现。�XIt comes from surface tension. Molecules at the surface are pulled inward, making the surface shrink like an elastic skin. Because hydrogen bonding gives water one of the highest surface tensions among common liquids, this skin can support light insects such as water striders; dew forming spherical droplets on lotus leaves is the same effect.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d84fd3bceeb4�body��加聚是烯烃等不饱和单体通过双键打开反复连接，不释放小分子，如聚乙烯。缩聚是带双官能团单体缩合，每步脱去水、醇等小分子，如聚酯、聚酰胺；前者产物与单体元素组成相同，后者不同。�EAddition polymerization opens double bonds of unsaturated monomers (e.g., ethylene) and links them without byproduct, as in polyethylene. Condensation polymerization joins bifunctional monomers while eliminating small molecules like water or alcohol, as in polyesters and polyamides; the latter changes elemental composition.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d8f45fefaab1�body��6溶剂能溶解油渍却不让衣物缩水或变形。�>Solvent dissolves grease without shrinking or warping fabrics.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d943c01ff065�body��Q内部氧化还原反应把电子推到负极、正极收电子，形成电流。�_Internal redox pushes electrons to the negative pole and pulls at the positive, making current.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�da911b856e3f�body��H高温破坏维系蛋白质形状的非共价键，使其失去功能。�NHeat breaks the non-covalent forces that hold a protein's shape, disabling it.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�dae73f0eac10�body���绿色化学侧重化学反应与工艺本身的环境无害化（原子经济、低毒、节能）；可持续化学范围更广，还包括经济可行、社会公平与全生命周期影响，是更宏观的发展目标。��Green chemistry focuses on making reactions and processes intrinsically benign (atom economy, low toxicity, energy efficiency); sustainable chemistry is broader, also covering economic viability, social equity, and full life-cycle impact as a macro goal.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�db413e239c00�body��3维生素C能向活性氧自由基（如羟基自由基）提供氢原子，把它们还原成稳定分子，同时自身变成较稳定的半脱氢抗坏血酸自由基，从而终止自由基链反应。食物中油脂的酸败正是自由基链式氧化，抗氧化剂通过打断链条来延缓变质。�oVitamin C donates a hydrogen atom to reactive oxygen radicals such as the hydroxyl radical, reducing them to stable molecules while itself becoming the relatively stable semidehydroascorbate radical, thereby terminating radical chain reactions. Rancidity of fats in food is exactly such a radical chain oxidation, and antioxidants slow spoilage by breaking the chain.�ans��src��)PNAS（维生素C自由基化学研究）�>PNAS (vitamin C radical chemistry); Royal Society of Chemistry��id�dcd61c2f0d16�body��␀氢只有一个电子，既能失去电子显金属性（如形成H+），也能得到一个电子显非金属性（如形成H-）。它位于周期表左上角，既不像碱金属也不像卤素，性质独特。因此在周期表中常被单独列出。�-Hydrogen has a single electron, so it can lose it and behave metallically (forming H+) or gain one and behave nonmetallically (forming H-). Located at the top left, it resembles neither alkali metals nor halogens and is chemically unique. It is therefore often listed separately in the periodic table.�ans��src��MHousecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》（第5版，Pearson）氢元素章节�]Housecroft, C. E.; Sharpe, A. G. Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson (the element hydrogen)��id�dd519760e7d4�body��e燃烧发生在煤与空气的接触界面上，接触面积越大，氧气越容易同时碰到更多碳原子，反应速率越快。煤粉的总表面积比同样质量的整块煤大几个数量级，所以点火更容易、燃烧更猛。火力发电厂把煤磨成粉喷入炉膛，目的正是用巨大的接触面积换取快速而充分的燃烧。��Combustion happens where coal meets air, so a larger contact area lets oxygen reach far more carbon atoms at once and the reaction speeds up. A powder has orders of magnitude more total surface area than the same lump, so it ignites easily and burns violently. Power plants grind coal into dust and blow it into the furnace precisely to buy fast, complete combustion with that huge surface area.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�df6fa8c1077d�body��;乳酸菌将糖类无氧转化为乳酸，降低 pH 抑制腐败菌并赋予酸奶、泡菜酸味与质地。与酒精发酵（酵母将糖转为乙醇和 CO₂）不同，乳酸发酵不产生气体，产物为单一有机酸，因而更适合腌制与乳制品。两者都是 NAD⁺ 再生的无氧产能途径。��Lactic-acid bacteria convert sugars anaerobically to lactic acid, lowering pH to inhibit spoilage microbes and giving yogurt and kimchi their sour taste and texture. Unlike alcoholic fermentation (yeast converting sugar to ethanol and CO₂), lactic fermentation produces no gas and yields a single organic acid, suiting pickling and dairy. Both regenerate NAD⁺ as anaerobic energy pathways.�ans��src��M《食品化学》(王璋) 发酵章；美国化学会(ACS)农业食品化学�AACS Journal of Agricultural and Food Chemistry; Food Microbiology��id�dfc0e92904d8�body��%ΔG° 是标准状态（各物质活度为 1）下的吉布斯自由能变，是一个固定常数；而 ΔG = ΔG° + RT ln Q 还与实际反应商 Q 有关。只有 ΔG < 0 时反应才自发；即便 ΔG° > 0，只要 Q 足够小（反应物远多于产物），反应仍可正向进行。�4ΔG° is the Gibbs free-energy change under standard conditions (unit activity) and is a fixed constant, while ΔG = ΔG° + RT ln Q also depends on the reaction quotient Q. Spontaneity requires ΔG < 0; even if ΔG° > 0, the reaction proceeds forward whenever Q is small enough (reactants in large excess).�ans��src��;Atkins & de Paula《物理化学》（第10版），第4章�8Atkins & de Paula, "Physical Chemistry" (10th ed.), Ch.4��id�e11462fca5cd�body���钢铁在空气里生锈需要水膜，而地下土壤本身就是潮湿的电解质，为电化学腐蚀创造了更有利的条件。土壤中不同部位的氧含量、酸碱度和盐分不同，会在钢管各区段形成氧浓差电池或微电池：氧多的地方是阴极，氧少的地方成为阳极而加速溶解。土壤越湿、含盐越高，导电性越好，腐蚀电流越大，所以埋地管道要涂防腐层并配合阴极保护。�"Steel rusts in air only with a water film, while damp soil is itself an electrolyte that favours electrochemical corrosion. Differences in oxygen content, acidity and salinity across the soil create oxygen-concentration cells and micro-cells on different sections of the pipe: oxygen-rich zones act as cathodes while oxygen-poor zones become anodes and dissolve faster. The wetter and saltier the soil, the better it conducts and the stronger the corrosion current - which is why buried pipelines get protective coatings plus cathodic protection.�ans��src��$《普通化学》（金属腐蚀）�General Chemistry (corrosion)��id�e2476d670520�body���在 HX 等极性加成中，氢加在含氢较多的双键碳上，卤素加在含氢较少的碳上，因形成更稳定的碳正离子中间体。反马氏加成（如过氧化物存在下的 HBr）则经自由基机理实现。��In polar addition of HX to an unsymmetrical alkene, H adds to the carbon with more hydrogens and X to the other, because the more stable carbocation intermediate forms. Anti-Markovnikov addition (e.g., HBr with peroxides) proceeds via a radical mechanism.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�e300b12028f4�body��化学计量数是化学方程式中各物质前的整数，表示反应按比例消耗或生成的分子（或摩尔）数目。它用于计算反应物与产物的量关系，并出现在平衡常数与速率方程的幂次中。配平方程式是定量化学计算的基础。�bA stoichiometric coefficient is the integer before each substance in a chemical equation, indicating how many molecules (or moles) are consumed or produced proportionally. It is used to relate amounts of reactants and products and appears as the exponent in equilibrium constants and rate laws. Balancing equations is the basis of quantitative chemistry.�ans��src��`Brown、LeMay、Bursten 等《化学：中心科学》（第14版，Pearson）化学计量章节�tBrown, T. L.; LeMay, H. E.; Bursten, B. E.; et al. Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson (stoichiometry)��id�e6ba51eb912c�body�٫腐蚀是金属与环境发生化学或电化学反应而损耗，最常见的是铁生锈。防护方法包括涂漆、镀层、使用不锈钢和牺牲阳极保护法。��Corrosion is the loss of metal through chemical or electrochemical reaction with the environment, with rusting iron being the most common. Protection includes painting, coating, stainless steel, and sacrificial anode methods.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�e740f6bd7d61�body���通电后阴极发生 2H₂O+2e⁻→H₂+2OH⁻，阳极发生 2H₂O→O₂+4H⁺+4e⁻，总反应把水分解为氢和氧。该过程证明水是化合物，也是制取绿氢的核心技术。��On electrolysis the cathode does 2H₂O+2e⁻→H₂+2OH⁻ and the anode 2H₂O→O₂+4H⁺+4e⁻, overall splitting water into hydrogen and oxygen. It proves water is a compound and underlies green-hydrogen production.�ans��src��ABard 与 Faulkner《电化学方法》；Atkins《物理化学》�DBard & Faulkner, Electrochemical Methods; Atkins, Physical Chemistry��id�e79f0001d39b�body��)碳常见 sp³、sp² 和 sp 三种杂化。sp³ 杂化形成四个等价轨道，呈四面体构型（如甲烷）；sp² 杂化形成三个平面轨道，呈平面三角形（如乙烯）；sp 杂化形成两个直线型轨道（如乙炔）。杂化方式决定了键角与分子骨架形状。�KCarbon commonly adopts sp³, sp², and sp hybridization. sp³ gives four equivalent orbitals in a tetrahedral arrangement (as in methane), sp² gives three coplanar orbitals in a trigonal arrangement (as in ethene), and sp gives two linear orbitals (as in ethyne). The hybridization dictates bond angles and the molecular skeleton.�ans��src��j《有机化学》(邢其毅, 第四版) 第一章；IUPAC《化学术语总表》(Gold Book, 2014 修订)�pIUPAC Gold Book (Compendium of Chemical Terminology, 2014); Carey & Sundberg, Advanced Organic Chemistry, Vol. 1��id�e9bb1a9af001�body��B尼龙等聚酰胺通常由二胺与二羧酸（或其酰氯）的缩聚反应制得，每形成一个酰胺键脱去一分子水（或 HCl）。该逐步聚合的产物分子量随反应程度提高而增长，需通过除去小分子、提高转化率来获得高分子量。己二胺与己二酸缩聚得到尼龙-66。��Polyamides such as nylon are made by step-growth polycondensation of a diamine with a diacid (or its diacid chloride), eliminating one water (or HCl) molecule per amide bond. In this step-growth process molecular weight grows as conversion increases, so high molecular weight requires removing the small molecule to drive the reaction. Hexamethylenediamine with adipic acid gives nylon-66.�ans��src��U《高分子化学》(潘祖仁, 第五版) 缩聚章；美国化学会(ACS)高分子�FOdian, Principles of Polymerization, step-growth; Macromolecules (ACS)��id�ea6c5189b04e�body��G血红蛋白里的铁(血红素)能可逆地结合和释放氧分子。�<Iron in heme reversibly binds and releases oxygen molecules.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�eb3b8c47c571�body���ICE 表（Initial-Change-Equilibrium）列出各物质初态、变化量与平衡浓度，代入平衡常数表达式求解未知量。它能系统化处理弱酸解离、溶解与气体平衡等问题。�An ICE table (Initial-Change-Equilibrium) lists each species' starting amount, the change, and the equilibrium amount, then substitutes into the K expression to solve unknowns. It systematically handles weak-acid dissociation, solubility, and gas equilibria.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�eb787b9a5a2a�body���放电时 Li⁺ 从负极石墨脱出，经电解质嵌入正极金属氧化物（如 LiCoO₂），电子经外电路做功；充电时外加电压使过程逆转。其高电压与能量密度源于锂的轻量与高负还原电势。�MDuring discharge Li⁺ de-intercalates from the graphite anode, moves through the electrolyte, and inserts into the cathode metal oxide (e.g., LiCoO₂) while electrons do work externally; charging reverses this with applied voltage. High voltage and energy density come from lithium's low mass and very negative reduction potential.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�ecdc8a3ed1bf�body���14C 由宇宙射线在大气中生成并进入生物圈，生物死亡后停止摄入，体内 14C 按 5730 年的半衰期指数衰减。通过测量残留 14C 比例可推算死亡年代，通常适用于数百年到约五万年内的样品。�-14C is produced in the atmosphere by cosmic rays and incorporated into living organisms; after death intake stops and the 14C decays with a 5730-year half-life. Measuring the remaining 14C fraction gives the time since death, typically for samples from a few hundred to about fifty thousand years old.�ans��src��?陈骏、王鹤年《地球化学》(科学出版社) 第 9 章�EW. F. Libby, Radiocarbon Dating, 2nd ed., University of Chicago Press��id�ef10b3f4a0f3�body��热塑性塑料加热可软化重塑，分子链间主要为物理缠结（如聚乙烯、PET），可反复加工回收。热固性塑料在固化时形成交联网络（如环氧树脂、酚醛），一旦成型不可再熔，耐热性好但难回收。两者结构决定用途。�5Thermoplastics soften and reshape on heating, with mainly physical chain entanglement (e.g., polyethylene, PET), and can be reprocessed. Thermosets form a crosslinked network during curing (e.g., epoxy, phenolic) and cannot be remelted, offering heat resistance but poor recyclability. Structure dictates use.�ans��src��潘祖仁《高分子化学》�Polymer Chemistry (Pan Zuren)��id�f12f230883dc�body��E汞原子间金属键较弱、熔点很低，常温下保持液态。�BMercury's weak metallic bonding gives it a very low melting point.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�f21e67d6731b�body���当分子含一个连有四个不同基团的手性中心（通常是碳原子）时，它与自身镜像无法重合，便形成一对对映体。Pasteur 在 1848 年从酒石酸盐首次分离出这种镜像异构体。��When a molecule has a stereocenter—usually carbon attached to four different groups—its mirror image cannot be superimposed, giving a pair of enantiomers. Pasteur first separated such mirror isomers from tartrate salts in 1848.�ans��src��UClayden《有机化学》；Carey 与 Sundberg《高等有机化学》；Pasteur 1848�XClayden, Organic Chemistry; Carey & Sundberg, Advanced Organic Chemistry; Pasteur (1848)��id�f278f607b3d9�body��>石墨层状结构层间有空隙，可可逆地插入锂离子形成插层化合物 LiₓC₆，理论比容量约 372 mAh/g。嵌锂时锂离子进入层间并储存于石墨烯片层之间，电子同时进入碳的 π 共轭体系，过程保持骨架完整。脱锂时反应逆向进行，实现充放电循环。�sGraphite's layered structure has gaps between sheets that reversibly accept lithium to form the intercalation compound LiₓC₆, with a theoretical capacity near 372 mAh/g. On lithiation, Li⁺ enters between graphene layers while electrons enter the carbon π system, leaving the framework intact. Delithiation reverses the process, enabling charge–discharge cycling.�ans��src��R《电化学原理》(李荻) 二次电池章；美国化学会(ACS)能源 LETTERS�KACS Energy Letters, anode materials; Journal of The Electrochemical Society��id�f3892ee8bf18�body���同素异形体指同一种元素组成的不同单质，因原子排列或成键方式不同而有不同性质。碳的同素异形体包括金刚石、石墨、富勒烯和石墨烯。氧气与臭氧也是氧元素的同素异形体。��Allotropes are different forms of the same element as a pure substance, differing in atomic arrangement or bonding and thus in properties. Carbon allotropes include diamond, graphite, fullerenes and graphene. Oxygen and ozone are allotropes of oxygen.�ans��src��SHousecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》（第5版，Pearson）同素异形体章节�SHousecroft, C. E.; Sharpe, A. G. Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson (allotropes)��id�f3f26464562b�body���蓝草含靛苷，发酵水解得到靛白（隐色体，可溶，黄绿）；布浸入后拿出，靛白被空气氧化成不溶的靛蓝，显现蓝色，这是传统蓝印花布的原理。��Indigo plants contain indican; fermentation yields leuco-indigo (soluble, yellow-green). Fabric soaked then exposed to air oxidizes it to insoluble blue indigo—the traditional vat-dyeing method.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�f4ba079bd0b0�body���混合物各组分在固定相与流动相之间的分配（吸附、溶解度或亲和力）不同，迁移速度有别而得以分离。例如气相/液相色谱按保留时间区分组分，薄层色谱按比移值 Rf 区分。��Components of a mixture partition differently between stationary and mobile phases (by adsorption, solubility, or affinity), so they migrate at different rates and separate. GC/HPLC resolve by retention time; TLC by the Rf value.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�f5f43da3fab9�body��,缓冲对（如醋酸/醋酸根）中，加入少量酸时被其共轭碱中和，加入少量碱时被弱酸中和，使 pH 基本不变。但缓冲组分的总量是有限的，一旦被外加酸碱大量消耗或比例失衡（通常超出 1:10–10:1 范围），缓冲能力就会急剧下降。�4In a buffer pair (e.g., acetic acid/acetate), added acid is consumed by the conjugate base and added base by the weak acid, keeping pH nearly constant. The total amount of buffer components is finite, however, so once they are largely consumed or the ratio leaves the ~1:10–10:1 range, buffering collapses.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay & Bursten《化学：中心科学》（第14版），第17章�JBrown, LeMay & Bursten, "Chemistry: The Central Science" (14th ed.), Ch.17��id�f5f763be5d62�body���Suzuki-Miyaura 偶联是在钯催化下，有机硼试剂与卤代烃发生交叉偶联生成碳-碳键的反应。它条件温和、底物兼容性好，广泛用于药物、材料和天然产物的芳环连接。�3The Suzuki-Miyaura coupling is a palladium-catalyzed cross-coupling between organoboron reagents and haloarenes to form carbon-carbon bonds. It proceeds under mild conditions with broad functional-group tolerance and is widely used to join aromatic rings in pharmaceuticals, materials, and natural products.�ans��src��u《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 22 章 ; 另见: Miyaura & Suzuki, Chem. Rev. 1995, 95, 2457 (ACS)�wMiyaura & Suzuki, Chem. Rev. 1995, 95, 2457 (ACS) ; see also: 《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 22 章��id�f6544e928d3c�body�ٍDNA由四种含氮碱基、脱氧核糖和磷酸组成，碱基排列顺序储存遗传信息。两条链缠绕成著名的双螺旋结构。٪DNA is made of four nitrogenous bases, deoxyribose sugar, and phosphate, and the order of bases stores genetic information. Two strands wind into the famous double helix.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f70b7935122b�body���样品被雾化并高温原子化后，基态原子只吸收该元素特征波长的光（如铅 283.3 nm）。吸光度与光路中该原子的数目成正比，按朗伯-比尔定律 A = εlc 换算，再对照标准曲线即可得出浓度。�LThe sample is nebulized and atomized at high temperature; ground-state atoms absorb only their element-specific wavelength (e.g., lead at 283.3 nm). Absorbance is proportional to the number of those atoms in the light path, and by the Beer–Lambert law A = εlc, compared against a calibration curve, the concentration is obtained.�ans��src��KSkoog, West, Holler & Crouch《分析化学基础》（第9版），第9章�TSkoog, West, Holler & Crouch, "Fundamentals of Analytical Chemistry" (9th ed.), Ch.9��id�fa4c6972e2c8�body�٫因为焓是状态函数，反应总焓变只取决于始态和终态，与路径无关。因此可把已知反应相加减，间接求出难以直接测量的反应焓。��Because enthalpy is a state function, the total enthalpy change depends only on initial and final states, not the path. Known reactions can thus be combined to find enthalpies that are hard to measure directly.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�fbadf5d1274f�body��活化能是反应物分子转变为产物必须越过的最低能量壁垒。催化剂提供一条能量更低的反应路径（新机理），从而降低活化能、加快反应，但不改变平衡位置。例如酶把生化反应的活化能大幅降低。�BActivation energy is the minimum energy barrier reactants must overcome to become products. A catalyst offers a lower-energy pathway (a new mechanism), lowering the activation energy and speeding the reaction without shifting equilibrium. Enzymes, for example, greatly lower the activation energy of biochemical reactions.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�fdaf0360d90d�body��N这是相似相溶规律。水是强极性分子，能通过离子-偶极作用把Na+和Cl-从晶格中拆散并包围起来；汽油是非极性碳氢化合物，几乎无法削弱氯化钠的离子键，所以盐在汽油中基本不溶解。极性溶剂溶解离子化合物或极性溶质，非极性溶剂溶解非极性溶质。�WThis is the like-dissolves-like rule. Water is strongly polar and pulls Na+ and Cl- apart from the lattice through ion-dipole interactions; gasoline is a nonpolar hydrocarbon that cannot weaken the ionic lattice, so salt hardly dissolves in it. Polar solvents dissolve ionic or polar solutes, while nonpolar solvents dissolve nonpolar solutes.�ans��src��'《普通化学》(Atkins) 溶液章节�%General Chemistry (Atkins), solutions��id�ff94d208095c�body��B溶质粒子减少水分子逃逸，需要更高温度才沸腾。�GSolute particles lower vapor escape, so a higher temperature is needed.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�002be6a8886e�body�ٍ呼出气中的乙醇在燃料电池或化学传感器上被氧化，产生的电流与酒精量成正比，从而读出血液酒精浓度。ٖEthanol in breath is oxidized at a fuel-cell or chemical sensor; the current produced is proportional to the alcohol amount, estimating blood alcohol.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�041e1995702b�body�ّ传感器(如电化学或金属氧化物型)对CO有选择性反应并产生电信号，浓度超标即报警，弥补了人闻不到的缺陷。٢An electrochemical or metal-oxide sensor reacts selectively to CO and generates a signal; it alarms above safe levels, compensating for our inability to smell CO.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�1c824cbd876c�body���柠檬汁里除了水和柠檬酸，还有糖和多种有机物，水分蒸发后留下的薄痕几乎无色。受热时这些残留先脱水，再焦糖化、氧化成棕色的大分子，笔迹就现形。关键是门槛不同：纸要相当高的温度才焦化，果汁残留低得多，同样的热量下只有写过字的部分先变棕。牛奶、洋葱汁是同一道理；可火太近、温度太高，纸先焦黑，字反而被盖住。�PLemon juice holds water, citric acid and sugars plus other organic compounds; once the water evaporates the thin residue left behind is almost colorless. Heating drives off water and then caramelizes and oxidizes that residue into larger brown molecules, so the writing shows up. The point is the different thresholds: paper needs a fairly high temperature to char, whereas the juice residue browns at a much lower one, so under the same heat only the strokes darken. Milk and onion juice work on the same principle; but too close a flame and the paper blackens first, swallowing the message.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�3644c3be9b52�body�� CFC 在平流层中受紫外线光解，释放出的氯原子作为催化剂反复破坏臭氧（O₃）分子，一个氯原子可摧毁上万个臭氧分子。这造成南极上空臭氧空洞。1987 年《蒙特利尔议定书》逐步淘汰 CFC 后，臭氧层已开始缓慢恢复。�7In the stratosphere, UV light photolyzes CFCs, releasing chlorine atoms that catalytically destroy ozone (O₃)—a single chlorine can ruin tens of thousands of ozone molecules. This caused the Antarctic ozone hole. After the 1987 Montreal Protocol phased out CFCs, the ozone layer has slowly begun recovering.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7d064cd60309�body��重金属（如铅、汞、镉）在环境中难降解、易在生物体内富集，并能与蛋白质、酶中的巯基等结合使之中毒。铅会损害儿童神经系统和智力发育，因此汽油和涂料中的铅已被严格限制。源头减排与修复是关键。�:Heavy metals like lead, mercury, and cadmium resist degradation, bioaccumulate, and bind to sulfhydryl groups in proteins and enzymes, causing toxicity. Lead damages children's nervous systems and cognitive development, so lead in gasoline and paint is tightly restricted. Source reduction and remediation are key.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8057a01d1220�body�ف铅化合物会覆盖在铂、钯、铑的活性表面上，堵住活性位点使催化剂失效，所以必须用无铅汽油。كLead compounds coat the platinum, palladium and rhodium surfaces, blocking active sites so the catalyst dies—hence unleaded fuel.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�99230500d627�body��)不饱和脂肪酸的碳碳双键有顺式或反式两种构型：顺式使碳链弯折、熔点低，多为液态植物油；反式使链较直、更接近饱和脂肪的排列，熔点高。反式脂肪会升高坏胆固醇（LDL）、降低好胆固醇（HDL），增加心血管疾病风险。�1Unsaturated fats have cis or trans double-bond geometry: cis kinks the chain and lowers the melting point (liquid oils), while trans keeps it straighter, closer to saturated fats, with a higher melting point. Trans fats raise LDL ("bad") and lower HDL ("good") cholesterol, increasing cardiovascular risk.�ans��src��;Voet & Voet《生物化学》（第4版），第10章脂类�3Voet & Voet, "Biochemistry" (4th ed.), Ch.10 Lipids��id�a2d765fda33b�body��.从铍到硼，电子进入更高的 2p 轨道且受内层屏蔽更强，更容易失去，故 B 比 Be 低。从氮到氧，氧的 2p 轨道出现成对电子，电子间排斥增大使其中一个更易被移走，故 O 比 N 低。这两处"反常"正体现了轨道能级与电子排斥的影响。�KFrom Be to B the electron enters the higher-energy 2p orbital with more shielding, so it is easier to remove, dropping below Be. From N to O the added electron pairs in a 2p orbital, and increased electron–electron repulsion makes one easier to remove, dropping below N. These "dips" reflect orbital energy and repulsion effects.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�chem_25_011�body��u它们发生了酸碱反应:醋酸和小苏打交换搭档,生成醋酸钠、水和二氧化碳气体,泡泡就是被撑出来的二氧化碳。这不是燃烧——燃烧需要氧气参与并放光发热,而这个反应不放火光,甚至还会吸一点热,摸杯子会觉得凉。判断化学反应类型要看有没有新物质生成和能量变化,不能只看冒泡。�3They run an acid-base reaction: acetic acid and baking soda swap partners making sodium acetate plus water and carbon dioxide — the bubbles are CO2. It is not combustion: no oxygen-fueled glow, and the mix even turns slightly colder. Reaction types depend on new substances and energy change, not bubbles.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版化学分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Chemistry volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�chem_25_012�body��n蜂蜜有三重防线:含水量极低,细菌会被高浓度糖反渗透脱水;糖浓度高本身渗透压惊人;还带弱酸性和微量过氧化氢。古埃及墓里放的蜂蜜数千年后仍可食用确有报道。但家庭储存要注意密封防潮——一旦吸水稀释,防线就破了。一岁以下婴儿不能吃蜂蜜,因为可能含肉毒杆菌芽孢。�\Honey holds three defenses: tiny water content dehydrating germs by osmosis; fierce sugar pressure; plus mild acidity and traces of hydrogen peroxide. Honey in Egyptian tombs reportedly stayed edible millennia later. Home storage must stay sealed — absorbed moisture breaks the wall. Never feed honey to infants under one for botulism spore risk.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版化学分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Chemistry volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�chem_25_014�body���能,但越来越难。用加速器把一种原子的原子核轰进另一种重核,极偶尔会融合成超重新元素——119号及以后的尝试正在各国实验室进行。新元素的原子往往只能存在几毫秒就衰变,确认它要靠检测衰变链。目前周期表收录118号,其中95号之后的元素几乎全是人工合成,地球自然界的存量趋近于零。�^Yes, yet harder each step. Accelerators smash one nucleus into another heavy nucleus; very rarely they fuse into a superheavy element — teams now hunt 119 and beyond. New atoms often live milliseconds, confirmed only via decay chains. The table lists 118 today; everything past 95 is essentially human-made with near-zero natural presence on Earth.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版化学分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Chemistry volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�chem_25_015�body��k因为万物皆由化学物质构成:水是一氧化二氢,氧气是双原子分子,你身体里跑着成千上万种化合物。化学物质不等于有害,剂量和形态才决定安全性。这类广告玩的是偷换概念,利用对化学的恐惧营销。学会看成分表和理解剂量,比记住恐吓词有用得多——这正是化学素养的意义。�NEverything is chemicals: water is dihydrogen monoxide, oxygen a diatomic gas, your body runs thousands of compounds. Chemical never equals harmful — dose and form decide safety. Such ads trade on word-swaps and chemophobia. Reading ingredient lists and understanding dose beats memorizing scare words — that is chemistry literacy.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版化学分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Chemistry volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�chem_26_013�body��@因为它把昂贵的量子化学计算一次性转存为训练数据，模拟时只需评估神经网络，代价比逐步求解Kohn-Sham方程低几个数量级。机理：用满足平移、旋转和原子置换对称性的描述符刻画每个原子的局部化学环境，网络据此输出逐原子能量并求和为总势能，解析梯度直接驱动分子动力学；模型仅在训练集覆盖的构型空间内插值才可靠，外推构型会静默失真，须靠主动学习补样并以不确定性估计把关，长程静电与电荷转移也不易显式表达。��Because the costly quantum chemistry is paid once up front as training data, while a simulation merely evaluates the fitted network, orders of magnitude cheaper than solving the Kohn-Sham equations step by step. Descriptors invariant to translation, rotation and atom swapping encode each atom's local chemical environment; the network returns per-atom energies whose sum and analytic gradient drive molecular dynamics directly. Reliability holds only as interpolation inside the configuration space spanned by the training set - extrapolation fails silently - so active learning must replenish samples and uncertainty estimates vet novel structures, while long-range electrostatics and charge transfer stay hard to express explicitly.�ans��src�ٱJ. Behler & M. Parrinello《Generalized neural-network representation of high-dimensional potential-energy surfaces》，Physical Review Letters，2007年，第98卷，146401页�bJ. Behler & M. Parrinello, Phys. Rev. Lett., 2007, 98, 146401 (DOI: 10.1103/PhysRevLett.98.146401)��id�eb9cd105f1b4�body��6平流层中紫外线把氧气分子（O₂）光解为氧原子，氧原子再与 O₂ 结合生成臭氧（O₃）。臭氧层吸收大部分有害的紫外-B 和紫外-C 辐射，保护地表生命免受 DNA 损伤。人类排放的氟氯烃曾严重破坏该层，后被《蒙特利尔议定书》管控。�-In the stratosphere, UV light splits O₂ into oxygen atoms, which then combine with O₂ to form ozone (O₃). The ozone layer absorbs most harmful UV-B and UV-C radiation, protecting surface life from DNA damage. Human-emitted CFCs once severely depleted it and were curbed by the Montreal Protocol.�ans��src��nChapman, S. 《高层大气臭氧理论》，《Quarterly Journal of the Royal Meteorological Society》, 1930�}Chapman, S. 'A Theory of Upper-Atmospheric Ozone,' Quarterly Journal of the Royal Meteorological Society, 1930, 56, 175–194��id�ed2b84d32800�body�ي松烟墨、油烟墨的主要成分是碳（单质），化学性质极稳定，不遇强氧化不褪色；碳粒还吸附于纸纤维。ٜSoot inks are mostly elemental carbon, chemically very stable and resistant to fading unless strongly oxidized; the particles also adsorb into paper fibers.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�09b79cea4f93�body��电负性是原子在分子中吸引成键电子能力的量度，鲍林标度中最强的是氟（约4.0）。当两个原子电负性差很大时形成离子键，差较小时形成极性共价键，相等时形成非极性共价键。电负性差越大，键的极性越强。�@Electronegativity measures an atom's ability to attract bonding electrons; on the Pauling scale fluorine is the strongest at about 4.0. A large electronegativity difference yields ionic character, a small one gives polar covalent bonds, and zero gives nonpolar bonds. The greater the difference, the more polar the bond.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7f073e3e9591�body���同一周期从左到右电负性总体增大，因为核电荷增加、原子半径减小、对电子吸引力增强。同一族从上到下电负性减小。氟是电负性最大的元素，铯和钫最小。这一趋势帮助预测键型和反应性。�.Across a period from left to right, electronegativity generally increases as nuclear charge grows and radius shrinks, strengthening electron attraction. Down a group it decreases. Fluorine is the most electronegative element; cesium and francium the least. This trend predicts bond type and reactivity.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�b450d6da80c9�body�ي纯酒精太快使细菌表面蛋白凝固成膜，反而挡住渗入；70%左右渗透性好，能使蛋白充分变性杀灭微生物。ـPure alcohol coagulates surface proteins too fast, blocking penetration; ~70% penetrates well and denatures proteins thoroughly.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�chem_25_008�body��火焰是燃烧的热气体,热空气比冷空气轻,拼命往上蹿,火苗自然向上跳。刚吹灭时的白烟其实是蜡的蒸气还没散尽,用点着的火柴靠近烟(不是烛芯),火苗会顺着烟跑回去重新点燃蜡烛——这个小实验一定要请大人陪你做!�Flames are hot burning gas; hot air is lighter and races upward, so flames leap up. The white smoke after blowing out is wax vapor still escaping — touch a lit match to the smoke (not the wick) and fire runs down it to relight the candle. Always ask a grown-up to try this with you!�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版化学分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�ZTen Thousand Whys: Chemistry volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�db8411642c51�body��u盐使蛋内水分向外渗透，蛋白质变性凝固，原本与蛋白结合的脂肪游离聚集，形成油滴。�rSalt drives water out by osmosis and denatures proteins, freeing the fat bound in yolk to gather as oily droplets.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�f1ea38995240�body�ي这些人缺乳糖酶，乳糖进入大肠被细菌发酵产气产酸，引起腹胀腹泻；不少东亚成年人乳糖酶本就偏低。ٜThey lack lactase; undigested lactose is fermented by gut bacteria, producing gas and acid—bloating and diarrhea. Many East Asian adults have low lactase.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5a2f00046e5c�body��y金的金属键使其极富延展性，原子层可滑动而不破，1克金可锤成极薄金箔或拉成很长金丝。ٟGold's metallic bonding makes it extremely ductile; atomic layers slide without breaking, so 1 g can be drawn into kilometers of wire or beaten into thin foil.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�71743d263c86�body�ه虾蟹体内的虾青素原本与蛋白质结合显青灰色，加热使蛋白变性，游离出红色的虾青素，故熟后变红。يAstaxanthin in shellfish is bound to protein (grayish); heating denatures the protein, freeing red astaxanthin, so cooked shrimp turn red.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�00097b142d59�body���泡沫是气体分散在液体中的多相体系，其稳定性取决于液膜排液速度与表面膜的弹性修复能力。表面活性剂降低表面张力并提供 Marangoni 效应，使液膜受扰动时自动补强，从而延长泡沫寿命。�'A foam is a dispersion of gas in liquid whose stability depends on the drainage rate of the liquid films and the elastic self-healing of surface films. Surfactants lower surface tension and provide the Marangoni effect, automatically reinforcing films under disturbance and prolonging foam life.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�00ea90bb5a81�body��:熵是体系微观状态数的度量，反映能量与粒子分布的混乱程度，统计表达为 S = k lnΩ。按热力学第二定律，孤立体系中的自发过程总是朝微观状态数更多、出现概率更大的方向进行，因此其熵只能增大或保持不变，仅在可逆极限下才不变。�	Entropy measures the number of microstates and reflects disorder. By the second law, a spontaneous process in an isolated system moves toward more probable (more numerous microstate) states, so entropy does not decrease and is constant only in the reversible limit.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�011acb2f113c�body�يCO₂ 与 H₂ 在 Cu/ZnO 催化下合成甲醇（CH₃OH）；若氢气来自可再生电力，则成为碳循环闭环的关键一环。ٓCO₂ and H₂ synthesize methanol (CH₃OH) over Cu/ZnO; if the H₂ comes from renewable power, it becomes a key step in closing the carbon loop.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�027fc2fc8803�body�ك以高选择性、快速、温和的偶联（如 CuAAC 叠氮-炔反应）连接分子，广泛用于药物发现与材料构建。ىIt uses highly selective, fast, mild couplings (e.g., CuAAC azide-alkyne) to link molecules, widely used in drug discovery and materials.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�02a3b5f435f1�body��阿伦尼乌斯公式表达为k = A·e^(-Ea/RT)，其中k是速率常数，A是指前因子，Ea是活化能，R是气体常数，T是绝对温度。它说明速率常数随温度升高呈指数增长。对该式取对数可线性化处理并求得活化能。�EThe Arrhenius equation is k = A·e^(-Ea/RT), where k is the rate constant, A the pre-exponential factor, Ea the activation energy, R the gas constant and T the absolute temperature. It shows the rate constant grows exponentially with temperature. Taking logarithms linearizes it and allows determination of activation energy.�ans��src�٪Arrhenius,《Über die Reaktionsgeschwindigkeit bei der Inversion von Rohrzucker durch Säuren》,Zeitschrift für Physikalische Chemie,1889 (DOI: 10.1515/zpch-1889-0116)٨Arrhenius, 'Über die Reaktionsgeschwindigkeit bei der Inversion von Rohrzucker durch Säuren', Zeitschrift für Physikalische Chemie, 1889, DOI: 10.1515/zpch-1889-0116��id�04fe0e5495ca�body�ل氧还原反应在常温下极慢，铂能大幅降低其过电位、加快反应，这正是电池成本与寿命的关键瓶颈。ُOxygen reduction is very slow at room temperature; platinum sharply lowers its overpotential, making it the key cost and durability bottleneck.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�0e72491e6704�body�ف纯水几乎不导电，加少量硫酸或氢氧化钾提供离子、增大电导，而这些添加剂本身基本不被消耗。لPure water barely conducts; a little H2SO4 or KOH supplies ions to boost conductivity, and the additive is essentially not consumed.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�11cda7231de1�body��标准电极电势是在标准状态（25℃、1 atm或1 bar、离子活度为1）下，某半反应相对标准氢电极的电势差，单位为伏特。电势越正，氧化型越易得电子、氧化性越强。它用于判断氧化还原自发方向和计算电池电动势。��The standard electrode potential is the potential difference of a half-reaction relative to the standard hydrogen electrode under standard conditions (25 C, 1 atm or bar, unit activity), measured in volts. The more positive it is, the more easily the oxidized form gains electrons and the stronger its oxidizing power. It is used to judge the spontaneity of redox reactions and compute cell voltage.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�126dc80f6022�body�ـ二巯基丙磺酸钠等螯合剂以多硫或多氮配位结合 Hg²⁺，经尿排出；有机汞（甲基汞）最难清除。َChelators like DMPS bind Hg²⁺ through multiple S or N donors and excrete it in urine; organic mercury (methylmercury) is hardest to remove.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�13095159a439�body�ٙ它能在温和条件下让乙烯按规整方式聚合，得到密度高、强度好的聚乙烯，也催生了聚丙烯，彻底改变了塑料工业。ٵIt lets ethylene polymerize in a regular, controlled way at mild conditions, giving strong high-density polyethylene and enabling polypropylene—transforming the plastics industry.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�130fce5a4e48�body�ل先把含硫物转化为硫化氢，再用克劳斯法把它部分氧化成单质硫，既得到产品又减少二氧化硫污染。ٙSulfur compounds are converted to H2S, then the Claus process partially oxidizes it to elemental sulfur—recovering product while cutting SO2 emissions.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�1c032fa78dc5�body��x生漆含漆酚，接触空气后氧化聚合成致密漆膜，耐水耐腐蚀；但漆酚会使部分人过敏起疹。٠Raw lacquer contains urushiol, which oxidizes and polymerizes into a dense, water- and corrosion-resistant film; however urushiol can cause allergic dermatitis.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�1e155b179e28�body�ٜ硫会强烈吸附在铂电极上占据活性位点，使氧还原反应受阻，对贵金属催化剂极为敏感，百万分之一级就能造成伤害。ٔSulfur strongly adsorbs on platinum sites, blocking the oxygen-reduction reaction; even parts-per-million levels damage the precious-metal catalyst.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�25529505b1a5�body��熵是体系混乱度或无序程度的度量，符号为S。在自发过程中孤立体系的熵总趋于增大（热力学第二定律）。气体比液体、液体比固体熵更大，因为微粒运动自由度更高。熵变与焓变共同决定过程是否自发。�YEntropy, symbol S, measures the disorder or randomness of a system. In spontaneous processes the entropy of an isolated system tends to increase (the second law of thermodynamics). Gases have higher entropy than liquids and liquids than solids because of greater freedom of motion. Entropy change and enthalpy change together decide spontaneity.�ans��src��lAtkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）熵与热力学第二定律章节�yAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (entropy; second law of thermodynamics)��id�26d3c22509db�body�ٟ青花用含钴的矿物（如进口苏麻离青）画坯，罩透明釉高温烧，钴离子在釉下呈稳定蓝；钴料产地不同，呈色浓淡有别。ٻBlue-and-white uses cobalt-bearing ore (e.g. imported Sumali cobalt) painted under a clear glaze; cobalt ions give a stable blue after high-temperature firing, with hue varying by source.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�2882ff566c61�body��}单层 MoS₂ 是直接带隙半导体，可作超薄晶体管与催化剂；与石墨烯互补，拓展了二维电子学。وMonolayer MoS₂ is a direct-gap semiconductor useful as ultrathin transistors and catalysts; it complements graphene in 2D electronics.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�2ccca340876b�body�ف把少量贵重金属分散在氧化铝等多孔载体上，可大幅提高表面积和利用率，并减少高温烧结失活。َDispersing a little active metal on porous alumina hugely raises surface area and usage efficiency while resisting high-temperature sintering.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�2ee7b6066f16�body��金属浸入电解质溶液时，表面因离子溶解或吸附形成电荷，溶液侧出现等量反号离子层，构成紧密层与扩散层结合的界面结构，称为双电层。双电层电势差正是电极电势的微观来源，也是电容和腐蚀的基础。��When a metal is immersed in an electrolyte, its surface gains charge by ion dissolution or adsorption, and an equal opposite-charged ion layer forms on the solution side, creating an interfacial structure of a compact and a diffuse layer called the electric double layer. Its potential difference is the microscopic origin of electrode potential and the basis of capacitance and corrosion.�ans��src��nBard, A. J.; Faulkner, L. R. 《电化学方法：基础与应用》（第2版，Wiley）双电层章节, 2001فBard, A. J.; Faulkner, L. R. Electrochemical Methods: Fundamentals and Applications, 2nd ed., Wiley, 2001 (electric double layer)��id�33102cfdde40�body�ه挥发性样品随惰性载气通过长柱子，各组分与固定相作用强弱不同，出峰时间不同，据此识别并定量。٩Volatile samples ride an inert carrier gas through a long column; differing interactions with the stationary phase give distinct retention times for ID and quantitation.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�3576fd7b4837�body��-螯合是多齿配体通过两个或更多配位原子与同一中心金属离子形成环状结构的配位方式，生成的配合物称为螯合物。由于环状结构稳定（螯合效应），螯合物通常比单齿配合物更难解离。EDTA是常见的强螯合剂，用于净水与解毒。�XChelation is when a polydentate ligand binds the same central metal ion through two or more donor atoms, forming a ring-like complex called a chelate. Thanks to ring stability (the chelate effect), chelates are usually harder to dissociate than monodentate complexes. EDTA is a common strong chelator used in water treatment and detoxification.�ans��src��PHousecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》（第5版，Pearson）螯合效应章节�WHousecroft, C. E.; Sharpe, A. G. Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson (chelate effect)��id�36ad4b07d149�body��r针尖与样品间的隧穿电流随间距指数变化，可对表面电子态成像，甚至移动单个原子。ْThe tunneling current between tip and sample is exponentially sensitive to distance, imaging surface electron states and even moving single atoms.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3b4f99df001d�body��浓差电池是由两个相同电极但电解质浓度不同的半电池组成的原电池，其电动势来源于浓度差而非电极种类差异。浓度高的一侧发生还原、低的一侧发生氧化，直至浓度趋于平衡。它能说明扩散驱动的电能产生方式。��A concentration cell is a galvanic cell made of two identical electrodes but half-cells with different electrolyte concentrations; its voltage comes from the concentration difference rather than different electrode materials. Reduction occurs on the more concentrated side and oxidation on the dilute side until concentrations equalize. It illustrates electricity generated by diffusion driving force.�ans��src��lAtkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）电化学（浓差电池）章节�gAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (concentration cells)��id�3cf4db8d7a05�body��~用不与生物体系反应的反应（如无铜点击）在细胞或动物体内定点标记分子，用于成像与递送。�}Reactions that do not perturb biology (e.g., copper-free click) label molecules in cells or animals for imaging and delivery.�ans��src���Madonna M. A. Mitry, Francesca Greco, Helen M. I. Osborn,《In Vivo Applications of Bioorthogonal Reactions: Chemistry and Targeting Mechanisms》,Chemistry - A European Journal,2023 (DOI: 10.1002/chem.202203942)��Madonna M. A. Mitry, Francesca Greco, Helen M. I. Osborn, 'In Vivo Applications of Bioorthogonal Reactions: Chemistry and Targeting Mechanisms', Chemistry - A European Journal, 2023, DOI: 10.1002/chem.202203942��id�3f0fafd2c145�body�ٖ它把重质长链烃在沸石催化剂上“拆短”成汽油和烯烃，是炼油厂提高轻质油品收率、生产化工原料的核心工艺。ٓIt breaks heavy long-chain oils into shorter gasoline-range molecules and olefins over zeolite catalysts—central to boosting light-product yield.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�40d98d47a311�body��~乙酰水杨酸会缓慢水解回水杨酸和乙酸，乙酸挥发出来就有类似醋的酸味，也提示药效在下降。ٔAcetylsalicylic acid slowly hydrolyzes back to salicylic acid and acetic acid; the escaping acetic acid smells like vinegar and signals degradation.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�4906e11a2672�body�ِ李时珍记载朱砂（硫化汞）、雄黄等入药，反映古人对矿物药的经验认知；现代已知汞、砷有毒，多已禁用。١Li Shizhen's Compendium listed cinnabar (HgS) and realgar as drugs, showing early mineral pharmacology; modern science recognizes their mercury/arsenic toxicity.�ans��src��*《无机化学》生物无机化学章节�4Inorganic Chemistry (bioinorganic chemistry); Nature��id�4f58902881a8�body��p多氯二苯并二噁英脂溶、稳定，并沿食物链生物放大；它结合 Ah 受体扰乱基因表达。ْPolychlorinated dibenzo-dioxins are lipophilic and stable, biomagnifying up the food chain; they bind the Ah receptor and disrupt gene expression.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�4f81c5283c8a�body�ف可用高温热化学循环(如硫-碘循环)或聚焦太阳能提供反应热，分步把水分解，避免全程消耗电能。ٗHigh-temperature thermochemical cycles (e.g., sulfur–iodine) or concentrated solar heat can split water in steps, avoiding all-electric energy input.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5a1e7579627f�body���吉布斯自由能G = H - TS，综合了体系的焓、温度和熵。在恒温恒压下，ΔG < 0 的反应自发进行，ΔG = 0 时达平衡，ΔG > 0 则非自发。它是判断化学反应方向与限度的核心判据。�Gibbs free energy G = H - TS combines a system's enthalpy, temperature and entropy. At constant temperature and pressure, a reaction with ΔG < 0 is spontaneous, ΔG = 0 means equilibrium and ΔG > 0 means non-spontaneous. It is the central criterion for reaction direction and extent.�ans��src��cAtkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）吉布斯自由能章节�eAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (Gibbs free energy)��id�62e7ec64c38b�body�ّ正负极的钒离子（V²⁺/V³⁺ 与 VO²⁺/VO₂⁺）在电解液中氧化还原，功率与容量可独立缩放，适合长时储能。٦Vanadium ions (V²⁺/V³⁺ and VO²⁺/VO₂⁺) are reduced/oxidized in liquid electrolytes; power and capacity scale independently, suiting long-duration storage.�ans��src��oA. J. Bard 与 L. R. Faulkner《Electrochemical Methods: Fundamentals and Applications》第2版，Wiley，2001�iA. J. Bard & L. R. Faulkner, Electrochemical Methods: Fundamentals and Applications, 2nd ed., Wiley, 2001��id�665f7cbc5233�body���浓差电池两电极材料相同，仅电解质浓度不同，离子从高浓度向低浓度扩散产生电势差。它可用于测量离子浓度、测定溶解度积，也是浓差腐蚀（差异充气腐蚀）的理论基础。�!A concentration cell uses identical electrodes but different electrolyte concentrations; ions diffuse from high to low concentration, generating a potential difference. It can measure ion concentrations and solubility products and underlies differential-aeration (concentration) corrosion.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�6b1f04e5ac78�body��~钙钛矿材料遇湿气和氧气容易发生离子迁移与分解，导致效率快速衰减，因此封装是最大难题。٠Perovskites suffer ion migration and decomposition when exposed to moisture and oxygen, so their efficiency fades fast—making encapsulation the big challenge.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�6df463fe77cb�body��点击化学由 Sharpless 提出，主张用少数高选择性、高产率、条件温和的反应快速连接分子模块。CuAAC（铜催化叠氮-炔环加成）几乎定量生成 1,4-三唑且无副产物，符合点击反应的标准，因此成为典型代表。�1Click chemistry, proposed by Sharpless, advocates using a small set of highly selective, high-yield, mild reactions to join molecular building blocks rapidly. CuAAC (copper-catalyzed azide-alkyne cycloaddition) gives near-quantitative 1,4-triazoles with no byproducts and thus epitomizes a click reaction.�ans��src�ّ《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 22 章 ; 另见: H. C. Kolb, M. G. Finn, K. B. Sharpless, Angew. Chem. Int. Ed. 2001, 40, 2004ٓH. C. Kolb, M. G. Finn, K. B. Sharpless, Angew. Chem. Int. Ed. 2001, 40, 2004 ; see also: 《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 22 章��id�6f450417e783�body���前药是把有活性但性质不佳的药物经化学修饰成无活性前体，进入体内后经酶或化学作用再释放出原药。例如依那普利（enalapril）作为依那普利拉的前药以改善口服吸收。��A prodrug is an inactive derivative of an active drug, designed to release the parent drug in vivo via enzymes or chemistry to improve properties. A classic example is enalapril, a prodrug of enalaprilat, made to improve oral absorption.�ans��src��1《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 2 章�LB. Testa & J. M. Mayer, Hydrolysis in Drug and Prodrug Metabolism, Wiley-VCH��id�7095f08f2f40�body��{在两相区的某温度下，两相的比例由连接线按“杠杆”反比分割，靠近哪一端则哪一相更多。٘At a temperature in the two-phase region, phase fractions split inversely along the tie-line like a lever; the nearer end gives the larger phase amount.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�70991975ae89�body�م它用陶瓷电解质传导氧离子，需要700–1000°C才够快；代价是启动慢，但效率高且能直接用多种燃料。ٜIt uses a ceramic electrolyte conducting oxide ions, needing 700–1000 °C to be fast; startup is slow but efficiency is high and it accepts various fuels.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�7a267cb682fd�body�ه碱基靠氢键配对（A-T两键、G-C三键），氢键较弱，加热可解旋复制，又保证配对专一，维持遗传信息。ىBase pairs are held by hydrogen bonds (A-T two, G-C three). Weak enough to unzip for replication, specific enough to encode genetic info.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7ebd03f21839�body�ً阴极发生 HER（2H⁺+2e⁻→H₂），阳极发生 OER（2H₂O→O₂+4H⁺+4e⁻）；OER 慢是能耗瓶颈，需要好催化剂。ىCathode HER (2H⁺+2e⁻→H₂) and anode OER (2H₂O→O₂+4H⁺+4e⁻); the slow OER is the energy bottleneck needing good catalysts.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�80488f152942�body���自催化反应中，某一生成物本身充当后续反应的催化剂，使反应速率随产物积累而加快。典型例子是高锰酸钾与草酸反应初期慢、随后因生成物催化而加速。自催化常表现为S形浓度-时间曲线。�.In an autocatalytic reaction, a product itself acts as the catalyst for later steps, so the rate accelerates as product accumulates. A classic example is permanganate with oxalic acid, slow at first then speeding up via product catalysis. Autocatalysis often gives an S-shaped concentration-time curve.�ans��src��jGray, P.; Scott, S. K. 《化学振荡与不稳定性》（Oxford University Press）自催化章节, 1990�mGray, P.; Scott, S. K. Chemical Oscillations and Instabilities, Oxford University Press, 1990 (autocatalysis)��id�8a876081797b�body�ي它们用血蓝蛋白携氧，其中含铜，含氧时呈蓝色、缺氧时偏无色；与人的血红蛋白（含铁，呈红）不同。َThey use hemocyanin, a copper-based oxygen carrier that is blue when oxygenated (nearly colorless without)—unlike iron-based red hemoglobin.�ans��src��*《无机化学》生物无机化学章节�4Inorganic Chemistry (bioinorganic chemistry); Nature��id�8b691ce8d6fa�body��催化剂中毒指某些杂质（如硫、磷、重金属离子）强烈吸附在活性中心上，占据或破坏活性位点，使催化活性显著下降甚至永久失活。中毒可分为可逆与不可逆两类。工业上需对原料进行深度净化以防止中毒。�1Catalyst poisoning occurs when impurities such as sulfur, phosphorus or heavy-metal ions strongly adsorb onto active sites, occupying or destroying them and sharply lowering activity, sometimes permanently. Poisoning can be reversible or irreversible. Industry must deeply purify feedstocks to prevent it.�ans��src��aButt, J. B.; Petersen, E. E. 《催化剂的活化、失活与中毒》（Academic Press）, 1988�gButt, J. B.; Petersen, E. E. Activation, Deactivation, and Poisoning of Catalysts, Academic Press, 1988��id�8b81dfae528e�body��2均相催化的活性中心与反应物处于同一相（通常为溶液），活性物种明确、选择性高，但产物分离困难；多相催化的催化剂为不同相（如固体负载金属），易与产物分离，但活性位点不均一。两者常通过配体或载体设计来调控性能。�_In homogeneous catalysis the active site and reactants share one phase (usually solution), giving well-defined species and high selectivity but difficult product separation; heterogeneous catalysis uses a different phase (e.g., supported solid metal), allowing easy separation but less uniform sites. Performance is tuned via ligand or support design.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�93aed8d9a4c7�body��钠硫电池是一种高温熔盐电池，以液态钠为负极、硫为正极、β-氧化铝陶瓷为固态电解质，工作温度约300至350摄氏度。放电时钠失去电子生成钠离子穿过电解质与硫形成硫化钠。它具有高能量密度，常用于电网储能。��A sodium-sulfur battery is a high-temperature molten-salt cell with liquid sodium as the negative electrode, sulfur as the positive electrode and a beta-alumina ceramic as the solid electrolyte, operating around 300 to 350 degrees Celsius. During discharge, sodium loses electrons to form Na+ that crosses the electrolyte and reacts with sulfur to form sodium sulfide. It has high energy density and is used for grid storage.�ans��src��KSudworth, J. L.; Tilley, A. R. 《钠硫电池》（Chapman & Hall）, 1985�NSudworth, J. L.; Tilley, A. R. The Sodium Sulfur Battery, Chapman & Hall, 1985��id�9506b3d12b74�body��光催化利用半导体（如二氧化钛）在光照下激发产生电子-空穴对，参与表面氧化还原反应，从而分解污染物或分解水制氢。它属于非均相催化，可在常温常压下进行。光催化在环境净化和清洁能源中前景广阔。�BPhotocatalysis uses a semiconductor such as titanium dioxide that, under light, generates electron-hole pairs participating in surface redox reactions to degrade pollutants or split water for hydrogen. It is heterogeneous catalysis operating at room conditions. It holds promise for environmental cleanup and clean energy.�ans��src��^Fujishima, A.; Honda, K. 《半导体电极上水的电化学光分解》，《Nature》, 1972�wFujishima, A.; Honda, K. 'Electrochemical Photolysis of Water at a Semiconductor Electrode,' Nature, 1972, 238, 37–38��id�9b42ddb42ab2�body�ي树脂和固化剂分开时稳定，混合后引发交联反应变硬成三维网络，比例和混合均匀程度都影响最终强度。كResin and hardener stay stable apart; mixed, they crosslink into a 3D network. Ratio and thorough mixing decide the final strength.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�a3ccf2aa3a73�body�ك无机砷（As(III)、As(V)）远毒于有机砷；As(III) 更易吸收且难沉淀，除砷需先氧化再加吸附或共沉淀。ٱInorganic As(III)/As(V) is far more toxic than organic arsenic; As(III) is more absorbable and less precipitable, so removal needs oxidation then adsorption or co-precipitation.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a59531eb5e04�body�م乙酰水杨酸不可逆地乙酰化 COX 酶，抑制前列腺素合成；低剂量还会抑制血小板 TXA₂ 而起抗凝作用。ٗAcetylsalicylic acid irreversibly acetylates COX enzymes, blocking prostaglandin synthesis; low doses also inhibit platelet TXA₂ for anticoagulation.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�a68ab0bb1fbb�body��s受紫外光激发产生电子-空穴对，生成 ·OH、·O₂⁻ 等强氧化物种，降解有机物并杀菌。نUV excitation creates electron-hole pairs that yield strong oxidants like ·OH and ·O₂⁻, degrading organics and killing microbes.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�aad912c26ea1�body�ِ能量储存在罐中的氧化还原电解液里，功率由电堆大小决定，两者可独立扩容，特别适合长时、大规模储能。٘Energy is stored in redox electrolyte tanks while power comes from the stack; the two scale independently, ideal for long-duration, large-scale storage.�ans��src��(Nature Energy（大规模储能技术）�0Nature Energy (large-scale storage technologies)��id�b4c947a0fa5c�body��过度充电会使正极材料结构破坏、负极锂金属析出形成枝晶，可能刺穿隔膜造成内部短路，甚至引发热失控燃烧。此外过充会加速电解液分解、损害循环寿命。因此电池管理系统必须限制充电上限电压。�tOvercharging destroys the positive electrode structure and causes metallic lithium to plate as dendrites on the negative electrode, which can pierce the separator and short the cell internally, even triggering thermal runaway and fire. It also accelerates electrolyte decomposition and harms cycle life. A battery management system must therefore cap the charging voltage.�ans��src��XTarascon, J.-M.; Armand, M. 《可充电锂电池面临的挑战》，《Nature》, 2001�wTarascon, J.-M.; Armand, M. 'Issues and Challenges Facing Rechargeable Lithium Batteries,' Nature, 2001, 414, 359–367��id�b796ff14dea5�body��y按比尔-朗伯定律，吸光度与浓度成正比；用比色法对照标准曲线，就能算出样品里的含量。يBy the Beer–Lambert law, absorbance is proportional to concentration; colorimetry against a standard curve gives the amount in a sample.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�be6ec4c8e40b�body�٩铁比铜活泼，发生置换：Fe + CuSO4 → FeSO4 + Cu，铜析出附在铁上；宋代《梦溪笔谈》记载胆水浸铜，是世界最早的湿法炼铜之一。ټIron is more reactive than copper, displacing it: Fe + CuSO4 → FeSO4 + Cu, copper deposits on iron. The Song-era 'dan-water copper' method was among the world's earliest hydrometallurgy.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�be93c1caf001�body�ٓ钴等过渡金属能稳定地可逆脱嵌锂离子并参与氧化还原，提供高电压和较高容量，但钴贵且有供应与安全问题。٩Cobalt and similar transition metals reversibly host Li+ and undergo redox, giving high voltage and capacity—though cobalt is costly and raises supply/safety concerns.�ans��src��XTarascon, J.-M.; Armand, M. 《可充电锂电池面临的挑战》，《Nature》, 2001�wTarascon, J.-M.; Armand, M. 'Issues and Challenges Facing Rechargeable Lithium Batteries,' Nature, 2001, 414, 359–367��id�c0a35f7c95b7�body��~催化剂同等降低正、逆反应的活化能，只加快到达平衡的速度，但不改变平衡常数和最终产率。١A catalyst lowers the activation energy of both forward and reverse reactions equally—it speeds reaching equilibrium but changes neither K nor the final yield.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c6a4daddae4a�body�ٮ若直接用水吸收SO3，会剧烈放热并产生大量酸雾，难以完全吸收。用约98%的硫酸吸收可避免酸雾、吸收更彻底，再稀释得到产品酸。٪Absorbing SO3 in water releases huge heat and forms acid mist that is hard to capture. Using ~98% H2SO4 avoids misting and gives near-complete absorption before dilution.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c6d5f6458809�body�ٓ钛密度只有钢的一半多，表面极易生成致密氧化膜(TiO2)自我钝化，所以强度高又耐蚀，广泛用于航空和植入物。٦Titanium’s density is just over half of steel’s, and it self-passivates with a dense TiO2 film—strong yet corrosion-resistant, ideal for aerospace and implants.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c932612c920c�body��rS²⁻ 极化率大利于 Li⁺ 迁移，室温电导可接近液态；但遇水会放出有毒的 H₂S 气体。نLarge, polarizable S²⁻ aids Li⁺ transport, giving room-temperature conductivity near liquids; but water releases toxic H₂S gas.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c97226cf464c�body��{硫理论容量高、原料廉价；但多硫化物“穿梭”导致容量衰减，需用宿主与界面工程来抑制。ٟSulfur has high theoretical capacity and cheap feedstock, but polysulfide 'shuttling' causes capacity fade, needing host and interface engineering to suppress.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�ceb9ff803c96�body��沸石是具有规整微孔结构的铝硅酸盐，比表面积巨大且孔径均一，可均匀分散活性组分并限域反应物分子。其酸性位点本身也能催化反应，并凭借择形效应提高选择性。因此沸石广泛用于裂化、异构化等过程。�GZeolites are aluminosilicates with regular microporous structures, huge specific surface area and uniform pore sizes that disperse active species and confine reactant molecules. Their acidic sites can catalyze directly and, via shape selectivity, raise selectivity. Hence zeolites are widely used in cracking and isomerization.�ans��src��hCorma, A. 《无机固体酸及其在酸催化烃类反应中的应用》，《Chemical Reviews》, 1995�~Corma, A. 'Inorganic Solid Acids and Their Use in Acid-Catalyzed Hydrocarbon Reactions,' Chemical Reviews, 1995, 95, 559–614��id�d13239665363�body�ه开放金属位点和含氮基团对 CO₂ 有优先吸附（相比 N₂），可用温度或压力摆动再生，适合烟气分离。ٍOpen metal sites and nitrogen groups preferentially adsorb CO₂ over N₂, and the material is regenerated by temperature or pressure swing.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d45f6d663490�body�ً某些合金(如LaNi5)能与氢可逆地形成氢化物，常温常压下吸附、加热时再把氢释放出来，体积储氢密度高。ٔAlloys like LaNi5 reversibly form hydrides with hydrogen—sorbing it at ambient conditions and releasing on heating—with high volumetric density.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�d858372fc3f9�body��芳香性指环状、平面且含有4n+2个离域π电子（休克尔规则）的分子所表现出的异常稳定性。苯是最典型的芳香化合物，其π电子离域使键长均等、不易发生加成而倾向取代。芳香性显著影响其化学行为与光谱。�AAromaticity is the exceptional stability shown by cyclic, planar molecules with 4n+2 delocalized pi electrons (Hückel's rule). Benzene is the classic aromatic compound; its delocalized pi electrons equalize bond lengths and favor substitution over addition. Aromaticity strongly influences chemical behavior and spectra.�ans��src��VMcMurry, J. 《有机化学》（第9版，Cengage）芳香性与休克尔规则章节�MMcMurry, J. Organic Chemistry, 9th ed., Cengage (aromaticity; Hückel's rule)��id�d873a0f2d723�body���同位素分馏是物理化学过程中轻重同位素因质量差异而发生非均匀分配的现象。例如海水中的有孔虫壳 CaCO3 中 18O/16O 比值随形成温度改变，通过测定其偏移可反演古海温与冰期旋回。�;Isotope fractionation is the mass-dependent uneven partitioning of light and heavy isotopes during physicochemical processes. For example, the 18O/16O ratio in foraminiferal CaCO3 shells varies with the temperature of formation, so its offset is used to reconstruct past sea-surface temperatures and glacial cycles.�ans��src�٣陈骏、王鹤年《地球化学》(科学出版社) 第 8 章 ; 另见: H. C. Urey, J. Chem. Soc. 1947, 562 (The Thermodynamic Properties of Isotopic Substances)٥H. C. Urey, J. Chem. Soc. 1947, 562 (The Thermodynamic Properties of Isotopic Substances) ; see also: 陈骏、王鹤年《地球化学》(科学出版社) 第 8 章��id�da61bd50849b�body�١某些原子核在强磁场中吸收特定射频，周围电子环境不同使共振频率发生偏移(化学位移)，从而定位各类原子及连接关系。ٮCertain nuclei absorb specific radio frequencies in a strong field; differing electron environments shift the resonance (chemical shift), mapping atoms and their connections.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�dcba6fc98e8b�body�مH₂ 在阳极氧化成 H⁺，经质子膜到达阴极与 O₂ 生成水并输出电能；关键在于铂催化与膜的水管理。��H₂ oxidizes at the anode to H⁺, crosses the membrane to the cathode and combines with O₂ into water while delivering electricity; key issues are Pt catalysis and membrane water management.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�e8834209d0d9�body��催化循环描述催化剂在反应中经历一系列中间态后再生、可再次参与反应的过程。每一步通常有明确的基元反应，催化剂在循环首尾状态不变。理解催化循环有助于设计更高效的催化剂与反应路径。�#A catalytic cycle describes how a catalyst passes through a series of intermediates and is regenerated to participate again, with each step a defined elementary reaction and the catalyst unchanged from start to end. Understanding the cycle helps design more efficient catalysts and pathways.�ans��src��]Atkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）催化循环章节�dAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (catalytic cycles)��id�ea5f5098571b�body��活性中心是催化剂表面或内部能够吸附反应物并促成化学键断裂与形成的特定原子或原子团。反应物在活性中心上被活化，经历吸附、反应、脱附过程。活性中心的数量与性质决定催化剂的活性和选择性。�1An active site is a specific atom or group on a catalyst's surface or interior that adsorbs reactants and promotes bond breaking and formation. Reactants are activated there through adsorption, reaction and desorption. The number and nature of active sites determine a catalyst's activity and selectivity.�ans��src��kThomas, J. M.; Thomas, W. J. 《非均相催化的原理与实践》（Wiley-VCH）活性中心章节, 1997�oThomas, J. M.; Thomas, W. J. Principles and Practice of Heterogeneous Catalysis, Wiley-VCH, 1997 (active sites)��id�eb21446f44f0�body�ُ对PTC、PROP苦味的感知由TAS2R38基因决定，基因型不同，有人极敏感，有人尝不出，体现人类味觉的遗传差异。٥Sensitivity to PTC/PROP bitterness is set by the TAS2R38 gene; variants make some people highly sensitive and others unable to taste it—a genetic taste difference.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�ec0481f2d72e�body�ِ沸石是孔径均一的微孔晶体，只有尺寸和形状合适的分子能进入孔道反应，这叫形状选择性，炼油中极有用。ٞZeolites are crystalline microporous solids with uniform pores; only molecules of the right size/shape enter and react—shape selectivity, vital in refining.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�f2a29ec2d038�body�ك先把分子打成带电离子，再按质荷比(m/z)分开；分子离子给分子量，碎片离子则透露原子如何连接。ْMolecules are ionized and separated by mass-to-charge ratio (m/z); the molecular ion gives the mass, fragment ions reveal how atoms are connected.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�f44f76a557da�body���溶度积Ksp是难溶电解质饱和溶液中离子浓度幂之积的平衡常数，反映物质的溶解能力。当溶液中离子积大于Ksp时会产生沉淀，小于Ksp时沉淀会溶解。利用Ksp可进行沉淀分离和离子积判断。�uThe solubility product Ksp is the equilibrium constant equal to the product of ion concentrations (each to its power) in a saturated solution of a sparingly soluble electrolyte, reflecting its dissolution ability. When the ion product exceeds Ksp, a precipitate forms; below it, the precipitate dissolves. Ksp is used for precipitation separation and ion-product judgments.�ans��src��iAtkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）溶度积与沉淀平衡章节�fAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (solubility product)��id�f807409d7bfb�body�ف温度变化时合金发生可逆的马氏体相变：低温能变形，加热回到母相就恢复原形，像有记忆一样。ٌA reversible martensitic phase transition lets the alloy be deformed when cold and snap back to the original ‘parent’ shape when heated.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�ffb8fd44a341�body��纳米尺度催化剂表面原子比例剧增，暴露在外的活性位点多，比表面积大，从而显著提升活性。同时量子尺寸效应和表面配位不饱和也改变电子结构、增强吸附活化能力。但纳米颗粒易团聚失活，需要稳定分散。�iAt the nanoscale, the fraction of surface atoms surges, exposing many active sites and a huge specific surface area, markedly raising activity. Quantum-size effects and unsaturated surface coordination also alter the electronic structure and strengthen adsorption-activation. But nanoparticles tend to agglomerate and deactivate, so stable dispersion is needed.�ans��src��>Astruc, D. 编《纳米颗粒与催化》（Wiley-VCH）, 2008�=Astruc, D. (ed.) Nanoparticles and Catalysis, Wiley-VCH, 2008��id�0101e146fdbf�body��`在贝克勒尔发现铀盐放射性的基础上，居里夫妇系统测量各种矿物的放射性，发现沥青铀矿的放射性远超其中铀含量所能解释的程度，据此推断存在新的未知元素。他们用放射性本身作为示踪，经过化学分离，从数吨沥青铀矿废渣中提取出钋和镭。镭的放射性极强，衰变时放出 α、β、γ 射线，长期近距离接触会损伤 DNA 和造血系统。当时辐射的危害尚未被认识，居里夫人长期接触放射性物质，最终在1934年死于再生障碍性贫血，成为辐射工作者的先驱警示。��Building on Becquerel's discovery that uranium salts emit radiation, the Curies measured the radioactivity of many minerals and found pitchblende far more radioactive than its uranium content could explain - implying unknown elements. They then used radioactivity itself as a tracer through chemical separations, and from tonnes of pitchblende residue isolated polonium and radium. Radium is intensely radioactive, emitting alpha, beta and gamma rays that damage DNA and blood-forming tissue with prolonged proximity. Because the hazards were unknown at the time, Curie handled radioactive material for years and died of aplastic anemia in 1934 - an enduring warning to all radiation workers.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�012ba4b59aff�body�ٍ透析用半透膜，小分子毒素（如尿素）能透过，而血细胞和大分子蛋白被留下，模拟肾脏把废物滤出血液。٘Dialysis uses a semipermeable membrane: small toxins (urea) pass through while blood cells and proteins are retained, mimicking the kidney's filtration.�ans��src��ABrenner and Rector's The Kidney, 9th ed., Elsevier Saunders, 2012�ABrenner and Rector's The Kidney, 9th ed., Elsevier Saunders, 2012��id�0322ff2130d5�body���色谱利用各组分在固定相与流动相之间分配行为的差异。样品随流动相（液体或气体）流过固定相（固体吸附剂或涂在载体上的液膜），不同分子在被固定相拉住和随流动相前进之间竞争：亲和力弱的组分大部分时间随流动相走，跑得快，先流出；亲和力强的被滞留更久，后流出。各组分因迁移速度不同而逐步拉开距离，先后到达检测器，峰面积还能定量给出各组分的含量。�TChromatography exploits differences in how components distribute between a stationary phase and a mobile phase. The sample rides the mobile phase (liquid or gas) over the stationary phase (a solid adsorbent or a liquid film on a support), and each molecule competes between being held by the stationary phase and moving with the mobile phase. Components that interact weakly spend most of their time travelling and elute first; strongly held ones linger and elute later. As their migration speeds differ they spread into separate peaks at the detector, and peak areas can quantify each component.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�039b8fbe2ef1�body��零级反应中速率与反应物浓度无关（rate = k），浓度随时间线性下降，半衰期随初始浓度变化。典型实例是酶被底物饱和时的反应，或某些表面催化（如金属表面的氨分解）受活性位点数量限制。�FIn zero-order kinetics the rate is independent of reactant concentration (rate = k), so concentration falls linearly and the half-life depends on initial concentration. Examples include enzyme reactions saturated with substrate and surface-catalyzed processes (e.g., NH₃ decomposition on metal) limited by active-site count.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�0556affa690e�body��配位键是一种特殊的共价键，成键的一对电子完全由同一个原子（配体）提供，另一原子提供空轨道接受。它常见于配合物和铵离子（NH4+）中。配位键形成后与其他共价键在性质上没有本质区别。�.A coordinate bond is a special covalent bond in which both electrons of the shared pair are donated entirely by one atom (the ligand) while the other supplies an empty orbital. It is common in complexes and the ammonium ion (NH4+). Once formed, it is essentially no different from other covalent bonds.�ans��src��^Housecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》（第5版，Pearson）配位键（dative bond）章节�`Housecroft, C. E.; Sharpe, A. G. Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson (coordinate/dative bonds)��id�060adff10eb5�body��骨螺紫提取自地中海骨螺的腺体分泌物，要经过光照氧化才显色，且上万只螺才能得几克染料。它色牢度极好、不易褪色，是古罗马皇室专用的高贵紫。高昂的收集成本使它成为古代最贵的染料之一。�,Tyrian purple came from the gland secretion of Mediterranean mollusks and required sunlight oxidation to develop color; thousands of snails yielded only a few grams. Its exceptional fastness made it the royal purple of Rome. The huge gathering cost made it among the most expensive dyes of antiquity.�ans��src��nBAKER,《Tyrian purple: an ancient dye, a modern problem》,Endeavour,1974 (DOI: 10.1016/0160-9327(74)90003-9)�lBAKER, 'Tyrian purple: an ancient dye, a modern problem', Endeavour, 1974, DOI: 10.1016/0160-9327(74)90003-9��id�062de306677a�body�ٙ辛烷值表示汽油抗爆震的能力；标号越高越不易在火花前自行点燃。高压缩比发动机若用低标号油会爆震、伤引擎。٨Octane rating measures resistance to knock; higher means less likely to self-ignite before the spark. High-compression engines knock and get damaged on low-octane fuel.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�063121978e4e�body��	氟的电负性最高（鲍林标度 4.0），因为它的原子半径小、有效核电荷高，把成键电子拉向自己。真正让它「一点就着」的还有第二件事：F–F 单键只有约 159 kJ/mol，明显弱于 Cl–Cl 的约 242 kJ/mol——两个氟原子上的孤对电子互相排斥，键反而不牢。断键便宜、成键时释放的能量又极大（生成的 F⁻ 水合能与晶格能都很高），两条合力使氟几乎能与所有元素反应，连稀有气体也能被逼出氟化物。�_Fluorine has the highest electronegativity on the Pauling scale (4.0) because its small radius and high effective nuclear charge pull bonding electrons toward it. What makes it 'ignite on contact' is a second fact: the F-F single bond is only about 159 kJ/mol, clearly weaker than Cl-Cl at about 242 kJ/mol, because the lone pairs on the two fluorine atoms repel each other. Breaking the bond is cheap, and forming new bonds releases a lot (the hydration and lattice energies of F- are very high). Together these let fluorine react with nearly every element, and even force compounds out of the noble gases.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�063191c01f6d�body��泡打粉是碳酸氢钠加两种酸性盐（如焦磷酸二氢钠、磷酸铝钠等）的混合物：遇水时一部分酸先反应放出二氧化碳，加热时另一部分酸再反应继续产气。这种双重作用让面团在搅拌和烘烤两阶段都膨松。�/Baking powder mixes sodium bicarbonate with two kinds of acid salts (e.g., sodium acid pyrophosphate, sodium aluminum phosphate): one reacts with water to release CO2 during mixing, and another reacts on heating to release more during baking. This double-acting leavening lifts the dough in both stages.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�07997e3537ee�body��!在SN2反应中，亲核试剂从离去基团相反的一侧进攻中心碳，因为这样能与部分形成的键轨道最大重叠、同时把离去基团推开，形成五配位的过渡态。背面进攻导致中心碳的构型完全翻转，即瓦尔登翻转（Walden inversion）。�KIn an SN2 reaction the nucleophile attacks the central carbon from the side opposite the leaving group, because this maximizes orbital overlap for bond formation while displacing the leaving group, giving a five-coordinate transition state. Backside attack inverts the configuration at the carbon completely—the Walden inversion.�ans��src��Q邢其毅、裴坚《基础有机化学》（第四版），北京大学出版社�\Xing Qiyi & Pei Jian, 'Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry' (4th ed.), Peking University Press��id�07ec3d877b6e�body���二茂铁由两个平行环戊二烯负离子夹一个 Fe²⁺，是首个被确认的“夹心”金属有机配合物，颠覆了人们对成键的认识。Kealy 与 Pauson 1951 年合成，Wilkinson 随后阐明其结构并因此获 1973 年诺奖。�Ferrocene sandwiches an Fe²⁺ between two parallel cyclopentadienyl anions, the first confirmed 'sandwich' metallocene, overturning ideas about bonding. Kealy and Pauson synthesized it in 1951; Wilkinson clarified its structure and won the 1973 Nobel Prize.�ans��src��8Kealy 与 Pauson 1951 年论文；Wilkinson 结构研究�2Kealy & Pauson (1951); Wilkinson structure studies��id�08d44f910d31�body�ٷ键级 = (成键电子数 − 反键电子数)/2。N₂ 有 10 个价电子，其中 8 个在成键轨道、2 个在反键轨道，键级 = (8−2)/2 = 3，对应三键且极稳定。ٲBond order = (bonding − antibonding electrons)/2. N₂ has 10 valence electrons: 8 bonding and 2 antibonding, so bond order = (8−2)/2 = 3, matching a very stable triple bond.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�08e0d36b2db0�body��BPET 使用发射正电子的放射性核素（如 ¹⁸F、¹¹C）标记生物分子注入体内。正电子行进极短距离后与电子发生湮灭，产生一对方向相反的 511 keV γ 光子；符合探测这两个光子的共线事件即可重建示踪剂在体内的三维分布，反映代谢与受体活动。��PET uses positron-emitting radionuclides such as ¹⁸F or ¹¹C to label biomolecules injected into the body. The positron travels a very short distance before annihilating with an electron, producing a pair of 511 keV gamma photons emitted in opposite directions; coincidence detection of these collinear photons reconstructs the tracer's 3D distribution, reflecting metabolism and receptor activity.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�09800c44e459�body�ٱATP即三磷酸腺苷，是细胞内的直接能量载体，水解末端的磷酸键会释放能量供生命活动使用。细胞靠它统一收付能量，故称能量货币。��ATP, or adenosine triphosphate, is the cell's direct energy carrier; hydrolyzing its terminal phosphate bond releases energy for life processes. Cells use it as a common energy currency, hence the name.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�0b13e383bf08�body���化学位移 δ 反映核所处电子屏蔽程度：电负性取代基去屏蔽使 δ 增大，氢键与芳香环电流也显著位移。通过与标准物（TMS）比较 δ 值可识别官能团与分子环境。�	Chemical shift δ reflects how shielded a nucleus is: electronegative substituents deshield and increase δ, while hydrogen bonding and aromatic ring currents also shift peaks. Comparing δ to a standard (TMS) identifies functional groups and molecular environment.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�0be4e8eab508�body�ٺ泡利不相容原理指出，在一个原子中不能有两个电子拥有完全相同的四个量子数。这意味着每个原子轨道最多只能容纳两个自旋相反的电子。��The Pauli exclusion principle states that no two electrons in an atom can have the same set of four quantum numbers. This means each atomic orbital can hold at most two electrons with opposite spins.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�0c4f467b5a58�body��ATg 是高分子链段运动从冻结（玻璃态）到解冻（高弹态）的可逆转变温度，不是热力学相变而是动力学松弛。高于 Tg 材料变软富弹性，低于 Tg 硬而脆。Tg 受链柔性、侧基、交联与增塑剂调控，决定塑料的服役温度窗口（如 PVC 的 Tg 约 80 ℃）。��Tg is the reversible temperature at which polymer segmental motion unfreezes, switching from a glassy to a rubbery state; it is a kinetic relaxation rather than a true phase transition. Above Tg the material is soft and elastic, below it hard and brittle. Tg is tuned by chain flexibility, side groups, cross-linking, and plasticizers and sets the service-temperature window (e.g., PVC's Tg is about 80 ℃).�ans��src��U《高分子物理》(何曼君, 第三版) 转变章；美国化学会(ACS)高分子�9Rubinstein & Colby, Polymer Physics; Macromolecules (ACS)��id�0c99426aad99�body�ٞ低于约13°C，白锡会缓慢转变为灰锡（粉末），这是一种同素异形体转变，史称锡疫，曾被认为毁了拿破仑军的锡纽扣。ّBelow ~13 C white tin slowly converts to gray tin (powder), an allotrope transition called tin pest; legend blames it for Napoleon's tin buttons.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�0da277fd87b7�body���碳酸钙分解是吸热且熵增的反应：ΔH>0 不利，ΔS>0 有利，判断取决于 ΔG=ΔH-TΔS 的符号。常温下 TΔS 项很小，ΔG>0，反应不自发；高温时 TΔS 项增大到超过 ΔH，ΔG<0，分解才得以进行。因为 ΔH 和 ΔS 本身随温度变化不大，这类分解反应普遍具有明显的起始温度，石灰窑必须维持约900摄氏度才能连续产出生石灰。��The decomposition is endothermic and entropy-increasing: ΔH > 0 opposes it, ΔS > 0 favours it, and the balance is set by the sign of ΔG = ΔH - TΔS. At room temperature the TΔS term is small, so ΔG > 0 and nothing happens; at kiln temperatures TΔS grows until it exceeds ΔH, ΔG turns negative and decomposition proceeds. Since ΔH and ΔS barely change with temperature, such decompositions show a well-defined onset temperature, and lime kilns must be kept near 900 °C to make quicklime continuously.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�0decf9feb63f�body��JMS/MS 先在第一级质量分析器中选定母离子，经碰撞诱导解离（CID）碎裂为子离子，再在第二级中检测特征子离子，即选择-碎裂-选择的三重筛选。这种母子离子组合（MRM/SRM）极大抑制背景干扰，使复杂基质中痕量目标物也能高灵敏度、高特异性定量。��In MS/MS, a precursor ion is selected in the first analyzer, fragmented by collision-induced dissociation (CID) into product ions, and a characteristic product ion is detected in the second analyzer—a select–fragment–select triple filter. This precursor–product pairing (MRM/SRM) strongly suppresses background, allowing highly sensitive and specific quantification of trace targets in complex matrices.�ans��src��[《分析化学》(武汉大学, 第五版) 质谱章；Nature Protocols 质谱定量方法�XNature Protocols, targeted MS/MS quantification; Analytical Chemistry (ACS), MRM methods��id�0f7e08e4b658�body�ٴ加聚是含不饱和键的单体直接相连成大分子，不放出小分子，如聚乙烯。缩聚是单体间脱去水或其他小分子形成聚合物，如尼龙和聚酯。��Addition polymerization links monomers with unsaturated bonds into large molecules without releasing small molecules, as in polyethylene. Condensation polymerization joins monomers while shedding water or another small molecule, as in nylon and polyester.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�12d5dbcb4a72�body��yE2是一步双分子消除：碱同时夺取beta-氢并促使离去基团离开，两者必须处于反式共平面位置，产物是反式消除的烯烃，速率与底物和碱的浓度都成正比。E1先解离成碳正离子，再由碱夺取beta-氢，分两步经过碳正离子中间体，速率只与底物有关，常与SN1竞争，并可能发生碳正离子重排。��E2 is a one-step bimolecular elimination: the base abstracts a beta-hydrogen while the leaving group departs simultaneously, and the two must be anti-periplanar, giving anti elimination; the rate depends on both substrate and base. E1 first ionizes to a carbocation and then a base removes a beta-hydrogen, proceeding in two steps through a carbocation intermediate; its rate depends only on the substrate, it often competes with SN1, and the cation may undergo rearrangement.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�186cd7e83912�body��)半导体吸收能量大于带隙的光后，电子跃迁到导带、价带留下空穴。要分解水，导带底必须高于 H+/H2 还原电位、价带顶必须低于 O2/H2O 氧化电位，才能分别驱动产氢与产氧。能带位置与带隙宽度共同决定光催化剂的适用范围。��A semiconductor excited by light with energy above its band gap sends electrons to the conduction band and leaves holes in the valence band. For water splitting, the conduction-band edge must be more negative than the H+/H2 reduction potential and the valence-band edge more positive than the O2/H2O oxidation potential to drive H2 and O2 evolution. Band positions and gap width together define the photocatalyst's usable range.�ans��src��z《物理化学》(傅献彩) 第五版 下册 第 14 章 ; 另见: A. Fujishima & K. Honda, Nature 1972, 238, 37 (Nature)�|A. Fujishima & K. Honda, Nature 1972, 238, 37 (Nature) ; see also: 《物理化学》(傅献彩) 第五版 下册 第 14 章��id�1878af91b83d�body�ٟ姆潘巴效应指特定条件下热水可能先结冰，可能与蒸发失水、对流、溶解气体差异有关，机制仍有争议，依赖具体条件。ٸThe Mpemba effect: under some conditions hot water freezes faster, possibly via evaporation, convection, or dissolved-gas differences; the mechanism is debated and condition-dependent.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�19193ee8e119�body���永久性染发靠小分子无色前体渗入头发，再用双氧水氧化聚合成大分子有色染料并锁在发丝内。双氧水还把头发天然黑色素漂淡，好让目标色显出来。浓度越高漂色越强，但也更伤发质。�)Permanent dye uses small colorless precursors that penetrate the hair, then hydrogen peroxide oxidizes and polymerizes them into large colored molecules trapped inside the shaft. Peroxide also lightens natural melanin so the target color shows. Higher strength bleaches more but damages hair more.�ans��src��8Royal Society of Chemistry（护肤与化妆品化学）�<Royal Society of Chemistry (skincare and cosmetic chemistry)��id�195b00404c82�body�ٗ量子零点能很大，让氦原子在1大气压下无法排成晶格，故不固化，必须加压才可能成固；液氦还能呈现超流动性。٧Large quantum zero-point energy keeps helium atoms from locking into a lattice at 1 atm, so it won't solidify without pressure; liquid helium also shows superfluidity.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�1b2b0e7ebc56�body���应优先选无毒、低挥发、可生物降解、来自生物质的溶剂，并避免卤代烃与一类/二类有机溶剂。常采用水、乙醇、超临界 CO₂ 或离子液体，并以溶剂回收率与 E-因子评估整体影响。��Prefer non-toxic, low-volatility, biodegradable, biomass-derived solvents and avoid halogenated or Class 1/2 organic solvents. Water, ethanol, supercritical CO₂, or ionic liquids are favored, with recovery rate and E-factor assessing overall impact.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�1e049b9613d4�body��M逆合成分析由诺贝尔化学奖得主科里提出：从目标分子出发，通过识别官能团转化、断键和重排，反向拆解成更简单的前体，逐步简化直到得到市售的廉价原料。逆向推导出的合成路线还要正向逐一验证每步反应的可行性、区域和立体选择性以及产率。��Retrosynthetic analysis, introduced by Nobel laureate E. J. Corey, works backward from the target molecule: by recognizing functional-group interconversions, bond disconnections and rearrangements, the molecule is progressively simplified into easier precursors until cheap commercial starting materials are reached. The reverse route is then validated forward, checking each step for feasibility, regio- and stereoselectivity, and yield.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�1ecc58a97774�body���多个平衡共享同一离子时彼此牵连：例如 AgCl 沉淀可被 NH₃ 通过生成 [Ag(NH₃)₂]⁺ 而溶解，总过程由 Ksp 与稳定常数共同决定。分别单独计算会得出错误结论，必须联立求解。��When equilibria share an ion they are linked: AgCl precipitate can dissolve in NH₃ by forming [Ag(NH₃)₂]⁺, governed jointly by Ksp and the stability constant. Treating them separately gives wrong results; they must be solved together.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�203e73cc90ef�body��缓冲溶液由弱酸及其共轭碱（或弱碱及其共轭酸）组成，能抵抗少量外加酸、碱或稀释而保持pH基本不变。其原理是共轭对通过消耗加入的H+或OH-来维持平衡。人体血液就依靠碳酸-碳酸氢盐缓冲体系维持酸碱稳定。�DA buffer solution contains a weak acid and its conjugate base (or a weak base and its conjugate acid) and resists changes in pH upon adding small amounts of acid, base or dilution. The conjugate pair consumes added H+ or OH- to maintain equilibrium. Human blood relies on the carbonic acid-bicarbonate buffer to stay stable.�ans��src��cAtkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）酸碱缓冲溶液章节�dAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (buffer solutions)��id�2061c82d660d�body�ٜ北宋沈括在《梦溪笔谈》中首次使用石油一词，并记录其可燃、可制墨，预言必大行于世，比西方早认识其燃料价值。ْSong polymath Shen Kuo first used the term shiyou (petroleum) in Dream Pool Essays, noting it burns and makes ink, predicting its future ubiquity.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�207335b586b4�body���镧系元素填充 4f 电子，屏蔽差使有效核电荷持续增大，原子/离子半径从 La 到 Lu 逐渐缩小。这导致同族的 4d 与 5d 元素（如 Zr/Hf、Nb/Ta）半径相近、性质极相似，难以分离。��Filling 4f in lanthanides poorly shields, so effective nuclear charge rises and radii shrink from La to Lu. This makes 4d and 5d congener pairs (e.g., Zr/Hf, Nb/Ta) nearly identical in size and chemistry, making them hard to separate.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�20a9ff6cd382�body��;自由基带单电子、极活泼，一旦生成就会夺取别处的电子并生成新的自由基，使反应像链条一样自我延续（链传递）。引发剂（如过氧化二苯甲酰）受热或光照均裂产生初始自由基，启动这条链；没有引发剂，室温下很难自发生成自由基。��Radicals carry a single, highly reactive electron; once formed they snatch electrons from neighbors and create new radicals, letting the reaction perpetuate like a chain (chain propagation). An initiator such as benzoyl peroxide thermally or photochemically homolyzes to produce the first radicals, starting the chain—without it, radicals rarely form spontaneously at room temperature.�ans��src��OCarey & Sundberg《高等有机化学》Part A（第5版），第11章自由基�FCarey & Sundberg, "Advanced Organic Chemistry" Part A (5th ed.), Ch.11��id�212c82ab16ab�body���E-因子 = 废弃物总质量 ÷ 目标产物质量，数值越低越“绿色”。精细化工常高达 25–100，而大宗化工可低于 1，因为多步合成与纯化累积大量溶剂与副产物废物流。��E-factor = total waste mass ÷ product mass; lower is greener. Fine chemicals often reach 25–100 while bulk chemicals can be below 1, because multi-step synthesis and purification accumulate large solvent and byproduct waste streams.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�22f31c676048�body��_胶片乳剂中的卤化银（主要是溴化银）吸收光子后，一个溴离子被氧化成溴原子并释放电子，电子被银离子捕获生成银原子，形成不可见的潜影。显影液把含潜影晶体的银离子还原成金属银，把影像放大十亿倍以上；定影液溶解除去未曝光的卤化银，最终留下负像。��In film emulsion, silver halide (mainly AgBr) absorbs a photon: a bromide ion is oxidized to a bromine atom, releasing an electron that reduces an Ag+ ion to silver, forming an invisible latent image. Developer reduces silver ions in exposed crystals to metallic silver, amplifying the image by more than a billion-fold; fixer dissolves the unexposed halide, leaving a negative image.�ans��src��!《无机化学》光化学章节�LInorganic Chemistry (photochemistry); Encyclopaedia Britannica (photography)��id�240f497b5218�body���在恒温下，标准反应自由能变与平衡常数 K 满足 ΔrG° = –RT ln K。K 很大时 ΔG° 为负，平衡强烈偏向产物；K 很小则偏向反应物。这一关系把热力学（可能性）与平衡位置直接联系起来。�At constant temperature, the standard reaction free energy and equilibrium constant obey ΔrG° = –RT ln K. A large K means negative ΔG° and products strongly favored; a small K favors reactants. This links thermodynamics (feasibility) directly to equilibrium position.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�2645b592233b�body��Eyring 方程 k = (k_B T / h)·e^(−ΔG‡/RT) 把速率常数与反应物到过渡态的活化吉布斯自由能 ΔG‡ 直接挂钩。温度升高使指数项增大、速率加快；在室温附近，ΔG‡ 每升高约 5.7 kJ/mol，速率大约降低一个数量级。�MThe Eyring equation, k = (k_B T / h)·exp(−ΔG‡/RT), relates the rate constant directly to the activation Gibbs free energy ΔG‡ between reactants and the transition state. Raising temperature increases the exponential term, and at room temperature each ~5.7 kJ/mol rise in ΔG‡ slows the reaction by roughly a factor of ten.�ans��src��<Atkins & de Paula《物理化学》（第10版），第22章�9Atkins & de Paula, "Physical Chemistry" (10th ed.), Ch.22��id�2810d6a91620�body��DLVO 理论认为胶体稳定性由范德华吸引与双电层静电排斥的叠加决定，总势能曲线存在能垒阻止聚沉。加入电解质压缩双电层、降低 ζ 电势，使排斥能垒减小甚至消失，颗粒因热运动碰撞而聚沉。�]DLVO theory states colloidal stability comes from the balance of van der Waals attraction and double-layer electrostatic repulsion, with an energy barrier in the total potential preventing aggregation. Adding electrolyte compresses the double layer and lowers the zeta potential, shrinking or removing the barrier so particles collide and coagulate.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�2972a5c92b52�body��苯（C₆H₆）的六个碳原子形成平面环，六个 π 电子离域在整个环上，满足休克尔 4n+2 规则（n=1）。这种离域降低了分子能量，使苯不易发生加成而倾向于取代反应。芳香性正是这种特殊稳定性的来源。�&In benzene (C₆H₆) the six carbons form a planar ring with six π electrons delocalized over the whole ring, satisfying Hückel's 4n+2 rule (n=1). This delocalization lowers the energy, so benzene resists addition and favors substitution. Aromaticity is the source of this special stability.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�29a15c29df34�body��r酶与底物过渡态的结合亲和力远高于与基态底物或产物的结合，从而显著降低活化能。丝氨酸蛋白酶（如胰凝乳蛋白酶）通过催化三联体（Ser-His-Asp）产氧负离子洞稳定四面体中间体，并借助广义酸碱与共价催化加速肽键水解。这种多重相互作用使反应速率提升约 10⁹–10¹⁰ 倍。��Enzymes bind the transition state far more tightly than the ground-state substrate or product, thereby lowering the activation energy. Serine proteases such as chymotrypsin use a catalytic triad (Ser-His-Asp) and an oxyanion hole to stabilize the tetrahedral intermediate, combining general acid-base and covalent catalysis to speed peptide hydrolysis. These concerted interactions accelerate the reaction by roughly 10⁹–10¹⁰ fold.�ans��src��h《Nature Chemical Biology》酶学综述；A. Fersht, Structure and Mechanism in Protein Science (1999)�oA. Fersht, Structure and Mechanism in Protein Science (1999); Nature Chemical Biology, enzyme mechanism reviews��id�29ae1232ed19�body��1E2 是单步反式共平面消除，碱夺取 β-H 同时离去基离开，速率与底物和碱都有关，遵循扎伊采夫或霍夫曼规则取决于碱。E1 先离解成碳正离子再失去 β-H，速率只与底物有关，常伴重排，有利于能稳定碳正离子的叔底物与弱碱条件。�KE2 is a one-step anti-periplanar elimination where base removes β-H as the leaving group leaves, rate depends on substrate and base, and follows Zaitsev or Hofmann rules by base strength. E1 first forms a carbocation then loses β-H, rate depends only on substrate, often rearranges, and favors tertiary substrates with weak base.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�29b5dd59ebb3�body�ٱ芳香族化合物含有苯环这样特殊的稳定环状结构，其中六个碳原子由离域电子连接。苯是最简单的芳香烃，广泛用于合成染料和药物。��Aromatic compounds contain special stable ring structures like the benzene ring, where six carbon atoms are joined by delocalized electrons. Benzene is the simplest aromatic hydrocarbon and is widely used to make dyes and medicines.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�2a901f8e841c�body��在重 p 区元素（如铅、铊）中，ns² 电子对因相对论效应和较差的屏蔽而难以参与成键，倾向于保留下来，于是低价态（+2）更稳定。轻的同族元素（C、Si）相对论效应可忽略，ns² 电子正常参与成键，故以 +4 为主。�MIn heavy p-block elements such as lead, the ns² electron pair is stabilized by relativistic effects and poor shielding, so it tends to remain unshared and the lower oxidation state (+2) becomes favored. Lighter group members like C and Si show negligible relativistic effects, so their ns² electrons bond normally and +4 dominates.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe《无机化学》（第5版），第8、14章�>Housecroft & Sharpe, "Inorganic Chemistry" (5th ed.), Chs.8,14��id�2b337f75bfdd�body��加聚是单体打开双键直接串联，产物只有高分子，原子利用率百分之百，如聚乙烯、聚丙烯；缩聚则是带两个官能团的单体之间脱去小分子（如水）而连接，产物是高分子加小分子。尼龙66由己二酸与己二胺缩水成酰胺键生成，涤纶由对苯二甲酸与乙二醇酯化缩聚而成，每个连接都脱去一分子水，所以它们都是缩聚产物。由于缩聚要求单体官能团接近等摩尔且反应程度很高，工业化控制比加聚更讲究。��In addition polymerization monomers simply open their double bonds and link up, so the only product is the polymer, with 100% atom economy - as in polyethylene or polypropylene. In condensation polymerization monomers carrying two functional groups join by splitting off a small molecule such as water, so the products are the polymer plus small molecules. Nylon-66 forms amide bonds when hexanedioic acid and hexamethylenediamine condense, and polyester forms by esterifying terephthalic acid with ethylene glycol - every link releases one water molecule, so both are condensation polymers. Because condensation needs near-equal stoichiometry of the two monomers and near-complete conversion, industrial control is trickier than for addition polymerization.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�2b3e0c3548bf�body��芳香性指平面、环状、完全共轭且含有4n+2个π电子的分子所表现出的特殊稳定性。根据休克尔规则，满足“平面+环状+连续共轭+π电子数为4n+2（n=0,1,2…）”的分子具有芳香性，例如苯有6个π电子（n=1）而稳定。�EAromaticity is the special stability shown by planar, cyclic, fully conjugated molecules that contain 4n+2 π electrons. By Hückel's rule, a molecule is aromatic if it is planar, cyclic, continuously conjugated, and has a 4n+2 count of π electrons (n = 0,1,2…); benzene, with 6 π electrons (n=1), is the classic example.�ans��src��c邢其毅、裴坚《基础有机化学》（第四版），北京大学出版社；E. Hückel,1931�nXing Qiyi & Pei Jian, 'Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry' (4th ed.), Peking University Press; E. Hückel, 1931��id�2bd1ad5e8845�body���纳豆菌（枯草芽孢杆菌）发酵大豆时分泌γ-多聚谷氨酸等胞外多糖，这些大分子溶于水形成黏稠拉丝。这种黏丝有助肠道健康和挂味，是纳豆的特征。发酵温度和湿度决定黏性强弱。�)During fermentation, Bacillus subtilis secretes extracellular polysaccharides such as gamma-polyglutamic acid, and these large molecules dissolve to form the sticky strings. The slime aids gut health and carries flavor, defining natto's character. Temperature and humidity set how stringy it gets.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�2cae66987536�body���勒夏特列原理只是定性经验：系统会抵抗外加扰动。它不能给出移动量，也非严格推导；精确的移动方向与程度必须由反应商 Q 与 K 的比较及范特霍夫方程等热力学关系决定。��Le Chatelier's principle is qualitative: a system resists perturbation. It gives no magnitude and is not a rigorous derivation; the exact direction and extent come from comparing Q with K and thermodynamic relations like the van't Hoff equation.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�2e06dd6ae02d�body�٧绝大多数α粒子直穿金箔，少数大角度偏转，说明原子内部绝大部分是空旷空间，正电荷和几乎全部质量集中在极小的原子核。٥Most alpha particles passed through while a few deflected sharply, proving atoms are mostly empty space with mass and positive charge concentrated in a tiny nucleus.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�2ea9f1447b58�body��z原子核外电子在磁场中感生环流，产生屏蔽局部磁场，使不同化学环境的核共振频率发生偏移，以相对于四甲基硅烷（TMS）的 ppm 值表示即化学位移。屏蔽程度取决于核周围电子云密度与化学键的各向异性，因此 δ 值直接反映官能团类型与邻接环境。结合耦合裂分可解析完整连接关系。��Electrons around a nucleus circulate in a magnetic field and generate a local shielding field, shifting the resonance frequency of nuclei in different chemical environments; expressed in ppm relative to tetramethylsilane (TMS), this is the chemical shift. The shielding depends on electron density and bond anisotropy, so δ reflects functional groups and neighboring environments. Combined with coupling splittings, it reveals full connectivity.�ans��src��W《有机波谱学》(宁永成) 核磁共振章；IUPAC（核磁共振术语，2001）�oIUPAC Recommendations for NMR Terminology (2001); Claridge, High-Resolution NMR Techniques in Organic Chemistry��id�309dafa05046�body���导体价带与导带重叠、电阻极小；绝缘体带隙很宽、电子难以跃迁；半导体的带隙介于两者之间（硅约 1.1 eV），升温或掺杂后导电性显著增强。正是这种可调性使硅成为集成电路的基础。�(Conductors have overlapping valence and conduction bands with tiny resistance; insulators have a wide band gap that blocks electron promotion; semiconductors sit between (silicon ~1.1 eV) and conduct far better when heated or doped. This tunability makes silicon the basis of integrated circuits.�ans��src��'《材料科学基础》（胡赓祥）�0Fundamentals of Materials Science (Hu Gengxiang)��id�32b402c41ed2�body��波函数 ψ 描述微观粒子的量子态，其平方 |ψ|² 给出在空间某处找到粒子的概率密度。薛定谔方程是一个描述体系能量与波函数关系的波动方程，求解它可得到原子和分子的能级与轨道。它是现代量子化学的基础。�UThe wavefunction ψ describes a particle's quantum state; its square |ψ|² gives the probability density of finding the particle at a point. The Schrödinger equation relates a system's energy to its wavefunction, and solving it yields the energy levels and orbitals of atoms and molecules. It is the foundation of modern quantum chemistry.�ans��src��!周公度《结构化学基础》�"Structural Chemistry (Zhou Gongdu)��id�348c466a74da�body��升温总是使平衡向吸热方向移动，降温则向放热方向移动，与勒夏特列原理一致。判断需先确定正反应是吸热还是放热（由焓变ΔH符号决定）。对于放热反应，升温会使平衡常数K减小、平衡左移。�EHeating always shifts equilibrium toward the endothermic direction and cooling toward the exothermic direction, consistent with Le Chatelier's principle. First determine whether the forward reaction is endothermic or exothermic (from the sign of ΔH). For an exothermic reaction, heating lowers K and shifts equilibrium left.�ans��src�فAtkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）温度对平衡的影响（范特霍夫方程）章节يAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (temperature effect on equilibrium; van't Hoff equation)��id�34935ef0916a�body��+香水由不同挥发速度的香料组成：分子量小、易挥发的做前调（几分钟内闻到），中等做中调（heart），大分子或缓释的做后调（数小时后）。随着时间推移，易挥发成分先散尽，留下持久的底香。这是香精配方的金字塔结构。�LA perfume blends fragrant molecules of different volatility: small, volatile ones form the top note you smell in minutes, medium ones the heart, and large or slow-releasing ones the base note hours later. Over time the volatile parts evaporate first, leaving the lasting base. This is the pyramid structure of fragrance formulation.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�359bc7072029�body���有效缓冲范围约为 pKa ± 1，对应 [A⁻]/[HA] 在 0.1 至 10 之间；超出此范围某一组分过少，难以中和外加酸碱。因此选缓冲剂须使其 pKa 接近目标 pH。��The effective buffer range is roughly pKa ± 1, where [A⁻]/[HA] lies between 0.1 and 10; beyond it one component is too scarce to neutralize added acid/base. Thus a buffer is chosen so its pKa is near the target pH.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�3608afdb5eaf�body�ٛ这是Belousov-Zhabotinsky反应，溴酸盐氧化有机物过程中中间物浓度周期性振荡，使指示剂颜色来回变化，像一台化学钟。ٵThe Belousov–Zhabotinsky reaction: bromate oxidizes an organic substrate with periodic concentration oscillations, flipping an indicator's color back and forth—a chemical clock.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�36f7542a0397�body�٤铝非常活泼，只能用电解法从熔融盐中制取。每生产1吨铝约耗电13000–15000度，加上巨大的槽电流，使铝工业成为用电大户。٫Aluminum is so reactive it must be won by electrolysis of molten salt. About 13,000–15,000 kWh per tonne plus huge cell currents make it extremely electricity-intensive.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�37007dd3705e�body��_CO以直线型配位到血红素Fe2+上，结合能力比O2强两百多倍，与氧竞争同一配位位点。CO结合后还改变血红素构象，使整个血红蛋白向高亲和态转变，剩余亚基释放氧更困难。结果是氧被血红蛋白锁住、组织供氧中断，严重时可致死；治疗用高压氧舱将CO竞争置换下来。��CO coordinates linearly to the heme Fe2+ with an affinity more than 200 times that of O2, competing for the same binding site. CO binding also changes the heme conformation, shifting the whole hemoglobin toward the high-affinity state so remaining subunits release oxygen even less readily. Oxygen is thus locked up and tissues are starved, which can be fatal; hyperbaric oxygen therapy displaces CO competitively.�ans��src��"PNAS（血红蛋白构象研究）�.PNAS (hemoglobin conformation studies); Nature��id�374df50a749d�body��K螯合效应指多齿配体（如EDTA）以两个及以上配位原子同时与同一中心离子成环，形成的螯合物比相应单齿配体配合物更稳定。其主要热力学根源是熵增：一个多齿配体取代多个单齿配体，使溶液中粒子数增加、混乱度上升，从而ΔG更负、稳定性更高。��The chelate effect is the extra stability of complexes in which a polydentate ligand (such as EDTA) binds the same central ion through two or more donor atoms, forming rings. The main thermodynamic origin is an entropy gain: one polydentate ligand replaces several monodentate ones, increasing the number of particles and disorder in solution, making ΔG more negative and the complex more stable.�ans��src��E武汉大学《无机化学》（第三版），高等教育出版社�IWuhan University, 'Inorganic Chemistry' (3rd ed.), Higher Education Press��id�377d416870b2�body���钻石里每个碳都以 sp³ 杂化与四个相邻碳共价相连，键能高、方向固定，整块晶体是一张三维共价网络。要让一层原子滑过另一层就得同时切断大量这种键，网络又无易滑移的弱面，所以极难被刻划，莫氏硬度 10 由此而来；同为碳的石墨靠范德华力堆层，一推就滑。但要注意硬度只指抗划伤与抗压入，不等于韧：钻石有解理面，受击会崩口。�Every carbon in diamond is sp³-bonded to four neighbours, strong links of fixed orientation making one three-dimensional covalent network. Sliding a plane of atoms means cutting many of those bonds at once, and the network offers no weak slip plane, so it resists scratching and sits at 10 on the Mohs scale; graphite, the same element stacked by van der Waals forces, shears at a push. Hardness here means resistance to scratching and indentation, not toughness: diamond has cleavage planes and chips under a blow.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�3784e0ca3ab2�body��qDLVO 理论认为范德华吸引与双电层排斥相互竞争；加入电解质压缩双电层，就会聚沉。ٔDLVO theory balances van der Waals attraction against double-layer repulsion; adding electrolyte compresses the double layer and causes coagulation.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�37f310ba0cd4�body�ٯ侯氏联合制碱法（1943）把氨碱法与合成氨结合：用氨、二氧化碳和食盐制得纯碱，副产氯化铵作氮肥，无废液排放，打破国外垄断。��Hou Debang's combined soda process (1943) couples ammonia-soda with synthetic ammonia: NaCl + NH3 + CO2 yields Na2CO3 and byproduct NH4Cl (nitrogen fertilizer) with no waste liquor, breaking foreign monopolies.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3935b3ebbcff�body��E2 是双分子消除：碱同时夺取 β-氢、离去基团从同一碳的邻位离去，一步形成碳碳双键，反应呈反式共平面最有利。它与 SN2 竞争，常在强碱、高位阻条件下占优。扎伊采夫规则常预测主要烯烃产物。�HE2 is a bimolecular elimination where a base removes a β-hydrogen as the leaving group departs from the adjacent carbon in one step, forming a C=C double bond; anti-periplanar geometry is most favorable. It competes with SN2 and dominates under strong base and steric conditions. Zaitsev's rule often predicts the major alkene.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�3ac2c18cbc27�body�ٟ油漆常具触变性，静置时结构形成变稠，搅动破坏结构变稀（可逆）；而玉米淀粉糊是剪切增稠，越搅越稠，机制相反。ٛMany paints are thixotropic: structure rebuilds at rest (thick), shearing breaks it (thin), reversibly. Cornstarch is shear-thickening—opposite behavior.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�3d7be0fa2dd7�body��/均相催化中催化剂与反应物同处一相（常为液相），活性中心均匀、选择性高但难分离回收。多相催化中催化剂为另一相（多为固体），反应物在其表面吸附活化，易与产物分离、适合连续工业过程。两者机理都涉及降低活化能。�^In homogeneous catalysis the catalyst and reactants share one phase (often liquid), giving uniform active sites and high selectivity but difficult recovery. In heterogeneous catalysis the catalyst is a separate phase (often solid); reactants adsorb and activate on its surface, easing separation for continuous industry. Both lower activation energy.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�3f06dd898f99�body���在八面体配体场中，5 个简并 d 轨道分裂为能量较低的 t₂g（dxy、dxz、dyz）和能量较高的 eg（dx²−y²、dz²），分裂能 Δo 决定高/低自旋与配合物颜色。��In an octahedral ligand field the five degenerate d orbitals split into lower-energy t₂g (dxy, dxz, dyz) and higher-energy eg (dx²−y², dz²); the splitting energy Δo governs high/low spin and complex color.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�3fc4a5841dae�body��物理防晒剂（二氧化钛、氧化锌）像小镜子反射散射紫外线；化学防晒剂（如奥克立林）吸收紫外线并转化为热量释放。物理类温和不易致敏但偏白，化学类轻薄但个别成分可能刺激。常二者复配兼顾效果与肤感。�9Physical filters like titanium dioxide and zinc oxide reflect and scatter UV like tiny mirrors, while chemical filters like octocrylene absorb UV and release it as heat. Physical types are gentle but leave a white cast; chemical types feel light but some can irritate. They are often combined for effect and feel.�ans��src��8Royal Society of Chemistry（护肤与化妆品化学）�<Royal Society of Chemistry (skincare and cosmetic chemistry)��id�3feb4884b21a�body���凯夫拉是对位芳纶，分子链含刚性芳环并通过酰胺键（氢键）紧密堆砌成取向晶体。沿链方向的共价键和链间氢键共同承受外力，使其比强度超过钢。它广泛用于防弹衣和轮胎帘子线。�(Kevlar is a para-aramid whose chains bear rigid aromatic rings and pack into oriented crystals via amide hydrogen bonds. Covalent bonds along the chain and interchain hydrogen bonds together bear load, giving a strength-to-weight ratio above steel. It is used in bulletproof vests and tire cords.�ans��src��潘祖仁《高分子化学》�Polymer Chemistry (Pan Zuren)��id�40c00a92ab4e�body�ٖ钠把电子溶进液氨，形成被氨分子溶剂化的电子，这种溶剂化电子吸收红光，溶液显蓝，浓时转青铜色并能导电。٢Sodium releases electrons solvated by ammonia; solvated electrons absorb red light, giving a blue solution that turns bronze and conductive at high concentration.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�41e5cb017a50�body��玻尔模型假设氢原子的电子只能处在一系列分立的能级上，跃迁时吸收或发射特定频率的光子，能量差为 ΔE = hν。这解释了氢原子线状光谱的存在和里德伯公式。虽对多电子原子不完善，却是量子化的经典开端。�>The Bohr model assumes a hydrogen electron occupies only discrete energy levels and emits or absorbs photons of specific frequency on transitions, with ΔE = hν. This explains the line spectrum of hydrogen and the Rydberg formula. Though incomplete for multi-electron atoms, it was a classic step toward quantization.�ans��src��!周公度《结构化学基础》�"Structural Chemistry (Zhou Gongdu)��id�424300e71857�body�ٖ凝胶电泳中带负电的DNA在电场里向正极迁移，小的片段跑得快，大的慢，从而按长度分开，用于亲子鉴定和测序。١In gel electrophoresis, negatively charged DNA migrates toward the anode; smaller fragments move faster, separating by length for paternity tests and sequencing.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�443b06a11b49�body�ٗ白川英树（2000诺奖）发现掺杂后的聚乙炔能导电，打破了塑料必绝缘的成见，催生了柔性屏、可充电池等新材料。ٟHideki Shirakawa (2000 Nobel) found doped polyacetylene conducts electricity, overturning plastics-are-insulators and enabling flexible displays and batteries.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�445f990febe1�body���A = ε·c·l 假定单色光、稀溶液、无化学相互作用，吸光度与浓度线性。高浓度、缔合/解离、散射或偏离单色光时线性关系失效（偏离比尔定律），需稀释或换波长。�,A = ε·c·l assumes monochromatic light, dilute solution, and no chemical interactions, giving linear absorbance vs concentration. At high concentration, association/dissociation, scattering, or non-monochromatic light break linearity (Beer's law deviation), requiring dilution or wavelength change.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�47de607b5203�body���纳米材料的尺寸在1到100纳米之间，此时表面效应和量子效应变得显著，使材料表现出特殊的光、电、力学性能。它们用于催化剂、药物和涂层等领域。��Nanomaterials have dimensions between 1 and 100 nanometers, where surface and quantum effects become significant, giving special optical, electrical, and mechanical properties. They are used in catalysts, medicine, and coatings.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�4aa51e2eb4d0�body���刚进房间时，气味分子持续刺激嗅觉受体产生神经信号，大脑便“闻到”味道；但受体和神经元会对恒定强度的刺激迅速产生适应性（敏感度下降），信号减弱，大脑遂不再将其标记为“有气味”。这是感觉系统的普遍机制，帮助我们把注意力留给变化和新异的刺激。离开一会儿后受体恢复，重新进入又能闻到。��On entering a room, odor molecules stimulate olfactory receptors and the brain registers the smell; but receptors and neurons quickly adapt to a steady stimulus, lowering their sensitivity so the signal fades and the brain stops flagging it as an odor. This sensory adaptation is common across senses and lets us save attention for changes and novel cues. Step out for a while and the receptors recover, so re-entering the room you smell it again.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�4b2f93a6d70b�body�ٗABX₃ 钙钛矿光吸收强、载流子扩散长，所以效率迅速提高；但它遇水、热、光易降解，稳定性是产业化最大瓶颈。ٰABX₃ perovskites absorb strongly and have long carrier diffusion, giving rapid efficiency gains; yet they degrade with water, heat and light, so stability is the key barrier.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�4ba47f5bea40�body�ـ玻璃膜两侧氢离子浓度不同会产生电势差，配合参比电极测出电压，再按能斯特关系换算成pH值。٬A thin glass membrane develops a voltage from the H+ concentration difference across it; with a reference electrode this voltage is converted to pH via the Nernst relation.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�4e05fabccbe0�body��勒夏特列原理指出：改变条件时，平衡会向抵消这种改变的方向移动。N2+3H2 可逆生成 2NH3 是放热反应，升温会推动平衡逆向移动、降低产率，所以工业上只用约450摄氏度作为催化剂活性的折中，并不追求更高温度。而高压使气体总体积减小，平衡向生成2分子氨的方向移动，直接提高转化率，因此采用200到300个大气压。实际温度的选择是反应速率与平衡产率之间的平衡：太低反应太慢，太高催化剂易失效。��Le Chatelier's principle says a system at equilibrium shifts to counteract a change in conditions. The reaction N2 + 3H2 ⇌ 2NH3 is exothermic, so higher temperature pushes the equilibrium backward and cuts the yield; industry therefore uses about 450 °C as a compromise for catalyst activity but avoids going hotter. High pressure shrinks the total gas volume, so the equilibrium shifts toward two molecules of ammonia and raises conversion - hence pressures of 200-300 atmospheres. The temperature is really a trade-off between reaction speed and equilibrium yield: too low and the reaction crawls, too high and both yield and catalyst suffer.�ans��src��$《普通化学》（化学平衡）�(General Chemistry (chemical equilibrium)��id�4fe6c7b55fe1�body��硼烷（如乙硼烷 B2H6）中价电子总数少于形成经典二中心二电子键（2c-2e）所需的数目，因此称为缺电子化合物。它们通过三中心二电子键（3c-2e，如桥氢键）成键，其多面体结构可由韦德规则（Wade's rules）预测。�GIn boranes such as diborane (B2H6), the total number of valence electrons is insufficient to form ordinary two-center two-electron bonds, making them electron-deficient. They are stabilized by three-center two-electron bonds (3c-2e, e.g. bridging B-H-B hydrogens), and their polyhedral structures are predicted by Wade's rules.�ans��src��h武汉大学《无机化学》（第三版），高等教育出版社；K. Wade,《Chem. Commun.》,1971��Wuhan University, 'Inorganic Chemistry' (3rd ed.), Higher Education Press; K. Wade, 'The structural significance of the number of skeletal bonding electron-pairs in carboranes and boranes,' Chem. Commun., 1971��id�51379c4b02c2�body�ل钯可吸收相当于自身体积数百倍的氢气，氢以原子形式溶入钯晶格，这一性质用于氢气纯化和储存。ْPalladium absorbs hundreds of times its volume in hydrogen, with H atoms dissolving into its lattice—used for hydrogen purification and storage.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�51739eb991e1�body��杂化轨道理论把中心原子能量相近的原子轨道线性组合成数目相等、方向更利于成键的新轨道，如sp、sp2、sp3杂化。它解释了分子的几何构型与键角。杂化不改变电子总数，只重新分配空间取向。�MHybrid orbital theory linearly combines atomic orbitals of similar energy on a central atom into the same number of new orbitals better oriented for bonding, such as sp, sp2 and sp3 hybridization. It explains molecular geometry and bond angles. Hybridization keeps the total electron count and only redistributes spatial orientation.�ans��src��fBrown、LeMay、Bursten 等《化学：中心科学》（第14版，Pearson）杂化轨道理论章节�|Brown, T. L.; LeMay, H. E.; Bursten, B. E.; et al. Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson (hybrid orbital theory)��id�533a25932699�body���天然靛蓝本身不溶于水，必须先在碱性发酵液中用微生物或还原剂把它还原成可溶的无色靛白。布料浸入后氧化，靛白重新变回蓝色固着在纤维上，这就是先染后氧化的还原染色。�Natural indigo is insoluble, so it must first be reduced in an alkaline ferment by microbes or reducing agents into soluble, colorless leuco-indigo. The cloth is dipped and the leuco form oxidizes back to blue, fixing on the fiber—a dye-then-oxidize vat process.�ans��src��{Brown、LeMay、Bursten 等《化学：中心科学》（第14版，Pearson）氧化还原（氧化剂与还原剂）章节لBrown, T. L.; LeMay, H. E.; Bursten, B. E.; et al. Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson (oxidizing and reducing agents)��id�53bb9a07c736�body��手性分子是指与其镜像不能重合的分子，如同左手与右手。通常分子中存在一个连有四个不同基团的碳原子（手性中心）时即具有手性。手性分子常成对出现为对映异构体，其旋光性和生物活性可能完全不同。�=A chiral molecule is one that cannot be superimposed on its mirror image, like a left and right hand. Chirality usually arises when a carbon atom is bonded to four different groups (a chiral center). Chiral molecules commonly appear as enantiomers whose optical activity and biological behavior can differ completely.�ans��src��PMcMurry, J. 《有机化学》（第9版，Cengage）立体化学与手性章节�LMcMurry, J. Organic Chemistry, 9th ed., Cengage (stereochemistry; chirality)��id�5438896f333c�body���咖啡豆在烘焙时发生美拉德反应和焦糖化，生成数百种挥发性香气分子，如吡嗪、呋喃类。研磨打破细胞释放这些分子，热水冲泡把它们萃取到杯中。新鲜度和烘焙度都显著影响香味。�!During roasting, coffee beans undergo Maillard reactions and caramelization that create hundreds of volatile aroma molecules such as pyrazines and furans. Grinding breaks cells and releases them, and hot water extracts them into the cup. Freshness and roast level strongly shape the scent.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�543bbea08f94�body���共轭二烯（4 个π电子）与亲双烯体（2 个π电子）协同成环给出六元环，电子转移一步完成且不产生中间体，是经典的周环反应。Diels 与 Alder 在 1928 年发现并获 1950 年诺奖。��A conjugated diene (4 π electrons) and a dienophile (2 π electrons) join in one concerted step to a six-membered ring with no intermediate—a classic pericyclic reaction. Diels and Alder discovered it in 1928 (Nobel 1950).�ans��src��:Diels 与 Alder 1928 年论文；Clayden《有机化学》�0Diels & Alder (1928); Clayden, Organic Chemistry��id�546c1b0a7a6c�body�ٮ半导体的导电性介于导体和绝缘体之间，最常见的是硅和锗。通过掺入少量杂质可精确控制其导电性，是芯片和太阳能电池的基础。��Semiconductors have conductivity between that of conductors and insulators, with silicon and germanium being the most common. Adding tiny amounts of impurities precisely controls their conductivity, forming the basis of chips and solar cells.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�55c6e25401ad�body���橡胶由交联的长链高分子组成，未拉伸时分子链卷曲、可用构象数（熵）大；拉伸时被强迫拉直，构象数减少、熵下降。根据热力学，橡胶的弹性主要源于熵变而非键能：快速拉伸时熵减使内能小幅上升而发热，松手回弹则熵增、吸热而变凉。所以橡胶的弹性是“熵弹性”，与金属弹簧的“能弹性”机制相反。�:Rubber is a network of cross-linked long polymer chains. Unstretched, the chains are coiled and have many possible conformations (high entropy); stretching forces them straight, reducing the number of conformations and lowering entropy. Thermodynamically, rubber's elasticity comes mainly from this entropy change rather than bond energy: quick stretching lowers entropy, raises internal energy a bit, and warms the rubber, while releasing it lets entropy rise and the rubber cools. So rubber shows entropy elasticity, the opposite of a metal spring's energy elasticity.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�5806d3d7bcef�body�ّ用固体电解质取代易燃有机电解液，能量密度更高、不易燃，还可使用锂金属负极；难点在固-固界面阻抗大。��They replace flammable liquid electrolyte with a solid one, enabling higher energy density and non-flammability plus lithium-metal anodes; the challenge is high solid-solid interfacial resistance.�ans��src��^Janek & Zeier，《电池发展的固态未来》，《自然·能源》1卷，16141（2016）�VJanek & Zeier, 'A solid future for battery development,' Nature Energy 1, 16141 (2016)��id�594fe9be5679�body���光化学烟雾是 NOₓ 与 VOCs 在强日照下发生系列自由基链反应生成的二次污染。NO₂ 光解产生氧原子启动反应，VOCs 经 OH 自由基氧化生成过氧自由基，后者把 NO 氧化回 NO₂ 并生成臭氧与过氧乙酰硝酸酯（PAN）等氧化剂。其严重程度取决于 NOₓ/VOC 比值与光照强度，是城市夏季臭氧污染的核心。��Photochemical smog is secondary pollution formed when NOₓ and VOCs undergo radical-chain reactions under intense sunlight. NO₂ photolysis yields oxygen atoms that initiate the chain; VOCs oxidized by OH radicals form peroxy radicals that convert NO back to NO₂ while generating ozone and oxidants like peroxyacetyl nitrate (PAN). Severity depends on the NOₓ/VOC ratio and sunlight intensity and underlies summer urban ozone pollution.�ans��src��f《环境化学》(戴树桂, 第二版) 大气光化学章；Environmental Science & Technology (ACS)�WEnvironmental Science & Technology (ACS), atmospheric photochemistry; Nature Geoscience��id�5a266a84c92d�body���半满或全满的 d 亚层更稳定，使 Cr、Cu 等原子把本该进入 4s 的电子转入 3d，导致 [Ar]3d⁵4s¹ 或 [Ar]3d¹⁰4s¹ 这样的排布。Miessler 与 Tarr 在《无机化学》中列出了这些偏离。��A half- or full-filled d subshell is more stable, so atoms like Cr and Cu shift an electron from 4s into 3d, giving [Ar]3d⁵4s¹ or [Ar]3d¹⁰4s¹. Miessler and Tarr list these deviations in 'Inorganic Chemistry'.�ans��src��>Miessler 与 Tarr《无机化学》；Atkins《物理化学》�@Miessler & Tarr, Inorganic Chemistry; Atkins, Physical Chemistry��id�5b642132c5ef�body��*Wittig 反应用磷叶立德与醛/酮反应，专一地把羰基（C=O）转化为烯烃（C=C），并可精确控制双键位置。它避免了传统方法产生的位置异构副产物，是合成维生素 A、天然产物中烯键的常用手段，相关概念获 1979 年诺贝尔化学奖。�OThe Wittig reaction uses a phosphonium ylide to convert a carbonyl (C=O) into an alkene (C=C) with precise control of the double-bond position. It avoids the positional-isomer byproducts of older methods and is widely used to make alkene linkages in vitamin A and natural products; the underlying chemistry earned the 1979 Nobel Prize.�ans��src��kClayden, Greeves & Warren《有机化学》（第2版），第40章；Wittig & Schöllkopf, Chem. Ber. 1954�fClayden, Greeves & Warren, "Organic Chemistry" (2nd ed.), Ch.40; Wittig & Schöllkopf, Chem. Ber. 1954��id�5be60ca6ac79�body��	电位分析法通过测量指示电极与参比电极组成的电池电动势来测定离子活度。pH 玻璃电极对 H⁺ 敏感，其电位随 pH 线性变化，再与稳定参比电极比较得到读数。它快速、非破坏性，广泛用于现场检测。�8Potentiometry measures the electromotive force of a cell made of an indicator and a reference electrode to determine ion activity. A pH glass electrode is sensitive to H⁺, its potential varying linearly with pH, compared against a stable reference. It is fast and non-destructive, widely used in field testing.�ans��src��武汉大学《分析化学》�"Analytical Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�5e263c31cb78�body��*某些原子核（如 ¹H、¹³C）具有自旋和核磁矩，在外磁场中分裂出不同能级。射频脉冲激发后，不同化学环境的核因屏蔽效应产生不同共振频率（化学位移），并提供耦合裂分信息。NMR 因此能确定原子的连接方式和空间关系。�MSome nuclei (e.g., ¹H, ¹³C) have spin and a magnetic moment, splitting into levels in an external field. After radiofrequency excitation, nuclei in different chemical environments resonate at different frequencies (chemical shift) due to shielding and show coupling splittings. NMR thus reveals connectivity and spatial relations.�ans��src��武汉大学《分析化学》�"Analytical Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�5ff17fe2e26f�body��<血红蛋白由四个亚基组成，结合一个氧分子后会引起构象由紧张态（T态）向松弛态（R态）转变，使其余亚基更易结合氧，即正协同效应。这种协同性使氧合饱和度对氧分压呈S形（sigmoid）曲线，有利于在肺部高效摄取并在组织中释放氧气。�aHemoglobin has four subunits; binding one O2 triggers a conformational shift from the tense (T) state to the relaxed (R) state, making the remaining subunits bind oxygen more readily—positive cooperativity. This produces a sigmoidal oxygen-saturation curve versus partial pressure, enabling efficient oxygen uptake in the lungs and release in tissues.�ans��src��E王镜岩等《生物化学》（第三版），高等教育出版社�EWang Jingyan et al., 'Biochemistry' (3rd ed.), Higher Education Press��id�621f231998cc�body��4原因是镧系收缩：4f 电子对核电荷的屏蔽能力差，随原子序数增加，核对最外层电子的引力增强，离子半径缓慢而持续地缩小。镧系元素的最外层电子结构几乎相同，化学性质主要由最外层电子决定，所以它们与同一配体的反应行为差别极小，半径的微小差异又不足以造成明显的化学选择性。工业上只能利用半径差异进行成千上万次离子交换或溶剂萃取循环，才能获得高纯的单一稀土，这也是稀土精炼成本高昂的重要原因。��The cause is the lanthanide contraction: 4f electrons shield the nucleus poorly, so as atomic number rises the nucleus pulls the outer electrons harder and ionic radii shrink slowly and steadily. Because the outermost electron configurations of the lanthanides are nearly identical and chemistry is governed largely by those outer electrons, their reactions with a given ligand are almost indistinguishable, while the small radius differences cannot provide enough chemical selectivity. Industry must run thousands of ion-exchange or solvent-extraction cycles exploiting those tiny radius variations to obtain one high-purity element - a big reason refined rare earths are so expensive.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�63772f71dc62�body���CO 以其孤对电子向金属空 d 轨道提供 σ 配位（σ 给予），同时金属充满的 d 电子反馈到 CO 的空 π* 反键轨道（π 反馈）。这种协同成键稳定了低氧化态金属并削弱 C−O 键，使 ν(CO) 红移。�CO donates a lone pair into an empty metal d orbital (σ donation) while metal d electrons back-donate into CO's empty π* orbital (π back-bonding). This synergic bonding stabilizes low-oxidation-state metals and weakens the C−O bond, shifting ν(CO) to lower wavenumbers.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�64b6dd949d26�body�ٓ强酸在水中几乎完全电离，如盐酸、硫酸和硝酸。弱酸只部分电离，如醋酸和碳酸，因此相同浓度下酸性较弱。��Strong acids ionize almost completely in water, such as hydrochloric, sulfuric, and nitric acids. Weak acids only partially ionize, such as acetic and carbonic acids, so they are less acidic at the same concentration.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�6644698b9b3f�body���二者满足 ΔG° = −RT·ln K（R为气体常数、T为热力学温度），因此K = e^(−ΔG°/RT)。若ΔG° < 0则K > 1、反应在标准态下正向自发；若ΔG° > 0则K < 1、正向非自发。�#They are related by ΔG° = −RT·ln K (R the gas constant, T the absolute temperature), so K = e^(−ΔG°/RT). If ΔG° < 0 then K > 1 and the reaction is spontaneous in the forward direction under standard conditions; if ΔG° > 0 then K < 1 and the forward direction is non-spontaneous.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�6685a6375de2�body��f宇宙射线产生的大气 ¹⁴C 被生物通过碳循环固定，活着时体内 ¹⁴C/¹²C 比保持恒定；死亡后 ¹⁴C 按 5730 年半衰期衰变而不再补充。测残留 ¹⁴C 比例即可反推死亡年代，常规适用范围约 5 万年以内。局限包括需校正大气 ¹⁴C 波动、样品须含足够碳且未受现代碳污染。��Cosmic rays produce atmospheric ¹⁴C, which living organisms fix via the carbon cycle so their ¹⁴C/¹²C ratio stays constant; after death ¹⁴C decays with a 5730-year half-life and is no longer replenished. Measuring the remaining ¹⁴C fraction back-calculates the death date, typically up to about 50,000 years. Limits include calibrating atmospheric ¹⁴C fluctuations and ensuring samples contain enough carbon and no modern contamination.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�68891857387c�body���吉布斯自由能 ΔG = ΔH − TΔS 同时计入焓与熵，只有 ΔG<0 的过程在恒温恒压下才自发。看似吸热的溶解或结晶有时也能自发，正是因为熵增抵消了焓的不利。吉布斯 1876 年确立了这一判据。�Gibbs free energy ΔG = ΔH − TΔS combines enthalpy and entropy; only ΔG<0 makes a process spontaneous at constant T and P. Some endothermic dissolutions still occur because entropy gain outweighs the enthalpy penalty. Gibbs established this criterion in 1876.�ans��src�ٔJ. W. Gibbs,《On the Equilibrium of Heterogeneous Substances》, 康涅狄格艺术与科学学院院刊, 1876; Atkins & de Paula《物理化学》نJ. W. Gibbs, On the Equilibrium of Heterogeneous Substances, Trans. Conn. Acad. Arts Sci., 1876; Atkins & de Paula, Physical Chemistry��id�694fd839194d�body���正常雨水因溶有二氧化碳本就微酸（pH约5.6）。工业排放的二氧化硫、氮氧化物在空气中氧化成硫酸、硝酸，随雨落下使pH更低，形成酸雨，会腐蚀建筑和伤害植物。控制排放是治理关键。�)Even normal rain is slightly acidic (pH about 5.6) from dissolved carbon dioxide. Industrial sulfur dioxide and nitrogen oxides oxidize in air to sulfuric and nitric acids that fall with rain, lowering pH into acid rain, which corrodes buildings and harms plants. Cutting emissions is the key fix.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�6a91f5818e79�body���阿司匹林分子中，酯基由水杨酸的酚羟基被乙酸乙酰化而成，这一修饰降低了游离水杨酸对胃的刺激性并改善了药代性质；进入体内后，酯基被酯酶水解，逐步释放出水杨酸。真正不可逆抑制环氧化酶（COX）的是阿司匹林本身：它把乙酰基共价转移到COX活性中心的丝氨酸残基上，使酶永久失活，从而阻断前列腺素合成，产生退热、镇痛和抗炎作用；游离水杨酸对COX只有较弱且可逆的抑制。但前列腺素减少会削弱胃黏膜的保护层，这正是长期服用易伤胃的原因。羧基使分子呈弱酸性，能与碱成盐（如阿司匹林钠盐）改善水溶性。�qIn aspirin, the ester group forms when the phenolic hydroxyl of salicylic acid is acetylated by acetic acid; this modification reduces the stomach irritation of free salicylic acid and improves the drug's pharmacokinetics. Once ingested, esterases hydrolyse the ester and release salicylic acid gradually. It is aspirin itself that irreversibly inhibits cyclooxygenase (COX): it transfers its acetyl group covalently to a serine residue in the enzyme's active site, permanently disabling it and blocking prostaglandin synthesis, which brings antipyresis, analgesia and anti-inflammation; free salicylic acid inhibits COX only weakly and reversibly. Fewer prostaglandins, however, weaken the stomach's protective lining - the reason long-term use irritates it. The carboxyl group makes the molecule weakly acidic and lets it form water-soluble salts such as sodium acetylsalicylate.�ans��src��,Royal Society of Chemistry（阿司匹林）�$Royal Society of Chemistry (aspirin)��id�6aaf04c12ac3�body���Bednorz 与 Müller 在 1986 年发现镧钡铜氧在远高于传统极限的温度下出现零电阻，打破了 BCS 理论预期，开启高温超导研究。Tinkham 的《超导导论》系统论述了铜酸盐的奇异相图。�Bednorz and Müller found in 1986 that lanthanum barium copper oxide loses resistance far above the conventional limit, breaking BCS expectations and launching high-Tc research. Tinkham's 'Introduction to Superconductivity' surveys the cuprates' strange phase diagram.�ans��src��OBednorz 与 Müller 1986 年论文（1987 诺奖）；Tinkham《超导导论》�PBednorz & Müller (1986, Nobel 1987); Tinkham, Introduction to Superconductivity��id�6aefb3820ac0�body�٨有机磷抑制乙酰胆碱酯酶，神经递质乙酰胆碱无法被清除，在突触堆积，使肌肉持续兴奋甚至抽搐；解药常用阿托品、解磷定。٨Organophosphates inhibit acetylcholinesterase, so acetylcholine accumulates at synapses, over-stimulating muscles (convulsions); atropine and pralidoxime are antidotes.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�6b1314b9cb0f�body�� 蒸气压是液体（或固体）与其蒸气在平衡时的压强，反映物质挥发的难易，随温度升高而增大。拉乌尔定律指出，理想溶液中溶剂的蒸气压等于纯溶剂蒸气压乘以它的摩尔分数。该定律是依数性（如沸点升高）的基础。�qVapor pressure is the pressure of a vapor in equilibrium with its liquid or solid, reflecting how readily a substance evaporates; it rises with temperature. Raoult's law states that in an ideal solution the solvent's vapor pressure equals the pure solvent's vapor pressure times its mole fraction. This law underlies colligative properties like boiling-point elevation.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�6b15eeba16ed�body�١红细胞表面糖链末端糖不同：A型加N-乙酰半乳糖胺，B型加半乳糖，O型末端糖最少（只到前体）；这层糖衣决定血型抗原。پRed-cell surface glycans differ at the terminal sugar: A adds N-acetylgalactosamine, B adds galactose, O has the least (precursor only)—these sugar decorations define blood-group antigens.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�6cf938552137�body���当温度和压强超过二氧化碳的临界点（31.1摄氏度、7.38兆帕）时，CO2进入超临界态：密度接近液体，而黏度和扩散系数接近气体，溶解能力可通过温度和压强连续调节，能溶解多种非极性物质。反应或萃取后减压即可让CO2气化分离，无溶剂残留，因此广泛用于咖啡因萃取、天然产物提取和绿色清洗。��Beyond the critical point of CO2 (31.1 degrees Celsius, 7.38 MPa), the fluid becomes supercritical: density near that of a liquid while viscosity and diffusivity approach those of a gas, with solvating power tunable continuously by temperature and pressure and able to dissolve many nonpolar substances. Releasing pressure vaporizes the CO2 with no solvent residue, so it is used for caffeine decaffeination, natural-product extraction and green cleaning.�ans��src��!《无机化学》相平衡章节�DInorganic Chemistry (phase equilibrium); IUPAC (supercritical fluid)��id�6e5cc46c28ca�body���第二周期只有 2s、2p 价轨道，无可用 d 轨道且原子半径很小，导致最大配位数受限（通常 4）、形成强 pπ-pπ 多重键（如 N≡N、O=O），而第三周期同族元素可超价并偏好单键网络结构。�The second period has only 2s and 2p valence orbitals—no d orbitals and very small radius—so maximum coordination is limited (usually 4) and strong pπ-pπ multiple bonds form (N≡N, O=O), whereas third-period congeners can hypervalent and prefer single-bond networks.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�6fe4856d57ab�body���次氯酸钠在水中生成次氯酸，能氧化破坏色素分子的发色基团，使有色污渍褪色。它也能杀灭细菌和病毒。但会损伤丝绸、羊毛等蛋白质纤维，并可能使某些染料掉色。�Sodium hypochlorite forms hypochlorous acid in water, which oxidizes and destroys the chromophores—the color-bearing groups—of pigment molecules, fading stains. It also kills bacteria and viruses. But it damages protein fibers like silk and wool and can strip some dyes.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�70cbf2921be3�body��]99mTc半衰期仅约6小时，发射140千电子伏的伽马射线，穿透力适中、组织吸收少，适合SPECT相机成像；它衰变后很快变成半衰期很长、只发软β射线的99Tc，对患者的剂量负担低。99mTc由钼-99衰变产生，可标记到多种配体上靶向不同器官，用于心脏灌注显像、骨扫描等。��99mTc has a half-life of only about 6 hours and emits 140-keV gamma rays that penetrate well with little tissue absorption, ideal for SPECT imaging; after decay it quickly becomes 99Tc, which has a long half-life and emits only soft beta radiation, keeping the patient dose low. Produced from molybdenum-99 decay, 99mTc can be tagged onto many ligands to target different organs, such as cardiac perfusion imaging and bone scans.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�71a154c98fe4�body���玻尔效应指血红蛋白的氧亲和力随 pH 降低（CO₂ 升高）而下降。代谢活跃的组织产生 CO₂ 和乳酸使局部偏酸，血红蛋白构象改变、更容易把结合的氧释放给组织，从而精准匹配供氧需求。�
The Bohr effect is the decrease in hemoglobin's oxygen affinity as pH falls (and CO₂ rises). Active tissues produce CO₂ and lactic acid, lowering local pH; hemoglobin then shifts conformation and more readily releases its bound oxygen, matching supply to demand.�ans��src��DLehninger《生物化学原理》（第7版），第7章血红蛋白�7Lehninger, "Principles of Biochemistry" (7th ed.), Ch.7��id�71e9dd2a7713�body���碱性电池以氢氧化钾等强碱为电解液，而传统锌锰干电池用氯化铵等中性或弱酸电解质。碱性环境让锌负极反应更高效、内阻更低、容量和放电更优。但它不能充电，且漏液有腐蚀性碱。�bAn alkaline battery uses a strong base like potassium hydroxide as electrolyte, whereas traditional zinc-carbon cells use neutral or weakly acidic ammonium chloride. The alkaline medium lets the zinc anode react more efficiently with lower internal resistance, giving better capacity and discharge. It is not rechargeable, and leaks are corrosive alkali.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�7267259a38a3�body���半等当点时一半弱酸被中和，[HA] = [A⁻]，代入亨德森方程得 pH = pKa。该点恰为缓冲容量最大处，曲线最平坦；由此可直接在半等当点读出弱酸的 pKa。��At half-equivalence, half the weak acid is neutralized, so [HA] = [A⁻], and Henderson-Hasselbalch gives pH = pKa. This is also where buffer capacity peaks and the curve is flattest, so pKa can be read off directly at the half-equivalence point.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�73022945ae7e�body�ف地面臭氧是汽车尾气中的氮氧化物和挥发性有机物在阳光下降合成的，会刺激呼吸道、伤害植物。�nGround-level ozone forms photochemically from NOx and VOCs in sunlight and irritates lungs and damages plants.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7350d233df61�body���SN2是一步双分子反应：亲核试剂从背面进攻，离去基团从另一侧离开，构型发生翻转（瓦尔登翻转），速率与底物和亲核试剂浓度都成正比，偏爱位阻小的甲基和伯碳底物。SN1分两步：先解离生成平面形碳正离子，再被亲核试剂从两侧进攻，产物发生外消旋化，速率只与底物浓度有关，能形成稳定碳正离子的叔碳底物最易发生。极性溶剂对两者影响也不同。�RSN2 is a one-step bimolecular reaction: the nucleophile attacks from the back while the leaving group departs from the other side, inverting the configuration (Walden inversion); the rate depends on both the substrate and the nucleophile, and unhindered methyl and primary substrates react best. SN1 proceeds in two steps: dissociation to a planar carbocation, then nucleophile attack from either face, racemizing the product; the rate depends only on the substrate, and tertiary substrates that form stable carbocations react most readily. Solvent polarity affects the two differently as well.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�73f88ff7e124�body�ٲ青蒿素受热易破坏，屠呦呦受古法启发用低沸点乙醚低温萃取，保留活性，后改造出双氢青蒿素，拯救无数疟疾病人，获2015诺贝尔奖。��Artemisinin is heat-labile; Tu Youyou used low-boiling ether for low-temperature extraction (inspired by ancient texts), preserving activity, then developed dihydroartemisinin—winning the 2015 Nobel Prize.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�743c4e610791�body��z常规超导体（如铅、铌）的超导转变温度很低，只有几开尔文到20开尔文左右，必须用昂贵的液氦冷却。1986年科学家发现铜氧化物超导体后，很快研制出钇钡铜氧（YBa2Cu3O7，转变温度约92开尔文），超过液氮沸点77开尔文，只需廉价的液氮即可。零电阻意味着电流通过时不产生焦耳热、没有能量损耗，可以承载巨大的电流密度；超导体还完全排斥磁场（迈斯纳效应），从而实现磁悬浮。至今铜氧化物高温超导的机理仍在争论中，但零损耗输电和超导磁体已经开始改变技术面貌。��Conventional superconductors like lead and niobium have very low transition temperatures, only a few kelvin to about 20 K, and need expensive liquid helium. After copper-oxide superconductors were discovered in 1986, YBCO (YBa2Cu3O7, transition temperature about 92 K) quickly followed, exceeding the 77 K boiling point of liquid nitrogen, so it needs only cheap liquid nitrogen. Zero resistance means no Joule heating and no energy loss as current flows, so wires can carry enormous current densities; a superconductor also expels magnetic fields completely (the Meissner effect), enabling levitation. The mechanism of high-temperature superconductivity is still debated, yet lossless power lines and superconducting magnets are already reshaping technology.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�744d29990be3�body��熬糖时水分被熬干，糖浆达到高浓度的过饱和状态，快速冷却后形成无定形的玻璃态糖壳，所以透明、硬脆、有光泽。如果回潮吸水，糖会转成晶体变得发黏不脆。控制熬糖温度和冷却速度是关键。�/Boiling drives off water until the syrup is highly supersaturated, and quick cooling forms an amorphous glass sugar shell that is transparent, hard, crisp, and glossy. If it reabsorbs moisture the sugar recrystallizes and turns sticky and dull. Controlling boil temperature and cooling speed is the key.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�74c41a5b34ad�body��
金属受力变形主要靠晶体中的位错滑移，位错移动越容易，金属越软。纯铁的晶格非常规整，位错几乎畅通无阻；加入碳、铬等后，异种原子尺寸与铁不同，造成局部晶格畸变，像钉子一样钉住位错，使它难以运动，金属就变硬变强，这叫做固溶强化。析出的碳化物和晶粒细化还能进一步阻碍位错。但强度提升往往伴随塑性下降，所以钢需要淬火、回火等热处理，在强度与韧性之间取得平衡。�[Metals deform mainly by the sliding of dislocations through the crystal, and the easier they move the softer the metal. Pure iron has a very regular lattice where dislocations glide almost freely; adding carbon or chromium introduces atoms of different size that distort the lattice locally, acting like nails that pin dislocations and stop them moving - solid-solution strengthening. Precipitated carbides and grain refinement pile on further obstacles. But strength usually comes at the cost of ductility, so steel is heat-treated through quenching and tempering to balance strength against toughness.�ans��src��'《普通化学》（金属与合金）�%General Chemistry (metals and alloys)��id�757642418365�body��}它是波函数 ψ 的空间分布，|ψ|² 给出电子在某处出现的概率密度，并非经典的“轨道”轨迹。ٍIt is the spatial distribution of a wavefunction ψ; |ψ|² gives the probability density of finding an electron, not a classical orbit path.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�767aee7e2931�body���将固体盐的形成分解为升华、电离、解离、电子亲和及晶格形成等步骤，利用 Hess 定律：由元素生成化合物的标准焓变等于各步焓变之和，从而解出无法直接测定的晶格能。�The formation of a solid salt is broken into sublimation, ionization, dissociation, electron affinity, and lattice formation steps; Hess's law states the net formation enthalpy equals their sum, letting you solve for the otherwise unmeasurable lattice energy.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�77f21377f35a�body��E过渡金属离子的 d 轨道在配体电场作用下发生能级分裂，分裂能的大小恰好落在可见光光子能量范围。电子在分裂后的 d 轨道之间跃迁（d-d 跃迁）时吸收特定波长的可见光，剩下的光被我们看到，配合物因此呈现补色。配体不同、分裂能不同，吸收波长就不同，所以六水合铜离子呈蓝色，而四氨合铜离子呈深蓝。有些颜色还来自配体到金属的电荷转移跃迁，如高锰酸钾的紫色，血红蛋白的颜色则来自铁-卟啉体系对可见光的选择性吸收。��In the electric field of ligands, the d orbitals of a transition-metal ion split into different energies, and the splitting gap falls right in the energy range of visible light. When an electron jumps between split d orbitals (a d-d transition), it absorbs light of a specific wavelength, and we see the complementary colour of what remains. Different ligands give different splittings, hence different absorbed wavelengths - so the hexaaqua copper ion is blue while the tetraammine copper ion is deep blue. Some colours come from ligand-to-metal charge transfer, as in the purple of permanganate, and the colour of hemoglobin arises from the selective visible absorption of the iron-porphyrin system.�ans��src��$《普通化学》（配位化学）�*General Chemistry (coordination chemistry)��id�77f3927a3771�body���在 O₂ 的 MO 图中，两个最高占据轨道（π*2p）各容纳一个自旋平行电子，产生净磁矩，使其被磁场吸引。价键理论无法预测这一点，因为它只画了双键而没有未成对电子。�In O₂'s MO diagram the two highest occupied π*2p orbitals each hold one unpaired electron with parallel spins, giving a net magnetic moment that attracts it to a magnetic field. Valence bond theory fails here because it depicts only a double bond with no unpaired electrons.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�794761f9db52�body���石墨烯只有一个原子厚，碳以 sp² 杂化铺成蜂窝平面，受力时由面内共价键直接承担，不靠层间弱接合；薄到这份上裂纹与位错无处容身，强度接近本征上限而非缺陷下限。它几乎全是表面，面密度可忽略，比强度约比多数工程材料高一个数量级。但这说的是单片：宏观膜与复合材料有褶皱、滑移和界面失效，远达不到，石墨能当润滑剂也正出于此。�^Graphene is one atomic layer, carbons sp²-bonded into a honeycomb plane, so loading strains those in-plane bonds directly rather than the weak join between layers, and a layer this thin leaves no room for cracks or dislocations, putting strength near the intrinsic ceiling instead of a defect-set floor. Nearly all surface, its mass per area is negligible, giving specific strength about an order of magnitude above most engineering materials. That is one clean flake: membranes and composites fold, slip between layers and fail at interfaces, and graphite is soft enough to lubricate for the same reason.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�79a05412f3d0�body��P镧系收缩指镧系元素（57–71号）从左到右原子半径和离子半径逐渐减小的现象，原因是4f电子屏蔽效应差，有效核电荷持续增大。它使得同族的镧系后元素（如锆与铪、铌与钽）半径异常接近、性质极相似而难以分离，并导致后续过渡金属原子半径偏小。��The lanthanide contraction is the steady decrease in atomic and ionic radii across the lanthanides (elements 57–71), caused by the poor shielding of 4f electrons, which raises the effective nuclear charge. It makes post-lanthanide same-group pairs such as zirconium-hafnium and niobium-tantalum almost identical in size and very hard to separate, and leaves later transition metals with smaller-than-expected radii.�ans��src��E武汉大学《无机化学》（第三版），高等教育出版社�IWuhan University, 'Inorganic Chemistry' (3rd ed.), Higher Education Press��id�7aac46a639a8�body���铁生锈本就是电化学过程：水膜上铁溶成亚铁离子放出电子，氧气在另一头收电子，两边靠离子导电连成回路。纯水几乎不导电，盐溶进水膜送来大量离子，回路电阻骤降，无数微小原电池同时开动；氯离子还破坏表面氧化膜、与铁离子结成可溶物，让阳极不肯钝化。盐不是被吃掉的反应物，干燥的盐也不生锈，缺的是那层水膜；而铁锈疏松保水，不像铝的氧化膜能自阻后续腐蚀。��Rusting is already an electrochemical process: in a water film iron dissolves to ferrous ions and gives up electrons, oxygen takes electrons somewhere else in that film, and the two halves are closed by ion conduction. Pure water barely conducts, but dissolved salt floods the film with ions, so the circuit resistance collapses and countless microscopic galvanic cells run at once; chloride also breaks the surface oxide and forms soluble complexes with iron, keeping the anode from passivating. Salt is not a reactant being eaten up, and dry salt does not rust, what is missing is the water film; and rust is porous and holds water, so unlike aluminum's oxide it never shuts the attack down.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7be49fe45fae�body���1962年Bartlett让氙与强氧化剂六氟化铂(PtF6)反应，生成了氙—铂氟化物固体盐类化合物，证明重稀有气体并非绝对惰性；随后XeF2、XeF4等氙氟化物相继被合成；氙还用于强光灯和麻醉。�3In 1962 Bartlett reacted xenon with the strong oxidant platinum hexafluoride (PtF6), forming a solid xenon-platinum fluoride salt compound, showing heavy noble gases aren't absolutely inert; XeF2, XeF4 and other xenon fluorides were synthesized soon after; xenon is also used in bright lamps and anesthesia.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�7c090a991025�body�ٟ我们感受到的风味大部分来自嗅觉；鼻子不通时食物挥发的气味分子到不了嗅觉受体，于是只剩下甜咸酸苦等基础味觉。٣Most of flavor is actually smell; with a blocked nose, odor molecules can't reach olfactory receptors, leaving only basic tastes like sweet, salt, sour and bitter.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�7ed25ce59dab�body��d亲电取代通常分两步：亲电试剂（如硝酰阳离子NO2⁺）进攻苯环形成带正电的σ络合物（芳正离子）中间体，随后失去质子恢复芳香性。由于苯环电子云密度有限且芳香性稳定，反应需强亲电试剂或缺电子条件推动，故常常需要催化剂（如硝化中的浓硫酸）活化亲电体。��Electrophilic substitution generally proceeds in two steps: the electrophile (e.g., the nitronium ion NO2⁺) attacks the ring to form a positively charged σ-complex (arenium ion) intermediate, which then loses a proton to restore aromaticity. Because the benzene ring has limited electron density and its aromatic stabilization resists attack, a strong electrophile or catalyst (such as concentrated sulfuric acid in nitration) is needed to activate the electrophile.�ans��src��Q邢其毅、裴坚《基础有机化学》（第四版），北京大学出版社�\Xing Qiyi & Pei Jian, 'Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry' (4th ed.), Peking University Press��id�81b8e264ad13�body��h光化学烟雾的核心机制是：汽车尾气中的氮氧化物（NOx）和挥发性有机物（VOC）在强紫外光照射下发生一系列自由基链式反应。二氧化氮吸收阳光光解生成一氧化氮和活性极高的氧原子，氧原子与氧气结合成臭氧；挥发性有机物氧化产生过氧自由基，进一步把一氧化氮氧化回二氧化氮，并生成 PAN（过氧乙酰硝酸酯）、醛类等二次污染物。这些物质聚集形成淡蓝色的刺眼烟雾，因此形成需要污染源、强光照和高温三个条件，夏季晴热的机动车密集城市最容易发生。��The core mechanism is a free-radical chain driven by strong ultraviolet light. Nitrogen oxides (NOx) and volatile organic compounds (VOCs) from traffic react in a series: nitrogen dioxide photolyzes under sunlight into nitric oxide and a highly reactive oxygen atom, which combines with O2 to form ozone; VOCs oxidize into peroxy radicals that recycle NO back to NO2 and generate secondary pollutants such as PAN (peroxyacetyl nitrate) and aldehydes. The accumulating mixture forms the irritating, hazy-blue smog. Formation needs three ingredients - precursor emissions, intense sunlight and high temperature - which is why sunny, hot cities with heavy traffic suffer most.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�82caac4e19fd�body�٭中国科学家首次人工全合成了结晶牛胰岛素（51个氨基酸的蛋白质），证明生命物质可由化学方法合成，是蛋白质合成史上的突破。ٰIn 1965 Chinese scientists achieved the first total chemical synthesis of crystalline bovine insulin (a 51-amino-acid protein), proving life molecules can be made by chemistry.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�82cdd5a27763�body���电镀属于电解：把工件（如铁件）接在阴极，要镀的金属（如铜、镍）作阳极，放入含该金属离子的电解液中。通电后阳极金属溶解（M-ne- 生成 Mn+），补充溶液中消耗的金属离子；同时 Mn+ 在阴极获得电子还原沉积成金属原子，逐层析出在工件表面。控制电流密度、温度和添加剂，可以使镀层晶粒细小、结合牢固且厚度均匀。镀层既美观又能防腐蚀，是典型的金属覆盖层保护方式。�KElectroplating is electrolysis: the workpiece (say iron) is the cathode, the coating metal (copper or nickel) is the anode, and both sit in an electrolyte containing that metal's ions. On current flow the anode dissolves (M - ne⁻ → Mⁿ⁺), replenishing the ions the solution uses up, while at the cathode Mⁿ⁺ gains electrons and is reduced to metal atoms that deposit layer by layer on the workpiece. Controlling current density, temperature and additives yields fine grains, strong adhesion and uniform thickness. Besides looks, the coat shields the base metal from corrosion.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�848bed1e6c59�body�ّCFC 在平流层受紫外光分解释放 Cl·，催化循环破坏 O₃（O₃→O₂）；一个氯原子可毁掉成千上万个臭氧分子。ٖUV splits CFCs in the stratosphere, releasing Cl· that catalytically destroys O₃ (O₃→O₂); one Cl atom can wreck thousands of ozone molecules.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�852c454bbbf2�body��h惰性气体原子虽无永久偶极，但电子云的瞬时涨落会产生瞬时偶极，诱导邻近原子产生诱导偶极，两者相互吸引，这就是色散力（伦敦力）。色散力随电子数增多、极化率增大而增强，所以从氦到氙沸点逐步升高。它存在于一切分子之间，是非极性分子间唯一的吸引来源。��Although noble-gas atoms have no permanent dipole, instantaneous fluctuations of their electron clouds create transient dipoles that induce dipoles in neighbors, which attract each other - this is the dispersion (London) force. It strengthens with electron count and polarizability, so boiling points rise steadily from helium to xenon. It operates between all molecules and is the only attraction among nonpolar ones.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�854af10b80b7�body��配位数指直接与中心金属结合的配位原子数，常见为 4 和 6。配位数 6 多呈八面体（如 [Co(NH₃)₆]³⁺），配位数 4 可为四面体或平面正方形（如 [Ni(CN)₄]²⁻）。配位数由金属离子大小和配体性质决定。�6The coordination number is the count of donor atoms directly bound to the metal; 4 and 6 are common. Six-coordinate complexes are usually octahedral (e.g., [Co(NH₃)₆]³⁺), while four-coordinate ones can be tetrahedral or square planar (e.g., [Ni(CN)₄]²⁻). It depends on metal size and ligand nature.�ans��src��*《无机化学》（武汉大学等编）�!Inorganic Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�85edb06db010�body���自发性不能只看焓变（吸热还是放热），还要看熵变。冰在0摄氏度以上融化、硝酸铵在水中溶解都是吸热的，却会自发发生，因为固体变成液体或溶解后分子排列更混乱，体系熵增大，提供了驱动力。真正的判据是吉布斯自由能 ΔG=ΔH-TΔS：放热（ΔH<0）或熵增（ΔS>0）都有利于ΔG<0。吸热而能自发，靠的正是熵增那一项在常温或高温下压过了吸热的代价。�VSpontaneity is not decided by enthalpy alone - whether heat is released or absorbed - but also by entropy. Ice melting above 0 °C and ammonium nitrate dissolving in water are endothermic yet spontaneous, because a solid turning into a liquid or a salt dissolving makes the molecular arrangement more disordered, increasing entropy and supplying the driving force. The true criterion is the Gibbs free energy ΔG = ΔH - TΔS: both releasing heat (ΔH < 0) and gaining entropy (ΔS > 0) favour ΔG < 0. An endothermic process stays spontaneous when the +TΔS term outweighs the heat it must absorb.�ans��src��'《普通化学》（化学热力学）�+General Chemistry (chemical thermodynamics)��id�87dfb00b1105�body���速率常数k是速率方程中比例系数，反映反应在本征条件下的快慢，只与温度、催化剂和溶剂有关，与浓度无关。k越大反应越快。通过实验测定不同温度下的k可求取活化能。�KThe rate constant k is the proportionality coefficient in the rate law, reflecting how fast a reaction proceeds under intrinsic conditions; it depends only on temperature, catalyst and solvent, not on concentration. A larger k means a faster reaction. Measuring k at different temperatures lets one determine the activation energy.�ans��src��rAtkins 与 de Paula《物理化学》（第10版，牛津大学出版社）化学动力学（速率常数）章节�aAtkins, P. W.; de Paula, J. Physical Chemistry, 10th ed., Oxford University Press (rate constant)��id�8809dbf19e93�body��b米氏方程 v = Vmax[S]/(Km+[S]) 描述单底物酶促反应速率随底物浓度的变化。Vmax 是酶被底物饱和时的最大速率，与酶浓度成正比；Km 是反应速率达到 Vmax 一半时的底物浓度，近似反映酶对底物的亲和力（Km 越小亲和力越高）。该方程基于稳态假设，是酶动力学的基础模型。��The Michaelis–Menten equation v = Vmax[S]/(Km+[S]) describes how the rate of a single-substrate enzyme reaction varies with substrate concentration. Vmax is the maximal rate at saturation and is proportional to enzyme concentration; Km is the substrate concentration at half-maximal rate and approximates affinity (smaller Km means tighter binding). Derived under the steady-state assumption, it is the foundational model of enzyme kinetics.�ans��src��[《生物化学》(Lehninger, 第七版) 酶动力学章；美国化学会(ACS)酶学分会�lLehninger Principles of Biochemistry, 7th ed., enzyme kinetics chapter; ACS Division of Biological Chemistry��id�89655670bb5f�body��,玻璃化转变温度是高分子从硬而脆的玻璃态转变为柔软橡胶态的临界温度，此时链段运动被“解冻”。Tg决定了塑料的使用温度下限和橡胶的耐寒性——例如聚苯乙烯Tg约100℃、室温下为硬塑料，而天然橡胶Tg很低、室温呈弹性。��The glass transition temperature is the critical temperature at which a polymer changes from a hard, brittle glassy state to a soft, rubbery state as chain-segment motion 'thaws.' Tg sets the lower service-temperature limit of plastics and the cold resistance of rubbers—e.g., polystyrene (Tg ~100 ℃) is a rigid plastic at room temperature, while natural rubber has a very low Tg and is elastic at room temperature.�ans��src��H何曼君等《高分子物理》（第三版），复旦大学出版社�EHe Manjun et al., 'Polymer Physics' (3rd ed.), Fudan University Press��id�89bdc43494f6�body���温室气体的本质是分子振动能级与红外光子能量匹配，能吸收红外辐射。二氧化碳是直线型分子，它的不对称伸缩振动和弯曲振动会改变分子偶极矩，从而与红外光子强烈耦合，产生特征吸收带，其中最强者在约15微米。地球表面发出的热红外辐射峰值约在10微米，但覆盖很宽的波长区间，相当一部分落在二氧化碳的强吸收带上；被吸收后能量再向四面八方再辐射，一部分返回地面，形成保温效应。氮气和氧气是非极性双原子分子，振动不改变偶极矩，对红外辐射基本透明，这正是二氧化碳、水蒸气和甲烷等微量气体能主导温室效应的原因。�A greenhouse gas works because its molecular vibration levels match the photon energies of infrared light, so it can absorb IR. Carbon dioxide is a linear molecule whose asymmetric stretch and bending vibrations change the dipole moment, coupling strongly to IR photons in characteristic bands, the strongest near 15 μm. Thermal IR emitted by the Earth's surface peaks around 10 μm but spans a wide range, and a substantial share falls in CO2's strong absorption; the absorbed energy is re-emitted in all directions, and part returns to the ground, trapping heat. Nitrogen and oxygen are nonpolar diatomic molecules whose vibrations do not change the dipole moment, so they are nearly transparent to IR - which is why trace gases like CO2, water vapour and CH4 dominate the greenhouse effect.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8ab3d742ee6d�body��k热电材料利用塞贝克效应（温差产生电压）和帕尔帖效应（通电产生温差）实现热-电互转。其转换效率由无量纲优值 ZT = S²σT/κ 决定，其中 S 为 Seebeck 系数、σ 电导、κ 热导。提高 ZT 需同时增大电输运、抑制热导（如纳米结构化降低晶格热导），这是材料设计的核心矛盾。��Thermoelectric materials exploit the Seebeck effect (voltage from a temperature difference) and Peltier effect (temperature difference from current) for direct heat–electricity conversion. Efficiency is set by the dimensionless figure of merit ZT = S²σT/κ, where S is the Seebeck coefficient, σ the electrical conductivity, and κ the thermal conductivity. Raising ZT requires enhancing electrical transport while suppressing heat conduction (e.g., via nanostructuring), the central design trade-off.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8b2d88562cc6�body��可以说它是，但只说对一半。缝隙太窄时溶液几乎不动，氧被消耗又补不回来，缝内贫氧、缝外富氧，便成氧浓差电池：缝内作阳极溶解，缝外作阴极。加速来自自催化：金属离子在缝内堆积、水解释出氢离子，氯离子迁入平衡电荷，酸化的静止液体又让钝化膜补不回来。边界有两条：浓差不限于氧，金属离子或氢离子的浓度差同样能成电池，无氧也一样；它与点蚀机理相近，只是被几何缝隙圈在里头。�WPartly yes, but that is only half of it. In a tight crevice the solution barely moves, so oxygen is consumed faster than it can be replaced: the inside turns oxygen-poor and the outside stays oxygen-rich, forming an oxygen concentration cell in which the interior is the anode that dissolves and the exterior the cathode. The acceleration comes from autocatalysis: metal ions pile up inside, their hydrolysis releases hydrogen ions, chloride migrates in to balance the charge, and this stagnant acid solution stops the passive layer from repairing itself. Two limits worth adding: the concentration difference need not be oxygen, since differences in metal-ion or hydrogen-ion concentration make a concentration cell just as well, even without oxygen; and the mechanism is close to pitting, the difference being that geometry confines it inside a crevice.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�8b4c8d1edf2c�body�ٺ氨先在铂铑网催化剂上氧化成一氧化氮，再氧化成二氧化氮，最后溶于水生成硝酸，并副产可循环的一氧化氮。它是工业固定氮的关键路线。٪NH3 is first oxidized over a Pt–Rh gauze to NO, then to NO2, which dissolves in water to give HNO3 while recycling NO. It is the key industrial route to fixed nitrogen.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�8c1a1772fd2c�body���酸性条件下羰基先质子化，水亲核进攻形成四面体中间体再脱醇；碱性条件下氢氧根直接进攻，生成羧酸盐并使平衡彻底向右。March 的《高等有机化学》给出两种路径的详细步骤与速率规律。�Under acid the carbonyl is protonated, water attacks to a tetrahedral intermediate, then alcohol leaves; under base hydroxide attacks directly to give a carboxylate, driving the equilibrium fully right. March's 'Advanced Organic Chemistry' details both pathways and kinetics.�ans��src��JMarch《高等有机化学》；Carey 与 Sundberg《高等有机化学》�PMarch's Advanced Organic Chemistry; Carey & Sundberg, Advanced Organic Chemistry��id�8fa1883ea210�body�ل皮下血红蛋白里的铁被逐步分解，先变成蓝绿色的胆绿素，再变成黄色的胆红素，最后被身体吸收。�~Subcutaneous hemoglobin iron is broken down stepwise into blue-green biliverdin, then yellow bilirubin, before being absorbed.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�90bb89d95bea�body��P返滴定是先加入过量已知浓度的试剂与被测物反应，再用另一种标准溶液滴定剩余的试剂。当被测物难溶、反应慢或没有合适指示剂时使用，例如测定碳酸钙：先加过量盐酸将其溶解，再用标准氢氧化钠返滴剩余盐酸，实际消耗量等于加入量减去剩余量。��In back titration, an excess of a reagent of known concentration is added to react with the analyte, and the remaining reagent is then titrated with a second standard solution. It is used when the analyte is sparingly soluble, reacts slowly, or lacks a suitable indicator - for instance, calcium carbonate is dissolved in excess HCl and the leftover acid is back-titrated with standard NaOH; the amount consumed is the added amount minus the remainder.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�91742f7554f3�body���电解沉积或消耗的物质质量 m = (Q·M)/(n·F)，其中 Q 为通过电量（库仑），M 为摩尔质量，n 为电子转移数，F 为法拉第常数（96485 C/mol）。它说明产物量与电量成正比、与 n 成反比。��The mass produced or consumed is m = (Q·M)/(n·F), where Q is charge in coulombs, M molar mass, n electrons transferred, and F Faraday's constant (96485 C/mol). It shows product amount is proportional to charge and inversely proportional to n.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�91b1e6c71464�body��k稳定性顺序为：叔碳正离子大于仲碳正离子大于伯碳正离子大于甲基正离子。烷基通过给电子诱导效应和超共轭效应，把正电荷分散到相邻的C-H或C-C sigma键上，烷基越多、正电荷越分散，越稳定。与双键或苯环共轭也能显著稳定正离子，所以烯丙基和苄基碳正离子格外稳定。��Stability follows: tertiary carbocation > secondary > primary > methyl. Alkyl groups disperse the positive charge through electron-donating inductive effects and hyperconjugation with adjacent C-H or C-C sigma bonds; more alkyl groups mean more charge dispersal and greater stability. Conjugation with double bonds or a benzene ring also stabilizes the cation strongly, so allylic and benzylic carbocations are especially stable.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�92bfe3366e62�body�ى用光催化剂把 H₂O 和 CO₂ 转成 H₂ 或燃料（太阳能燃料）；难点在高效稳定催化剂与多电子转移步骤。ٛIt uses photocatalysts to turn H₂O and CO₂ into H₂ or fuels (solar fuels); the hard parts are efficient stable catalysts and multi-electron transfer.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�93c33f586e81�body��M乙烯的两个碳各用三个sp2杂化轨道，在平面内以约120度角形成C-C sigma键和C-H sigma键；每个碳剩下的一个未杂化p轨道垂直于分子平面，两个p轨道侧面重叠形成pi键。pi电子云分布在平面上下，结合较弱，容易被试剂进攻，所以烯烃容易发生亲电加成反应。��Each carbon of ethene uses three sp2 hybrids to form the C-C sigma bond and C-H sigma bonds, arranged at about 120 degrees in a plane; each carbon's remaining unhybridized p orbital stands perpendicular to the plane, and the two p orbitals overlap side-on to form the pi bond. The pi electrons sit above and below the plane, are weakly held, and are easily attacked, which is why alkenes undergo electrophilic addition.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�94ff76cc8e35�body���质谱先把样品分子电离成带电离子，再按质荷比（m/z）在电磁场中分离并检测。分子离子峰给出近似分子量，碎片离子峰反映结构信息。它与色谱联用（如 GC-MS）是复杂混合物分析的主力工具。�SMass spectrometry ionizes sample molecules into charged ions, then separates and detects them by mass-to-charge ratio (m/z) in electric and magnetic fields. The molecular ion peak gives the approximate molecular weight, and fragment peaks reveal structure. Coupled with chromatography (e.g., GC-MS), it is a workhorse for complex mixtures.�ans��src��武汉大学《分析化学》�"Analytical Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�95ffa33b3a93�body��
过渡态理论认为反应物与高能的活化络合物（过渡态）快速达成平衡，其转化为产物的速率由 k_BT/h 乘以平衡常数决定，并引入活化焓与活化熵。它比阿伦尼乌斯更细致地解释温度与结构对速率的影响。�ATransition state theory assumes reactants equilibrate rapidly with a high-energy activated complex (the transition state), whose conversion to products proceeds at k_BT/h times an equilibrium constant, introducing activation enthalpy and entropy. It explains temperature and structural effects more deeply than Arrhenius.�ans��src��^Atkins, de Paula, Keeler,《Atkins' Physical Chemistry》第11版,Oxford University Press,2018�iP. Atkins, J. de Paula and J. Keeler, Atkins' Physical Chemistry, 11th ed., Oxford University Press, 2018��id�99433d1ca4e0�body��6起爆药（叠氮化铅、雷酸汞那一类）的设计目的不是「威力大」，而是被一点点刺激就启动: 分解的活化能低，微弱的热、摩擦或撞击就足以开始反应，而反应一旦开始就自加热、并自我加速，在毫秒级把固体变成大量气体。它自己炸不了多少东西，作用是提供那个起爆脉冲，去引爆下面那层敏感度低、威力大的炸药。也正因为敏感，起爆药必须单独存放，且严禁金属摩擦——实验室里它总是以少量、湿润或封装的形式出现。�lPrimary explosives (lead azide, mercury fulminate and the like) are designed not to be powerful but to be easy to start: the activation energy for decomposition is low, so slight heat, friction or impact begins the reaction, which then self-heats and accelerates, turning solid into a large volume of gas within milliseconds. They barely detonate anything by themselves; their job is to supply the initiating pulse for the less sensitive, more powerful charge beneath. That same sensitivity is why they are stored separately, never subject to metal friction, and appear in the lab in small, damp or encapsulated amounts.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�999e4401b710�body���E = E° − (RT/nF)·lnQ 把电池电势与反应商、温度联系起来。它解释了浓度变化如何改变电极电势，并可用于计算非标准条件下的电池电压、离子浓度与 pH 依赖。�E = E° − (RT/nF)·lnQ relates cell potential to the reaction quotient and temperature. It explains how concentration changes shift electrode potentials and lets you compute cell voltage, ion concentrations, and pH dependence under non-standard conditions.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�99f119ebe84f�body��}大气 CO₂ 溶入海水生成 H₂CO₃，降低 pH 并减少 CO₃²⁻，使珊瑚与贝类更难形成 CaCO₃ 外壳。ٗAtmospheric CO₂ dissolves to form H₂CO₃, lowering pH and depleting CO₃²⁻, making it harder for corals and shellfish to build CaCO₃ shells.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9c446762085c�body��U-Pb 定年同时使用 238U→206Pb（半衰期约 44.7 亿年）和 235U→207Pb（约 7.04 亿年）两条衰变链，并用 207Pb/206Pb 比值相互校验，消除部分开放体系扰动。锆石等高铀低铅矿物封闭温度高、抗蚀变，因此可获得高精度年龄。�<U-Pb dating uses both the 238U→206Pb chain (half-life ~4.47 Ga) and the 235U→207Pb chain (~0.704 Ga) and cross-checks with the 207Pb/206Pb ratio to correct some open-system disturbances. Minerals like zircon, with high U, low initial Pb, high closure temperature and resistance to alteration, yield precise ages.�ans��src�م陈骏、王鹤年《地球化学》(科学出版社) 第 9 章 ; 另见: S. A. Bowring & T. H. Housh, Science 1995, 269, 1535 (AAAS)هS. A. Bowring & T. H. Housh, Science 1995, 269, 1535 (AAAS) ; see also: 陈骏、王鹤年《地球化学》(科学出版社) 第 9 章��id�9c6072e9dd3f�body���SN2 是一步协同过程，亲核试剂从离去基团背面进攻，伴随构型翻转；SN1 先离解成平面碳正离子，再被进攻，常导致外消旋化。Hughes 与 Ingold 在 1935 年用动力学与立体化学建立了这一分类。�SN2 is a one-step concerted attack from the backside of the leaving group, inverting configuration; SN1 first ionizes to a planar carbocation then is attacked, often giving racemization. Hughes and Ingold established this classification by kinetics and stereochemistry in 1935.�ans��src��@Hughes 与 Ingold 1935 年论文；March《高等有机化学》�:Hughes & Ingold (1935); March's Advanced Organic Chemistry��id�9cf23d4a26b0�body��T在分子轨道理论中，O₂ 的 16 个电子按能级顺序填充后，在能量较高的 π* 反键轨道上留下两个自旋平行的未成对电子。根据洪特规则，这两个电子分占两个简并的 π* 轨道且自旋相同，使分子具有净磁矩。价键理论因假设所有电子成对而无法解释这一现象。��In molecular orbital theory, O₂'s 16 electrons fill orbitals in order of energy, leaving two unpaired electrons of parallel spin in the higher-energy degenerate π* antibonding orbitals. Hund's rule places these electrons in separate π* orbitals with the same spin, giving the molecule a net magnetic moment. Valence bond theory fails to predict this because it assumes all electrons are paired.�ans��src��_《物理化学》(傅献彩, 第五版) 分子结构章；IUPAC（物理化学术语，2007）كAtkins & de Paula, Physical Chemistry, molecular orbital chapter; IUPAC (Quantities, Units and Symbols in Physical Chemistry, 2007)��id�9d3621b47b6b�body��)塔菲尔方程 η = a + b·log|j| 描述了过电位 η 与电流密度 j 的对数线性关系，反映电化学反应的动力学阻力。过电位是衡量驱动某反应偏离平衡所需额外电压的指标，越小说明催化剂活性越高，对电解水、燃料电池等至关重要。�qThe Tafel equation η = a + b·log|j| describes the logarithmic relation between overpotential η and current density j, reflecting the kinetic barrier of an electrochemical step. Overpotential measures the extra voltage needed to drive a reaction away from equilibrium; smaller overpotential means higher catalyst activity, critical for water splitting and fuel cells.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�9da18137ff1e�body��b均相催化循环一般包括配体解离、底物配位、插入/迁移以及产物解离等基元步骤，循环再生活性中心。Wilkinson 催化剂 RhCl(PPh₃)₃ 催化的烯烃氢化即依次经历膦配体解离、烯烃配位、氧化加成 H₂、迁移插入与还原消除。每个基元步骤都有确定的速率与立体化学后果。��A homogeneous catalytic cycle generally comprises elementary steps such as ligand dissociation, substrate coordination, insertion/migration, and product dissociation, regenerating the active site. In RhCl(PPh₃)₃ (Wilkinson's catalyst) hydrogenation of alkenes, these are phosphine dissociation, alkene coordination, oxidative addition of H₂, migratory insertion, and reductive elimination. Each step has a defined rate and stereochemical outcome.�ans��src��u《美国化学会志》(JACS) 催化机理研究；R. H. Crabtree, The Organometallic Chemistry of Transition Metals�dR. H. Crabtree, The Organometallic Chemistry of Transition Metals; JACS, catalytic mechanism studies��id�9dd9124b94e6�body��S导电聚合物主链为共轭 π 体系，π 电子离域形成可移动的载流子通道。本征态导电性差，经氧化（p 型）或还原（n 型）掺杂后，在能隙中引入极化子/双极化子能级并产生载流子，电导率可提升数个数量级达到金属范围。掺杂是非化学计量的电荷转移过程。��Conducting polymers have a conjugated π backbone with delocalized π electrons that form channels for mobile carriers. In the pristine state they conduct poorly; oxidative (p-type) or reductive (n-type) doping introduces polaron/bipolaron levels within the gap and creates carriers, raising conductivity by orders of magnitude into the metallic range. Doping is a non-stoichiometric charge-transfer process.�ans��src��R《Nature Materials》导电高分子综述；A. J. Heeger 等 Nobel 讲座 (2000)�ZA. J. Heeger et al., Nobel Lecture (2000) on conducting polymers; Nature Materials reviews��id�9def94e1048a�body��布朗斯特酸碱以"质子（H⁺）的给受"来定义，而路易斯酸碱以"电子对的给受"来定义：路易斯酸是电子对受体。BF₃ 中的硼有空的 p 轨道可接受电子对，所以是路易斯酸，但它本身既不能给出也不含可被给出的质子。�GBrønsted–Lowry theory defines acids and bases by proton donation and acceptance, whereas Lewis theory uses electron-pair donation and acceptance—a Lewis acid is an electron-pair acceptor. BF₃ has an empty orbital on boron that accepts an electron pair, making it a Lewis acid even though it contains no proton to donate.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9e08c6ca0f44�body��f放射性钾-40以约12.5亿年的半衰期通过电子俘获衰变成氩-40。含钾矿物（如长石、云母）结晶时会排出氩，此后氩-40在晶格中不断积累，因此密封良好的矿物中氩-40与钾-40的比值直接对应结晶年龄。该方法可测数百万年到数十亿年的岩石与火山灰，考古学中常与碳-14互补。��Radioactive potassium-40 decays to argon-40 by electron capture with a half-life of about 1.25 billion years. Potassium-bearing minerals such as feldspar and mica expel argon when they crystallize; afterwards argon-40 accumulates in the lattice, so in well-sealed minerals the argon-40 to potassium-40 ratio directly gives the crystallization age. The method dates rocks and volcanic ash from millions to billions of years old and complements carbon-14 dating in archaeology.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�a119e33374f3�body�ٮ电负性是原子在分子中吸引电子的能力，常用鲍林标度表示。它在周期表中从左到右增大、从下到上增大，氟是电负性最强的元素。��Electronegativity is an atom's ability to attract electrons in a molecule, commonly measured on the Pauling scale. It increases from left to right and from bottom to top across the periodic table, with fluorine being the most electronegative element.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�a1a3c7fd7fb5�body���银表面黑斑是硫化银，把它和铝箔一起泡在加盐和小苏打的热水中，构成原电池：铝比银活泼作负极被氧化，硫化银在正极被还原回银，黑色消失。这比打磨更保护银器，不伤表面。�MThe black on silver is silver sulfide; soaking it with aluminum foil in hot salted baking-soda water sets up a galvanic cell: aluminum, more reactive, oxidizes at the negative side while silver sulfide is reduced back to metallic silver at the positive side, removing the black. It protects the silver better than abrasive polishing.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a1b65b28b411�body���分子离子峰 M⁺· 的 m/z 近似分子质量，结合氮规则（含奇数 N 则分子量为奇数）与同位素峰（如 Cl、Br 的特征峰比）可推断分子式。碎片离子峰反映断键方式，用于解析结构。�The molecular ion peak M⁺· gives an approximate molecular mass; with the nitrogen rule (odd mass implies odd count of N) and isotope patterns (e.g., characteristic Cl/Br peak ratios) you infer a formula. Fragment ions reveal cleavage patterns for structure elucidation.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�a23ba331a89a�body��在正方形或八面体中，若两个相同配体相邻为顺式、相对为反式，则产生异构体。[Co(NH₃)₄Cl₂]⁺ 有顺式（两 Cl 相邻，具极性）与反式（两 Cl 相对）两种，性质（颜色、偶极、反应活性）不同。��In square-planar or octahedral geometries, two identical ligands can be adjacent (cis) or opposite (trans), giving isomers. [Co(NH₃)₄Cl₂]⁺ exists as cis (Cl adjacent, polar) and trans (Cl opposite) forms differing in color, dipole, and reactivity.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�a3bdd7065773�body���中心离子的d电子数和配体场共同决定几何构型。d8构型的Pt2+、Au3+以及强场下的Ni2+等常形成平面正方形，因为此时晶体场稳定化能最高，顺铂是典型代表；而大多数d0到d5离子以及弱场下的高自旋d7到d10离子（如[CoCl4]2-（d7）、Zn2+（d10））则倾向于四面体。配体体积大时也因空间排斥而偏好四面体。��The d-electron count of the central ion and the ligand field together set the geometry. d8 ions such as Pt2+ and Au3+, and Ni2+ in strong fields, often form square-planar complexes because crystal-field stabilization energy is greatest there; cisplatin is the classic example. Most d0-d5 ions, and high-spin d7-d10 ions in weak fields such as [CoCl4]2- (d7) and Zn2+ (d10), prefer tetrahedral geometry, and bulky ligands also favor tetrahedral to reduce steric repulsion.�ans��src��$《无机化学》配位化学章节�OInorganic Chemistry (coordination chemistry); IUPAC (coordination nomenclature)��id�a52e6c18bcd5�body���活性中心的三维形状、电荷与疏水口袋与特定底物精确互补，通过多重弱相互作用锁定并定向底物，使反应沿低能路径进行。Fersht 在《蛋白质科学与机制》中从物理化学量化了这种识别。�The active site's 3D shape, charge pattern and hydrophobic pockets complement a specific substrate, locking and orienting it through multiple weak interactions so the reaction follows a low-energy path. Fersht quantifies this recognition in 'Structure and Mechanism in Protein Science'.�ans��src��HLehninger《生物化学原理》；Fersht《蛋白质科学与机制》�YLehninger, Principles of Biochemistry; Fersht, Structure and Mechanism in Protein Science��id�a809d72352b0�body���骨头里的钙多以难溶的磷酸钙形式存在，加醋提供酸性环境，把部分钙转化为可溶的醋酸钙，更易进入汤里。不过溶出量有限，汤里的钙未必比牛奶高。想补钙仍应以奶制品、豆制品为主。�Bone calcium is mostly insoluble calcium phosphate; vinegar's acidity converts some into soluble calcium acetate that enters the broth. The amount is limited, though, and the soup's calcium may still fall short of milk. Dairy and soy remain better calcium sources.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a8bbdd14072f�body��G两亲分子含亲水头与疏水尾，在水中为降低疏水尾与水的不利接触，自发排列成疏水核、亲水壳的结构。浓度超过临界胶束浓度（CMC）后形成胶束，双链两亲体可进一步封闭成双层囊泡。驱动力是疏水效应与水合熵增，几何填充参数决定最终形貌。��Amphiphiles have hydrophilic heads and hydrophobic tails; to minimize unfavorable contact of the tails with water they spontaneously arrange into structures with a hydrophobic core and hydrophilic shell. Above the critical micelle concentration (CMC) they form micelles, and double-tailed amphiphiles can close into bilayer vesicles. The driving force is the hydrophobic effect and associated water entropy gain, while the packing parameter sets the final morphology.�ans��src��|Eicke,《Self-Organization of Amphiphilic Molecules: Micelles and Micro-Phases》,CHIMIA,1982 (DOI: 10.2533/chimia.1982.241)�zEicke, 'Self-Organization of Amphiphilic Molecules: Micelles and Micro-Phases', CHIMIA, 1982, DOI: 10.2533/chimia.1982.241��id�aa2aaf4858bc�body��-狄尔斯—阿尔德反应是一个[4+2]环加成反应，由共轭二烯与亲二烯体在加热条件下一步生成六元环，无需催化剂。它是协同反应，具有立体专一性（顺式加成）和区域选择性，1928年由狄尔斯和阿尔德发现并获1950年诺贝尔化学奖。�TThe Diels-Alder reaction is a [4+2] cycloaddition in which a conjugated diene and a dienophile combine in one step under heat to form a six-membered ring, with no catalyst required. It is concerted, stereospecific (cis addition), and regioselective; it was discovered by Diels and Alder in 1928 and earned the 1950 Nobel Prize in Chemistry.�ans��src��c诺贝尔奖官方网站（NobelPrize.org，1950年化学奖）；邢其毅《基础有机化学》�ONobelPrize.org (Chemistry 1950); Xing Qiyi, 'Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry'��id�abbac2baf431�body���麝香的主要香成分是麝香酮等大环酮类分子，分子量较大、挥发性低，蒸发慢。它们还能与皮肤蛋白结合缓慢释放，所以留香很久。这也是很多香水用麝香作基香的原因。��Musk's main odorants are large macrocyclic ketones like muscone, which are heavy and evaporate slowly. They also bind to skin proteins and release gradually, giving very long persistence. That is why musk is used as a base note in many perfumes.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�abebb47777c6�body��{相传他梦见一条咬住自己尾巴的蛇，由此联想到六个碳原子连成环状，提出了苯的环状结构。�}Legend says he dreamt of a snake biting its tail, inspiring the idea of six carbons linked in a ring—the benzene structure.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�ac1f9be1be43�body���沸石是结晶硅铝酸盐，孔径仅零点几纳米，与有机分子直径同量级，且全晶体尺寸一致。分子要么进得来要么进不来；孔腔限制哪种过渡态容得下，出来的只剩跑得动的异构体，即反应物、过渡态、产物三重择形。铝替硅留负电荷，由可交换阳离子平衡，配质子便是强酸位，催化与择形同在此孔。别把择形算给比表面积：无定形硅铝酸盐面积同样大却不挑分子。��Zeolites are crystalline aluminosilicates whose pores measure only a few tenths of a nanometer, about the diameter of an organic molecule, and that size stays uniform throughout the crystal. A molecule either fits in or it does not; the cavities limit which transition states can be accommodated, and only the isomers that can diffuse out survive - reactant, transition-state and product selectivity. Substituting aluminium for silicon leaves negative charge, balanced by exchangeable cations, which becomes a strong acid site once it carries a proton, so catalysis and shape-selection share the same pore. Selectivity should not be credited to surface area: amorphous aluminosilicates offer the same area yet pick no molecules.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�ac7564e2263e�body��o酶催化必须先生成酶-底物复合物 ES：E+S 可逆生成 ES，ES 再生成 E+P，反应速率取决于 ES 的浓度。底物浓度低时，ES 浓度与[S]成正比，速率随底物线性上升；底物浓度高时，几乎所有酶分子都被底物占据，ES 达到饱和，速率逼近最大值 Vmax，不再随[S]增加。这一关系用米氏方程描述：v=Vmax[S]/(Km+[S])，其中 Km 是速率达到一半 Vmax 时的底物浓度，反映酶对底物的亲和力，Km 越小亲和力越大。许多药物就是通过占据活性中心、使 Km 增大而 Vmax 不变（竞争性抑制）来起作用的。��Enzyme catalysis must first form the enzyme-substrate complex ES: E + S ⇌ ES → E + P, and the rate depends on how much ES exists. At low substrate, ES grows linearly with [S] and so does the rate; at high substrate nearly every enzyme molecule is occupied, ES saturates, and the rate approaches its maximum Vmax no matter how much more substrate you add. This relationship is the Michaelis-Menten equation, v = Vmax[S]/(Km + [S]), where Km is the substrate concentration giving half of Vmax and reflects the enzyme's affinity for its substrate (smaller Km, tighter binding). Many drugs work by occupying the active site as competitive inhibitors, raising the apparent Km while leaving Vmax unchanged.�ans��src��-《普通化学》（酶促反应动力学）�#General Chemistry (enzyme kinetics)��id�acf3a010cbb8�body�ٙ原子半径在同一周期从左到右减小，因为核电荷增多把电子拉得更紧。在同一族从上到下增大，因为电子层数增加。ٳAtomic radius decreases from left to right across a period because greater nuclear charge pulls electrons closer. It increases down a group because more electron shells are added.�ans��src��bSam Kean,《The Disappearing Spoon》Little, Brown,2010;中译《元素的盛宴》接力出版社�XS. Kean, The Disappearing Spoon, Little Brown, 2010; Chinese ed. Jielie Publishing House��id�ae0a3dff8a7f�body��维生素C能抑制酪氨酸酶活性，减少黑色素生成，还能把已形成的黑色素还原、淡化色斑。它也是抗氧化剂，能对抗紫外线和污染造成的自由基损伤。但本身不稳定易氧化，常做成衍生物或避光包装。�Vitamin C inhibits tyrosinase, cutting melanin production, and also reduces existing melanin to fade spots. As an antioxidant it counters free-radical damage from UV and pollution. But it is unstable and oxidizes easily, so it is often used as a derivative or in opaque packaging.�ans��src��8Royal Society of Chemistry（护肤与化妆品化学）�<Royal Society of Chemistry (skincare and cosmetic chemistry)��id�aebc3d3f15b4�body��&标准生成焓（ΔfH°）是在标准状态（通常 100 kPa、指定温度）下，由最稳定单质生成 1 摩尔化合物时的焓变。稳定单质的生成焓定义为零。利用各物质的标准生成焓可计算反应的焓变：ΔrH° = ΣΔfH°(产物) – ΣΔfH°(反应物)。�;Standard enthalpy of formation (ΔfH°) is the enthalpy change when one mole of a compound forms from its most stable elements in their standard states (usually 100 kPa at a specified temperature). The most stable elements are assigned zero. Reaction enthalpy is ΔrH° = ΣΔfH°(products) – ΣΔfH°(reactants).�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�b019a0c996f4�body���满足休克尔 4n+2 规则的环状共轭π电子体系具有离域的闭环电子，能量显著低于定域结构，因而稳定且不易加成。Hückel 在 1931 年用量子化学预言了这种特殊稳定性。�A cyclic conjugated π system obeying Hückel's 4n+2 rule has delocalized loop electrons whose energy is markedly lower than a localized structure, making it stable and resistant to addition. Hückel predicted this special stability quantum-chemically in 1931.�ans��src��2Hückel 1931 年论文；Clayden《有机化学》�*Hückel (1931); Clayden, Organic Chemistry��id�b6e299f22cd2�body���这由蛋白质折叠的能量学决定。疏水氨基酸残基倾向于包埋进内部以避开水分，亲水残基暴露在表面；主链肽键之间形成氢键，侧链之间的离子键和二硫键进一步锁定构象。这些相互作用共同使折叠后的自由能最小化，而氨基酸序列正是这些相互作用的唯一来源，因此一级结构决定三维结构，这就是 Anfinsen 定律（1972年诺贝尔化学奖）。不过折叠通常需要分子伴侣帮助绕开错误折叠的能垒陷阱；折叠一旦异常，会形成聚集体和淀粉样纤维，与阿尔茨海默病、帕金森病等神经退行性疾病有关。��The energetics decide it. Hydrophobic residues pack into the core to escape water while hydrophilic ones stay on the surface; backbone peptide groups hydrogen-bond, and side-chain ionic bonds and disulfide bonds lock the conformation further. Together these interactions minimize the free energy of the folded state, and the amino-acid sequence is their only source - so sequence dictates structure, the Anfinsen principle (Nobel Prize in Chemistry, 1972). Folding usually needs molecular chaperones to dodge the energy traps of misfolding; when it goes wrong, aggregates and amyloid fibrils form, linked to neurodegenerative diseases such as Alzheimer's and Parkinson's.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b8608a0d7320�body��:八面体配体从六个方向靠近中心金属，使直接指向配体的 dz2、dx2-y2 轨道能量升高（eg），而夹在轴间的 dxy、dxz、dyz 能量较低（t2g），形成分裂能 Δo。当可见光中能量与 Δo 匹配的光子被吸收，电子从 t2g 跃迁到 eg，配合物便呈现其补色。�FIn an octahedral field the ligands approach along the axes, raising the energy of the dz2 and dx2-y2 orbitals (eg) while the inter-axial dxy, dxz, dyz lie lower (t2g), giving the splitting energy Δo. A visible photon whose energy matches Δo promotes an electron from t2g to eg, and the complex shows the complementary color.�ans��src�ف《无机化学》(武汉大学) 第三版 第 10 章 ; 另见: H. Bethe, Ann. Phys. 1929, 3, 133 (Termaufspaltung in Kristallen)كH. Bethe, Ann. Phys. 1929, 3, 133 (Termaufspaltung in Kristallen) ; see also: 《无机化学》(武汉大学) 第三版 第 10 章��id�ba446138af80�body��金属的导带已充满可动电子，升温只加剧晶格振动（散射），使电阻增大、导电性下降。半导体在接近绝对零度时价带满、导带空，升温把电子激发越过禁带进入导带，载流子数量指数增加，导电性随之增强。�GMetals already have a filled band of mobile electrons, so heating mainly increases lattice scattering, raising resistance and lowering conductivity. A semiconductor's valence band is full and conduction band empty near 0 K; heating excites electrons across the band gap, exponentially increasing carriers and thus conductivity.�ans��src��HAtkins & de Paula《物理化学》（第10版），第21章固体电子�9Atkins & de Paula, "Physical Chemistry" (10th ed.), Ch.21��id�bbe3dbbdf6b3�body��N目前主流的"形状理论"认为：气味分子必须契合嗅觉受体特定的结合口袋，形状、大小和官能团共同决定信号。同一种气味（如麝香）可由结构迥异的分子产生，只要它们的空间轮廓匹配同类受体；近年也有"振动理论"尝试用分子振动解释，但仍有争议。�~The prevailing "shape theory" holds that an odorant must fit a specific olfactory receptor pocket, with shape, size, and functional groups together determining the signal. The same smell (e.g., musky) can come from structurally diverse molecules if their spatial contours match the same receptor class; a competing "vibrational theory" invoking molecular vibrations remains debated.�ans��src��JBushdid 等, "Science" 2014, 343, 1370（人类可辨气味数量研究）�iBushdid et al., "Humans can discriminate more than 1 trillion olfactory stimuli," Science 2014, 343, 1370��id�bc0a007715e8�body�٫镧系元素化学性质极相似（镧系收缩），传统方法分离很差；徐光宪创立串级萃取理论，实现高效分离，奠定中国稀土产业基础。��Lanthanides are chemically near-identical (lanthanide contraction), hard to separate; Xu Guangxian's cascade-extraction theory enabled efficient separation, underpinning China's rare-earth industry.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�bc2845191423�body��p重核（如 ²³⁵U）吸收中子裂变为两个中等质量碎片，由于中等核每个核子平均结合能更高，质量亏损按 E=mc² 转化为巨大能量。裂变同时放出 2–3 个中子，若其中至少一个引发新的裂变并使增殖系数 k ≥ 1，链式反应即可自持。临界质量与几何、反射层共同决定能否达到临界。��A heavy nucleus such as ²³⁵U captures a neutron and splits into two medium-mass fragments; because medium nuclei have higher binding energy per nucleon, the mass defect converts to huge energy via E=mc². Fission also emits 2–3 neutrons, and if at least one induces another fission so the multiplication factor k ≥ 1, the chain reaction sustains itself. Critical mass and geometry, with reflectors, determine whether criticality is reached.�ans��src��M《原子核物理》(卢希庭)；国际原子能机构(IAEA)核技术报告�DIAEA nuclear technology reports; Krane, Introductory Nuclear Physics��id�bc3bfad5b980�body�ٟ哈伯法在铁基催化剂作用下，把氮气和氢气合成氨，是化肥工业的基础。该反应需要高温高压，催化剂显著降低活化能。��The Haber process uses an iron-based catalyst to synthesize ammonia from nitrogen and hydrogen, forming the basis of the fertilizer industry. It needs high temperature and pressure, and the catalyst greatly lowers the activation energy.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�bc4ce990a302�body���洗衣液是高浓度液体表面活性剂，在硬水和冷水中依然稳定、起泡少、易漂洗。肥皂在硬水中易与钙镁形成不溶皂垢，附着在衣物上发灰。洗衣液还常含酶，能分解蛋白、淀粉污渍。�+Laundry liquid is a concentrated surfactant that stays stable and low-sudsing in hard or cold water and rinses easily. Soap forms insoluble scum with calcium and magnesium in hard water, leaving a gray film on clothes. Detergents also often contain enzymes that break down protein and starch stains.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�be10ea72d67d�body��9HF分子间能形成相当强的F-H...F氢键，液态HF中还存在链状的氢键网络，打断这些氢键需要大量能量，所以其沸点约19.5摄氏度，反常地高。HCl分子间只有色散力，分子量虽更大，沸点却仅约零下85摄氏度。氢键使HF成为卤化氢中沸点最高者。��HF molecules form quite strong F-H...F hydrogen bonds, and liquid HF has chain-like hydrogen-bonded networks; breaking them requires substantial energy, so HF boils at about 19.5 degrees Celsius, anomalously high. HCl molecules interact only through dispersion forces, so despite a larger molar mass it boils at about -85 degrees Celsius. Hydrogen bonding makes HF the highest-boiling hydrogen halide.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c0f3d28251a8�body���丁香富含丁香酚，它能作用于牙齿神经的痛觉通道产生局部麻醉感，并有一定抗菌作用。牙医用丁香油临时安抚蛀牙疼痛正是这个原理。但它是刺激性精油，不可内服过量。�Cloves are rich in eugenol, which acts on pain channels in dental nerves to give local numbing and also has antimicrobial effects. Dentists use clove oil to soothe a decayed tooth temporarily for this reason. But it is an irritant essential oil and must not be ingested in excess.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c1372199758a�body��护肤品的水和营养成分是微生物的温床，不加防腐剂容易长菌变质、引发皮肤感染。防腐剂抑制细菌真菌繁殖，保证产品在保质期内安全。合理用量下对大多数人安全，敏感肌可选无防腐或精简配方。�0The water and nutrients in skincare are a haven for microbes, so without preservatives products spoil and can infect skin. Preservatives curb bacteria and fungi to keep them safe through shelf life. At proper levels they are safe for most; sensitive skin can choose preservative-free or minimal formulas.�ans��src��8Royal Society of Chemistry（护肤与化妆品化学）�<Royal Society of Chemistry (skincare and cosmetic chemistry)��id�c28772366aff�body��@薛定谔方程是量子力学的核心方程，描述微观粒子波函数随空间与时间的演化。求解氢原子定态薛定谔方程得到一系列本征函数和本征值，分别对应原子轨道及其能量（能级）。这些轨道的量子数 n、l、m 规定了电子的壳层、形状和空间取向。��The Schrödinger equation is the central equation of quantum mechanics, describing how a particle's wavefunction evolves in space and time. Solving its time-independent form for the hydrogen atom yields eigenfunctions and eigenvalues that correspond to atomic orbitals and their energy levels. The quantum numbers n, l, and m define the shell, shape, and spatial orientation of each orbital.�ans��src��e《物理化学》(傅献彩, 第五版) 量子力学基础章；IUPAC（物理化学术语，2007）مAtkins & de Paula, Physical Chemistry, quantum foundations chapter; IUPAC (Quantities, Units and Symbols in Physical Chemistry, 2007)��id�c3acd5faf206�body��xAl₂O₃ 太稳定、碳还原不经济；Hall-Héroult 法用熔融冰晶石电解氧化铝得铝，因此极耗电。ٗAl₂O₃ is too stable for economical carbon reduction; the Hall-Héroult process electrolyzes alumina in molten cryolite, so it is very power-hungry.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�c53d416b7e97�body���在量子力学中，电子没有确定轨道，而是以概率分布出现在核外空间，称为电子云。原子轨道是描述电子出现概率的数学函数，按形状分为s、p、d、f等类型。�In quantum mechanics, electrons do not follow fixed paths but appear in space around the nucleus as probability distributions called electron clouds. Atomic orbitals are mathematical functions describing these probabilities and are classified by shape as s, p, d, and f types.�ans��src��[大连理工大学无机化学教研室 编,《无机化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�oDalian University of Technology Inorganic Chemistry Group, Inorganic Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�c621ac470863�body��配合物可有几何异构（如顺式/反式二氯二氨合铂）和旋光异构（手性配合物），还有电离异构、水合异构等。顺铂与反铂因结构不同药效迥异，说明构型对性质影响巨大。立体化学在配合物中同样重要。�4Complexes show geometric isomerism (e.g., cis/trans-dichlorodiammineplatinum) and optical isomerism (chiral complexes), plus ionization and hydration isomers. Cisplatin and transplatin differ sharply in efficacy, showing how configuration matters. Stereochemistry is as important in complexes as in organics.�ans��src��*《无机化学》（武汉大学等编）�!Inorganic Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�c65801e47f52�body��第二定律有多种等价表述，克劳修斯表述为热量不能自发从低温物体传到高温物体。它宣告了过程的不可逆性，并引出熵增原理：孤立体系的熵总是趋向最大。这解释了为什么混合、扩散等过程不可逆。�HThe second law has several equivalent forms; Clausius stated that heat cannot spontaneously flow from a colder to a hotter body. It declares the irreversibility of processes and leads to the entropy-increase principle: an isolated system's entropy tends toward a maximum. This explains why mixing and diffusion are irreversible.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�cb345d2196e1�body�ٗ下村脩从水母中分离出绿色荧光蛋白GFP，经改造可作活体荧光标记，让研究者实时观察蛋白质与细胞，获2008诺奖。ٞOsamu Shimomura isolated green fluorescent protein (GFP) from jellyfish; engineered GFP tags let scientists watch proteins/cells live, earning the 2008 Nobel.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�cb53e89878bc�body���紫草根部含紫草素等萘醌类色素，可溶于油脂或酒精后上染纤维。它属于天然植物染料，颜色随pH和媒染剂变化，从紫红到蓝紫。古人用它做昂贵的紫色染材。�The roots of gromwell contain naphthoquinone pigments like shikonin that dissolve in oil or alcohol and bind to fibers. As a natural plant dye its hue shifts from purplish-red to blue-violet with pH and mordant. Ancient dyers valued it as a costly purple source.�ans��src��bZollinger H., Color Chemistry, 3rd ed., Wiley-VCH, 2003, 第 2 章(染料结构与颜色的关系)�fZollinger H., Color Chemistry, 3rd ed., Wiley-VCH, 2003, Ch. 2 (structure-color relationships in dyes)��id�cb6ba2a3bc83�body��0当材料尺寸降到纳米尺度（1–100 nm），表面原子比例剧增，比表面积巨大，量子限域效应也开始显现。这使纳米颗粒的催化活性、颜色和熔点等与块体明显不同，例如金纳米颗粒可呈红色。这类特性推动了催化、医药等领域发展。�BWhen materials shrink to the nanoscale (1–100 nm), the fraction of surface atoms and surface area surge, and quantum confinement appears. This makes nanoparticles differ from bulk in catalytic activity, color, and melting point—gold nanoparticles can look red, for instance. Such traits advance catalysis and medicine.�ans��src��'《材料科学基础》（胡赓祥）�0Fundamentals of Materials Science (Hu Gengxiang)��id�cc7dd1e38442�body���蓝瓶子实验中，葡萄糖（还原剂）与亚甲基蓝（氧化还原指示剂）溶于水并接触空气。静置时空气中的氧把无色的还原态亚甲基蓝氧化成蓝色（氧化态）；同时葡萄糖缓慢把蓝色氧化态还原回无色。如此反复氧化还原循环，溶液便周期性地变蓝又褪色，振荡快慢受温度、氧气和糖浓度影响。��In the blue-bottle experiment, glucose (a reducing agent) and methylene blue (a redox indicator) are dissolved in water exposed to air. At rest, dissolved oxygen oxidizes the colorless reduced methylene blue to its blue oxidized form; meanwhile glucose slowly reduces the blue form back to colorless. This redox cycle repeats, so the solution periodically turns blue and then fades. The oscillation speed depends on temperature, oxygen, and sugar concentration.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�cf89621d9966�body���ATP 末端的三磷酸链上负电荷彼此排斥；水解成 ADP 与磷酸根后排斥解除、产物溶剂化更好，自由能下降，这才是细胞支取的能量。它叫货币是因为既不存能也不干活，只居中介：氧化燃料供能把 ADP 再磷酸化，ATP 再交出磷酸基团推动运输、运动和合成。但要注意断键只吸热，「高能键放能」是简写；它也不是储备，只够几秒剧烈活动。�sThe negative charges on ATP's triphosphate tail repel one another; hydrolyzing it to ADP and phosphate relieves that repulsion and leaves the products better solvated, so free energy drops, and that drop is what a cell spends. It is a currency because it neither stores energy nor does work, sitting in the middle instead: energy from oxidizing fuel re-phosphorylates ADP, and ATP hands a phosphate group onward to drive transport, motion and synthesis. Breaking any bond only absorbs heat, so "the high-energy bond releases energy" is shorthand for more stable products, and ATP is no reserve—it covers seconds of hard work.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�chem_19_003�body���chi 随温度降低(即升温使 chi 减小)时体系表现出上临界共溶温度(UCST)行为:高温均相,降温进入双结线以内发生液-液相分离。对高分子量链,混合熵项被链长 N 压低,临界点满足 chi_c ≈ (1/2)(1+1/√N)^2 并趋于 0.5,临界体积分数 φ_c ≈ 1/√N 且偏向溶剂一侧。这解释了为何高分子溶液的互溶窗口远比小分子混合物窄。��Such a system shows upper critical solution temperature (UCST) behavior: miscible at high temperature, it enters the binodal on cooling and undergoes liquid-liquid demixing. For long chains the entropy term is suppressed by the degree of polymerization N, giving chi_c ≈ (1/2)(1+1/√N)^2 → 0.5 and a critical polymer volume fraction φ_c ≈ 1/√N skewed toward solvent-rich compositions. This is why polymer solutions have far narrower miscibility windows than small-molecule mixtures.�ans��src��TP. J. Flory《Principles of Polymer Chemistry》(1953)第十二章格胞统计处理�sP. J. Flory, Principles of Polymer Chemistry, Cornell University Press, 1953, Ch. XII lattice-statistical treatment��id�chem_19_006�body��焦糖化是糖类在高温下(蔗糖约需 160 °C 以上)经脱水、烯醇化和聚合生成深色风味物的过程,不需要其他组分参与。美拉德反应则是还原糖的羰基与氨基酸/蛋白质的氨基缩合形成 Schiff 碱,再经 Amadori 重排、Strecker 降解等串联路径生成类黑素与吡嗪类香气物。氨基作为亲核催化剂降低了羰基活化门槛,加上 Schiff 碱形成放热,使其在 100 °C 左右甚至更低即可显著进行,这也是烤肉着色快于熬糖的原因之一。�:Caramelization is sugar alone undergoing dehydration, enolization, and polymerization at high temperature (sucrose needs roughly >160 °C). The Maillard reaction instead condenses carbonyls of reducing sugars with amino groups of amino acids or proteins into Schiff bases, followed by Amadori rearrangement and Strecker degradation cascades yielding melanoidins and pyrazines. Amines act as nucleophilic catalysts that lower the carbonyl activation barrier, so browning proceeds readily near 100 °C or below — one reason roasted meat browns faster than boiling sugar.�ans��src�ٟJ. E. Hodge,《Dehydrated Foods, Chemistry of Browning Reactions in Model Systems》,Journal of Agricultural and Food Chemistry,1953 (DOI: 10.1021/jf60015a004)ٝJ. E. Hodge, 'Dehydrated Foods, Chemistry of Browning Reactions in Model Systems', Journal of Agricultural and Food Chemistry, 1953, DOI: 10.1021/jf60015a004��id�chem_19_013�body��_钼酸根以高亲和力固定在酸性氧化铝柱上,子体高锝酸根因分配行为不同,可被生理盐水单独洗脱。子体活度按衰变动力学增长,约23小时后接近峰值,再次淋洗即得最大收率。这套周期性“挤奶”流程把短寿命核素的供应从加速器现场解放出来,支撑着绝大多数SPECT显像。��Molybdate is immobilized with high affinity on an acidic alumina column, while the daughter pertechnetate, owing to different partitioning, is washed off alone with saline. Daughter activity regrows by decay kinetics and approaches its maximum after roughly 23 hours, when a second elution gives peak yield. This periodic milking decouples short-lived nuclide supply from on-site accelerator operation and underpins most SPECT imaging.�ans��src�قIAEA Technical Reports Series No. 466《Technetium-99m Radiopharmaceuticals: Manufacture of Technetium-99m Generators》,IAEA,2010وIAEA Technical Reports Series No. 466, Technetium-99m Radiopharmaceuticals: Manufacture of Technetium-99m Generators, IAEA, Vienna, 2010��id�chem_19_016�body���算法先给每个原子赋初值不变量(元素、形式电荷、连接度),随后逐轮合并邻近原子的标识,得到半径不断扩张的子结构哈希。各半径层的特征再折叠进固定长度的位向量,供相似度比较与虚拟筛选使用。由于结果与原子编号无关,同一分子总能得到一致的指纹;代价是哈希可能碰撞,提高维度可以稀释冲突。��Each atom first receives an initial invariant (element, formal charge, connectivity); successive rounds then merge neighboring identifiers, producing substructure hashes of ever larger radius. Features from every radius layer are folded into a fixed-length bit vector ready for similarity comparison and virtual screening. Because the result ignores atom numbering, one molecule always yields one consistent fingerprint; hash collisions are the price, diluted by raising dimensionality.�ans��src�فRogers & Hahn,《Extended-Connectivity Fingerprints》,Journal of Chemical Information and Modeling,2010 (DOI: 10.1021/ci100050t)�Rogers & Hahn, 'Extended-Connectivity Fingerprints', Journal of Chemical Information and Modeling, 2010, DOI: 10.1021/ci100050t��id�chem_19_019�body��|Flory-Huggins相互作用参数并不是常数,它同时包含依赖温度的焓贡献与过量熵贡献;酰胺基团与水之间的氢键随升温削弱,熵项又不利于混合,χ随之越过临界值。混合自由能曲线因此失去稳定性,体系在下临界共溶温度处自发脱混。这一温敏特性让PNIPAM成为智能水凝胶与温控分离膜的骨架材料。�The Flory-Huggins interaction parameter is anything but constant: it carries both a temperature-dependent enthalpic part and an excess entropic part. Hydrogen bonds between amide groups and water weaken as heat is applied while the entropic term already disfavors mixing, so chi climbs past its critical value. The mixed free-energy curve then loses stability and demixes spontaneously at the lower critical solution temperature — the property that makes PNIPAM a scaffold for smart hydrogels and thermally gated membranes.�ans��src��{H. G. Schild《Poly(N-isopropylacrylamide): experiment, theory and application》,Progress in Polymer Science 17 (1992) 163�xH. G. Schild, Poly(N-isopropylacrylamide): experiment, theory and application, Progress in Polymer Science 17 (1992) 163��id�chem_20_003�body���石墨嵌锂后电位随嵌锂量下降,在高倍率或低温大电流充电时,负极表面极化会使局部电位降至0 V(vs Li/Li+)以下,锂离子来不及扩散进入石墨层间而在表面还原为金属锂。析出的锂一部分失去电活性成为死锂并消耗电解液,还会促进枝晶生长刺穿隔膜造成内短路。因此BMS需根据温度与倍率动态限制充电电流,把负极电位维持在析锂阈值之上。�lAs lithium intercalates, the graphite potential falls, and under high-rate or low-temperature charging the surface overpotential can push the local anode potential below 0 V vs Li/Li+, so Li+ reduces to metallic lithium on the surface instead of intercalating. Deposited lithium partially becomes electrochemically inert dead lithium while consuming electrolyte, and it promotes dendrite growth that can pierce the separator and cause internal short circuits. Battery management systems therefore limit charge current dynamically according to temperature and rate to keep the anode potential above the plating threshold.�ans��src�ٙWaldmann、Hogg与Wohlfahrt-Mehrens 2018年发表于Progress in Energy and Combustion Science的商用锂离子电池析锂副作用综述70卷253-278页٩T. Waldmann, B.-I. Hogg & M. Wohlfahrt-Mehrens, Li plating as unwanted side reaction in commercial Li-ion cells - A review, Prog. Energy Combust. Sci., 2018, 70, 253-278��id�chem_20_006�body���新烟碱作用于昆虫中枢神经的烟碱型乙酰胆碱受体(nAChR),其硝基亚氨基/氰基等吸电基团使其与昆虫受体亚基的结合亲和力比对哺乳动物受体高数百至上千倍。哺乳动物nAChR对该类化合物的结合位点构象不同且亲和力弱,加之血脑屏障阻挡,故在治疗剂量下难以中毒。这种受体水平的差异构成了新烟碱选择性的核心机制,但也带来传粉昆虫暴露的生态风险争议。�?Neonicotinoids target nicotinic acetylcholine receptors in the insect central nervous system; their electron-withdrawing nitroimine or cyano groups give binding affinities for insect receptor subunits hundreds to thousands of times higher than for mammalian ones. Mammalian nAChRs differ in binding-site conformation and bind these compounds weakly, and the blood–brain barrier further limits exposure, explaining the favorable acute-toxicity profile. This receptor-level selectivity is the core mechanism, though it remains debated because of risks to pollinating insects.�ans��src���Tomizawa 与 Casida,《NEONICOTINOID INSECTICIDE TOXICOLOGY: Mechanisms of Selective Action》,Annual Review of Pharmacology and Toxicology 45, 247,2005 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev.pharmtox.45.120403.095930)��Tomizawa and Casida, 'NEONICOTINOID INSECTICIDE TOXICOLOGY: Mechanisms of Selective Action', Annual Review of Pharmacology and Toxicology 45, 247, 2005, DOI: 10.1146/annurev.pharmtox.45.120403.095930��id�chem_20_009�body��w小环酮的C–CO–C键角被压缩至远小于正常sp^2杂化的120°,按Bent规则,羰基碳伸向环内的两个σ单键被迫采用更多p成分,C=O键因此获得更多s成分、力常数增大,伸缩频率随之升高。丙酮的ν(C=O)约1715 cm^-1,而环丁酮升至约1780 cm^-1,环丙酮更高。该规律可用于推断未知物中羰基所处环系的大小。��Small rings compress the C–CO–C angle well below the normal sp2 value of 120°; relieving this angular strain pushes the carbonyl carbon toward more p-like character in its single bonds, increasing s character and force constant of the C=O bond itself, which raises the stretching frequency. Acetone absorbs near 1715 cm−1 whereas cyclobutanone appears around 1780 cm−1 and cyclopropanone higher still. This trend lets one infer ring size around a carbonyl in unknown structures.�ans��src��_Pretsch等《有机化合物结构解析:波谱数据表》羰基化合物红外特征频率表مPretsch, Bühlmann & Badertscher, Structure Determination of Organic Compounds: Tables of Spectral Data, carbonyl IR frequency tables��id�chem_20_013�body��火灾残渣通常先用顶空吸附或溶剂萃取富集挥发性组分,再经 GC 分离、MS 检测。汽油的鉴定不依赖单一化合物,而是识别其特征谱图模式:烷烃、环烷烃、芳烃(甲苯、二甲苯异构体、1,2,4-三甲苯等)及茚满系列的相对丰度分布构成指纹。将未知谱图与 ASTM E1618 标准分类和标准油样库比对,可给出类别级鉴定结论(如判定为汽油类);由于不同品牌油品配方相近且风化会改变组成,通常不作品牌级的同一认定。��Fire debris is typically enriched by headspace adsorption or solvent extraction, then separated by GC and detected by MS. Identification does not rest on a single compound but on characteristic pattern recognition: the relative abundances of alkanes, cycloalkanes, aromatics (toluene, xylene isomers, 1,2,4-trimethylbenzene) and the indane series form a fingerprint. Comparing unknown chromatograms against ASTM E1618 classifications and reference ignitable-liquid libraries supports class-level identification (e.g., gasoline); because commercial formulations are similar and weathering alters composition, brand-level attribution is generally not made.�ans��src��IASTM E1618-19 Standard Test Method for Ignitable Liquid Residues by GC-MS�mASTM E1618-19, Standard Test Method for Ignitable Liquid Residues in Extracts of Fire Debris Samples by GC-MS��id�chem_20_016�body���发酵期间酵母由乙酰羟酸合酶(ILV2编码)把丙酮酸转化为α-乙酰乳酸供缬氨酸合成,部分前体泄漏到胞外后经非酶氧化脱羧生成双乙酰。成熟期酵母的双乙酰还原酶先把它还原为乙偶姻、再还原为2,3-丁二醇,两者的感官阈值比双乙酰高出数千倍,异味随之消除。生产上在主酵末期回温进行双乙酰还原期(diacetyl rest)、维持足量悬浮酵母并避免过早降温,可以加速这一还原过程。�DDuring fermentation yeast converts pyruvate into alpha-acetolactate via ILV2-encoded acetohydroxyacid synthase for valine synthesis; part of this precursor leaks out of the cell and undergoes non-enzymatic oxidative decarboxylation to diacetyl. In maturation, yeast diacetyl reductase steps it down to acetoin and then 2,3-butanediol, whose sensory thresholds are thousands of times higher, so the off-flavor fades away. Brewers accelerate the reduction with a diacetyl rest near the end of primary fermentation, keeping enough yeast in suspension and avoiding premature chilling.�ans��src�ٚKrogerus & Gibson, Journal of the Institute of Brewing 2013, 119(3): 86-97, 125th Anniversary Review: Diacetyl and Its Control during Brewery FermentationمKrogerus & Gibson, J. Inst. Brew. 2013, 119(3), 86-97, 125th Anniversary Review: Diacetyl and Its Control during Brewery Fermentation��id�chem_20_019�body��A石墨负极嵌锂电位约0.1 V(相对于Li/Li+),低于常规碳酸酯溶剂的还原分解电位,首次充电时溶剂与锂盐在石墨表面被还原,生成的碳酸锂、烷基碳酸锂与聚合物沉积成一层离子导电而电子绝缘的钝化层,即SEI膜。VC分子中的碳碳双键降低了LUMO能级,使其更易还原,能在溶剂共嵌入石墨之前于更高电位优先分解,形成致密且富有机锂组分的薄界面膜。该膜阻止溶剂分子嵌入导致石墨层剥离,并减少活性锂的不可逆消耗,从而提升首次效率和循环寿命。��Lithium intercalates into graphite at about 0.1 V versus Li/Li+, below the reduction potentials of common carbonate solvents, so during the first charge the solvent and lithium salt are reduced on graphite; Li2CO3, lithium alkyl carbonates and polymers deposit into a passivation layer that conducts ions but blocks electrons - the SEI. The carbon-carbon double bond in VC lowers its LUMO, letting it reduce preferentially at higher potential before solvent co-intercalation starts and form a dense, organic-lithium-rich thin film. This film prevents graphite exfoliation driven by co-intercalated solvent and curbs irreversible lithium consumption, improving first-cycle efficiency and cycling stability.�ans��src��{Zhang, S. S., Journal of Power Sources 2006, 162(2): 1379-1394, A review on electrolyte additives for lithium-ion batteries�sZhang, S. S., J. Power Sources 2006, 162(2), 1379-1394, A review on electrolyte additives for lithium-ion batteries��id�chem_21_003�body��普通自由基聚合中链增长与链终止竞争剧烈,链一旦引发便不可逆地增长至死亡,各链寿命差异大,故分布接近高斯且PDI常在1.5以上。ATRP通过卤原子可逆钝化使活性种与休眠种之间快速交换,RAFT则通过硫代羰基硫化合物可逆加成断裂链转移实现同样的休眠-活化平衡。每条链经历多次活化-钝化循环,增长机会被均摊,所有链近似同步生长,数均分子量随转化率线性上升,PDI可降到1.1左右甚至更低。��In conventional radical polymerization, propagation competes irreversibly with termination: once initiated, a chain grows until it dies, chain lifetimes differ widely, and the distribution approaches Gaussian with PDI typically above 1.5. ATRP establishes a rapid equilibrium between active and dormant species via reversible halogen atom transfer, while RAFT achieves the same dormancy-activation balance through reversible addition-fragmentation chain transfer with thiocarbonylthio compounds. Every chain undergoes many activation-deactivation cycles, growth opportunities are equalized, all chains grow nearly synchronously, Mn rises linearly with conversion, and PDI drops to about 1.1 or lower.�ans��src��oMatyjaszewski 与 Xia,《Atom Transfer Radical Polymerization》,Chemical Reviews,2001 (DOI: 10.1021/cr940534g)�kMatyjaszewski & Xia, 'Atom Transfer Radical Polymerization', Chemical Reviews, 2001, DOI: 10.1021/cr940534g��id�chem_21_006�body��x天然水体依靠碳酸盐缓冲体系(HCO3-/CO32-)工作:外加的 H+ 或 OH- 被碳酸的两级平衡反应消耗,pH 被钳制在 pKa 约 6.3 与 10.3 之间。缓冲容量来自流域内方解石、白云石等碳酸盐矿物风化溶解所积累的碱度。因此在同等酸负荷下,天然水的 pH 漂移远小于纯水,只有碱度耗尽后才会发生明显酸化。��Natural waters rely on the bicarbonate/carbonate buffer system: added H+ or OH- is consumed by the coupled carbonic acid equilibria, holding pH between the two pKa values of H2CO3, about 6.3 and 10.3. The buffering capacity comes from alkalinity accumulated through weathering dissolution of carbonate minerals such as calcite and dolomite in the catchment. Under the same acid load, pH therefore shifts far less than in pure water, and marked acidification occurs only once alkalinity is exhausted.�ans��src��[Stumm W., Morgan J. J., Aquatic Chemistry, 3rd ed., Wiley, 1996, 第 8 章(碳酸盐平衡)�]Stumm W., Morgan J. J., Aquatic Chemistry, 3rd ed., Wiley, 1996, Ch. 8 (carbonate equilibria)��id�chem_21_009�body���当 CdSe 颗粒直径小于其激子玻尔直径(约 11 nm,对应玻尔半径约 5.6 nm)时,电子与空穴受到三维量子限域,准连续能带分裂为分立能级,有效带隙随尺寸减小而展宽。小颗粒带隙大,发射短波蓝光;颗粒长大,限域减弱,带隙收窄,发射红移至橙红。合成上通过控制成核后的熟化时间与温度来调节粒径,即可实现发射波长的连续调谐。�cWhen the particle diameter falls below the exciton Bohr diameter of CdSe (about 11 nm, corresponding to a Bohr radius near 5.6 nm), electrons and holes experience three-dimensional quantum confinement and the quasi-continuous bands split into discrete levels, widening the effective gap as size decreases. Small particles have large gaps and emit short-wavelength blue light; as particles grow, confinement weakens, the gap narrows, and emission red-shifts toward orange-red. Controlling post-nucleation ripening time and temperature adjusts particle size, enabling continuous tuning of the emission wavelength.�ans��src��_Brus L. E., J. Chem. Phys., 1984, 80, 4403;Murray C. B. 等, J. Am. Chem. Soc., 1993, 115, 8706�cBrus L. E., J. Chem. Phys., 1984, 80, 4403; Murray C. B. et al., J. Am. Chem. Soc., 1993, 115, 8706��id�chem_21_013�body���三价稀土离子替换部分骨架质子后,分子筛酸性位密度和水热稳定性同时增强,裂化更深,重油转化率明显提高。但稀土离子周围的强静电场加速双分子氢转移反应,把汽油馏分中的烯烃饱和成烷烃,研究法辛烷值因此损失一到两个单位。这种活性与辛烷值的负相关是平衡催化剂配方设计必须权衡的核心矛盾。��Trivalent rare-earth cations replacing some framework protons raise both acid-site density and hydrothermal stability, so the catalyst cracks deeper and heavy-oil conversion climbs. The intense electrostatic fields around those cations also speed bimolecular hydrogen transfer, which saturates gasoline-range olefins into paraffins and costs one to two research-octane numbers. Balancing this activity-versus-octane inverse relationship remains central to equilibrium-catalyst formulation.�ans��src�ٌPine L A, Maher P J, Wachter W A. Prediction of cracking catalyst behavior by a zeolite unit cell weight model. J. Catal., 1984, 85: 466-476ٗPine L A, Maher P J, Wachter W A. Prediction of cracking catalyst behavior by a zeolite unit cell weight model. Journal of Catalysis, 1984, 85: 466-476��id�chem_21_016�body���晶核剂先在玻璃中诱发分相并形成亚临界晶核，随后二硅酸锂、β-锂辉石等主晶相在两段式热处理中于这些核上异相生长。晶粒通常被控制在数十至几百纳米，细密互锁的晶体能偏转裂纹尖端、抑制应力集中，整体热膨胀系数还可通过晶相比例调节。因此二硅酸锂微晶玻璃的弯曲强度可达数百兆帕，耐热冲击性能远优于同组成的均质玻璃。�TThe nucleating agent first drives amorphous phase separation that produces subcritical nuclei, onto which major phases such as lithium disilicate or beta-spodumene grow heterogeneously during two-stage heat treatment. Grain sizes are kept near 50-500 nm, so dense interlocking crystals deflect crack tips and raise toughness, while the bulk expansion coefficient is tuned by adjusting the crystalline fraction. Lithium-disilicate glass-ceramics consequently reach flexural strengths of several hundred megapascals and survive thermal shocks far beyond what the parent homogeneous glass tolerates.�ans��src�يStookey,《Catalyzed Crystallization of Glass in Theory and Practice》,Industrial & Engineering Chemistry,1959 (DOI: 10.1021/ie50595a022)وStookey, 'Catalyzed Crystallization of Glass in Theory and Practice', Industrial & Engineering Chemistry, 1959, DOI: 10.1021/ie50595a022��id�chem_22_003�body���青蒿素是一种带有过氧桥的倍半萜内酯。疟原虫消化血红蛋白时会释放游离血红素，其二价铁将过氧桥还原，O-O键均裂后生成高活性碳自由基，这些自由基进而烷基化虫体蛋白质并损伤膜系统，导致疟原虫迅速死亡。过氧桥是活性必需结构，脱氧青蒿素几乎没有活性，这也解释了该药对红内期疟原虫见效快的特点。�Artemisinin is a sesquiterpene lactone containing an endoperoxide bridge. Digestion of hemoglobin by malaria parasites releases free heme, whose ferrous iron reduces the peroxide; cleavage of the O-O bond generates highly reactive carbon-centered radicals that alkylate parasite proteins and damage membranes, rapidly killing the pathogen. The endoperoxide is indispensable for activity, deoxyartemisinin being essentially inactive, which explains the drug's remarkably fast clearance of erythrocytic-stage parasites.�ans��src��}J. Wang 等，Nature Communications（《自然·通讯》），2015年，第6卷，文章号10111，DOI: 10.1038/ncomms10111٩J. Wang et al., "Haem-activated promiscuous targeting of artemisinin in Plasmodium falciparum", Nature Communications, vol. 6, art. 10111, 2015, DOI: 10.1038/ncomms10111��id�chem_22_006�body���螺旋轴和滑移面均含平移分量：被它们联系的一对等效原子所散射的波，相位差为2πh·t。当该相位差恰为π的奇数倍时，两列波完全相消，相应类型反射的结构因子恒等于零，与原子的种类和坐标无关。因此，只需查明哪些hkl类型的衍射系统性地缺失，就能确定各对称元素中的平移成分，从而锁定空间群。��Screw axes and glide planes carry translational components: waves scattered by two atoms related by such a translation t differ in phase by 2πht. When this phase difference equals an odd multiple of π, the waves cancel exactly and the structure factor of that reflection class is zero no matter where the atoms lie. Identifying which hkl classes are systematically absent therefore fixes the translational part of each symmetry element and pins down the space group.�ans��src�ف《国际晶体学表》A卷：空间群对称性，M. I. Aroyo主编，第6版，国际晶体学联合会（IUCr），2016年。ُInternational Tables for Crystallography, Vol. A: Space-Group Symmetry, ed. M. I. Aroyo, 6th ed., International Union of Crystallography, 2016.��id�chem_22_009�body���Jahn-Teller定理指出：非线性分子处于轨道简并电子态时会自发畸变以解除简并、降低能量。Cu²⁺为d⁹组态，八面体场中eg轨道共三个电子，一个双占、一个单占。沿z轴拉长使dz²下降而dx²-y²升高，被稳定的是双占的dz²轨道，体系总能净降低，简并解除，形成两条较长的轴向键与四条较短的赤道键。�4The Jahn-Teller theorem states that a non-linear molecule in an orbitally degenerate electronic state distorts spontaneously to lift that degeneracy and lower its energy. Cu²⁺ is d⁹, and in an octahedral field three electrons occupy the two eg orbitals, one being doubly occupied and the other singly occupied. Elongating along the z axis lowers dz² and raises dx²-y²; because the stabilized dz² holds two electrons, the net total energy decreases, the degeneracy disappears, and the ion ends up with two long axial bonds and four shorter equatorial ones.�ans��src���H. A. Jahn、E. Teller，《简并电子态下多原子分子的稳定性 I. 轨道简并》，Proceedings of the Royal Society A，1937年，第161卷，220–235页，DOI: 10.1098/rspa.1937.0142。��H. A. Jahn and E. Teller, "Stability of polyatomic molecules in degenerate electronic states. I. Orbital degeneracy", Proceedings of the Royal Society A, vol. 161, pp. 220-235, 1937, DOI: 10.1098/rspa.1937.0142.��id�chem_22_013�body���不锈钢依靠表面富铬氧化物钝化膜防护。氯离子半径小、侵蚀性强，优先吸附在硫化物夹杂等膜缺陷处并局部穿透，使钝化膜破裂成核为蚀孔。孔内溶解的金属离子发生水解产生氢离子，溶液酸化；氯离子迁入孔内以维持电中性，形成高浓度强腐蚀性的孔内溶液。孔外大片钝化表面充当阴极，构成大阴极-小阳极的自催化电池，驱动点蚀持续向深处发展。�cStainless steel is protected by a chromium-rich oxide passive film. Being small and highly aggressive, chloride ions preferentially adsorb at film defects such as sulfide inclusions and penetrate locally, nucleating pits where the film breaks down. Inside an occluded pit, dissolved metal cations hydrolyze, releasing protons and acidifying the solution, while chloride migrates inward to maintain electroneutrality, building a concentrated, highly corrosive electrolyte. The large passivated exterior acts as the cathode, forming a big-cathode/small-anode autocatalytic cell that drives pit growth ever deeper.�ans��src��DMars G. Fontana《Corrosion Engineering》第3版, McGraw-Hill, 1986�BMars G. Fontana, Corrosion Engineering, 3rd ed., McGraw-Hill, 1986��id�chem_22_016�body���·OH主要来自臭氧光解产生的O(¹D)与水汽反应及HO₂+NO途径，带未配对电子，几乎能氧化一切还原性痕量气体。CH₄+·OH氢摘取一步活化能高，室温速率常数仅约6×10⁻¹⁵ cm³ s⁻¹，正是这最慢的一步决定了甲烷约十年的大气寿命，也是多数VOCs降解链的起始与速控步。OH平均浓度仅约10⁶个/cm³，却决定大气总体氧化容量，故称“清洁剂”。�}In the sunlit troposphere ·OH arises when O(¹D) atoms from ozone photolysis react with water vapour, and via HO₂ + NO. With its unpaired electron it attacks nearly every reduced trace gas. Methane oxidation starts with H-abstraction, CH₄ + ·OH → ·CH₃ + H₂O, whose high barrier leaves a room-temperature rate constant of only ≈6×10⁻¹⁵ cm³ s⁻¹; this single slow step sets methane's roughly decade-long atmospheric lifetime and initiates degradation chains for most VOCs. Although mean ·OH levels are barely 10⁶ molecules cm⁻³, they define the atmosphere's total oxidizing capacity — hence “detergent”.�ans��src��lFinlayson-Pitts B.J. & Pitts J.N. Jr.《Chemistry of the Upper and Lower Atmosphere》, Academic Press, 2000�hB.J. Finlayson-Pitts & J.N. Pitts Jr., Chemistry of the Upper and Lower Atmosphere, Academic Press, 2000��id�chem_22_019�body���青霉素在大小与电荷分布上酷似肽聚糖侧链末端的D-Ala-D-Ala二肽，因而能进入转肽酶（青霉素结合蛋白）的活性腔。稠合双环骨架把四元β-内酰胺的酰胺键强行扭离平面，酰胺共振被破坏，羰基异常缺电；活性位丝氨酸羟基一旦进攻便开环，生成热力学稳定的无活性酰基酶，交联中断，细菌在渗透压下胀裂。人体细胞没有细胞壁这一靶标，故药物选择性毒性很高。�`Penicillin mimics the size and charge distribution of the D-Ala-D-Ala terminus of the peptidoglycan stem, so it enters the active site of transpeptidases (penicillin-binding proteins). Its fused bicyclic framework forces the four-membered β-lactam amide far out of planarity, destroying amide resonance and making the carbonyl highly electrophilic. Attack by the active-site serine opens the strained ring to a thermodynamically stable, inactive acyl–enzyme complex; cross-linking stops and the cell lyses under turgor pressure. Human cells lack a cell wall target, giving the drug its selective toxicity.�ans��src���Tipper 与 Strominger,《Mechanism of action of penicillins: a proposal based on their structural similarity to acyl-D-alanyl-D-alanine.》,Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences 54, 1133-1141,1965 (DOI: 10.1073/pnas.54.4.1133)��Tipper and Strominger, 'Mechanism of action of penicillins: a proposal based on their structural similarity to acyl-D-alanyl-D-alanine.', Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences 54, 1133-1141, 1965, DOI: 10.1073/pnas.54.4.1133��id�chem_23_003�body���N≡N三键键能约940 kJ/mol，哈伯法需高温高压催化；固氮酶靠铁钼辅因子（FeMo-co）这一多金属硫簇活化N₂：电子从P簇逐个传入辅因子，质子与电子按Lowe–Thorneley方案偶合加入，绕开高能中间体。每传递一个电子要先水解两个ATP，以保证电子单向流动并提升还原力，从而在常温常压下把N₂还原为氨。��The N≡N triple bond (~940 kJ/mol) forces the Haber–Bosch process to run hot, pressurized, and catalyzed. Nitrogenase instead activates N₂ on the FeMo-cofactor, a multi-metal sulfide cluster: electrons enter one by one from the P-cluster while protons join in the coupled steps of the Lowe–Thorneley sequence, bypassing high-energy intermediates. Two ATP must be hydrolyzed per electron delivered, enforcing one-way flow and boosting reducing power, so the enzyme fixes nitrogen under mild conditions.�ans��src�ٷB. M. Hoffman、D. Lukoyanov、Z.-Y. Yang、D. R. Dean、L. C. Seefeldt《Nitrogenase: A Draft Mechanism》，Acc. Chem. Res.，2013年，第46卷，595页（DOI: 10.1021/ar300367c）ٟB. M. Hoffman, D. Lukoyanov, Z.-Y. Yang, D. R. Dean & L. C. Seefeldt, "Nitrogenase: A Draft Mechanism", Acc. Chem. Res., 2013, 46, 595 (DOI: 10.1021/ar300367c)��id�chem_23_009�body���SNAr的决速步通常是亲核试剂对芳环的加成，而非离去基团的离开。亲核试剂进攻带吸电子基的芳环，生成负电荷离域于环上的Meisenheimer中间体；氟最强的吸电子诱导效应最能稳定该中间体，降低决速能垒，随后强C–F键的断裂快速完成、并不控速。故活性顺序反常为F > Cl > Br ≈ I，与脂肪族SN2正好相反，对硝基氟苯因此成为经典模型底物。�fThe rate-determining step in SNAr is usually the nucleophile's addition to the ring, not departure of the leaving group. Attack on a ring bearing electron-withdrawing groups forms a Meisenheimer intermediate whose negative charge is delocalized over the π system; fluorine's powerful inductive withdrawal stabilizes this species best, lowering the barrier of the slow step, so the subsequent cleavage of even the strongest C–F bond is fast and never controls the rate. Hence the inverted order F > Cl > Br ≈ I — opposite to aliphatic SN2 — which is why p-nitrofluorobenzene is the classic model substrate.�ans��src�ُJ. F. Bunnett 与 R. E. Zahler,《Aromatic Nucleophilic Substitution Reactions.》,Chemical Reviews 49, 273-412,1951 (DOI: 10.1021/cr60153a002)ًJ. F. Bunnett & R. E. Zahler, 'Aromatic Nucleophilic Substitution Reactions.', Chemical Reviews 49, 273-412, 1951, DOI: 10.1021/cr60153a002��id�chem_23_013�body���主要缺陷是带两个有效负电荷的铁空位V_Fe''与占据二价铁位的三价铁Fe_Fe•，两者按1:2的比例满足电中性。氧分压升高把更多Fe²⁺氧化为Fe³⁺，为维持晶格中性必须额外生成铁空位；而Fe²⁺正依赖空位机制跳跃迁移，空位浓度增大使扩散系数随之上升，这也造就了Fe1-xO极宽的非化学计量区。��The main defects are doubly negatively charged iron vacancies V_Fe'' and trivalent iron sitting on ferrous sites, Fe_Fe•, present in a 1:2 ratio that preserves electroneutrality. Higher oxygen pressure oxidizes more Fe2+ to Fe3+, which forces extra iron vacancies to keep the lattice neutral; since Fe2+ migrates by a vacancy-jump mechanism, the rising vacancy concentration increases its diffusivity, and the same coupling sustains the very broad nonstoichiometric range of Fe1-xO.�ans��src�ٍW. L. Roth,《Defects in the crystal and magnetic structures of ferrous oxide》,Acta Crystallographica,1960 (DOI: 10.1107/s0365110x60000297)ًW. L. Roth, 'Defects in the crystal and magnetic structures of ferrous oxide', Acta Crystallographica, 1960, DOI: 10.1107/s0365110x60000297��id�chem_23_016�body���它先在负电位下把溶液中的金属离子电解沉积到电极表面的汞（或铋）膜里，相当于把大体积样品中的金属浓缩成一层薄合金，几分钟即可富集上千倍；随后电位向正向扫描，各金属在各自特征电位先后溶出，形成尖窄的峰，峰电流与原始浓度成正比。先电化学预富集、再快速溶出检测，使信噪比大幅提升，检出限因此可达亚ppb级，适合现场水质监测。�lAt a negative deposition potential the metal ions are electrolytically plated into a thin mercury (or bismuth) film on the electrode, concentrating metal from a large sample volume into a tiny surface layer - often a thousand-fold enrichment within minutes. The potential is then scanned positively, and each metal strips out of the electrode at its own characteristic potential, giving a sharp peak whose current is proportional to the original concentration. Depositing first and detecting afterwards greatly raises the signal-to-noise ratio, pushing detection limits to sub-ppb levels suited to on-site water testing.�ans��src��oA. J. Bard 与 L. R. Faulkner《Electrochemical Methods: Fundamentals and Applications》第2版，Wiley，2001�iA. J. Bard & L. R. Faulkner, Electrochemical Methods: Fundamentals and Applications, 2nd ed., Wiley, 2001��id�chem_23_019�body���它是催化循环中的高价铁氧物种：血红素铁为Fe(IV)=O，卟啉环另带一个π阳离子自由基，轴向由半胱氨酸硫负离子锚定，氧化力远超普通血红素蛋白。它先夺取底物C-H键的氢原子，生成碳自由基和Fe(IV)-OH，随即氧回弹把羟基交回自由基位点，完成羟化。全过程在水相近中性条件下进行，这是药物I相代谢既强效又温和的原因。�hCompound I is the high-valent iron-oxo species at the heart of the catalytic cycle: the heme iron sits as Fe(IV)=O, the porphyrin ring carries an extra pi-cation radical, and a cysteinate axial ligand anchors the heme, pushing its oxidizing power far beyond ordinary globins. It first abstracts a hydrogen atom from a substrate C-H bond to give a carbon radical plus Fe(IV)-OH, then undergoes oxygen rebound, transferring the hydroxyl back onto the radical site to finish hydroxylation. The whole sequence proceeds in near-neutral aqueous conditions, which is why phase-I drug metabolism is both powerful and gentle.�ans��src���Pang,《Why high spin? Why sulphur? Comparative analysis of catalytic oxidation by Compound I of cytochrome P450, catalase, peroxidase, and selenocysteine-modified P450》,Computational and Theoretical Chemistry,2024 (DOI: 10.1016/j.comptc.2024.114720)��Pang, 'Why high spin? Why sulphur? Comparative analysis of catalytic oxidation by Compound I of cytochrome P450, catalase, peroxidase, and selenocysteine-modified P450', Computational and Theoretical Chemistry, 2024, DOI: 10.1016/j.comptc.2024.114720��id�chem_24_002�body���臭氧的净生成由阳光驱动,车流只是提供原料。清晨尾气排出大量NO与VOC,NO先把夜间残留的臭氧滴定消耗;随着太阳升高,NO2在波长小于420nm的光照下光解出氧原子,与O2结合生成O3,同时OH自由基氧化VOC产生的过氧自由基把NO转回NO2却不消耗臭氧,净生成速率午后最强,臭氧遂累积至峰值,傍晚光照减弱后回落。�+Net ozone production is driven by sunlight; traffic only supplies the ingredients. The morning rush emits large amounts of NO and VOCs, and that NO first titrates away the ozone left over from the night. As the sun climbs, NO2 photolyzes under light shorter than 420 nm to release oxygen atoms that combine with O2 into O3, while peroxy radicals from the OH oxidation of VOCs recycle NO back to NO2 without touching ozone. Net production is strongest in the early afternoon, so ozone accumulates to a peak and then falls as the light fades toward evening.�ans��src��uJ. H. Seinfeld、S. N. Pandis《Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics: From Air Pollution to Climate Change》,Wiley,2006�sJ. H. Seinfeld & S. N. Pandis, Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics: From Air Pollution to Climate Change, Wiley, 2006��id�chem_24_017�body���过氧桥正是青蒿素药效的核心：把这一过氧O-O键还原掉，抗疟活性几乎完全丧失。疟原虫消化血红蛋白时释放大量游离血红素，其中的亚铁离子催化过氧桥断裂，生成碳中心自由基与活性氧；这些物种迅速攻击疟原虫自身的蛋白质和膜脂，虫体随之死亡。人体细胞并不产生游离血红素，所受伤害相对轻微，药物的选择性由此而来。��The endoperoxide O-O bond is the pharmacological heart of artemisinin: reduce it away and antimalarial activity almost vanishes. As the malaria parasite digests hemoglobin it releases free heme, whose ferrous iron cleaves the peroxide bridge to spawn carbon-centered radicals and reactive oxygen species. These quickly attack the parasite's own proteins and membrane lipids, killing it. Human cells generate no free heme and suffer far less damage, which is where the selectivity comes from.�ans��src��[屠呦呦，《自然·医学（Nature Medicine）》，2011年，第17卷，1217至1220页�~Y. Tu, The discovery of artemisinin (qinghaosu) and gifts from Chinese medicine, Nature Medicine, 2011, vol. 17, pp. 1217-1220��id�chem_26_004�body��因为总包的溴酸盐氧化丙二酸反应内部藏着自催化正反馈与Br⁻抑制负反馈的耦合，远离平衡态时形成浓度极限环。机理：FKN模型中HBrO₂自催化生成迅速把Ce³⁺氧化为Ce⁴⁺，指示剂随之变色；Br⁻积累到临界浓度便关闭自催化通道并被缓慢消耗，同时Ce⁴⁺氧化丙二酸后被还原回Ce³⁺，体系复位进入下一轮。HBrO₂、Br⁻与Ce⁴⁺/Ce³⁺三个变量经延迟反馈交替升降，颜色即周期性变化。�2The overall bromate oxidation of malonic acid conceals coupled feedback: autocatalytic HBrO2 growth paired with bromide inhibition forms a concentration limit cycle far from equilibrium. In the FKN model, autocatalytic HBrO2 rapidly oxidizes Ce3+ to Ce4+, flipping the indicator color; when Br- reaches a critical level it shuts down the autocatalytic channel and is slowly consumed while Ce4+ oxidizes malonic acid and is reduced back to Ce3+, resetting the cycle. The delayed rise-and-fall of HBrO2, Br-, and the cerium couple drives the periodic color change.�ans��src���Field, Koros, Noyes,《Oscillations in chemical systems. II. Thorough analysis of temporal oscillation in the bromate-cerium-malonic acid system》,Journal of the American Chemical Society,1972 (DOI: 10.1021/ja00780a001)��Field, Koros, Noyes, 'Oscillations in chemical systems. II. Thorough analysis of temporal oscillation in the bromate-cerium-malonic acid system', Journal of the American Chemical Society, 1972, DOI: 10.1021/ja00780a001��id�chem_26_007�body��吸附强弱取决于金属d带与吸附质轨道杂化后反键态停留在费米能级以上而空置的程度。d带中心越靠近费米能级，未被占据的反键态越多，吸附键越强；应变、合金化或配体效应平移d带中心即可连续调节吸附强度。依据Sabatier原理，吸附过弱无法活化反应物，过强则中间体难以脱附转化，两端活性都受抑制，唯有中等吸附强度的表面居于火山顶，这为筛选合金与应变催化剂提供了标度关系基础。�iAdsorption strength is governed by how much of the antibonding hybrid between the metal d band and the adsorbate orbitals stays vacant above the Fermi level. A d-band center nearer the Fermi energy leaves more antibonding states empty and strengthens the bond, while strain, alloying, or ligand effects shift the center and retune adsorption continuously. By the Sabatier principle, surfaces that bind too weakly never activate the reactants and those that bind too strongly trap the intermediates, so activity peaks at intermediate binding strength - a scaling foundation for screening alloys and strained catalysts.�ans��src�ٚB. Hammer、J. K. Nørskov《Theoretical surface science and catalysis - calculations and concepts》，Advances in Catalysis，2000年，第45卷，71页�cB. Hammer & J. K. Norskov, Advances in Catalysis, 2000, 45, 71 (DOI: 10.1016/S0360-0564(02)45013-4)��id�chem_26_012�body��因为它给电子轨道安上一个虚构小质量，让电子与原子核在同一套拉格朗日量下一起演化，电子态始终近似贴着基态势面运动。机理：扩展拉格朗日量中以虚拟惯性参数μ驱动Kohn-Sham轨道的动力学，只要μ远小于核质量、初始波函数收敛且时间步长足够小，轨道便绝热跟随核运动而不与其共振交换能量，任一时刻都接近瞬时基态，作用力直接由DFT泛函微分得到，免去Born-Oppenheimer路径中每步的自洽迭代。�rIt hangs a small fictitious mass on the electronic degrees of freedom and propagates electrons and nuclei together under a single extended Lagrangian, letting the wavefunction glide along the ground-state surface. Provided the fictitious mass stays far below nuclear masses, the starting orbitals are well converged and the time step short enough, the orbitals evolve adiabatically without resonantly trading energy with the ions and remain close to the instantaneous ground state; forces come straight from differentiating the DFT functional, dispensing with the self-consistency loop required at every Born-Oppenheimer step.�ans��src�ٚR. Car & M. Parrinello《Unified approach for molecular dynamics and density-functional theory》，Physical Review Letters，1985年，第55卷，2471页�[R. Car & M. Parrinello, Phys. Rev. Lett., 1985, 55, 2471 (DOI: 10.1103/PhysRevLett.55.2471)��id�d08eef2b984e�body��}DFT 由 Hohenberg–Kohn 定理奠基，其核心是把多电子体系的基态能量表示为电子密度而非多体波函数的泛函，从而将 3N 维问题降维。Kohn–Sham 方程进一步用无相互作用电子的参考体系逼近真实体系。相比从头算方法，DFT 在精度与计算成本间取得较好平衡，因而广泛用于分子与材料性质预测。��DFT is founded on the Hohenberg–Kohn theorems, which state that the ground-state energy of a many-electron system is a functional of the electron density rather than the many-body wavefunction, reducing a 3N-dimensional problem. The Kohn–Sham equations approximate the real system with a reference of non-interacting electrons. Compared with ab initio methods, DFT balances accuracy and cost, making it popular for predicting molecular and material properties.�ans��src��PW. Kohn 与 L. J. Sham, Phys. Rev. 140, A1133 (1965);Kohn 诺贝尔演讲 (1998)�MW. Kohn & L. J. Sham, Phys. Rev. 140, A1133 (1965); Kohn Nobel Lecture (1998)��id�d10ad33fbd6f�body��(镧系收缩指从镧到镥，因4f电子屏蔽效应差，有效核电荷增加使原子和离子半径逐渐减小的现象。它导致同副族中第五、六周期元素半径相近（如锆与铪难分离），并影响过渡金属的性质递变。这是周期表中重要的结构效应。��Lanthanide contraction is the gradual decrease in atomic and ionic radii from lanthanum to lutetium, caused by poor shielding of 4f electrons raising the effective nuclear charge. It makes elements of the 5th and 6th periods in the same subgroup nearly equal in size (e.g. zirconium and hafnium are hard to separate) and affects transition-metal trends. It is a key structural effect in the table.�ans��src��]Housecroft 与 Sharpe《无机化学》（第5版，Pearson）f区元素与镧系收缩章节�hHousecroft, C. E.; Sharpe, A. G. Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson (f-block; lanthanide contraction)��id�d144682784f7�body��M福井谦一的前线轨道理论用 HOMO 与 LUMO 的对称性与相位重叠判断周环反应是否对称允许。例如电环化反应中，加热与光照分别由基态 HOMO 或激发态轨道的终端相位决定顺旋或对旋模式。该理论把 Woodward–Hoffmann 选择规则转化为直观的轨道相互作用图像。��Fukui's frontier orbital theory predicts whether a pericyclic reaction is symmetry-allowed by examining the symmetry and phase overlap of the HOMO and LUMO. In electrocyclic reactions, for example, thermal and photochemical conditions select conrotatory or disrotatory modes based on the terminal phases of the ground-state HOMO or excited-state orbital. This frames the Woodward–Hoffmann rules as intuitive orbital interactions.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d14d2e67b9d4�body��E有机-无机杂化钙钛矿（如 CH₃NH₃PbI₃）具有长载流子扩散长度、高光吸收系数和可调控的带隙，使光生电子-空穴对能高效分离与收集。溶液法制备成本低、可调组分带隙适合叠层电池。主要限制是铅的毒性和在湿热、光照下的长期稳定性问题。��Hybrid organic–inorganic perovskites such as CH₃NH₃PbI₃ have long carrier diffusion lengths, high absorption coefficients, and tunable band gaps, letting photogenerated electron–hole pairs separate and be collected efficiently. Solution processing is cheap, and tunable gaps suit tandem cells. Main limits are lead toxicity and poor long-term stability under heat, humidity, and light.�ans��src��I《Nature Photonics》钙钛矿综述；中国科学院半导体研究所�FNature Photonics, perovskite reviews; Nature Energy, stability studies��id�d21ea7f520b2�body���电解是在电流作用下强迫非自发的化学反应发生，如电解水产生氢气和氧气。电镀利用电解把金属离子还原成金属镀在物品表面，起保护和装饰作用。��Electrolysis forces a non-spontaneous chemical reaction using electric current, such as splitting water into hydrogen and oxygen. Electroplating uses electrolysis to reduce metal ions into a metal coating on an object for protection and decoration.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�d245be002719�body��起点是 NO₂ 见光分解：波长小于约 420 nm 的光把 NO₂ 打成 NO 和一个氧原子，氧原子与 O₂ 结合成臭氧。问题是城里有一堆挥发性有机物，它们在阳光下降解出的自由基把 NO 又氧化回 NO₂，却不消耗臭氧——于是臭氧只积累不减少，到下午达到峰值。同时生成的过氧乙酰硝酸酯(PAN)和气溶胶一起，构成那种刺激眼睛、让能见度下降的光化学烟雾。这也是它和「煤烟型」烟雾相反的地方: 太阳越烈，污染越重。�!It starts with photolysis of NO2: light shorter than about 420 nm splits NO2 into NO plus an oxygen atom, and that atom adds to O2 to make ozone. The trouble is the volatile organic compounds in a city: radicals from their breakdown re-oxidise NO back to NO2 without consuming the ozone, so ozone only accumulates, peaking in the afternoon. Peroxyacetyl nitrate (PAN) and aerosols formed alongside it make up the eye-stinging, visibility-reducing smog. This is the opposite of coal smoke type smog: the stronger the sun, the worse the pollution.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d3eae1293193�body���样品先被电离成带电碎片，再按质荷比（m/z）在电场或磁场中分离，得到的谱图峰位与相对强度可推断分子量与结构。McLafferty 与 Tureček 的《质谱解析》是碎片规律的标准参考。�+The sample is ionized into charged fragments, then separated by mass-to-charge ratio (m/z) in electric or magnetic fields; the peak positions and intensities reveal molecular weight and structure. McLafferty and Tureček's 'Interpretation of Mass Spectra' is the standard reference on fragmentation.�ans��src��JHarris《定量分析化学》；McLafferty 与 Tureček《质谱解析》�]Harris, Quantitative Chemical Analysis; McLafferty & Tureček, Interpretation of Mass Spectra��id�d4c4fd469e7a�body���油脂加热到冒烟点以上会发生热氧化、热裂解，产生丙烯醛等刺激性物质和少量多环芳烃。反复高温煎炸还会让油脂聚合，生成黏稠的有害物。控制油温、避免反复使用旧油可减少风险。�;Above its smoke point, oil undergoes thermal oxidation and cracking, releasing irritants such as acrolein and small amounts of polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons. Repeated high-heat frying also causes polymerization into sticky, harmful compounds. Keeping the temperature down and not reusing old oil lowers the risk.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�d7217610a44a�body���低温或短时反应受活化能主导，产物由最快路径决定（动力学控制）；高温或长时间则体系趋向最稳定的产物（热力学控制）。Diels-Alder 与烯醇化常用来展示这种产物分布的反转。��At low temperature or short time the product is set by the fastest path—kinetic control; at high temperature or long time the system favors the most stable product—thermodynamic control. Diels-Alder and enolization commonly show this product switch.�ans��src��ECarey 与 Sundberg《高等有机化学》；Atkins《物理化学》�HCarey & Sundberg, Advanced Organic Chemistry; Atkins, Physical Chemistry��id�d964109010fd�body���石油是几百种碳氢化合物的混合物，沸点从几十度到几百度不等。分馏塔自下而上温度递减，气化后的油蒸气在塔中上升时，各组分按沸点在不同高度的塔盘上冷凝：沸点最低的汽油组分最先在塔顶凝出，煤油、柴油等随后在中部凝出，重油则留在塔底。分出的馏分仍是混合物，还需催化裂化、重整等进一步加工，才能得到高辛烷值汽油等高附加值产品。�:Petroleum is a mixture of hundreds of hydrocarbons whose boiling points span from tens to several hundred degrees Celsius. In a fractionating column the temperature drops from bottom to top; as vapour rises, each compound condenses at the tray matching its boiling point - the low-boiling gasoline fraction condenses first near the top, kerosene and diesel condense lower down, and heavy residue stays at the bottom. Each fraction is still a mixture, so further steps like catalytic cracking and reforming turn them into high-value products such as high-octane gasoline.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�d9fe68a86ba4�body��\N₂ 完全对称、两端电负性相同，偶极矩为零。CO 中氧虽电负性更大，但氧的一个孤对电子以配位键形式提供给碳，且分子的主要共振结构为 ⁻C≡O⁺（碳端带部分负电荷、氧端带部分正电荷），这一电子分布压倒了电负性效应，使净偶极约 0.11 D、方向指向碳端。��N₂ is symmetric with identical end atoms, so its dipole is zero. In CO the more electronegative oxygen would pull electron density toward itself, but one of oxygen's lone pairs is donated to carbon as a dative bond and the dominant resonance form is −C≡O+ (partial negative on carbon, partial positive on oxygen). This distribution outweighs the electronegativity effect, giving CO a net dipole of about 0.11 D pointing toward the carbon end.�ans��src��HAtkins & de Paula《物理化学》（第10版），第16章分子结构�9Atkins & de Paula, "Physical Chemistry" (10th ed.), Ch.16��id�da779fd87a1f�body��先由 Lewis 酸（如 AlCl₃）生成强亲电试剂，芳环 π 电子进攻形成带正电的 σ 络合物（Wheland 中间体）破坏芳香性，随后碱夺去质子恢复芳香性得到取代产物。取代基通过给/吸电子效应与定位效应调控速率与区位。�`A Lewis acid (e.g., AlCl₃) first generates a strong electrophile; the aromatic π system attacks it to form a positively charged σ-complex (Wheland intermediate) that loses aromaticity, then a base removes a proton to restore aromaticity and yield the substituted product. Substituents control rate and position via electronic and directing effects.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�da82b02fdad8�body��)手性催化剂通过过渡态中非对映异构相互作用的能差，使一种对映体路径的活化能更低，从而主导产物。Sharpless 环氧化中，钛-酒石酸酯配合物与过氧叔丁醇配位，使烯丙醇的烯键只能从某一面进攻，得到高 ee 值的环氧产物。�ZA chiral catalyst lowers the activation energy of one enantiomeric pathway via diastereomeric transition-state interactions, making that path dominant. In Sharpless epoxidation, a titanium-tartrate complex coordinates tert-butyl hydroperoxide so the allylic alcohol's alkene is attacked preferentially from one face, giving epoxides with high ee.�ans��src�ى《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 23 章 ; 另见: T. Katsuki & K. B. Sharpless, J. Am. Chem. Soc. 1980, 102, 5974 (ACS)ًT. Katsuki & K. B. Sharpless, J. Am. Chem. Soc. 1980, 102, 5974 (ACS) ; see also: 《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 23 章��id�dab6a67d71b7�body�ٖ金属节点与有机配体自组装成周期性多孔晶格，比表面积可达数千 m²/g；孔的尺寸与功能基团可由配体设计调控。ٯMetal nodes and organic linkers self-assemble into periodic porous lattices with surface areas over thousands of m²/g; pore size and functionality are tunable via the linker.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�db9cb630f927�body���米氏方程 v = Vmax·[S]/(Km + [S]) 描述了酶促反应速率v随底物浓度[S]变化的饱和关系。Km等于反应速率达到最大速率一半时的底物浓度，反映了酶与底物的亲和力——Km越小，亲和力通常越高。�BThe Michaelis-Menten equation, v = Vmax·[S]/(Km + [S]), describes the saturating relationship between enzyme-catalyzed rate v and substrate concentration [S]. Km is the substrate concentration at which the rate is half of Vmax, and it reflects enzyme-substrate affinity—a smaller Km generally indicates higher affinity.�ans��src��e王镜岩等《生物化学》（第三版），高等教育出版社；L. Michaelis & M. Menten,1913�eWang Jingyan et al., 'Biochemistry' (3rd ed.), Higher Education Press; L. Michaelis & M. Menten, 1913��id�dbec3907d8e3�body���口红主体是蜡、油和色粉，蜡和油都是疏水的，水难以润湿溶解，所以不溶于水。它靠油脂附着在嘴唇上，喝水沾杯是表面油膜被带走。卸妆需用油性或含表面活性剂的卸妆产品。�Lipstick is mostly wax, oil, and pigment; wax and oil are hydrophobic and water cannot wet or dissolve them, so it is water-resistant. It sticks via the oil film, which transfers to a cup when drinking. Removing it needs an oily or surfactant-based makeup remover.�ans��src��KRosen & Kunjappu《表面活性剂与界面现象》（第4版），第1章�IRosen & Kunjappu, "Surfactants and Interfacial Phenomena" (4th ed.), Ch.1��id�dc148804108c�body��E当反应经由碳正离子中间体时，若邻近基团迁移能使正电荷转移到更稳定的位置（如从仲碳正离子变为更稳定的叔碳正离子），就会发生重排。典型例子是新戊基体系中1,2-氢迁移或烷基迁移，生成更稳定的碳正离子，从而改变最终产物的碳骨架。��When a reaction proceeds through a carbocation intermediate, a neighboring group migrates if doing so places the positive charge on a more stable site (e.g., from a secondary to a more stable tertiary carbocation), causing rearrangement. A classic case is a 1,2-hydride or alkyl shift in neopentyl-type systems, yielding a more stable carbocation and altering the carbon skeleton of the final product.�ans��src��Q邢其毅、裴坚《基础有机化学》（第四版），北京大学出版社�\Xing Qiyi & Pei Jian, 'Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry' (4th ed.), Peking University Press��id�dd415e417c99�body��共振结构指同一分子可用多种路易斯结构来表示，实际分子是这些结构的杂化体，没有一个单独结构能完整描述。例如碳酸根的三个C-O键等长，是三种共振式的平均。共振降低了分子能量，使其更稳定。�CResonance structures are multiple Lewis representations of the same molecule; the real molecule is a hybrid of them, and no single structure fully describes it. For example, the three C-O bonds in carbonate are equal in length, the average of three resonance forms. Resonance lowers the molecule's energy and stabilizes it.�ans��src��GMcMurry, J. 《有机化学》（第9版，Cengage）共振结构章节�FMcMurry, J. Organic Chemistry, 9th ed., Cengage (resonance structures)��id�de6f3dafa0a1�body�ٚ乙醇先被乙醇脱氢酶（ADH）变成乙醛，再靠乙醛脱氢酶（ALDH2）分解；很多人ALDH2活性低，乙醛堆积就会脸红、心悸。ٕAlcohol is converted by ADH to acetaldehyde, then by ALDH2; many people have low ALDH2, so acetaldehyde builds up, causing flushing and palpitations.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�dea8d3fceb86�body��k自由基卤代反应经历链引发（卤素分子均裂产生自由基）、链增长（夺取氢生成烷基自由基并继续传播）和链终止（自由基相互结合）三个阶段。由于不同C-H键的自由基取代速率相差不大，且反应放热量大，常生成多种一卤代物混合物，选择性较差（氯代尤甚，溴代稍好）。��Free-radical halogenation proceeds through initiation (homolysis of the halogen to form radicals), propagation (hydrogen abstraction to give an alkyl radical that continues the chain), and termination (radicals combining). Because various C-H bonds are abstracted at similar rates and the reaction is highly exothermic, multiple monohalogenated products form, giving poor selectivity—especially for chlorination, with bromination somewhat better.�ans��src��Q邢其毅、裴坚《基础有机化学》（第四版），北京大学出版社�\Xing Qiyi & Pei Jian, 'Fundamentals of Organic Chemistry' (4th ed.), Peking University Press��id�e0422482dd68�body���荧光是激发单重态直接回到单重态基态时发出的光，寿命约纳秒量级，激发光源移开后几乎立即消失。磷光则要经历系间窜越进入自旋不同的三重态，从三重态回到单重态基态在自旋上是被禁阻的，只能以慢得多的速率发生，寿命从微秒到数秒甚至更长。因此夜光材料在黑暗中仍能持续发光。�Fluorescence is light emitted when an excited singlet returns directly to the singlet ground state, with lifetimes on the nanosecond scale, so it vanishes almost immediately when the exciting source is removed. Phosphorescence requires intersystem crossing to a triplet state of different spin; return from the triplet to the singlet ground state is spin-forbidden and proceeds much more slowly, giving lifetimes from microseconds to seconds or longer. That is why glow-in-the-dark materials keep emitting in the dark.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e1d5f14dee66�body���多齿配体取代多个单齿配体时，粒子数增加使熵增（ΔS > 0），按 ΔG = ΔH − TΔS 使 ΔG 更负，平衡强烈偏向螯合物。此外螯合环的成环也提供额外的动力学与热力学稳定。� When a polydentate ligand replaces several monodentate ones, the number of particles increases, raising entropy (ΔS > 0); via ΔG = ΔH − TΔS this makes ΔG more negative, shifting equilibrium strongly toward the chelate. Ring closure adds further thermodynamic and kinetic stability.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�e363291dfeb5�body��	氨基酸表面活性剂以氨基酸为亲水头，结构与皮肤天然成分接近，在弱酸性下清洁力适中、脱脂少，对皮脂膜刺激小。相比强硫酸盐表活（如SLES），它洗后不易紧绷。但成本较高，常与其他表活复配。�;Amino-acid surfactants use an amino acid as the hydrophilic head, close to the skin's own components, and clean moderately at skin's weak acidity with little degreasing, so they irritate the barrier less. Versus strong sulfate surfactants like SLES, they leave skin less tight. They cost more and are often blended.�ans��src��KRosen & Kunjappu《表面活性剂与界面现象》（第4版），第1章�IRosen & Kunjappu, "Surfactants and Interfacial Phenomena" (4th ed.), Ch.1��id�e386f983f3e0�body��苯环富电子，易受带正电的亲电试剂进攻，发生取代而非加成。典型反应包括硝化（与混酸生成硝基苯）、卤代（FeX₃ 催化下上卤素）和傅-克烷基化/酰基化。这些反应保留了芳香环的稳定结构。�(Benzene's electron-rich ring is attacked by electrophiles, undergoing substitution rather than addition. Typical reactions include nitration (with mixed acid to nitrobenzene), halogenation (halogen under FeX₃), and Friedel–Crafts alkylation/acylation. These preserve the stable aromatic ring.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�e3b0f1f8b8ca�body��}把极细的金纳米颗粒（直径约几十纳米）分散在玻璃中，会形成胶体。金纳米颗粒对特定波长的可见光产生表面等离子体共振，强烈吸收绿光并散射红光，于是玻璃整体呈现深红（宝石红）。颜色取决于颗粒大小、形状和浓度——这是“胶体金”的纳米尺度光学效应，而非金的本体黄色。��Tiny gold nanoparticles (tens of nanometers across) dispersed in glass form a colloid. They exhibit surface plasmon resonance, strongly absorbing green light and scattering red, so the glass as a whole looks deep ruby red. The exact hue depends on particle size, shape, and concentration. The color is a nanoscale optical effect of colloidal gold, not the bulk yellow of the metal itself.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�e45aab9a3143�body���阿拉伯炼金家（如贾比尔）发展了蒸馏技术，alembic一词源自阿拉伯语，用于制取酒精、精油和无水矿物酸，是伊斯兰黄金时代对化学的重要贡献。ٯArab alchemists like Jabir advanced distillation; alembic comes from Arabic and was used for alcohol, essential oils and mineral acids—a key Islamic Golden Age contribution.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�e463087e79c3�body��gNMC 正极通式为 LiNiₓMnᵧCo_{1−ₓ−ᵧ}O₂（x+y+z=1），镍提升比容量，锰稳定结构并改善安全，钴提高电导与倍率性能。提高镍含量（如 NMC811）可增加能量密度，但会加剧阳离子混排与界面副反应，降低循环寿命。因此材料设计是在容量、稳定性与成本之间的多目标权衡。��NMC cathodes have the formula LiNiₓMnᵧCo_{1−ₓ−ᵧ}O₂ (x+y+z=1), where nickel boosts capacity, manganese stabilizes the structure and safety, and cobalt improves conductivity and rate capability. Raising nickel content (e.g., NMC811) increases energy density but worsens cation mixing and interfacial side reactions, shortening cycle life. Material design thus trades off capacity, stability, and cost.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e4b89b6a2bf5�body�ف纸张和棉纤维里的木质素等成分被光和氧慢慢氧化成发黄的物质，漂白剂残留也会催化这一过程。ٓLignin and similar components in paper and cotton slowly oxidize into yellow compounds under light and oxygen, and bleach residues can catalyze it.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�e4d6c70dd680�body���青霉素的beta-内酰胺环结构与肽聚糖合成末端的D-Ala-D-Ala片段相似，能不可逆地酰化转肽酶（青霉素结合蛋白PBP），抑制肽聚糖交联，细菌因细胞壁不完整而裂解。耐药菌通过产生beta-内酰胺酶水解青霉素，或突变PBP降低对药物的亲和力来抵抗，因此临床上开发了耐酶青霉素和beta-内酰胺酶抑制剂（如克拉维酸）组合用药。��Penicillin's beta-lactam ring mimics the D-Ala-D-Ala terminus of peptidoglycan synthesis, irreversibly acylating transpeptidases (penicillin-binding proteins, PBPs), blocking cell-wall crosslinking so bacteria lyse. Resistant bacteria produce beta-lactamases that hydrolyze penicillin or mutate PBPs to lower drug affinity; clinically this led to penicillinase-resistant penicillins and combinations with beta-lactamase inhibitors such as clavulanic acid.�ans��src��*Nature（青霉素机制与耐药研究）�1Nature (penicillin mechanism and resistance); ACS��id�e59ec8a11aa2�body�٢光合作用是植物利用光能把二氧化碳和水转化为葡萄糖并释放氧气的过程。简化方程式为6CO2加6H2O在光照下生成C6H12O6加6O2。��Photosynthesis is the process by which plants use light energy to convert carbon dioxide and water into glucose while releasing oxygen. The simplified equation is 6CO2 plus 6H2O under light giving C6H12O6 plus 6O2.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e6d0bb4b8ea9�body�ٮ中和反应是酸和碱反应生成盐和水的反应，本质是氢离子与氢氧根结合成水。中和反应通常放热，常用于调节土壤酸度和处理胃酸。��A neutralization reaction is the reaction of an acid and a base to form a salt and water, essentially hydrogen ions combining with hydroxide ions to make water. It is usually exothermic and is used to adjust soil acidity and treat stomach acid.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�e782745de28e�body���系统误差方向和大小时刻一定，来自仪器未校准、方法缺陷或试剂不纯，重复测量无法减小，须通过校准仪器、空白试验、对照试验或使用标准物质来校正。随机误差围绕真值随机波动，来自读数估读、温度微小变化等，增加测量次数取平均可减小。准确度主要受系统误差影响，精密度反映随机误差的大小。�Systematic error has a fixed direction and magnitude, caused by uncalibrated instruments, flawed methods or impure reagents; repeating measurements does not reduce it, and it is corrected by calibrating instruments, running blanks and controls, or using reference standards. Random error fluctuates around the true value, arising from reading estimation, slight temperature drift, and similar factors; averaging more measurements reduces it. Accuracy is limited mainly by systematic error, while precision reflects random error.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e795e220b723�body��	ADMET 指吸收、分布、代谢、排泄和毒性，描述药物在体内的命运与安全性。许多高活性分子因口服生物利用度低、代谢过快或被代谢成毒物而失败，因此改善 ADMET 性质往往决定候选药物能否进入临床。�2ADMET stands for absorption, distribution, metabolism, excretion, and toxicity, describing a drug's fate and safety in the body. Many potent molecules fail because of poor oral bioavailability, rapid metabolism, or toxic metabolites, so improving ADMET often decides whether a candidate reaches the clinic.�ans��src��t《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 2 章 ; 另见: I. Kola & J. Landis, Nat. Rev. Drug Discov. 2004, 3, 711�vI. Kola & J. Landis, Nat. Rev. Drug Discov. 2004, 3, 711 ; see also: 《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 2 章��id�e8941ef0f236�body��NEDTA（乙二胺四乙酸）能与几乎全部金属离子形成稳定且通常为1:1的螯合物，因此可用于广泛金属离子的定量测定。滴定需在受控pH（常加氨—铵盐缓冲液）下进行，因为EDTA的配位能力与pH密切相关；金属指示剂则在终点时因EDTA夺取金属离子而变色指示。�{EDTA (ethylenediaminetetraacetic acid) forms stable, usually 1:1 chelates with nearly all metal ions, so it can quantify a wide range of them. The titration is run at a controlled pH (often an ammonia-ammonium buffer) because EDTA's complexing ability depends strongly on pH, and a metal indicator signals the endpoint by changing color when EDTA displaces it from the metal ion.�ans��src��u华中师范大学、东北师范大学、陕西师范大学《分析化学》（第四版），高等教育出版社�`Central China Normal University et al., 'Analytical Chemistry' (4th ed.), Higher Education Press��id�eaceb4e3b8e0�body��+手性催化剂本身具有不对称的立体环境，反应物在其活性中心有两种对映面的结合方式，其中能量更低的一种占优势，从而只加速生成某一种对映体。2001 年诺贝尔化学奖即授予 Knowles、Noyori、Sharpless 在不对称催化领域的贡献。�ZA chiral catalyst presents an asymmetric environment at its active site, so the reactant can bind in two mirror-image orientations with different energies; the lower-energy pathway dominates and selectively accelerates formation of one enantiomer. The 2001 Nobel Prize in Chemistry honored Knowles, Noyori, and Sharpless for asymmetric catalysis.�ans��src��`W. S. Knowles, R. Noyori, K. B. Sharpless，《Science》，1996年，第274卷，1626至1638页�QW. S. Knowles, R. Noyori, K. B. Sharpless, Science, 1996, vol. 274, pp. 1626-1638��id�ead3007a4dfd�body���马氏规则：不对称烯烃与卤化氢加成时，氢加到含氢较多的碳上，卤素加到含氢较少的碳上。现代解释基于碳正离子中间体稳定性：质子先进攻双键，形成的碳正离子越稳定越占优势，而烷基取代越多、超共轭越强，正离子越稳定。在过氧化物存在下，HBr按自由基机理加成，得到反马氏产物。��Markovnikov's rule: when HX adds to an unsymmetrical alkene, hydrogen goes to the carbon bearing more hydrogens and halogen to the carbon bearing fewer. The modern explanation rests on carbocation stability: protonation produces a carbocation intermediate, and the more alkyl-substituted cation, stabilized by hyperconjugation and induction, forms preferentially. In the presence of peroxides, HBr adds by a radical mechanism and gives the anti-Markovnikov product.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�ec3b7cb98534�body���质谱先把样品分子电离成带正电的离子，再让它们在电场中加速、进入磁场或飞行管，离子运动的弯曲程度或飞行时间取决于质荷比 m/z。同样电荷下，质量越小的离子偏转越厉害，检测器按 m/z 从小到大记录出峰，形成质谱图。分子离子峰给出分子的相对分子质量，碎片离子峰则反映分子断裂的方式，帮助推断结构；高分辨质谱甚至可以区分相差不足一个电子质量的分子。��A mass spectrometer ionizes sample molecules into positively charged ions, accelerates them in an electric field, and sends them through a magnetic sector or a flight tube, where how much they curve or how long they fly depends on the mass-to-charge ratio m/z. For equal charge, lighter ions deflect more, and the detector records peaks from small to large m/z, producing a mass spectrum. The molecular-ion peak gives the relative molecular mass, while fragment-ion peaks reveal how the molecule breaks apart and help infer its structure; high-resolution instruments can even tell apart molecules differing by far less than one electron's mass.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�ed76bd716a6d�body���Q 与 K 形式相同但用任意时刻浓度/分压。若 Q < K，反应正向进行以增大产物；Q > K 则逆向进行；Q = K 时达平衡。这一判据比勒夏特列更定量且普适。�Q has the same form as K but uses instantaneous concentrations/partial pressures. If Q < K, the reaction proceeds forward to make more product; if Q > K, it goes reverse; Q = K means equilibrium. This criterion is more quantitative and general than Le Chatelier.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�edd53973bc53�body���茶叶含茶多酚和色素（如茶黄素、茶红素），热水萃取后能附着在天然纤维上，呈现褐黄到棕褐色。经明矾或铁媒染后颜色更深更牢。它是一种随手可得的天然染料，常用于草木染体验。�Tea contains polyphenols and pigments like theaflavins and thearubigins that extract in hot water and attach to natural fibers, giving yellow-brown to brown shades. Alum or iron mordant deepens and fixes the color. It is a handy natural dye for plant-dyeing projects.�ans��src��bZollinger H., Color Chemistry, 3rd ed., Wiley-VCH, 2003, 第 2 章(染料结构与颜色的关系)�fZollinger H., Color Chemistry, 3rd ed., Wiley-VCH, 2003, Ch. 2 (structure-color relationships in dyes)��id�ef2b239f1256�body��!稀有气体外层电子全满，化学性质极不活泼，但并非绝对不反应。1962 年巴特利特首次合成六氟合铂酸氙，此后人们制得了 XeF₂、XeF₄、XeO₃ 等多种氙化合物。较重稀有气体（如氙、氪）在强氧化条件下可形成化合物。�=Noble gases have full valence shells and are extremely inert, but not absolutely unreactive. In 1962 Bartlett first synthesized xenon hexafluoroplatinate, and later compounds such as XeF₂, XeF₄, and XeO₃ were made. Heavier noble gases like xenon and krypton can form compounds under strong oxidizing conditions.�ans��src��*《无机化学》（武汉大学等编）�!Inorganic Chemistry (Wuhan Univ.)��id�ef8316063793�body���能斯特方程 E = E° − (RT/nF)lnQ 把电池电动势与温度、反应物活度联系起来，说明浓度与 pH 如何改变实际电极电势。Nernst 在 1888 年导出它，是理解电池、神经电位与 pH 计的基础。��The Nernst equation E = E° − (RT/nF)lnQ links cell voltage to temperature and reactant activities, showing how concentration and pH shift real electrode potentials. Nernst derived it in 1888; it underlies batteries, nerve potentials and pH meters.�ans��src��A能斯特 1888 年论文；Bard 与 Faulkner《电化学方法》�7Nernst (1888); Bard & Faulkner, Electrochemical Methods��id�efa29c5fe38a�body��?在配体电场作用下，原本能量简并的五个d轨道会按对称性分裂成不同能级（如八面体场中分裂为t2g和eg两组）。当电子在分裂后的d轨道间跃迁（d-d跃迁）并吸收特定波长的可见光时，配合物便呈现其补色，因此许多过渡金属配合物带有颜色。�{Under the ligand electric field, the five degenerate d orbitals split into different energy levels according to symmetry (e.g., into t2g and eg sets in an octahedral field). When electrons transition between these split d levels (d-d transitions) and absorb specific visible wavelengths, the complex shows the complementary color—so many transition-metal complexes are colored.�ans��src��E武汉大学《无机化学》（第三版），高等教育出版社�IWuhan University, 'Inorganic Chemistry' (3rd ed.), Higher Education Press��id�f13d74f6f069�body���蝴蝶翅膀和孔雀羽毛的蓝绿色来自“结构色”：其表面有周期性纳米结构（如多层薄膜、光栅），通过薄膜干涉或衍射选择性反射特定波长，而非靠色素吸收。因此颜色随观察角度变化、不会像染料那样褪色，且常带金属光泽。把这类结构研磨破坏后颜色即消失，正说明它源于物理结构而非化学颜料。��The blues and greens of butterfly wings and peacock feathers come from structural color: nanoscale periodic structures (multilayers, gratings) interfere with or diffract light to selectively reflect particular wavelengths, instead of pigments absorbing others. The color therefore shifts with viewing angle, does not fade like a dye, and often has a metallic sheen. Grind the structure apart and the color disappears—proof it is physical, not chemical.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�f1e437dae679�body��活化能 Ea 是反应物越过能垒所需的最低能量，决定温度对速率的敏感程度；指前因子 A 反映碰撞频率与空间取向等概率因素。对 ln k 对 1/T 作图（阿伦尼乌斯图），斜率给出 −Ea/R，截距给出 ln A。�%The activation energy Ea is the minimum energy to cross the barrier and governs how sharply rate responds to temperature; the pre-exponential factor A reflects collision frequency and orientation probability. Plotting ln k versus 1/T (an Arrhenius plot) gives slope −Ea/R and intercept ln A.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�f2ffe3f1c6bd�body��{助剂能软化硬水、绑定钙镁离子并维持碱性，让表面活性剂专心去油污，还防止水垢再沉积。َBuilders soften hard water, bind calcium and magnesium, and keep the wash alkaline so surfactants focus on grease and prevent scale redeposit.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�f397a205434a�body��T方法先向样品加入已知量的同位素标记（如 ¹³C 标记）内标，让它和待测物均匀混合；由于两者化学性质相同、分离行为一致，任何前处理损失对二者比例都无影响。用质谱测同位素比值即可反推原含量，几乎不受回收率偏差干扰，故常用于标准物质定值。��The method spikes the sample with a known amount of an isotope-labeled (e.g., ¹³C) internal standard that mixes homogeneously with the analyte; because the two share identical chemistry and separation behavior, any processing loss affects their ratio equally. Measuring the isotope ratio by mass spectrometry back-calculates the original amount, largely immune to recovery errors, so it is used to certify reference materials.�ans��src��cNIST 标准参考物质方法（同位素稀释质谱）；Skoog 等《分析化学基础》第9版�yNIST Standard Reference Materials — isotope-dilution MS; Skoog et al., "Fundamentals of Analytical Chemistry" (9th ed.)��id�f3ace4a35d25�body��M荧光是发射光与激发光波长不同，可在全暗背景下测量极弱信号，故检测限远低于吸收法。荧光量子产率取决于辐射跃迁速率与非辐射过程（内转换、系间窜越、能量转移、猝灭）的竞争。重原子、顺磁性物质、碰撞猝灭剂及分子内旋转都会降低产率。��Fluorescence emits at a different wavelength from excitation, so it can be measured against a dark background, giving detection limits far below absorption methods. Quantum yield depends on the competition between radiative decay and nonradiative processes (internal conversion, intersystem crossing, energy transfer, quenching). Heavy atoms, paramagnetic species, collisional quenchers, and intramolecular rotation all lower the yield.�ans��src��_《分析化学》(武汉大学, 第五版) 分子发光章；IUPAC（光化学术语，2006）�[IUPAC (Photochemistry Terminology, 2006); Lakowicz, Principles of Fluorescence Spectroscopy��id�f5a9b99d8663�body��分子中的化学键像弹簧一样以特征频率振动（伸缩、弯曲等）。当红外光频率与某化学键的振动频率相等时，该键吸收红外能量、振动加剧，在光谱上出现吸收峰。不同官能团因原子质量和键强不同，吸收峰位置固定：例如羟基 O-H 在3300到2500 cm-1 附近出宽峰，羰基 C=O 在1700 cm-1 左右出强峰。把未知物的红外谱图与特征吸收表对照，就能确认它含哪些官能团，是鉴定未知有机化合物的常规手段。��Chemical bonds behave like springs vibrating at characteristic frequencies (stretching, bending). When the frequency of infrared light matches a bond's vibration frequency, the bond absorbs that energy and vibrates more strongly, producing an absorption peak. Each functional group absorbs at a characteristic position set by its atom masses and bond strength - for instance, O-H gives a broad band around 3300-2500 cm⁻¹ and C=O a strong peak near 1700 cm⁻¹. Matching the spectrum of an unknown compound against tables of characteristic absorptions therefore reveals its functional groups, making IR a routine tool for identifying organic compounds.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�f6bf61d4b4ae�body��(铝的标准电极电位比铁更负，热力学上更易被氧化；但氧化生成的 Al₂O₃ 膜致密且与基体结合牢固，立刻隔绝氧气和水，使腐蚀"自钝化"而停止。铁锈 Fe₂O₃·xH₂O 疏松多孔、容易剥落，无法阻隔环境，基体便持续被侵蚀。�UAluminum has a more negative standard potential than iron and is thermodynamically easier to oxidize, but the Al₂O₃ film it forms is dense and adheres tightly, instantly sealing off oxygen and water so corrosion self-passivates. Rust (Fe₂O₃·xH₂O) is porous and flakes off, leaving the underlying metal exposed to continued attack.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�f8322ff0aa24�body��血红蛋白四个亚基在结合氧后发生构象变化（T 态转 R 态），使后续亚基更易结合氧，呈 S 形氧合曲线。Perutz 用 X 射线晶体学阐明了这一变构结构基础，协同效应的分子机制在 1970 年的《自然》论文中被系统提出。�0Hemoglobin's four subunits change conformation (T to R state) as oxygen binds, making later sites bind more easily and giving a sigmoidal curve. Perutz elucidated this allosteric structural basis by X-ray crystallography, and the molecular mechanism of cooperativity was set out in his 1970 Nature paper.�ans��src��VLehninger《生物化学原理》；Perutz《自然》1970 年（T↔R 变构机制）�XLehninger, Principles of Biochemistry; Perutz, Nature (1970, T↔R allosteric mechanism)��id�fa324228e9a8�body�ٍ镜片里嵌有螺吡喃等分子，受紫外线激发后结构重排吸收可见光而变暗，紫外线消失又恢复原结构变透明。�}They embed molecules like spiropyrans that rearrange under UV to absorb visible light (darkening) and revert when UV is gone.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�fa494a24c213�body���按 Cahn-Ingold-Prelog 规则依原子序数给四个取代基排序（序号 1 最高），将最低优先级基团指向远离观察者，若 1→2→3 为顺时针则 为 R，逆时针为 S。出现双键/孤对或同位素时按扩展规则处理。�Under Cahn-Ingold-Prelog rules, rank the four substituents by atomic number (1 highest); orient the lowest-priority group away, and if 1→2→3 traces clockwise the center is R, counterclockwise S. Double bonds, lone pairs, and isotopes are handled by extended rules.�ans��src��H邢其毅 等,《基础有机化学》第4版,北京大学出版社,2016�QXing Qiyi et al., Basic Organic Chemistry, 4th ed., Peking University Press, 2016��id�faa9eca26a68�body���某些丙酸菌在成熟时分解乳酸产生二氧化碳，气体在半固体凝乳中聚集成孔，形成眼睛。孔洞大小和数量取决于菌种、温度和凝乳硬度。孔太多反而可能说明发酵过度。�Certain propionic bacteria break down lactate during ripening and release carbon dioxide, which gathers into bubbles in the semi-solid curd to form eyes. Hole size and number depend on the strain, temperature, and curd firmness. Too many holes can signal over-fermentation.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�fe066c29d56e�body��玻璃在常温下有固定形状和弹性模量，符合固体的特征；它只是在冷却时黏度增长太快、来不及排成规整晶格，形成原子无序堆积的"非晶体"。老式窗玻璃"底厚"是制造工艺造成的，并非缓慢流动的证据。�5At room temperature glass has a definite shape and elastic modulus, behaving as a solid; it simply cooled so fast that viscosity rose before atoms could arrange into a crystal, yielding a disordered "amorphous" structure. The thicker bottoms of old windowpanes come from manufacturing, not from sluggish flow.�ans��src��DCallister《材料科学基础》（第9版），第3章非晶材料�>Callister, "Materials Science and Engineering" (9th ed.), Ch.3��id�ff5bd9270d66�body��~EDTA含两个氨基和四个羧基，共六个配位原子，能与金属离子形成1比1的六齿螯合物。螯合效应的热力学根源主要是熵增：配体结合时释放出多个原先独立结合的水分子，体系混乱度增大，使吉布斯自由能变化更负，配合物因而更稳定。这也是EDTA用于水软化、重金属解毒和定量分析的原因。��EDTA has two amino and four carboxyl groups - six donor atoms - and forms 1:1 hexadentate chelates with metal ions. The chelate effect is largely entropic: binding releases several water molecules that were independently coordinated, increasing the disorder of the system, making the Gibbs free energy change more negative and the complex more stable. This is why EDTA softens water, treats heavy-metal toxicity and serves in quantitative analysis.�ans��src��'《无机化学》配位化合物章节�DInorganic Chemistry (coordination compounds); IUPAC (chelate effect)��id�ffd13735ffdf�body�ٓ充放电中负极表面不断生成并破裂固态电解质膜（SEI），消耗锂离子；正极金属也会溶出，可用容量逐渐下降。ٗCycling grows and cracks the solid-electrolyte interphase (SEI) on the anode, consuming Li ions, while cathode metals dissolve—usable capacity fades.�ans��src��XTarascon, J.-M.; Armand, M. 《可充电锂电池面临的挑战》，《Nature》, 2001�wTarascon, J.-M.; Armand, M. 'Issues and Challenges Facing Rechargeable Lithium Batteries,' Nature, 2001, 414, 359–367��id�051c0f0600d9�body���Heck 反应是钯催化下卤代芳烃与烯烃偶联生成取代烯烃，关键步骤为氧化加成、烯烃迁移插入和 β-氢消除；Sonogashira 反应由钯/铜协同催化，卤代烃与末端炔烃经氧化加成、铜炔化物转金属化、还原消除偶联，生成芳基取代的内炔。成键类型上前者构筑 C(sp2)-C(sp2) 键，后者构筑 C(sp2)-C(sp) 键。�The Heck reaction couples aryl halides with alkenes under palladium catalysis to give substituted alkenes, proceeding through oxidative addition, migratory insertion of the alkene, and beta-hydride elimination; the Sonogashira reaction uses Pd/Cu cocatalysis to couple aryl halides with terminal alkynes through oxidative addition, transmetalation of a copper acetylide, and reductive elimination to give aryl-substituted internal alkynes. The former forms a C(sp2)-C(sp2) bond and the latter a C(sp2)-C(sp) bond.�ans��src��v《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 22 章 ; 另见: R. F. Heck, J. Am. Chem. Soc. 1972, 94, 5898 (ACS)�xR. F. Heck, J. Am. Chem. Soc. 1972, 94, 5898 (ACS) ; see also: 《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 22 章��id�12e6c0e03fd5�body��t混凝土凝固（水化）时，水泥与水反应生成凝胶并消耗水分；表面蒸发和内部水分向表面迁移（干燥收缩）使体积缩小，而内部约束限制了自由收缩，于是在内部产生拉应力。当拉应力超过混凝土早期抗拉强度时便开裂。控制水灰比、养护保湿、添加减缩剂或配筋可减轻收缩开裂。��As concrete sets, cement reacts with water (hydration) to form a gel and consumes water; evaporation from the surface and water migrating outward (drying shrinkage) make the volume shrink, but internal constraints prevent free contraction, building tensile stress. When that stress exceeds the young concrete's tensile strength, cracks form. Keeping the mix wet during curing, lowering the water–cement ratio, adding shrinkage reducers, or using reinforcement all help limit cracking.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�4f179bc1a43d�body�ل土壤和花岗岩会释放放射性氡气，在密闭室内积累，长期吸入增加肺癌风险；加强通风可显著降低。�|Soil and granite emit radioactive radon; trapped indoors it accumulates and raises lung-cancer risk—ventilation lowers it.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�5d96516005cd�body�� 药物的电离状态决定其脂溶性与跨膜能力：非离子化形式更易穿过生物膜，离子化形式水溶性更好、利于转运。根据 Henderson-Hasselbalch 关系，胃肠道 pH 决定了弱酸/弱碱的吸收部位，因此电离常数 pKa 是关键的成药性质。�PA drug's ionization state governs lipophilicity and membrane crossing: the non-ionized form crosses biological membranes more easily, while the ionized form is more water-soluble for transport. By the Henderson-Hasselbalch relation, GI tract pH determines where weak acids or bases are absorbed, so pKa is a key developability property.�ans��src�ٗ《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 2 章 ; 另见: G. L. Amidon, H. Lennernäs, V. P. Shah, J. R. Crison, Pharm. Res. 1995, 12, 413 (Springer)ٙG. L. Amidon, H. Lennernäs, V. P. Shah, J. R. Crison, Pharm. Res. 1995, 12, 413 (Springer) ; see also: 《药物化学》(尤启冬) 第 3 版 第 2 章��id�751455d18c53�body�ي水泥的水化反应需要水，持续湿润让硅酸钙充分生成凝胶、强度稳定增长；缺水会表面开裂、强度不足。ٚCement hydration needs water; keeping it moist lets calcium-silicate gel form and strength grow steadily, while drying causes surface cracks and weakness.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�8beb90fe1b30�body�ِ普鲁士蓝是亚铁氰化铁，人体基本不吸收，却能在肠道结合铊、铯等重金属促其排出，既是颜料也是解毒药。هPrussian blue (iron ferrocyanide) is not absorbed but binds thallium/cesium in the gut, speeding excretion—both pigment and antidote.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�952ec4b65141�body���海水含有大量溶解盐（尤其氯离子），导电性远高于淡水，使腐蚀微电池回路电阻降低、电流增大。氯离子还能破坏金属表面的钝化膜，加速点蚀，因此海水环境腐蚀更为严重。�Seawater contains abundant dissolved salts (especially chloride) and conducts far better than freshwater, lowering the resistance of corrosion microcell circuits and increasing current. Chloride also breaks passive films and induces pitting, so marine corrosion is much more severe.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�a06c9986bbac�body�ه它们与肌红蛋白形成亚硝基肌红蛋白显粉红色并抑制肉毒梭菌；但过量可生成亚硝胺致癌，故需限量。ٗThey form nitroso-myoglobin for the pink color and inhibit Clostridium botulinum; but excess can form carcinogenic nitrosamines, so levels are limited.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�b7597d77eeac�body�ِ用糖解或甲醇解把聚酯水解/醇解回单体（BHET 或对苯二甲酸二甲酯），再聚合得到原生级塑料，可循环多次。ٙGlycolysis or methanolysis breaks the polyester back into monomers (BHET or DMT) that are repolymerized into virgin-grade plastic, recyclable many times.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�c1d057ce7b51�body��$这类反应往往是多步且有放热预平衡（如 NO 氧化），升温使平衡常数减小、关键中间体浓度下降，整体表观速率下降。这并不否定阿伦尼乌斯关系，而是表观速率常数由多个步骤常数组合而成，需区分基元与表观活化能。��Such reactions are usually multistep with an exothermic pre-equilibrium (for example the oxidation of NO); heating lowers that equilibrium constant and the concentration of the key intermediate, so the overall apparent rate falls. This does not contradict the Arrhenius relation: the apparent rate constant is a composite of several elementary rate constants, so the apparent activation energy can be negative even when every elementary step has a positive one.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�chem_26_002�body��因为只有量子力学能描述反应中化学键的断裂与生成，全蛋白QM计算代价又高得不可行，而纯力场无法处理成键变化，QM/MM正好取长补短。机理：将底物、辅因子及参与质子或电子转移的关键残基划入QM区，用DFT或半经验方法求解电子结构；其余蛋白和溶剂作为MM区用经典力场点电荷提供静电与范德华环境并影响QM区势能面，边界用连接原子封端。由此在可承受的计算量内同时保留化学精度和环境效应。�oOnly quantum mechanics can describe bonds breaking and forming in a reaction step, full QM on an entire protein is hopelessly expensive, and classical force fields cannot handle bond changes, so QM/MM splits the labor. Substrates, cofactors, and key residues shuttling protons or electrons form a QM region solved with DFT or semiempirical methods; the rest of the protein and solvent act as MM point charges supplying electrostatics and van der Waals environments that shape the QM potential surface, capped by link atoms at the boundary. This keeps chemical fidelity and environmental effects together at affordable cost.�ans��src�ٞA. Warshel、M. Levitt《Theoretical studies of enzymic reactions》，J. Mol. Biol.，1976年，第103卷，227页（该工作获2013年诺贝尔化学奖）�gA. Warshel & M. Levitt, J. Mol. Biol., 1976, 103, 227 (recognized by the 2013 Nobel Prize in Chemistry)��id�chem_26_010�body��依据是阴阳离子间的强静电作用把蒸气压压到检测极限以下，使用环节几乎零挥发性有机物排放，离子组合可像搭积木一样按目标性质定制，并能蒸馏回收多次循环。争议集中在全生命周期视角：部分咪唑类离子液体对水生生物毒性高且难降解，六氟磷酸根遇湿可能水解生成氢氟酸，合成与纯化耗能耗时，一旦缺乏配套回收体系，其整体环境足迹未必优于常规溶剂，绿色标签须逐例审视。�yThe case rests on the strong Coulomb attraction between paired ions pushing vapor pressure below detection, essentially zero volatile organic emissions during use, modular design of cation-anion combinations for targeted properties, and repeated recovery through distillation. Controversy centers on the lifecycle view: several imidazolium systems show high aquatic toxicity and poor biodegradability, hexafluorophosphate anions can hydrolyze toward hydrofluoric acid on contact with moisture, and synthesis plus purification consume energy and time, so without robust recycling the net footprint need not beat conventional solvents.�ans��src��qR. D. Rogers、K. R. Seddon《Ionic liquids—solvents of the future?》，Science，2003年，第302卷，792页�SR. D. Rogers & K. R. Seddon, Science, 2003, 302, 792 (DOI: 10.1126/science.1090313)��id�chem_26_015�body���因为真正分解的不是普通分子A，而是经碰撞获得的富能分子A*，压力决定A*的去活化与分解谁更快。机理：碰撞把A活化为A*，A*或被淬灭回A，或越过能垒分解成产物；对A*取稳态近似可得速率=k₁k₂[A]²/(k₋₁[A]+k₂)。高压下碰撞频繁，k₋₁[A]≫k₂，速率正比于[A]，表观为一级；低压下碰撞稀少，k₂≫k₋₁[A]，速率正比于[A]²，转为二级。这一时间滞后思想日后发展为RRKM理论。��What decomposes is not ordinary molecule A but an energized molecule A* built by collisions, and pressure decides whether quenching or decomposition consumes A* faster. Collisions activate A into A*, which either sheds its excess energy in another collision or clears the barrier to products; a steady-state treatment of A* gives a rate of k1 times k2 times [A] squared divided by k-1[A] plus k2. At high pressure deactivation dominates, the denominator is ruled by k-1[A], and the rate is first-order in A; at low pressure collisions grow scarce, decomposition wins, and the rate turns second-order. This time-lag picture later matured into RRKM theory.�ans��src�٬Lindemann（附 Arrhenius、Langmuir、Dhar 讨论）,《Discussion on “the radiation theory of chemical action”》,Trans. Faraday Soc.,1922 (DOI: 10.1039/tf9221700598)ٚLindemann, Arrhenius, Langmuir & Dhar, 'Discussion on “the radiation theory of chemical action”', Trans. Faraday Soc., 1922, DOI: 10.1039/tf9221700598��id�dd418cf21124�body��{含碳酸盐岩石的湖泊有碱度缓冲，能中和酸；缺乏缓冲的湖泊酸度积累，鱼和微生物会受害。�vLakes with carbonate rocks have alkalinity to neutralize acid; poorly buffered lakes accumulate acidity, harming life.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�e6dc854b190d�body��2配体效应指配体的电子给受能力和空间位阻改变金属中心的电子密度与空位，从而影响氧化加成、迁移插入和还原消除的速率。富电子膦配体促进氧化加成，大位阻膦配体则限制副反应、提高选择性，二者是设计催化剂的核心旋钮。�wThe ligand effect means a ligand's electron-donating/withdrawing ability and steric bulk change the metal's electron density and open coordination sites, affecting rates of oxidative addition, insertion, and reductive elimination. Electron-rich phosphines promote oxidative addition while bulky phosphines suppress side reactions and raise selectivity, both key design knobs.�ans��src��p《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 22 章 ; 另见: C. A. Tolman, Chem. Rev. 1977, 77, 313 (ACS)�rC. A. Tolman, Chem. Rev. 1977, 77, 313 (ACS) ; see also: 《有机化学》(邢其毅) 第二版 下册 第 22 章��id�ec456ccf76cc�body��量子产率定义为每吸收一个光子所引起的指定化学事件（反应物消耗或产物生成）的数目，可大于 1（链反应）或小于 1（伴随失活）。它是衡量光化学反应效率的核心指标，用于比较光催化剂和反应路径。� Quantum yield is the number of specified chemical events (reactant consumed or product formed) per photon absorbed; it can exceed 1 in chain reactions or be below 1 when deactivation competes. It is the central metric of photochemical efficiency for comparing photocatalysts and pathways.�ans��src��B傅献彩 等,《物理化学》第5版,高等教育出版社,2005�LFu Xiancai et al., Physical Chemistry, 5th ed., Higher Education Press, 2005��id�4c6bffb4459e�body�ـBPA结构类似雌激素，可能从容器迁入食物，干扰人体内分泌，所以婴幼儿用品多改用BPA-free材料。�vBPA mimics estrogen and can leach into food, potentially disrupting hormones, so baby products use BPA-free materials.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�5ca161fbbae4�body�٢玻璃中电子需要的激发能量高于可见光光子能量，所以可见光不被吸收而直接穿过；金属有大量自由电子会吸收并反射光。لGlass has a band gap larger than visible photons, so light passes through; metals have free electrons that absorb and reflect light.�ans��src��AHousecroft & Sharpe,《Inorganic Chemistry》第5版,Pearson,2018�NC. E. Housecroft and A. G. Sharpe, Inorganic Chemistry, 5th ed., Pearson, 2018��id�623c9ea1d33d�body���化学防晒剂是共轭有机分子，能级差对上紫外光子，吸光后电子跳到激发态。关键在下一步：它靠内转换极快地回到基态，把能量交给分子振动、散成热，光既没深入皮肤，也没把分子拆坏。UVB 波长短、主要伤表皮，UVA 波长长、钻得深，而单个分子的吸收带很窄，得几种接力才盖得住。它不像物理颗粒只靠散射反射，且吸光会衰减，所以要补涂。�%Chemical UV filters are conjugated organic molecules whose energy gap matches an ultraviolet photon, so absorbing the light lifts an electron into an excited state. The decisive step is the next one: they return to the ground state by internal conversion extremely fast, handing the energy to molecular vibration, that is, to heat. The light neither penetrates far into skin nor lingers long enough to break the molecule apart. UVB is the shorter wavelength that mainly scorches the surface, UVA the longer one that reaches deeper, and since a single molecule absorbs only a narrow band, several filters must be lined up to cover it. Unlike physical particles, which work mainly by scattering and reflection, these convert the energy, and their absorbing power decays, which is why they must be reapplied.�ans��src��iTheodore Gray,《Molecules: The Elements and the Architecture of Everything》,Black Dog & Leventhal,2014�5Theodore Gray, Molecules, Black Dog & Leventhal, 2014��id�6463d3dce906�body��渗透是水穿半透膜流向浓侧，直到两边化学势持平，撑住的压差便是渗透压，稀溶液中近似正比于浓度与热力学温度。反渗透是在浓侧加一道高于渗透压的外压，逼溶剂反向穿膜，盐分留在浓水侧排走：膜过的是溶剂而非溶液。两点常被略过：进料越咸所需压差越大，家用机与海水淡化不同量级；机理也不是把离子筛在孔外，而是致密膜内溶解扩散的快慢差别，二氧化碳等小分子照样透过。�:Osmosis is water crossing a semipermeable membrane toward the concentrated side until the chemical potentials match, and the pressure it can hold up is the osmotic pressure, roughly proportional to concentration and absolute temperature in a dilute solution. Reverse osmosis adds a pressure on the concentrated side above that osmotic pressure, forcing the solvent backwards through the membrane while the salt is left in a concentrate that is drained off: what crosses is solvent, not solution. Two points often get skipped: the saltier the feed, the larger the pressure needed, so a household unit and a seawater plant are not on the same scale; and the mechanism is not screening ions out of pores but the difference in dissolution and diffusion through a dense membrane, so small molecules like carbon dioxide still cross.�ans��src��C武汉大学 主编,《分析化学》第6版,高等教育出版社�LWuhan University eds., Analytical Chemistry, 6th ed., Higher Education Press��id�6abc852860a3�body��x不锈钢含铬，表面生成极薄且致密的氧化铬钝化膜，把金属与空气、水隔开，所以耐腐蚀。�~Chromium forms a thin, dense chromium-oxide passive film that seals the metal from air and water, giving corrosion resistance.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7084b2b137d7�body���血液的红来自血红素：亚铁离子坐在卟啉四个吡咯氮围成的平面中心，这套共轭体系把强吸收带压在蓝紫到蓝绿光区，蓝光被吸走，透出的便是红光。氧结合到铁上会改变配位场与卟啉的电子结构，于是氧合血亮红、缺氧血暗红——动脉与静脉的色差由此而来。至于静脉发蓝是错觉：血只是变暗，青紫来自皮肤对光的滤过；血浆本身近乎淡黄。��Blood is red because of heme: an iron(II) ion sits in the flat centre held by the four pyrrole nitrogens of the porphyrin, and this conjugated system absorbs strongly from the blue-violet into the blue-green, so the blue is taken out and what comes through is red. Adding oxygen to the iron changes its ligand field and the electronic structure of the porphyrin, which is why oxygenated blood is bright red and oxygen-poor blood dark red; that is the difference between arterial and venous colour. That veins "look blue" is an illusion - the blood has only darkened, and the bluish cast comes from light filtering through skin; plasma itself is nearly pale yellow.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8a8eebf70f36�body��腺苷是清醒时在大脑里不断累积的信号，一坐上腺苷受体就压低觉醒神经元、催促入睡。咖啡因与腺苷同属甲基黄嘌呤、形状相近，于是抢先占住受体的位子却不按下开关，把腺苷挡在门外，困意信号传不进去。它是拮抗剂而不是燃料，并不减少腺苷，只是让受体收不到。这占位可逆，咖啡因被代谢后积压的腺苷照样生效，人就突然困倒；长期摄入还让受体数目上调，带来耐受与停喝后的头痛。��Adenosine is a signal that piles up in the brain through the waking hours, and once it sits on an adenosine receptor it damps the arousal neurons and pushes you toward sleep. Caffeine is a methylxanthine like adenosine and close enough in shape to take the seat on the receptor first without switching it on, shutting adenosine out so the drowsiness signal never lands. It is an antagonist, not a fuel: it does not reduce the adenosine, it only keeps the receptor from receiving it. That occupation is reversible, so the adenosine that has built up lands as soon as the caffeine is metabolized and the sleepiness crashes in; with regular intake the number of receptors is also upregulated, which is where tolerance and the headache after stopping come from.�ans��src��JBrown, LeMay 等,《Chemistry: The Central Science》第14版,Pearson,2017�KT. L. Brown et al., Chemistry: The Central Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�chem_26_019�body���为摆脱对溶解氧的依赖，并把工作电位压进干扰物质不再氧化的窗口。机理：天然路径中酶把O₂还原为H₂O₂，电流随生理氧分压起伏，且H₂O₂需在约+0.6 V氧化检测，该电位下抗坏血酸、尿酸、对乙酰氨基酚同步放电造成正偏差；二茂铁衍生物体积小，可贴近黄素活性中心从FADH₂夺取电子，再扩散至电极表面于约+0.2 V再生，信号不再受氧分压牵制，选择性与灵敏度大幅提高。�fMediators free the sensor from dissolved-oxygen dependence and push the operating potential into a window where interferents stay silent. On the natural route the enzyme reduces O2 to H2O2, so the current tracks physiological oxygen tension, and reading the peroxide demands about +0.6 V, where ascorbate, urate, and acetaminophen oxidize side by side and bias results upward. Compact ferrocene derivatives reach the flavin center closely enough to strip electrons from FADH2, then diffuse to the electrode and regenerate near +0.2 V; the signal no longer rides on oxygen, lifting both selectivity and sensitivity.�ans��src���A. E. G. Cass、G. Davis、H. A. O. Hill、A. P. F. Turner等《Ferrocene-mediated enzyme electrode for amperometric determination of glucose》，Analytical Chemistry，1984年，第56卷，667页�KA. E. G. Cass et al., Anal. Chem., 1984, 56, 667 (DOI: 10.1021/ac00268a018)��id�02fe877e1de3�body���细菌是单细胞的原核生物，没有真正的细胞核，个体通常只有几微米大。它们形态多样（球状、杆状、螺旋状），广泛分布于土壤、水和生物体内，有的致病，但多数对人类有益或无害。�Bacteria are single-celled prokaryotes without a true nucleus, usually only a few micrometers across. They come in varied shapes, spherical, rod-like, spiral, and live everywhere in soil, water, and bodies; some cause disease, but most are harmless or helpful.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�033d702e7ae1�body�ٟ在营养充足但不过量的情况下，动物会调低生长信号、加强细胞修复，于是从酵母到猴子的许多物种都出现了寿命延长。ٌWith enough but not excess food, animals dial down growth signaling and boost repair, lengthening life across species from yeast to monkeys.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�065cb45aa668�body���达尔文是19世纪的英国博物学家，提出了以自然选择为核心的进化论。他在环球航行中观察了大量动植物，写成《物种起源》一书。他的理论彻底改变了人们对生命多样性的理解。�"Charles Darwin was a 19th-century British naturalist who proposed the theory of evolution by natural selection. During a voyage around the world he observed vast numbers of plants and animals and wrote On the Origin of Species. His theory transformed how people understand life's diversity.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�07bc66fb53b2�body�ٱ能量在每一营养级间大约只有百分之十被下一个营养级利用（十分之一定律），逐级大量损耗使更高营养级可支撑的生物量极其有限。ٖOnly about ten percent of energy passes to the next trophic level (the 10% rule), so progressive loss leaves too little to support many higher levels.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�0c65329098d9�body���动脉把血液从心脏运送到全身，多数携带含氧血，管壁较厚有弹性。静脉把血液送回心脏，管壁较薄，常有瓣膜防止血液倒流。两者共同构成闭合的循环网络。��Arteries carry blood away from the heart, mostly oxygen-rich, with thick elastic walls. Veins return blood to the heart, with thinner walls and often valves that prevent backflow. Together they form a closed circulation network.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�0de6bd504a2e�body���负鼠等动物遇险会僵直不动、吐舌装死，许多捕食者只吃活猎物，闻到“死味”或看到不动就失去兴趣。装死还让动物显得病弱有毒，从而降低被吃概率。这是一种廉价的保命策略。�Opossums and others freeze, limp, and play dead when threatened; many predators prefer live prey and lose interest at the smell or sight of a still 'corpse.' Playing dead also suggests disease or toxicity, lowering the chance of being eaten. It is a cheap survival trick.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�103e96628bc5�body��乳酸菌把牛奶或蔬菜里的糖分发酵成乳酸，使环境变酸并抑制坏菌生长。酸奶靠保加利亚乳杆菌等把牛奶变稠变酸，泡菜靠多种乳酸菌让蔬菜入味且不腐坏。这种发酵是人类最古老的保藏食物方式之一。�mLactic acid bacteria ferment sugars in milk or vegetables into lactic acid, acidifying the environment and suppressing spoilage microbes. Yogurt relies on species like Lactobacillus bulgaricus to thicken and sour milk, while kimchi uses mixed lactic bacteria to flavor and preserve vegetables. Such fermentation is among humanity's oldest food-preservation methods.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�15098d3a24c0�body�ٞ核糖体沿mRNA移动，每次用携带氨基酸的tRNA按密码子配对，将氨基酸连成肽链，直到遇到终止密码子，蛋白质合成结束。ْThe ribosome moves along mRNA, using tRNAs carrying amino acids to match each codon and link them into a peptide chain until it hits a stop codon.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�163286d5a6b0�body���细菌既不是植物也不是动物，它们属于独立的原核生物域。它们没有真正的细胞核，结构比动植物简单得多。细菌在土壤、水和人体内无处不在。��Bacteria are neither plants nor animals; they belong to the separate domain of prokaryotes. They lack a true nucleus and are far simpler than plants or animals. Bacteria are everywhere in soil, water, and even inside our bodies.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�168c59cfb9d4�body�ٺ大肠主要负责吸收水分和电解质，使食物残渣变干成形。它还容纳肠道菌群，帮助发酵部分纤维并产生维生素。剩余残渣最终形成粪便排出。��The large intestine mainly absorbs water and electrolytes, drying and shaping the leftover material. It hosts gut bacteria that ferment some fiber and produce vitamins. The remainder becomes stool and is expelled.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�17aea229613b�body���蜜蜂采花蜜和花粉作食物，同时把花粉带到另一朵花上帮助植物授粉，双方都受益，是互利共生。没有蜜蜂等传粉者，许多水果和坚果的产量会大幅下降。��Bees collect nectar and pollen as food while carrying pollen to other flowers, helping plants reproduce; both sides benefit, a mutualism. Without bee pollinators, yields of many fruits and nuts would drop sharply.�ans��src�هEd Yong,《I Contain Multitudes》Ecco/HarperCollins,2016;中译《我包罗万象》(郑李译),后浪丨北京联合出版公司,2019�~Ed Yong, I Contain Multitudes, Ecco/HarperCollins, 2016; Chinese ed. (Zheng Li tr.), Beijing United Publishing (Houlang), 2019��id�1968607badaf�body�ٜ耵聍是外耳道腺体的正常分泌物，能黏附灰尘、抑制细菌真菌并润滑耳道；它大多会随咀嚼自行排出，不必频繁掏挖。ٴCerumen is a normal secretion that traps dust, inhibits bacteria and fungi and lubricates the canal; it usually clears itself with jaw movement, so frequent picking is unnecessary.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�1a49e6057148�body��5DNA（脱氧核糖核酸）由四种脱氧核糖核苷酸组成，每种核苷酸含有一个磷酸基团、一个脱氧核糖和一个含氮碱基（腺嘌呤、胸腺嘧啶、鸟嘌呤或胞嘧啶）。这些核苷酸通过磷酸二酯键连接成两条反向平行的长链，再盘绕成双螺旋结构。�8DNA (deoxyribonucleic acid) is built from four kinds of deoxyribonucleotides, each containing a phosphate group, a deoxyribose sugar, and one nitrogenous base (adenine, thymine, guanine, or cytosine). The nucleotides are linked by phosphodiester bonds into two antiparallel strands that coil into a double helix.�ans��src��《分子生物学》�'Molecular Biology of the Cell (Alberts)��id�1e7e6efd54df�body���乳牙较小，适合幼儿较小的颌骨。随着颌骨长大，下方恒牙逐渐发育并顶替乳牙位置。乳牙脱落后恒牙萌出，伴随人一生。这是发育中的正常更替。��Baby teeth are small, suited to a child's smaller jaw. As the jaw grows, permanent teeth develop beneath and push the baby teeth out. After the deciduous teeth fall, the permanent ones emerge for life. This is normal developmental replacement.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�1ef8a3904491�body�ٱ北极熊的毛是中空透明的，只是把可见光散射成白色；皮肤其实是黑的，能吸收阳光保暖。毛管还能导光到皮肤，像天然“暖气管”。��Polar bear hairs are hollow and transparent, merely scattering visible light to look white; the skin underneath is black to absorb sun warmth. The hollow hairs even pipe light to the skin like natural “radiators”.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�1ff6894535d0�body���苹果细胞破损后，多酚氧化酶接触到酚类物质和氧气，把它们氧化成褐色的醌类，这是酶促褐变。柠檬汁里的维生素C能减慢这个过程，低温也能延缓。这种反应本身无害，只是卖相变差。�When apple cells are broken, the enzyme polyphenol oxidase meets phenolic compounds and oxygen, oxidizing them into brown quinones—enzymatic browning. Vitamin C in lemon juice slows it, and cold temperature also helps. The reaction is harmless, just less appealing.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�20878d865d21�body���是的，仙人掌的刺就是高度退化、变硬的叶子，目的是减少水分蒸腾并防御动物啃食。真正的光合作用改由肥厚的茎来完成。所以刺虽不起眼，却是仙人掌省水的关键发明。��Yes, cactus spines are highly reduced, hardened leaves, meant to cut water loss and deter browsers. Photosynthesis is handed to the thick stem. So spines, though inconspicuous, are the cactus's key water-saving invention.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�21b9607942b6�body��vFMT 把健康捐赠者的肠道菌群转入患者肠道，对反复发作的艰难梭菌感染有很高的治愈率。�sFMT transfers healthy donor gut microbes to a patient and cures most recurrent Clostridioides difficile infections.�ans��src�هEd Yong,《I Contain Multitudes》Ecco/HarperCollins,2016;中译《我包罗万象》(郑李译),后浪丨北京联合出版公司,2019�~Ed Yong, I Contain Multitudes, Ecco/HarperCollins, 2016; Chinese ed. (Zheng Li tr.), Beijing United Publishing (Houlang), 2019��id�22689cf3d760�body��u食物链是生物之间“谁吃谁”的链条：植物被虫吃，虫被鸟吃，能量就这样一级级传递。�pA food chain is the 'who eats whom' line: plants feed insects, insects feed birds, passing energy up the levels.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�24d1c79efa11�body�ٮ细胞呼吸把葡萄糖逐步分解，在有氧条件下最终生成二氧化碳、水和大量ATP；糖酵解在细胞质中先产出少量ATP，后续在线粒体完成。��Cellular respiration breaks down glucose to carbon dioxide, water, and lots of ATP under aerobic conditions; glycolysis first yields a little ATP in the cytoplasm, then mitochondria finish the job.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�271b18d7b9a1�body�٥感冒大多由病毒引起，而抗生素只针对细菌；滥用抗生素还会破坏正常菌群并催生耐药菌，所以感冒一般靠休息和症状缓解。٣Colds are mostly viral while antibiotics target bacteria; misuse also disrupts normal flora and breeds resistance, so colds are managed by rest and symptom relief.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�289c1bd43649�body���植物的绿色来自叶绿素，这种色素能吸收阳光用于光合作用。叶绿素主要吸收红光和蓝光，却反射绿光，所以叶子看起来是绿的。没有叶绿素，植物就无法制造养分。��The green color of plants comes from chlorophyll, a pigment that captures sunlight for photosynthesis. Chlorophyll mainly absorbs red and blue light but reflects green, so leaves look green. Without chlorophyll, plants could not make their own food.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�2951715f5720�body�٥生物多样性支撑授粉、净水、土壤形成和气候调节等生态系统服务，是人类粮食、药物和清洁环境的根基，失去它代价极高。٬Biodiversity underpins ecosystem services like pollination, clean water, soil formation and climate regulation—the foundation of our food, medicine and clean environment.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�29f1b2f22249�body���染色体是细胞核内由DNA和蛋白质紧密缠绕形成的棒状结构。人类体细胞有46条，即23对，其中一半来自父亲、一半来自母亲。它们确保遗传信息在分裂时准确分配。��Chromosomes are rod-like structures in the nucleus made of tightly coiled DNA and protein. Human body cells have 46, or 23 pairs, half from each parent. They ensure genetic information is accurately divided during cell division.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�2a705734ba0e�body���大脑是身体的指挥中心，负责思考、记忆、感觉和运动控制等。它通过脊髓和神经与全身相连，快速传递信号。大脑还调节心跳、呼吸等不自觉的活动。�The brain is the body's command center, handling thinking, memory, sensation, and movement control. It connects to the whole body through the spinal cord and nerves, passing signals rapidly. It also regulates automatic activities like heartbeat and breathing.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�2b73099bc512�body���心脏是一台肌肉泵，不停地把血液送往全身，输送氧气和养分并带走废物。它通过血管构成的循环系统与肺、肾等器官相连。成年人安静时每分钟大约跳60到100次。�#The heart is a muscular pump that continuously sends blood throughout the body, delivering oxygen and nutrients and carrying away waste. It connects via blood vessels to organs like the lungs and kidneys in a circulatory system. At rest an adult heart beats about 60 to 100 times per minute.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�2c3d061877b2�body��l微生物是用肉眼看不见的微小生物，包括细菌、真菌和一些藻类，它们无处不在。فMicroorganisms are tiny living things invisible to the naked eye, including bacteria, fungi, and some algae; they are everywhere.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�2c884c0332de�body�ي高盐、高糖或干燥大幅降低水分活度，使细菌难以繁殖；烟熏还会带来酚类等抗菌物质，从而延长保存。ٓHigh salt, sugar or drying sharply lower water activity so bacteria struggle to grow; smoking adds antimicrobial phenolics, extending preservation.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�2ce6ad4816d7�body��含羞草叶子受到触碰时，叶枕细胞会迅速失水使叶片下垂闭合，这是一种快速的运动反应。它能吓退啃食的昆虫或减轻风雨伤害，属于植物的防御行为。几分钟后水分重新分布，叶子又会慢慢张开。�6When a mimosa leaf is touched, cells in its pulvinus rapidly lose water, causing the leaflet to droop and close in a fast movement response. This startles leaf-eating insects or reduces damage from wind and rain, acting as a defensive behavior. After a few minutes the water redistributes and the leaf reopens.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�2d1bd2151968�body���鸟类身体轻、骨骼中空，并长有能产生升力的羽毛翅膀。强有力的胸肌驱动翅膀扇动，而高效的肺系统提供充足氧气。这些特征共同让飞行成为可能。��Birds have light, hollow bones and feathered wings that generate lift. Powerful chest muscles drive the wing beats, and an efficient lung system supplies plenty of oxygen. Together these features make flight possible.�ans��src��R吴相钰 等 编,《陈阅增普通生物学》第4版,高等教育出版社,2014�VWu Xiangyu et al., Chen Yuezeng General Biology, 4th ed., Higher Education Press, 2014��id�2d20ef13af41�body��`当爸爸的精子和妈妈的卵子结合成受精卵，就开始了一个新生命的发育。�fWhen a father's sperm joins a mother's egg to form a fertilized cell, a new life's development begins.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�2dfe01c6afad�body�٪大多数氨基酸由多个密码子编码，这种现象称为简并性；它使 DNA 突变有时不改变所编码的氨基酸，从而降低了有害突变的概率。ٿMost amino acids are encoded by more than one codon, a property called degeneracy; it means some DNA mutations do not change the encoded amino acid, buffering the impact of harmful mutations.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�2ea5c20fac17�body�٢连作会耗竭特定养分并积累土传病害和害虫；轮作不同科作物可恢复地力、打断病虫害循环，还能利用豆科固氮减少化肥。��Continuous cropping depletes specific nutrients and builds up soil-borne pests and diseases; rotating different plant families restores soil, breaks pest cycles and can use legumes to fix nitrogen.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�34faf9c07b21�body��细胞是能独立进行新陈代谢、生长和繁殖的最小结构单位，所有已知生物都由细胞组成（病毒除外，它必须借助细胞才能复制）。无论是单细胞生物还是多细胞生物，生命活动都建立在细胞的基础之上。�0The cell is the smallest structural unit that can independently carry out metabolism, growth, and reproduction, and all known living things are made of cells (viruses being the exception, since they need a cell to replicate). Whether an organism is single-celled or multicellular, life is built on cells.�ans��src��《细胞生物学》�'Molecular Biology of the Cell (Alberts)��id�354d97f8cc4a�body�ٟ低温只减缓微生物生长和酶反应，并不能杀死它们；部分嗜冷菌在冰箱里仍会缓慢繁殖，所以久放依然会变质甚至产毒。ٲCold only slows microbial growth and enzyme reactions, it does not kill them; some psychrotrophs still grow slowly in the fridge, so food eventually spoils or even becomes toxic.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�376c312975e2�body�ٮ个体或配子迁移带来的基因交流会降低种群间的遗传差异、抵消分化，使相邻种群保持相似；隔离减少基因流则会促进新物种形成。��Migration of individuals or gametes introduces gene exchange that reduces genetic differences between populations and counters divergence, keeping neighboring groups similar; reduced gene flow promotes speciation.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�384ffa3d533f�body���化脓是免疫细胞和入侵细菌厮杀后的“战场残骸”：大量死去的白细胞、细菌和组织液混在一起形成黄色脓液。它在提醒你身体正在抗感染，但如果红肿热痛加重或发烧应及时就医。�Pus is the debris of a battle between immune cells and invading bacteria: dead white cells, bacteria, and tissue fluid mix into yellowish matter. It signals the body is fighting infection, but if redness, swelling, pain, or fever worsen, you should see a doctor.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�392b3abe5704�body���神经元是神经系统的基本单位，专门接收、处理和传递电信号。它像一根带分支的电线，把信息从感官传到大脑、再从大脑送到肌肉，使我们能看、想、动。��A neuron is the basic unit of the nervous system, specialized to receive, process, and transmit electrical signals. Like a branched wire, it carries information from the senses to the brain and from the brain to muscles, letting us see, think, and move.�ans��src��《神经科学》�%Principles of Neural Science (Kandel)��id�3975aedc9a28�body�٨他在 1753 年提出用拉丁文的属名加种加词为每个物种定一个全球通用的名字，避免了各地俗名混乱，奠定了现代分类学的基础。ٚIn 1753 he proposed a Latin genus plus species epithet as one globally shared name per organism, ending local-name confusion and founding modern taxonomy.�ans��src��《植物学》�Campbell Biology��id�3984f3067fe9�body�ٖ咖啡中的咖啡因会占据大脑里腺苷的受体，阻止疲劳信号传递，从而暂时提升警觉，但它并不能替代真正的睡眠。ِCaffeine occupies adenosine receptors in the brain, blocking fatigue signals to temporarily boost alertness, but it does not replace real sleep.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�39e61575fbfc�body�ٱ世界自然保护联盟依据种群趋势和威胁程度评估物种灭绝风险并分级（如极危、濒危、易危），帮助政府和公众确定保护的优先次序。٬The IUCN assesses extinction risk from population trends and threats, ranking species (e.g. Critically Endangered, Endangered, Vulnerable) to guide conservation priorities.�ans��src��EE. O. Wilson,《The Diversity of Life》Harvard University Press,1992�CE. O. Wilson, The Diversity of Life, Harvard University Press, 1992��id�3c946445ffcf�body��)孟德尔通过豌豆杂交实验总结出分离定律和自由组合定律：成对的遗传因子在形成配子时彼此分离，不同性状的遗传因子则独立分配。这奠定了现代遗传学的基础，说明性状由可分离、可传递的「遗传因子」（即基因）决定。�MThrough pea-crossing experiments, Mendel formulated the law of segregation and the law of independent assortment: paired hereditary factors separate when gametes form, and factors for different traits are distributed independently. This founded modern genetics by showing traits are determined by separable, heritable factors, genes.�ans��src��《遗传学》�(Genetics: A Conceptual Approach (Pierce)��id�3d3d53236511�body�ٴ生物多样性指一定区域内物种、基因和生态系统的丰富程度。多样的物种让生态系统更稳健、抗干扰能力更强。人类活动正加速其丧失。ٽBiodiversity is the richness of species, genes, and ecosystems in an area. Diverse species make ecosystems more robust and resilient to disturbance. Human activity is accelerating its loss.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�3dd90522c4a2�body�ٙ血液流经肾小球的滤网，水和小分子进入肾小囊，肾小管再重吸收有用物质、分泌废物，最终浓缩成尿液排出体外。ٻBlood is filtered at the glomerulus, where water and small molecules enter the capsule; the tubule then reabsorbs useful substances and secretes wastes, concentrating urine for excretion.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�3e0aaed16a54�body�ي乳酸菌发酵牛奶中的乳糖产生乳酸，使蛋白质凝固变酸稠，部分乳糖被分解更易消化，并保留大量活菌。٫Lactic-acid bacteria ferment milk lactose into lactic acid, curdling and acidifying the protein; some lactose is broken down for easier digestion and live cultures remain.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�44a146f58673�body��x遗传多样性越高，种群越能适应环境变化、抵抗疾病和避免近交，是物种长期存活的保险。مHigher genetic diversity lets populations adapt to change, resist disease, and avoid inbreeding, an insurance for long-term survival.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�49cec43d2fd5�body��i植物用叶子里的叶绿素，借阳光把水和二氧化碳变成糖和氧气，这叫光合作用。�Using chlorophyll in leaves, plants turn water and carbon dioxide into sugar and oxygen with sunlight—this is photosynthesis.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�49ea8f20ae67�body�٨蜜蜂采蜜时为开花植物传粉、植物为蜜蜂提供花蜜就是互利共生；根瘤菌为豆科植物固氮、植物为细菌提供糖类也是典型例子。نBees pollinating flowers while obtaining nectar is mutualism, as is rhizobia fixing nitrogen for legumes in exchange for plant sugars.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�4a8189cc2c29�body��]哺乳动物大多用乳汁喂养幼崽、身上有毛发或皮毛，并且是温血动物。�SMammals usually feed their young with milk, have hair or fur, and are warm-blooded.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�4bc06a9387ed�body�ٖ不会。实验表明金鱼记忆可维持数月，能学会辨认喂食信号、避开电击和走迷宫，几秒记忆只是流传已久的误解。١No. Experiments show goldfish memory lasts months; they can learn to recognize feeding cues, avoid shocks and navigate mazes, so the few-seconds claim is a myth.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�4cca1a9fcd42�body���心脏是一个不停跳动的肌肉泵，把血液输送到全身，把氧气和营养物质带给细胞，并把二氧化碳等废物带走。它分为左右两侧，分别推动肺循环和体循环，维持生命活动的运转。�The heart is a muscular pump that beats continuously to send blood throughout the body, delivering oxygen and nutrients to cells and carrying away waste like carbon dioxide. Divided into left and right sides, it drives pulmonary and systemic circulation to keep the body running.�ans��src��PGuyton 与 Hall，《医学生理学教科书》（第13版，Elsevier，2016）�HGuyton & Hall, Textbook of Medical Physiology (13th ed., Elsevier, 2016)��id�50ce836c6204�body���食物链描述能量和养分在生物之间依次传递的顺序，通常从植物开始。食草动物吃植物，食肉动物再吃食草动物。它展示了自然界谁吃谁的简单关系。��A food chain describes the sequence by which energy and nutrients pass from one organism to the next, usually starting with plants. Herbivores eat plants, and carnivores eat the herbivores. It shows the simple who-eats-whom relationships in nature.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�524caf32cbeb�body�٫出汗是身体降温的方式：汗腺把水分排到皮肤表面，水分蒸发时带走热量。运动或天气炎热时出汗会增多。及时补水能避免脱水。��Sweating is the body's way to cool down: glands release water onto the skin, and as it evaporates, heat is carried away. Sweating increases during exercise or hot weather. Replenishing water in time prevents dehydration.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5364161d0853�body���绿色植物在叶绿体中利用光能把二氧化碳和水合成葡萄糖，并释放氧气，这个过程叫光合作用。它把太阳能转化为储存在糖里的化学能，是几乎所有食物链的能量源头。�In chloroplasts, green plants use light energy to combine carbon dioxide and water into glucose while releasing oxygen, this is photosynthesis. It converts solar energy into chemical energy stored in sugar and is the energy source for nearly all food chains.�ans��src��《植物学》�Campbell Biology��id�538c4c2a51f9�body���酵母菌在温暖湿润的面团里分解糖，产生二氧化碳和酒精。二氧化碳气体被面筋网兜住形成小气孔，面团就膨胀变松软。烘烤时酒精蒸发、气孔固定，于是有了蓬松的面包。��Yeast in warm, moist dough breaks down sugars into carbon dioxide and alcohol. The gas is trapped by the gluten network as tiny bubbles, making the dough expand and soften. Baking evaporates the alcohol and sets the pores, yielding fluffy bread.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�53ea11360950�body�ٙ植物细胞壁主要由纤维素构成的微纤丝网络组成，提供机械支撑、维持细胞形状和抵御病原，并赋予植物挺立姿态。ٯThe plant cell wall is mainly a cellulose microfibril network that provides mechanical support, maintains cell shape, resists pathogens and gives plants their upright posture.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�54a9e97132ee�body���蛋白质是构成肌肉、皮肤和酶的重要材料，几乎参与所有生命活动。它们由氨基酸按基因指令串连折叠而成。人体需要不断从食物中获取蛋白质来修复和生长。�Proteins are key building materials for muscle, skin, and enzymes and take part in nearly every life process. They are made by linking and folding amino acids according to genetic instructions. The body needs a steady supply of protein from food for repair and growth.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�578fba0d26e1�body���免疫系统是身体的防御网络，由白细胞、淋巴结、脾脏等组成，负责识别并清除细菌、病毒和异常细胞。它像一支警卫队，既抵挡外来入侵，也清理体内的「叛徒」，保护我们少生病。�The immune system is the body's defense network of white blood cells, lymph nodes, spleen, and more, tasked with recognizing and clearing bacteria, viruses, and abnormal cells. Like a guard force, it repels outside invaders and removes internal traitors, helping keep us healthy.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�59181d89ce87�body���当某类生物所处环境长期稳定、且自身形态已很适应时，演化压力小，外形可保持上亿年不变，如鲎、腔棘鱼。它们像被时间“冻结”的标本，帮我们窥见远古生命的样子。�When a group's environment stays stable and its body plan is already well adapted, evolutionary pressure is low and form can remain unchanged for hundreds of millions of years, like horseshoe crabs and coelacanths. They are time-frozen specimens revealing ancient life.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�5b24f9169753�body�٫胃酸主要是盐酸，使胃内呈强酸性。它能激活消化酶、杀灭随食物进入的细菌，并帮助分解蛋白质。酸性环境是胃部消化的关键。��Stomach acid is mainly hydrochloric acid, making the stomach strongly acidic. It activates digestive enzymes, kills bacteria entering with food, and helps break down proteins. This acidic environment is key to gastric digestion.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5b3bf5fda65f�body�ٱ牙齿最外层是坚硬的牙釉质，是人体最硬的组织。里面是牙本质，中心是含神经和血管的牙髓。良好的清洁能保护牙釉质、预防蛀牙。��The outer layer of a tooth is hard enamel, the toughest tissue in the human body. Beneath it lies dentin, and at the center is the pulp with nerves and blood vessels. Good cleaning protects enamel and prevents cavities.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5d234aba771d�body���扬子鳄体型小、吻部短圆、性情温顺，是中国特有的淡水鳄，生活在长江下游的河湖沼泽；它比湾鳄等热带鳄更耐寒，但数量稀少，是国家一级保护动物。��The Chinese alligator is small, with a short rounded snout and gentle temperament—a freshwater crocodile endemic to China's lower Yangtze lakes and marshes. It tolerates cold better than tropical crocs but is rare and highly protected.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�5d435b6da613�body�ه不是。脚气是皮肤癣菌这类真菌感染引起的，温暖潮湿的环境容易发作，需要用抗真菌药而非抗生素。ُNo. Athlete's foot is a fungal infection by dermatophytes, thriving in warm moist conditions and needing antifungal, not antibiotic, treatment.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�5d93f0053840�body���X 连锁基因在男性（XY）只有一份拷贝，隐性等位基因会直接表现，而女性（XX）需要两份隐性等位基因才会表现，因此红绿色盲等 X 连锁性状男性更常见。��X-linked genes have a single copy in males (XY) so recessive alleles are expressed directly, whereas females (XX) need two copies to show the trait, making conditions like red-green color blindness far more common in males.�ans��src��0Lewin's Genes XII,Jones & Bartlett Learning,2018�2Lewin's Genes XII, Jones & Bartlett Learning, 2018��id�61d894f10dd9�body�ٮ呼吸为身体获取氧气并排出二氧化碳。氧气用于细胞产生能量，二氧化碳是这一过程的废物。没有持续供氧，细胞几分钟就会受损。��Breathing brings in oxygen and removes carbon dioxide. Oxygen fuels the cells' energy production, while carbon dioxide is the waste of that process. Without a steady oxygen supply, cells are damaged within minutes.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�64838319de2d�body��i一些雌萤会模仿他种闪光诱食雄萤，幼虫的发光也用来警告捕食者自己不好吃。�nSome females mimic other species' flashes to lure and eat males, and larval glow warns predators of bad taste.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�65214adc165a�body��那是霉菌的菌丝和孢子，最常见的是青霉和曲霉。它们在温暖潮湿处迅速生长，把面包里的养分分解掉并长出带孢子的“毛”来散播后代。有些霉菌会产生有害毒素，所以发霉食物最好整块丢弃。�Those are the hyphae and spores of mold, commonly Penicillium or Aspergillus. In warmth and damp they grow fast, breaking down the bread's nutrients and sprouting fuzzy spore-bearing threads to disperse. Some molds make harmful toxins, so moldy food is best discarded entirely.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�6567a68beeff�body�ِ氟能取代牙釉质中羟基磷灰石的羟基，形成更耐酸的氟磷灰石，并抑制致龋菌代谢产酸，从而帮助预防蛀牙。ٲFluoride replaces hydroxyl groups in enamel hydroxyapatite to form more acid-resistant fluorapatite and inhibits acid production by cariogenic bacteria, helping prevent cavities.�ans��src��《口腔预防医学》�6Dental Caries: The Disease and Its Clinical Management��id�65bdb3e4a6e0�body���蜜蜂在采蜜时把花粉从一朵花带到另一朵，帮助植物完成授粉并结出果实和种子。许多农作物依赖蜜蜂等昆虫传粉才能丰收。蜜蜂数量下降会威胁粮食安全。��As bees gather nectar, they carry pollen from one flower to another, helping plants pollinate and produce fruit and seeds. Many crops depend on bees and other insects for pollination to yield a harvest. Declining bee numbers threaten food security.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�67e5ed25ce6f�body�ٜ唾液能润湿食物，便于咀嚼和吞咽。它含有淀粉酶，可开始分解淀粉为糖。此外唾液还有清洁口腔和初步抗菌的作用。ٶSaliva moistens food to ease chewing and swallowing. It contains amylase that starts breaking starch into sugars. Saliva also cleans the mouth and offers early antibacterial defense.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�6bf4969d1ae6�body���因为蜜蜂的螫针带倒钩，蜇哺乳动物后会连内脏拔出导致死亡；但这能保护整个蜂巢——用一只工蜂的命换群体安全，对“家族”更有利，所以被自然选择保留。��A bee's barbed stinger rips out its guts when stuck in mammal skin, killing it. But it defends the whole hive; sacrificing one worker for colony safety benefits the “family”, so evolution kept it.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�70b4939c66ac�body�٢神经元在静息时膜内外有电位差；受刺激时钠离子内流产生动作电位，沿轴突传导，到末梢释放神经递质传给下一个细胞。ٷAt rest a neuron has a voltage across its membrane; a stimulus lets sodium rush in, creating an action potential that travels the axon and releases neurotransmitters to the next cell.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7128ba2c4ebe�body���在寒冷或干旱季节，落叶树会主动脱落叶子以减少水分流失和能量消耗。叶片中的叶绿素分解后，原本被遮盖的黄色、红色色素显现出来。这是一种越冬的适应策略。��In cold or dry seasons, deciduous trees shed their leaves to reduce water loss and energy use. As chlorophyll breaks down, the yellow and red pigments that were hidden become visible. It is an adaptation for surviving winter.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�7308005ac5af�body�ٱ它们鲜明的形态与生命周期（出淤泥而不染、花期短暂）契合人们对纯洁、无常与重生的联想，因而频繁出现在绘画、纹样与文学中。ٹTheir striking forms and life cycles (rising clean from mud, brief blooming) resonate with ideas of purity, impermanence and rebirth, so they recur in painting, patterns and literature.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7b6b67529ad1�body���神经元是神经系统的基本单元，专门接收、处理和传递信息。它有一条长轴突用来把信号送到远处，末端与其他细胞连接。大脑就是由数百亿个神经元网络构成的。�	A neuron is the basic unit of the nervous system, specialized to receive, process, and transmit information. It has a long axon that carries signals to distant targets and connects with other cells at its ends. The brain is a network of tens of billions of neurons.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�7d288a105e6b�body���潮湿墙面提供了水分和灰尘里的有机物，孢子落下就萌发成放射状蔓延的菌丝，形成一圈圈或羽状的霉斑。不同菌种颜色不同，常见黑、绿、白。保持干燥和通风是防止霉斑的最好办法。��Damp walls supply water and organic dust for spores to germinate into radially spreading hyphae, forming ringed or feathery patches. Colors vary by species—black, green, white. Keeping dry and ventilated is the best prevention.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�7e6ba3fdecf2�body�ٖ传统疫苗多直接递送弱化或灭活的病原体，而 mRNA 疫苗只递送制造一种病毒蛋白的说明书，让细胞自己生产抗原。ٰTraditional vaccines often deliver weakened or killed pathogens, while mRNA vaccines deliver only the instructions to make one viral protein, letting cells produce the antigen.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�82dc27b82d07�body�٤核仁是细胞核内无膜包被的区域，负责核糖体 RNA 的转录、加工以及核糖体亚基的组装，是细胞蛋白质合成机器的生产车间。پThe nucleolus is a membrane-less nuclear region that transcribes and processes ribosomal RNA and assembles ribosomal subunits—the production site of the cell's protein-synthesis machinery.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�8885645b30d4�body���是的，主动脉是人体最粗大的动脉，它直接从心脏左心室发出。主动脉把含氧血输送到全身各处的主要分支。它的弹性帮助缓冲每次心跳产生的压力波动。��Yes, the aorta is the largest artery in the body, arising directly from the left ventricle. It distributes oxygen-rich blood to the major branches that supply the whole body. Its elasticity helps cushion the pressure surges of each heartbeat.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8ac1765cee0d�body�ٔ果肉中的多酚氧化酶接触空气，把酚类物质氧化成褐色的醌类；滴柠檬汁（维C和酸）可抑制该反应，延缓变色。٠Polyphenol oxidase in the flesh uses oxygen to oxidize phenolics into brown quinones; lemon juice (vitamin C and acid) inhibits the reaction and slows browning.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8ac6c999ce03�body���一部分能活。许多乳酸菌有耐酸本领，裹在食物里更难被胃酸全灭，到达肠道后能帮助维持菌群平衡。不过数量有限，不能指望它们“包治百病”。ٲSome survive. Many lactobacteria resist acid and ride through inside food, reaching the gut to help balance flora. But numbers are limited—don't expect them to cure everything.�ans��src�هEd Yong,《I Contain Multitudes》Ecco/HarperCollins,2016;中译《我包罗万象》(郑李译),后浪丨北京联合出版公司,2019�~Ed Yong, I Contain Multitudes, Ecco/HarperCollins, 2016; Chinese ed. (Zheng Li tr.), Beijing United Publishing (Houlang), 2019��id�8b2f570f2511�body���条纹的作用至今有多种说法：可能干扰采采蝇等吸血昆虫的定位，也可能在奔跑时让捕食者难以锁定单只。最新证据更支持“防虫”说。条纹并非用来隐藏，因为草原上黑白对比反而醒目。�Several ideas exist for stripes: they may disrupt bloodsucking flies like tsetse from landing, or confuse predators tracking a single runner. The latest evidence leans toward fly protection. Stripes are not for hiding—black-and-white contrast stands out on the savanna.�ans��src��aRichard Dawkins,《The Selfish Gene》Oxford,1976;中译《自私的基因》中信出版社,2012�TR. Dawkins, The Selfish Gene, Oxford University Press, 1976; Chinese ed. CITIC, 2012��id�8ca61529c960�body���细胞代谢产生的二氧化碳进入血液，经静脉送回右心再到肺部。在肺泡处，二氧化碳扩散进气道并随呼气被排出。这个过程与氧气吸入方向相反却同步进行。��Carbon dioxide made by cells enters the blood, returns via veins to the right heart and then the lungs. At the alveoli it diffuses into the airways and is breathed out. This runs opposite to but alongside oxygen intake.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8d23cbdde20b�body���温泉边缘的七彩颜色常来自成片的嗜热微生物垫，不同温度带长着不同颜色的细菌：绿、黄、橙、红。它们用特殊色素防晒并耐高温，层层铺开就像天然调色板。�The rainbow colors at hot-spring edges often come from mats of thermophilic microbes; each temperature band grows different colored bacteria—green, yellow, orange, red. Their special pigments protect against sunlight and heat, laying out like a natural palette.�ans��src��KMadigan 等，《Brock 微生物生物学》（第15版，Pearson，2018）�IMadigan et al., Brock Biology of Microorganisms (15th ed., Pearson, 2018)��id�8f576f6e7471�body�٫成年人安静时心率约为每分钟60到100次。按平均每分钟70次计算，一天大约跳动10万次。心脏通过这种持续跳动把血液泵送到全身。ٽAt rest, an adult heart rate is about 60 to 100 beats per minute. Averaging 70 beats per minute, that is roughly 100,000 beats per day. This steady pumping pushes blood throughout the body.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�8f7e47a7bcf7�body�٨植物与昆虫既有丰富的形态与色彩，又常承载象征意义（如荷兰静物寓意生命短暂），体现了自然观察与艺术表达的紧密结合。ٽPlants and insects offer rich form and color and often carry symbolism (e.g. Dutch still lifes as vanitas, hinting at life's brevity), blending natural observation with artistic expression.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�933a9ae978b1�body���细胞太小是为了维持足够的表面积来与周围环境交换物质。体积增大时表面积相对变小，交换效率会下降。所以生物用大量小细胞而非少数巨细胞来构建身体。��Cells stay small to keep enough surface area for exchanging materials with their surroundings. As volume grows, surface area per unit shrinks and exchange becomes inefficient. That is why bodies are built from many tiny cells rather than a few giant ones.�ans��src��U翟中和 王喜忠 丁明孝,《细胞生物学》第4版,高等教育出版社,2011�HZhai Zhonghe et al., Cell Biology, 4th ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�938dca0698ac�body�ٙPCR用高温变性、降温让引物结合、中温让DNA聚合酶延伸的循环，每一轮使目标DNA翻倍，几十轮后可获数百万倍拷贝。پPCR cycles through heating to separate strands, cooling so primers bind, and warming for polymerase extension; each cycle doubles the target, yielding millions of copies in dozens of rounds.�ans��src��KAlberts 等,《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第6版,Garland Science,2014�PB. Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell, 6th ed., Garland Science, 2014��id�944cb79e92bd�body�ٟ栖息地是生物生活的物理场所，而生态位描述其在环境中所扮演的功能角色，包括食物、活动时间和与其他物种的关系。٨A habitat is the physical place where an organism lives, whereas a niche describes its functional role—its food, activity timing and relationships with other species.�ans��src��DOdum & Barrett,《Fundamentals of Ecology》第5版,Brooks/Cole,2004�QE. P. Odum and G. W. Barrett, Fundamentals of Ecology, 5th ed., Brooks/Cole, 2004��id�9606abbef05d�body�ٖ芦荟凝胶含多糖和多种化合物，能保湿、舒缓并轻度抗炎，对轻微晒伤和烫伤有帮助；但深度烧伤仍需及时就医。٫Aloe gel holds polysaccharides and compounds that moisturize, soothe and mildly reduce inflammation, helping minor sunburns and burns—but deep burns still need a doctor.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�96aadaab4283�body���植物通过光合作用，在叶片里用阳光把二氧化碳和水转化成糖和氧气。这一过程发生在叶绿体中，是地球上绝大多数生命的能量来源。植物因此被称为生产者。��Through photosynthesis, plants use sunlight in their leaves to convert carbon dioxide and water into sugar and oxygen. This process happens in the chloroplasts and is the energy source for most life on Earth. Plants are therefore called producers.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�988e23918ced�body���脊椎动物是拥有由脊椎骨组成脊柱的动物，主要包括鱼类、两栖类、爬行类、鸟类和哺乳类五大类。它们大多有内骨骼和发达的中枢神经系统，是动物界中结构最复杂的一支。�Vertebrates are animals with a backbone made of vertebrae, chiefly fish, amphibians, reptiles, birds, and mammals. Most have an internal skeleton and a well-developed central nervous system, forming the most structurally complex branch of the animal kingdom.�ans��src��《动物学》�Campbell Biology��id�9a2582bbfa8a�body���碘酒和酒精能破坏细菌蛋白质的外层和酶，使微生物变性失活，属于广谱消毒剂。但它们也会刺激人体细胞，所以只能用于皮肤表面，不能往深伤口里灌。日常小伤口清洁足够。��Iodine and alcohol denature bacterial proteins and enzymes, inactivating microbes as broad-spectrum disinfectants. They also irritate human cells, so use only on skin surface, not deep wounds. They suffice for cleaning minor cuts.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�9a2ed8d75daa�body���蚜虫吸食植物汁液后会排出甜甜的“蜜露”，蚂蚁爱吃这种糖液，便守在旁边“放牧”蚜虫并驱赶其天敌。蚂蚁得到食物，蚜虫得到保护，是一种互利关系。ٺAphids suck plant sap and excrete sugary 'honeydew' that ants love, so ants stand by 'herding' them and fend off predators. The ants get food and the aphids get protection—a mutualism.�ans��src��DHölldobler & Wilson,《蚂蚁》(The Ants),斯普林格出版集团�/Hölldobler & Wilson, The Ants, Springer-Verlag��id�9b8f9b6d2130�body�ٱ洋葱细胞破损后，蒜氨酸酶把前体物质转化为丙硫醛-S-氧化物（催泪因子），它挥发到空气中刺激角膜神经，引发流泪以冲洗刺激物。��When onion cells are damaged, alliinase converts precursors into syn-propanethial-S-oxide (the lachrymatory factor), which volatilizes and irritates corneal nerves, triggering tears to flush the irritant.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�9cfbf39dee51�body�ٴ细菌可通过突变或获得抗性基因，使药物靶点改变、产生降解酶、外排泵排出药物或减少药物摄入，从而在有药环境中存活并扩散抗性。��Via mutation or acquired resistance genes, bacteria alter drug targets, produce degrading enzymes, pump out drugs or reduce uptake, surviving and spreading resistance under antibiotic pressure.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�9f925f39e8e9�body�٥木质部主要把根吸收的水分和无机盐向上运输到地上部分，韧皮部则把叶片光合作用制造的糖类等有机物运送到全身各器官。٬Xylem mainly carries water and minerals upward from roots, while phloem distributes sugars and other organic products made by photosynthesis to organs throughout the plant.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�a0c702754210�body���抗体是B淋巴细胞产生的蛋白质，能特异性识别并结合外来抗原。它像“标签”标记病原体，方便其他免疫细胞清除。抗体是体液免疫的核心武器。��Antibodies are proteins made by B lymphocytes that specifically recognize and bind foreign antigens. Like tags, they mark pathogens so other immune cells can clear them. Antibodies are central to humoral immunity.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a2f2a5d15726�body�ِ有的兰花模拟雌蜂的外形与气味诱使雄蜂授粉，或模拟宿主植物骗过寄生藤的识别，是拟态在植物界的体现。�Some orchids mimic female bees to lure pollination, or mimic host plants to fool parasitic vines, mimicry in the plant kingdom.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a444480e825b�body�ف在松林和稀树草原，火能打破种子休眠、清除竞争者并回补养分；一味抑制火反而会让系统退化。وIn pine forests and savannas, fire breaks seed dormancy, clears competitors, and recycles nutrients; suppressing it degrades the system.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�a73bb80240ea�body��x低温会降低蒜氨酸酶活性，也减缓催泪因子的挥发扩散，所以冷藏后再切时刺激明显减轻。ٌLow temperature lowers alliinase activity and slows the volatile lachrymatory factor's diffusion, so chilled onions sting far less when cut.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013��id�a879fb7d2104�body���牛奶营养丰富，空气中的乳酸菌等趁机制造乳酸，使蛋白质凝结、味道变酸，这就是自然发酵变酸。若污染了致病菌还可能腐臭。冷藏能延缓但无法永远阻止微生物活动。��Milk is nutritious, so airborne lactic bacteria and others make lactic acid, curdling proteins and souring the taste—natural fermentation. If pathogens contaminate it, it can also rot and smell foul. Refrigeration slows but cannot stop microbes forever.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�ab4493cfde49�body�ٓ磷脂双层天然挡住大多数带电和水溶性分子，膜上的通道与载体蛋白则按需放行特定物质，维持细胞内外差异。٬The lipid bilayer blocks most charged and watery molecules, while channels and carriers selectively let specific substances through, maintaining inside-outside differences.�ans��src��4Urry 等,《Campbell Biology》第11版,Pearson,2017�<L. A. Urry et al., Campbell Biology, 11th ed., Pearson, 2017��id�ac29583d003b�body�ٍ细菌通过二分裂将遗传物质复制后均等分配到两个子细胞，过程快速且无需配偶，是细菌主要的增殖方式。ٮBacteria replicate by binary fission, duplicating their chromosome and splitting it equally into two daughter cells rapidly and without a mate, their main proliferation mode.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�ac6735d93389�body���猫脸部、尾巴根有气味腺，蹭你是把它的气味标记在你身上，宣示“这是我的家人”。同时它也在收集你的气味、表达亲近。在猫的语言里，蹭是一种社交问候而非单纯撒娇。��Cats have scent glands on the face and tail base; rubbing you marks you with their smell, claiming 'this is my family.' They also pick up your scent and show affection. In cat language, rubbing is a social greeting, not just coyness.�ans��src��A尚玉昌,《动物行为学》第2版,北京大学出版社,2010�FShang Yuchang, Animal Behavior, 2nd ed., Peking University Press, 2010��id�ae5b8fc52b43�body���只有雌蚊吸血，而且主要是为了获取蛋白质来发育卵巢、产卵，吸血本身并非日常能量来源。雄蚊和雌蚊平时都靠花蜜和果汁维生。所以蚊子吸血是繁殖需要而非单纯觅食。��Only female mosquitoes bite, mainly to get protein for egg development; blood is not their everyday energy source. Both sexes normally feed on nectar and fruit juice. So blood-feeding serves reproduction, not mere hunger.�ans��src�هEd Yong,《I Contain Multitudes》Ecco/HarperCollins,2016;中译《我包罗万象》(郑李译),后浪丨北京联合出版公司,2019�~Ed Yong, I Contain Multitudes, Ecco/HarperCollins, 2016; Chinese ed. (Zheng Li tr.), Beijing United Publishing (Houlang), 2019��id�af623ab64cc6�body��病毒通常比细菌小得多，细菌是完整的单细胞生物，能自己代谢繁殖；病毒没有细胞结构，必须钻进宿主细胞才能复制。抗生素能杀死细菌但一般对病毒无效，所以感冒多为病毒引起时吃药用处有限。�BViruses are usually far smaller than bacteria. Bacteria are complete single-celled organisms that metabolize and reproduce on their own, while viruses have no cell structure and must enter a host cell to replicate. Antibiotics kill bacteria but generally do nothing against viruses, so they are little help for most colds.�ans��src��D周德庆,《微生物学教程》第3版,高等教育出版社,2011�IZhou Deqing, Microbiology Tutorial, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 2011��id�afcea655edf9�body�ٖ这类疗法不直接杀癌，而是解除肿瘤对免疫系统的压制或武装免疫细胞，让身体自己的防御去识别并清除癌细胞。هRather than killing cancer directly, these therapies lift tumors' suppression of immunity or arm immune cells to find and clear cancer.�ans��src��mJaneway 等，《免疫生物学：健康与疾病中的免疫系统》（第9版，Garland Science，2016）�gJaneway et al., Immunobiology: The Immune System in Health and Disease (9th ed., Garland Science, 2016)��id�b1a81d3172ad�body��入秋后日照变短、气温下降，树木回收叶子里的叶绿素等养分，绿色褪去后原本被掩盖的黄色类胡萝卜素显现。有些树还会合成红色花青素保护叶片、辅助养分回流。这是落叶前的“告别表演”。�As days shorten and cool in autumn, trees reclaim nutrients like chlorophyll from leaves; the green fades to reveal hidden yellow carotenoids. Some trees also make red anthocyanins to protect leaves and aid nutrient recovery. It is a farewell show before dropping leaves.�ans��src��;Raven 等,《Biology of Plants》第8版,W. H. Freeman,2013�CP. H. Raven et al., Biology of Plants, 8th ed., W. H. Freeman, 2013